cmn2w9ydt0005jc3ojjo5gkfn	gen-roles	general	Roles & Permissions	both	{}	What are the user roles and permissions?	What are the user roles and permissions?\nUser roles\nWho has access\nPermission levels\nRole types\nAdmin access\nThe application has 10 roles organized into three tiers: Administrators (GRC Admin, Customer Admin), Audit roles (Audit Head, Audit Manager, Auditor, Auditee), and Cross-module roles (Reviewer, Contributor, Department Reviewer, Department Contributor).\n**GRC Administrator** — System-level admin with full access to all modules across all tenants, including GRC Administration (customer accounts, master data, email, SSO)\n**Customer Administrator** — Organization-level admin with full CRUD on Organization, Compliance, Risk Management, Asset Management, and Internal Audit within their tenant\n**Audit Head** — Full access to all Internal Audit pages; view-only access to Organization, Compliance, and Risk Management for audit planning context\n**Audit Manager** — Manages audit engagements, fieldwork, findings, CAPA, and reports; view-only access to Risk and Compliance\n**Auditor** — Performs audit fieldwork, creates work papers and findings; view-only access to Compliance controls/evidence\n**Auditee** — Views assigned findings, provides management responses, updates CAPA items assigned to them\n**Reviewer** — Organization-wide view and review access across all GRC modules including Internal Audit; can approve/reject but limited editing\n**Contributor** — Organization-wide create and edit access to Compliance, Risk Management, Asset Management, and Organization processes; no Internal Audit or admin access\n**Department Reviewer** — Same as Reviewer but scoped to their assigned department only\n**Department Contributor** — Same as Contributor but scoped to their assigned department only\nOrganization-wide roles see data across all departments; department-scoped roles see only their department's data\nPermissions are enforced at both the UI level (hidden menus/buttons) and the API level (blocked requests)\nroles\npermissions\nadmin\nreviewer\ncontributor\nauditor\naccess\naudit head\naudit manager\nauditee	{-0.044921875,0.0625,0.09814453125,0.0146331787109375,0.006687164306640625,-0.002254486083984375,-0.018585205078125,0.0191192626953125,0.007228851318359375,-0.004619598388671875,0.0194854736328125,-0.050445556640625,0.00423431396484375,0.001881599426269531,-0.01708984375,-0.0139007568359375,0.002521514892578125,-0.0063018798828125,-0.0161285400390625,0.07623291015625,0.0906982421875,0.00850677490234375,-0.0118255615234375,-0.00348663330078125,-0.05035400390625,0.01212310791015625,-0.032012939453125,0.049774169921875,-0.022674560546875,-0.023040771484375,0.0296478271484375,-0.0084381103515625,-0.0159759521484375,-0.021942138671875,0.02032470703125,-0.0196990966796875,0.001862525939941406,0.0313720703125,0.03680419921875,0.0200958251953125,0.0044403076171875,0.0164031982421875,-0.0228424072265625,-0.00572967529296875,-0.0216064453125,-0.0008225440979003906,0.00373077392578125,-0.0178070068359375,-0.002408981323242188,-0.00707244873046875,-0.029510498046875,0.0074310302734375,0.001408576965332031,0.018524169921875,-0.0098114013671875,0.00873565673828125,-0.03070068359375,-0.0214996337890625,-0.0389404296875,-0.006633758544921875,-0.03216552734375,-0.0657958984375,-0.0210723876953125,-0.007965087890625,0.003396987915039062,-0.016143798828125,-0.0196685791015625,0.01200103759765625,0.0084991455078125,0.0204010009765625,0.0208740234375,-0.00696563720703125,0.007495880126953125,-0.039703369140625,0.002965927124023438,-0.01398468017578125,0.06622314453125,0.0309906005859375,-0.0302734375,-0.003021240234375,0.01105499267578125,-0.002927780151367188,-0.048919677734375,-0.0252532958984375,0.003038406372070312,0.003217697143554688,-0.03955078125,-0.031402587890625,-0.02313232421875,-0.0157623291015625,-0.032562255859375,0.016082763671875,-0.055938720703125,0.054412841796875,0.0140533447265625,-0.0262908935546875,0.00116