cmn2w9yod000ejc3ogrphetro	org-issue-create	organization	Context	grc	{}	How do I create an issue?	How do I create an issue?\nAdd issue\nNew issue\nIssue list\nCreate issue entry\nStakeholder issue\nCreate issues from the Issue List in the Context section to track stakeholder-related concerns.\nNavigate to **Organization** > **Context** > **Issue List**\nClick **Add New** to begin issue creation\nFill in service-related details: **Name**, **Owner**, **Category**, **Domain**\nClick **Next** to choose applicable regulations (e.g., ISO 27001, NIST CSF, PCI DSS)\nClick **Next** to link relevant processes using **Choose Processes**\nSelect stakeholder type (**Internal**, **External**, **Third Party**) and define needs/expectations\nClick **Next** to review all entered details (Info, Regulation, Process, Stakeholder)\nClick **Save** to finalize the issue and trigger notification to the issue owner\nUpon saving, an automated email is sent to the designated issue owner\nAdmin can edit or delete issues using the respective buttons\nImport and export options are available for bulk management\nissue\ncreate\nadd\nnew\nstakeholder\ncontext	{-0.005652934778481722,0.004714357201009989,0.06600713729858398,-0.02603478543460369,-0.03209566324949265,-0.04058580100536346,0.005726548843085766,0.01225671544671059,0.0113610802218318,0.07120918482542038,0.08323279023170471,-0.01170461159199476,-0.03477030247449875,-0.0455179326236248,0.03533467650413513,0.002013647230342031,-0.05727162212133408,0.02110265381634235,0.009361235424876213,0.007833747193217278,0.05054821819067001,0.03202205151319504,0.004229732323437929,0.03020624071359634,-0.03069699928164482,0.03410777822136879,-0.02601024694740772,0.03295449167490005,0.002860207110643387,0.007208028808236122,0.04026680812239647,-0.01604783162474632,-0.02382636815309525,0.006551637779921293,0.03118775971233845,0.02981363236904144,-0.01338546257466078,0.01304193120449781,0.0143547123298049,0.05192234367132187,0.01744649559259415,-0.002754387212