cmn2w9ypy000ijc3oy7wnx054	org-bia	organization	Process	grc	{}	How do I perform a Business Impact Analysis (BIA)?	How do I perform a Business Impact Analysis (BIA)?\nBIA analysis\nBusiness impact\nProcess criticality\nBIA assessment\nPerform BIA to evaluate the criticality of key processes and prioritize risk mitigation and continuity planning.\nNavigate to **Organization** > **Process** > **Business Impact Analysis**\nClick **Perform BIA**\nCategorize department activities from **High** to **Low** and list corresponding impacts\nNote that the highest impact score will be indicated across all activities\nEnter **RTO** (Recovery Time Objective) and **RPO** (Recovery Point Objective) values\nSubmit for approval\nThe Performance Dashboard offers visual KPIs following BIA analysis\nbia\nbusiness\nimpact\nanalysis\ncriticality\nrto\nrpo	{-0.03537017107009888,0.05386469885706902,0.06691388785839081,0.01618884317576885,-0.02825689129531384,-0.0551401823759079,-0.02806066162884235,0.004059475380927324,0.02295872382819653,0.004939436912536621,0.02127851732075214,0.0186662282794714,-0.03313807398080826,-0.07270262390375137,0.03137201815843582,0.01969642750918865,-0.01613978669047356,0.008965185843408108,-0.04537782073020935,0.02456534467637539,0.03603244200348854,0.008076025173068047,-0.0377739705145359,0.02122946083545685,0.0183964129537344,-0.009731702506542206,0.004577640909701586,-0.0009458822314627469,0.002080327831208706,-0.02801160514354706,0.04584386199712753,0.003372675739228725,-0.03546828404068947,-0.04248344898223877,0.004942503292113543,-0.008940656669437885,-0.0489344596862793,0.002554035279899836,0.05357035622000694,0.001065458985976875,-0.01956151984632015,0.01366240344941616,-0.004626697860658169,0.02759462036192417,-0.02327759563922882,0.01807754300534725,0.02764367684721947,-0.03321165964007378,0.03326071426272392,0.0145454304292798,-0.02823236212134361,0.0415513664484024,-0.02528893575072289,-0.02548516541719437,0.02492100745439529,0.02498232945799828,-0.00