cmn2w9yya000ojc3okvwq3wxd	comp-policy	compliance	Governance	grc	{}	How do I create and manage policies?	How do I create and manage policies?\nAdd policy\nNew policy\nPolicy management\nApprove policy\nPublish policy\nCreate and manage policies from the Governance section. Policies go through approval and publishing workflows.\nNavigate to **Compliance** > **Governance** from the sidebar\nClick **New Policy** to create a new policy\nUse **Export** to export all policies\nFilter by **status**, **framework**, or use search\nClick on any policy to view details\nIn policy details: select **department**, assign to **departmental contributors/reviewers**, set **approver** (limited to department reviewers)\nSet **recurrence** (weekly, monthly, quarterly) and **review date**\nAdd documents in the **Attachments** section (AI will review for relevant information)\n**Approve** and **Publish** the policy when ready\nAssigned To is limited to departmental contributors and reviewers\nApprovers are limited to department reviewers\nLinked controls, evidence, and exceptions are displayed and can be managed\npolicy\ncreate\nadd\napprove\npublish\ngovernance\nnew	{0.00493621826171875,0.02783203125,0.0654296875,-0.01451873779296875,-0.01461029052734375,-0.0136260986328125,-0.0589599609375,0.001615524291992188,0.018707275390625,0.07000732421875,0.06787109375,-0.01190185546875,0.01267242431640625,-0.050872802734375,0.001839637756347656,-0.01800537109375,-0.033050537109375,0.024810791015625,0.05694580078125,0.042755126953125,0.027130126953125,0.04534912109375,0.0160980224609375,0.038848876953125,-0.023712158203125,0.02484130859375,-0.02978515625,0.03131103515625,-0.00830841064453125,-0.034088134765625,0.0264434814453125,-0.0021820068359375,-0.0214691162109375,0.010955810546875,-0.008148193359375,0.0217437744140625,-0.0080718994140625,0.00440216064453125,0.0209503173828125,0.031158447265625,-0.01155853271484375,-0.03265380859375,0.01953125,0.0159759521484375,-0.003072738647460938,0.01309967