cmn2w9yzh000rjc3o926dc7at	comp-evidence	compliance	Evidence	grc	{}	How do I manage evidence?	How do I manage evidence?\nAdd evidence\nUpload evidence\nCreate evidence\nEvidence list\nEvidence details\nCreate and manage compliance evidence from the Evidence page, including status tracking, attachments, and KPI configuration.\nNavigate to **Compliance** > **Evidence** from the sidebar\nView the evidence dashboard showing total count and status filter\nClick **Create New Evidence** to add new evidence\nUse **Export** to export all evidence\nFilter by **status**, **department**, **framework**, or use search\nClick on any evidence to view details\nIn evidence details: set department, assignee, approver, recurrence, and review date\nEnable **KPI Required** if KPI tracking is needed for this evidence\nAdd documents in the **Attachments** section (AI-reviewed)\nView and manage linked **controls** and **policies** (link or unlink as needed)\nAssigned To is limited to departmental contributors and reviewers\nApprovers are limited to department reviewers\nevidence\nupload\ncreate\nadd\nmanage\ncompliance\nattachments	{0.00860595703125,0.035186767578125,0.045501708984375,-0.0156707763671875,-0.0132598876953125,-0.0167236328125,-0.007244110107421875,0.0215911865234375,0.0035400390625,0.07781982421875,0.06829833984375,0.002197265625,0.02685546875,-0.023956298828125,0.0167694091796875,-0.00940704345703125,0.00957489013671875,0.01148223876953125,0.00981903076171875,0.05377197265625,0.02874755859375,-0.0187530517578125,0.033355712890625,0.037384033203125,-4.917383193969727e-05,-0.018798828125,-0.051055908203125,0.031494140625,-0.00968170166015625,-0.04278564453125,0.0692138671875,-0.00826263427734375,-0.00872802734375,0.05963134765625,0.01123046875,0.0266876220703125,-0.00765228271484375,0.0032196044921875,-0.014984130859375,0.001008033752441406,0.03387451171875,-0.037109375,0.004276275634765625,0.003814697265625,-0.022552490234375,0.01296234130859375,-0.0177764892578125,0.003873825