cmn2w9yzw000sjc3o13crz33r	comp-exception	compliance	Exception Management	grc	{}	How do I manage exceptions?	How do I manage exceptions?\nAdd exception\nCreate exception\nException status\nApprove exception\nException workflow\nManage compliance exceptions with a status workflow: Pending > Approved > Authorized > Closed. Exceptions can be linked from control or policy details.\nNavigate to **Compliance** > **Exception Management** from the sidebar\nView all exceptions on the dashboard with filters by **status** and **category**\nClick **Add New** to create a new exception, or link from control/policy detail pages\nSelect the **category** and fill in other details — the exception is created with **Pending** status\n**Approve** the exception within the given date (if not approved by the date, status becomes **Overdue**)\nOnly **GRC users** can **Authorize** an approved exception\nAfter authorization, change the status to **Closed**\nStatus flow: Pending → Approved → Authorized → Closed (or Overdue if not approved in time)\nDepartment users cannot authorize or close exceptions — only GRC users have this access\nExceptions can also be linked from Control Detail and Policy Detail pages\nexception\nadd\ncreate\napprove\nauthorize\nmanagement\npending\noverdue	{-0.018341064453125,0.04034423828125,0.039886474609375,-0.0006165504455566406,-0.0311279296875,0.016021728515625,-0.032806396484375,-0.01070404052734375,0.0450439453125,0.04180908203125,0.047576904296875,-0.0176239013671875,0.00775909423828125,0.02349853515625,-0.005950927734375,-0.017181396484375,-0.01029205322265625,0.024749755859375,0.0136871337890625,0.06927490234375,0.00839996337890625,0.042236328125,0.0137786865234375,0.082275390625,-0.045440673828125,0.035400390625,-0.01377105712890625,0.061614990234375,-0.0091400146484375,-0.002298355102539062,0.0330810546875,-0.007579803466796875,-0.041717529296875,0.017486572265625,0.031402587890625,0.04205322265625,0.0212860107421875,0.003351211547851562,0.00844573974609375