cmn2w9z0a000tjc3o8ipnqegy	comp-kpi	compliance	KPI	grc	{}	How do KPIs work in compliance?	How do KPIs work in compliance?\nKPI tracking\nKey performance indicator\nKPI evidence\nKPI actual score\nKPI status\nKPIs are linked to evidence. When 'KPI Required' is enabled on evidence, GRC users define objectives and Department users provide actual scores.\nNavigate to an evidence detail page and enable **KPI Required**\nAs a GRC user: fill in **KPI Objective**, **Data Source**, **Expected Score**, **Description**, and **Calculation Formula**, then **Save**\nAs a Department user: edit and save the **Actual Score** for the evidence\nNavigate to **Compliance** > **KPI** to view all KPIs with status, review date, and department\nClick on any KPI to view complete details and attached documents from the evidence\nStatus is **Scheduled** until the Department user responds\nIf Expected Score < Actual Score → status is **Missed**\nIf Expected Score > Actual Score → status is **Achieved**\nIf Department user does not respond by review date → status is **Overdue**\nkpi\nkey\nperformance\nindicator\nscore\nexpected\nactual\nevidence	{0.005229949951171875,0.0655517578125,0.021331787109375,-0.01812744140625,0.005916595458984375,-0.00958251953125,-0.024261474609375,-0.00974273681640625,0.0406494140625,0.033538818359375,0.058563232421875,0.00618743896484375,-0.009979248046875,-0.036773681640625,0.0260162353515625,-0.0112762451171875,-0.002227783203125,-0.0217437744140625,-0.0164337158203125,0.0379638671875,0.0374755859375,-0.01323699951171875,0.0048980712890625,0.0001052021980285645,-0.0152435302734375,-0.003665924072265625,-0.0281982421875,-0.001214981079101562,-0.004413604736328125,0.005031585693359375,0.032470703125,-0.000591278076171875,-0.047882080078125,-0.00372314453125,0.0384521484375,0.029449462890625,-0.020904541015625,0.045135498046875,0.0009598731994628906,-0.004306793212890625,0.0157012939453125,-0.001928329467773438,-0.04669189453125,-0.00839996337890625,-0.042938232421875,