cmn2w9z8j000zjc3obw4yvc2g	asset-classify	asset-management	Classification	grc	{}	How do I classify an asset?	How do I classify an asset?\nCIA rating\nAsset classification\nNew asset classification\nAsset criticality score\nClassify assets by defining sub-category, group, sensitivity, and CIA ratings (Confidentiality, Integrity, Availability) to calculate an Asset Criticality Score.\nNavigate to **Asset Management** > **Asset Classification**\nView existing classifications with search and export options\nClick **New Asset Classification** to create a new entry\nSelect **Asset Sub-category** (e.g., Database, Server)\nSelect **Asset Group** (e.g., SQL Database, Firewalls)\nSet **Asset Sensitivity** (Low/Medium/High)\nRate **Confidentiality** — how critical to protect data from unauthorized access\nRate **Integrity** — data accuracy and protection from unauthorized modification\nRate **Availability** — how important for the asset to be accessible without downtime\nThe **Asset Criticality Score** is calculated automatically from these factors\nClick **Save**\nUse the Action column to edit or delete existing classifications\nclassify\nclassification\ncia\nconfidentiality\nintegrity\navailability\ncriticality	{-0.02807402610778809,0.02412759326398373,0.05151630938053131,-0.00785741861909628,-0.01068727113306522,0.005240248516201973,-0.02112641371786594,-0.02996453270316124,0.009452533908188343,-0.00801692996174097,0.01232374086976051,-0.0262780450284481,-0.001414187718182802,-0.02063015475869179,-0.00423000892624259,-0.02866480872035027,-0.01449782401323318,0.03124062530696392,-0.03197319433093071,0.01175658870488405,-0.005845801439136267,0.02805039472877979,-0.02568726055324078,-0.0002232053375337273,0.005346589721739292,0.01903503946959972,-0.02426938153803349,-0.04097673296928406,-0.009476165287196636,0.005748322233557701,0.07486406713724136,-0.01127805467694998,0.004097082652151585,0.02533279173076153,0.001461450359784067,-0.003695349907502532,-0.004794206935912371,0.00