cmn2w9z8x0010jc3ogsjyh7gz	asset-settings-cia	asset-management	Settings	grc	{CustomerAdministrator,GRCAdministrator}	How do I configure CIA scoring for assets?	How do I configure CIA scoring for assets?\nCIA settings\nConfidentiality scoring\nAsset scoring\nScoring calculation\nConfigure how assets are scored based on the CIA model (Confidentiality, Integrity, Availability) from Asset Settings.\nNavigate to **Asset Management** > **Asset Settings** > **CIA**\nDefine **Confidentiality** levels (C1, C2, etc.) with labels and values\nDefine **Integrity** levels (I1, I2, etc.) with labels and values\nDefine **Availability** levels (A1, A2, etc.) with labels and values\nSet **Scoring Calculation** method: **High of all** (takes highest), **Addition of all** (sums up), or **Product of all** (multiplies)\nDefine **Ranges** (High/Low) to categorize total scores into risk levels\nUse Add Confidentiality (C), Add Integrity (I), or Add Availability (A) to create new options\ncia\nscoring\nconfidentiality\nintegrity\navailability\nsettings\nranges	{-0.01017968077212572,0.01442375872284174,0.0922827422618866,0.004204384982585907,-0.02677127718925476,-0.01449703797698021,0.03490525111556053,-0.004955495242029428,-0.0003833791706711054,-0.003245651023462415,-0.0002435001515550539,-0.03854477778077126,-0.0221669115126133,-0.03358623012900352,-0.005480661988258362,-0.01619466952979565,0.007901923730969429,0.03309770300984383,-0.01628016121685505,-0.006985935382544994,-0.01435047946870327,0.03045965544879436,-0.03424574062228203,0.01646335795521736,-0.01249407697468996,-0.000169839448062703,-0.005474555306136608,-0.02530569583177567,0.008366024121642113,-0.01618245616555214,0.03119244612753391,-0.009959843009710312,-0.03011768683791161,-0.02005403116345406,-0.01105902902781963,-0.00963008776307106,0.01098574977368116,0.0314122848212719,0.01907697878777981,0.01290932483971119,-0.04157364368438721,0.06106587126851082,0.006607327144593,-0.04724055901169777,0.00129154312890023,-0.01756254