cmn2wa14o0018jc3oxnpcryz7	risk-assess	risk-management	Risk Assessment	grc	{}	How do I assess a risk?	How do I assess a risk?\nRisk assessment steps\nEvaluate a risk\nRate a risk\nRisk scoring\nLikelihood and impact\nAssess risks through a step-by-step wizard covering Risk Context, Likelihood, Impact, Risk Rating, and Response Strategy.\nNavigate to **Risk Management** > **Risk Assessment**\nView all risks being tracked with search and filter options\nClick the action button next to a risk to start assessment\n**Step 1 — Risk Context**: Link the risk to specific assets and assign an owner\n**Step 2 — Likelihood**: Select probability from Rare to Very Likely\n**Step 3 — Impact**: Assess impact from Low to High across categories (Financial, Operational, etc.)\n**Step 4 — Risk Rating**: System auto-calculates from Likelihood × Impact (Low, Medium, High, Very High) and recommends action\n**Step 5 — Risk Response Strategy**: Choose **Transfer**, **Avoid**, **Accept**, or **Treat** and document the plan\nClick **Submit** to finalize the assessment\nAvoid — eliminate the risk by discontinuing the causing activity\nTransfer — shift to a third party (insurance, outsourcing, contracts)\nMitigate (Treat) — reduce likelihood or impact via controls and safeguards\nAccept — acknowledge but take no action when cost outweighs impact\nassess\nevaluate\nrate\nscore\nrisk\nlikelihood\nimpact\nwizard\nsteps	{-0.03759765625,0.035919189453125,0.0501708984375,0.0203399658203125,-0.021942138671875,-0.035064697265625,-0.00868988037109375,0.01025390625,0.007450103759765625,0.042266845703125,0.008270263671875,-0.00522613525390625,-0.01522064208984375,-0.038055419921875,0.0174102783203125,-0.02496337890625,-0.004180908203125,0.04266357421875,-0.048126220703125,0.01551055908203125,0.005168914794921875,0.03619384765625,0.0078887939453125,0.0172882080078125,-0.0208282470703125,-0.0129547119140625,-0.038238525390625,-0.03680419921875,-0.001376152038574219,0.01512908935546875,0.058685302734375,-0.02