cmn2wa1540019jc3oh2wh461u	risk-response	risk-management	Risk Response	grc	{}	How do I manage risk response strategies?	How do I manage risk response strategies?\nRisk response\nRisk mitigation\nRespond to risk\nRisk treatment\nSubmit risk response\nManage risk response strategies from the Risk Response page. Filter by strategy or progress status, link controls, and submit for approval.\nNavigate to **Risk Management** > **Risk Response Strategy** from the sidebar\nUse the **Risk Response Strategy dropdown** to filter by method (Treat, Transfer, Avoid, Accept)\nUse the **Risk Response Progress dropdown** to filter by status\nView charts showing visual representation of risks by method/status\nClick the **Respond/Resume** button next to a risk to open the response page\nView all necessary data and link required **controls** to the risk\n**Submit for approval** when the response strategy is complete\nUse the **View** button to see all data and changes made\nresponse\nstrategy\nmitigate\ntreat\naccept\navoid\ntransfer\nsubmit\napproval	{-0.03338623046875,0.048675537109375,0.045623779296875,0.019439697265625,-0.051544189453125,-0.0302886962890625,-0.00946044921875,0.0263519287109375,0.006404876708984375,0.049835205078125,0.010467529296875,-0.01544952392578125,0.035858154296875,0.001276016235351562,-0.0199737548828125,-0.0675048828125,0.0108795166015625,0.0423583984375,-0.019378662109375,0.057098388671875,-0.01320648193359375,0.001583099365234375,0.007472991943359375,0.041473388671875,-0.0280914306640625,0.0411376953125,-0.0196380615234375,-0.00732421875,-0.035888671875,0.006420135498046875,0.055206298828125,-0.01207733154296875,-0.0240936279296875,0.052154541015625,0.0234832763671875,-0.035400390625,-0.0305328369140625,-0.0081787109375,0.006275177001953125,0.015594482421875,0.0279998779296875,0.023895263671875,-0.00374603271484375,0.043792724609375,-0.0037078857421875,0.0421142578125,-0.007755279541015625,-0.054351806640625,0.010833740234375,-0.002012252807617188,-0.0185