cmn2wa15i001ajc3ou6rdiq33	risk-settings	risk-management	Settings	grc	{CustomerAdministrator,GRCAdministrator}	How do I configure risk settings?	How do I configure risk settings?\nRisk configuration\nRisk categories\nLikelihood settings\nImpact settings\nControl strength\nRisk methodology\nConfigure all risk management parameters from Risk Settings including categories, control strength, likelihood, threats, vulnerabilities, methodology, and impact.\nNavigate to **Risk Management** > **Risk Settings**\n**Category** — define vulnerability and threat categories with labels and values\n**Control Strength** — define levels to evaluate security control effectiveness (name + score)\n**Likelihood** — configure probability measurement and scoring\n**Threat** — manage and define predefined threats\n**Vulnerability** — manage and define predefined vulnerabilities\n**Risk Methodology** — define the calculation formula: Risk Score = Likelihood × Impact × Asset Score × Vulnerability Score\n**Risk Category** — manage categories (Cyber, Operations, Legal, Physical, Cloud, Operational) with Active/Inactive status\n**Impact** — define impact categories and severity levels with name, score, and description\n**Vulnerability Rating** — define severity levels and corresponding scores\nsettings\nrisk\ncategory\nlikelihood\nimpact\ncontrol\nstrength\nmethodology\nthreat\nvulnerability	{-0.021453857421875,0.002210617065429688,0.062225341796875,-0.001914024353027344,-0.04132080078125,-0.041900634765625,0.004917144775390625,0.023773193359375,0.011322021484375,0.0592041015625,-0.038848876953125,0.0138702392578125,0.025726318359375,-0.007556915283203125,0.01088714599609375,-0.0162200927734375,-0.0237884521484375,0.0732421875,-0.011505126953125,0.04046630859375,0.0274810791015625,0.0004606246948242188,-0.0081634521484375,0.031890869140625,-0.033477783203125,0.00390625,0.00479888916015625,-0.0203399658203125,0.02264404296875,-0.0080413818359375,0.048736572265625,-0.01161956787109375,-0.0088424682