cmn2wa16p001djc3ov9uss2lo	audit-dashboard	internal-audit	Dashboard	audit	{AuditHead,Auditor}	What does the Internal Audit Dashboard show?	What does the Internal Audit Dashboard show?\nAudit dashboard overview\nAudit summary cards\nAudit metrics\nAudit KPIs\nThe Audit Dashboard provides a summarized view of all audit-related activities and key performance metrics, helping audit heads and team members monitor risk, audit progress, and auditor schedules at a glance.\nNavigate to **Internal Audit** > **Dashboard**\nReview the **Top Summary Cards**: Total Risks Identified, Very High Severity Risks, Ongoing Audits, Completed Audits\nView the **Risk by Rating** chart showing distribution across High, Medium, and Low severity\nCheck the **CAPA Status Overview** showing Open vs Closed actions per department\nReview the **Annual Audit Plan** calendar view (January to December) for scheduled audits\nCheck the **Auditor Schedule** showing each auditor's assigned durations across months\nClick on a risk severity bar to view risks of that rating\nClick on CAPA status badges to view department details\nClick on an audit row in the Annual Plan to view its details\ndashboard\naudit\nsummary\noverview\nmetrics\ncards\nkpi	{-0.031646728515625,0.0242462158203125,0.042266845703125,0.0208892822265625,-0.01105499267578125,0.0093231201171875,-0.03765869140625,-0.0202484130859375,0.042083740234375,0.0134735107421875,0.0168914794921875,-0.044525146484375,-0.015838623046875,-0.004291534423828125,0.04931640625,-0.04779052734375,-0.032257080078125,0.012969970703125,-0.039703369140625,0.058380126953125,0.040435791015625,0.01506805419921875,0.0199737548828125,0.0430908203125,-0.017974853515625,-0.023223876953125,-0.0157928466796875,-0.02398681640625,0.01192474365234375,0.03472900390625,0.04095458984375,-0.02288818359375,-0.0121002197265625,-0.00579071044921875,0.0254974365234375,0.002117156982421875,-0.03045654296875,-0.00441741943359375,0.0156097412109375,-0.005878448486328125,0.0064888000488281