cmn2wa1hz001njc3ourlscuwl	audit-fieldwork-details	internal-audit	Field Work	audit	{}	How do I add fieldwork details to an audit?	How do I add fieldwork details to an audit?\nAdd findings to audit\nFieldwork documentation\nUpdate audit fieldwork\nAdd comments workpapers\nAccess audit fieldwork details to add comments, upload workpapers, manage task lists, request evidence, and upload supporting documents.\nNavigate to **Internal Audit** > **Field Work**\nClick **Add/View Details** on the target audit\nUse **Comments** to write, save, and view comments for collaboration\nUse **Work Papers** to attach and organize supporting audit documents\nUse the **Audit Engagement Task List** to track individual tasks: Ref No, Task, Document, Executed status, Comments\nAdd more tasks using the **+ Add Task** button\nUse **Evidence Request** to add new requests specifying title, sample size, and description\nUse **Other Documents** to upload additional files (policies, evidence, reports)\nComments support collaboration and documentation of fieldwork progress\nWorkpapers keep supporting documents organized and linked to the audit\nEach task row can be marked as executed with a checkbox\nfieldwork\ndetails\nfindings\ncomments\nworkpapers\ndocumentation\naudit	{-0.017364501953125,0.03399658203125,0.0302581787109375,-0.02496337890625,-0.051055908203125,-0.029876708984375,-0.0042266845703125,0.0138397216796875,-0.00896453857421875,0.0181427001953125,0.0311431884765625,0.01410675048828125,0.01464080810546875,-0.033843994140625,-0.00873565673828125,0.0081787109375,0.0160369873046875,0.001850128173828125,-0.017913818359375,0.03607177734375,0.019134521484375,0.031524658203125,0.001680374145507812,-0.00591278076171875,0.0003085136413574219,-0.0675048828125,-0.057830810546875,-0.008392333984375,-0.034759521484375,-0.02117919921875,-0.005931854248046875,-0.024261474609375,0.0049591064453125,-0.001082420349121094,-0.01311492919921875,0.03070068359375,-0.0002603530883789062,-0.0287628173828125,0.