cmn2wa1p4001ojc3odaojtm26	audit-fieldwork-findings	internal-audit	Field Work	audit	{}	How do I add audit findings?	How do I add audit findings?\nCreate audit finding\nAdd finding\nDocument audit issue\nRecord finding\nDocument audit findings with details about the issue, severity, causes, effects, recommendations, and assign CAPA actions.\nNavigate to **Internal Audit** > **Field Work** and open the relevant audit\nGo to the **Findings** section\nClick **Add Finding** to create a new finding\nEnter details: issue description, severity rating, criteria, condition, cause, and effect\nAdd **Recommendations** for corrective action\nAssign **CAPA** by designating responsible personnel and setting the status\nSet the **Target Closure Date**\nAttach **Supporting Documents** related to the finding\nClick **Save** to record the finding\nFindings can have severity levels: Low, Medium, High\nCAPA assignment ensures accountability for issue resolution\nSupporting documents provide audit evidence for the finding\nfinding\nfindings\nadd\ncreate\naudit\nissue\ndocument	{-0.017608642578125,0.0269775390625,0.0701904296875,-0.01436614990234375,-0.0133056640625,-0.016448974609375,-0.00684356689453125,-0.05352783203125,-0.006755828857421875,0.02325439453125,0.04925537109375,0.001589775085449219,-0.036041259765625,-0.0179290771484375,0.041046142578125,-0.0225067138671875,0.0020751953125,-0.001729011535644531,-0.039764404296875,0.025238037109375,0.053253173828125,0.03302001953125,-0.0008091926574707031,0.03155517578125,0.003078460693359375,-0.0618896484375,-0.01763916015625,0.004650115966796875,-0.01389312744140625,-0.0216827392578125,0.03173828125,-0.017425537109375,-0.027099609375,0.0085296630859375,0.017181396484375,0.03564453125,-0.0057525634765625,-0.016571044921875,0.0157928466796875,-0.0256195068359375,0.0215911865234375,0.013580322265625,0.03936767578125,-0.0100555419921875,0.003889083862304688,-0.04248046875,0.0159912109375,0.01403045654296875,0.00722503662109375,0.0098571777343