cmn2wa1pi001pjc3oqdn2xhk6	audit-evidence-request	internal-audit	Field Work	audit	{}	How do I create an evidence request?	How do I create an evidence request?\nRequest audit evidence\nAdd evidence request\nEvidence collection\nRequest documents for audit\nCreate evidence requests to specify what documentation is needed for the audit, including the title, sample size, and description.\nNavigate to **Internal Audit** > **Field Work** and open the relevant audit\nGo to the **Evidence Request** section\nClick **Add Request**\nEnter the **Request Title** (subject of the evidence request)\nSpecify the **Number of Samples** required\nAdd a **Description** with specifics of the evidence needed\nClick **Save** to create the request\nEach request shows the evidence title and sample size\nYou can attach documents, edit, or delete requests using the action icons\nevidence\nrequest\ncreate\ncollection\ndocuments\nsample\naudit	{-0.00862884521484375,-0.0003118515014648438,0.024017333984375,-0.0382080078125,-0.0296173095703125,-0.0236358642578125,-0.0220947265625,0.00698089599609375,-0.047271728515625,0.01171112060546875,0.047332763671875,-0.016510009765625,0.00843048095703125,-0.03143310546875,0.000782012939453125,0.019500732421875,0.029571533203125,-0.002027511596679688,-0.0199737548828125,0.023468017578125,0.024932861328125,0.004058837890625,-0.0199737548828125,-0.007076263427734375,0.001844406127929688,-0.052032470703125,-0.0282440185546875,-0.003259658813476562,-0.01139068603515625,-0.043060302734375,0.034210205078125,-0.0252532958984375,-0.0164947509765625,0.0400390625,0.002019882202148438,0.039306640625,-0.02935791015625,-0.049346923828125,0.006744384765625,0.0189056396484375,0.0089263916015625,-0.03143310546875,0.006320953369140625,0.001619338989257812,0.006114959716796875,-0.001536369323730469,-0.01332855224609375,-0.009796142578125,-0.0231781005859375,-0.01348876953125,0.0055694580078125,0.003065109252929688,0.013885498046875,-0.02130126953125,0.001597404479980469,-0.0176