cmn2wa1rk001ujc3oikz384xn	audit-settings-overview	internal-audit	Audit Settings	audit	{AuditHead}	What settings can I configure for Internal Audit?	What settings can I configure for Internal Audit?\nAudit configuration\nAudit settings overview\nConfigure audit parameters\nAudit setup\nAudit Settings lets you configure key parameters: Audit Category, Nature of Controls, Risk Assessment, Periodicity, Escalation, Audit Type, and User Management.\nNavigate to **Internal Audit** > **Audit Settings**\nClick on any configuration card to open its settings page:\n**Audit Category** — Define categories (Compliance, Operational, IT, Financial)\n**Nature of Controls** — Configure control types (Preventive, Detective, Corrective)\n**Risk Assessment** — Set risk rating scales and scoring methods\n**Periodicity** — Define audit frequency (Monthly, Quarterly, Annually)\n**Escalation Configuration** — Set reminder rules for overdue items\n**Audit Type** — Manage audit types (Internal, External, Follow-up)\n**User Management** — Manage audit users and role assignments\nOnly AuditHead role has access to Audit Settings\nEach card redirects to its dedicated configuration page\nsettings\nconfiguration\nconfigure\naudit\nsetup\nparameters	{-0.055389404296875,0.0100250244140625,0.069091796875,-0.0300750732421875,-0.04150390625,-0.007755279541015625,0.01010894775390625,0.003030776977539062,0.052093505859375,0.00614166259765625,0.00785064697265625,-0.048065185546875,0.019927978515625,0.0169677734375,0.0259246826171875,-0.04412841796875,-0.0421142578125,0.057647705078125,-0.00756072998046875,0.07904052734375,0.059173583984375,0.0243988037109375,-0.007755279541015625,0.0283966064453125,0.00836944580078125,-0.0552978515625,-0.026397705078125,-0.01580810546875,0.0047760009765625,-0.044403076171875,0.033233642578125,-0.02349853515625,0.009765625,-0.038818359375,-0.01334381103515625,0.0259857177734375,-0.00525665283203125,-0.038726806640625,0.033935546875,-0.001671791076660156,-0.00251388549804687