cmn2wa1sd001wjc3o1rwxc89z	audit-escalation-config	internal-audit	Audit Settings	audit	{AuditHead}	How do I configure audit escalation rules?	How do I configure audit escalation rules?\nEscalation settings\nAudit reminders\nOverdue escalation\nEscalation configuration\nConfigure escalation rules to set automatic reminders for overdue audit events like Response Submission, Acknowledgement, Clarification, Interview, and Issue Resolution.\nNavigate to **Internal Audit** > **Audit Settings** > **Escalation Configuration**\nFor each event type, enter the number of reminder days:\n**Response Submission** — days before reminder for submitting audit responses\n**Acknowledgement** — days before reminder to acknowledge findings\n**Clarification** — days before reminder for requested clarifications\n**Interview** — days before reminder for scheduled audit interviews\n**Issue Resolution** — days before reminder to resolve audit issues\nClick **Save** to apply, or **Cancel** to discard changes\nExample: entering 3 for Response Submission sends a reminder after 3 days if no response\nescalation\nreminders\noverdue\nconfiguration\ndays\nresponse\nacknowledgement	{-0.04486083984375,0.020721435546875,0.08807373046875,-0.028472900390625,-0.07403564453125,0.0166778564453125,0.0191192626953125,-0.0211181640625,-0.0103302001953125,0.038482666015625,-0.00498199462890625,-0.05828857421875,0.01467132568359375,0.002939224243164062,0.001179695129394531,0.0186920166015625,0.0184173583984375,0.01424407958984375,-0.03411865234375,0.06475830078125,0.02337646484375,0.02410888671875,0.0150909423828125,0.025146484375,-0.048126220703125,-0.023345947265625,-0.00829315185546875,-0.012542724609375,-0.00824737548828125,-0.0294189453125,0.00453948974609375,-0.0269775390625,-0.0439453125,-0.01380157470703125,0.0071563720703125,0.04351806640625,-0.012298583984375,-0.0137786865234375,0.01013946533203125,-0.014373779296875,-0.0207672119140625,-0.01398468017578125,-0.004245758056640625,0.003658294677734375,-0.