cmn2wa20x0021jc3or9l7nb08	ca-role-overview	general	Roles & Permissions	grc	{CustomerAdministrator}	What can I do as a Customer Administrator?	What can I do as a Customer Administrator?\nCustomer Administrator capabilities\nWhat is my role as Customer Admin\nCustomer Admin permissions\nWhat modules can I access as Customer Administrator\nCustomer Admin role overview\nWhat does Customer Administrator do\nAs a Customer Administrator, you are the organization-level admin with full CRUD access to all GRC modules within your tenant. You manage users, settings, and configurations but cannot access GRC Administration or other tenants.\nYou have full access to **Organization** — profile, context, users, processes, BIA, and settings\nYou have full access to **Compliance** — frameworks, controls, governance, evidence, exceptions, KPIs, risk matrix, reports, and master data\nYou have full access to **Risk Management** — dashboard, register, assessment, response, risk control matrix, settings, and reports\nYou have full access to **Asset Management** — inventory, classification, settings, and reports\nYou have full access to **Internal Audit** — dashboard, universe, risk identification, planning, fieldwork, findings, CAPA, reports, document library, and settings\nYou can manage users and assign roles within your organization\nYou can configure organization settings including profile and branding\nYou have global scope — access to all department data within your tenant\nYou cannot access GRC Administration or other customer tenants\ncustomer\nadministrator\nrole\ncapabilities\npermissions\nmodules\naccess\ntenant	{-0.0003149509429931641,0.042327880859375,0.039276123046875,0.043853759765625,-0.00927734375,-0.0181427001953125,-0.00159454345703125,0.01486968994140625,0.01238250732421875,0.0176544189453125,0.003604888916015625,-0.031463623046875,-0.01293182373046875,-0.004535675048828125,-0.013946533203125,-0.0059051513671875,-0.0169830322265625,-0.0066375732421875,-0.021408081054687