cmn2wa21b0022jc3ofvz9sady	ca-org-profile	organization	Profile	grc	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage the organization profile as a Customer Administrator?	How do I manage the organization profile as a Customer Administrator?\nEdit organization identity\nUpdate company logo and branding\nManage organization branches and data centers\nSet organization vision and mission\nConfigure social media links\nUpload organization brochure\nAs Customer Administrator, you can fully manage the organization profile including identity, logo, branches, data centers, cloud providers, social media links, and brochure uploads.\nNavigate to **Organization** > **Profile** from the sidebar\nEdit the organization identity: name, email, phone, established date, employee count, branch count, head office, website\nUpload or update the **organization logo** using the logo upload area\nSet the **vision**, **mission**, **values**, and **CEO message** fields\nManage **branches** — add branches with location and address details\nManage **data centers** — add data centers with location type, address, and vendor\nManage **cloud providers** — add cloud provider name and service type\nConfigure **social media links** — Facebook, YouTube, Twitter, LinkedIn\nUpload a **brochure** document for the organization\nSet **regulatory jurisdiction** and **compliance requirements**\nOnly Customer Administrators and GRC Administrators can edit the organization profile\nLogo and brochure uploads support common image and document formats\nChanges to the profile are reflected across the entire system\norganization\nprofile\nlogo\nbranding\nbranches\ndata centers\ncloud providers\nvision\nmission\nsocial media\nbrochure	{0.002262115478515625,0.0293426513671875,0.004497528076171875,0.03228759765625,-0.01056671142578125,-0.00814056396484375,-0.001539230346679688,0.023162841796875,-0.007091522216796875,0.04400634765625,0.0153656005859375,-0.0274658203125,0.043212890625,-0.028717041015625,-0.01202392578125,0.01166534