cmn2wa22f0025jc3ogq4twbbw	ca-org-processes	organization	Process	grc	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage business processes as a Customer Administrator?	How do I manage business processes as a Customer Administrator?\nCreate business processes\nLink processes to risks and controls\nProcess KPI tracking\nProcess hierarchy management\nExport process data\nProcess criticality classification\nManage business processes from the Process page. Processes can be linked to risks, controls, and assets for traceability, and each supports KPI tracking and BIA assessment.\nNavigate to **Organization** > **Process** from the sidebar\nView all business processes with filtering and search capabilities\nClick **Add New** to create a process — enter name, code, owner, department, and description\nEdit existing processes by clicking the edit action on any row\nDelete processes that are no longer needed\nConfigure **Process KPI tracking** for each process\nPerform **BIA (Business Impact Analysis)** per process\n**Link processes** to risks and controls for cross-module traceability\nClassify **process criticality** levels\nSet up **process hierarchy** for parent-child relationships\nUse **Export** to download process data in Excel format\nProcesses are referenced by Risk Management, Compliance, and Internal Audit modules\nBulk import/export is available for efficient data management\nprocesses\nbusiness\ncreate\nkpi\nhierarchy\ncriticality\nlink\nrisks\ncontrols\nexport	{-0.039581298828125,0.053985595703125,0.06927490234375,0.0186767578125,-0.028564453125,-0.032867431640625,-0.01268768310546875,0.01001739501953125,0.02593994140625,0.053924560546875,-0.00213623046875,-0.0258331298828125,0.003240585327148438,-0.036285400390625,0.0311126708984375,0.0003857612609863281,-0.00656890869140625,0.043243408203125,-0.0267181396484375,0.0268402099609375,0.057647705078125,0.031463623046875,-0.012054443359375,0.054656982421875,0.01149749755859375,0.0079193115234375,-0.00508880615234375,0.0011863708