cmn2wa2ay0028jc3oced8iymc	ca-comp-frameworks	compliance	Framework	grc	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I adopt and manage compliance frameworks as Customer Administrator?	How do I adopt and manage compliance frameworks as Customer Administrator?\nSelect compliance frameworks for my organization\nImport framework from Excel\nTrack framework compliance percentage\nDownload framework template\nBrowse available frameworks\nFramework subscription management\nBrowse and adopt compliance frameworks like ISO 27001, NIST, SOC 2, and GDPR. Track compliance, policy, and evidence percentages per framework.\nNavigate to **Compliance** > **Frameworks** from the sidebar\nBrowse available frameworks displayed as cards in a grid view\nReview framework details: code, name, description, type, status, country, industry\nClick on a framework card to **adopt/select** it for your organization\nTrack **compliance percentage**, **policy percentage**, and **evidence percentage** per framework\nUse **Import** to upload framework templates from Excel\nUse **Export** to download framework data\nClick **Download Template** to get the Excel template for framework import\nDifferentiate between **custom** and **standard** frameworks\nManage framework **subscription/access** settings\nSelected frameworks automatically populate controls and requirements\nCompliance percentage is calculated based on compliant controls linked to the framework\nYou can adopt multiple frameworks simultaneously\nframework\nadopt\nselect\nimport\ncompliance\npercentage\ntemplate\nsubscription\niso\nnist\nsoc\ngdpr	{-0.0316387303173542,0.02766894362866879,0.06313397735357285,-0.03096912801265717,0.03570417687296867,-0.02742980048060417,-0.02328065410256386,-0.01363119948655367,0.03156698867678642,0.05629446357488632,0.03484325855970383,-0.01953805238008499,0.005885927937924862,-0.004522807896137238,0.06208174303174019,-0.02154686115682125,0.009775005280971527,-0.01605851016938686,0.00677972799167037,0.05667709186673164,0.0670