cmn2wa2bb0029jc3o2oxb4afb	ca-comp-controls	compliance	Controls	grc	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I assess and manage compliance controls as Customer Administrator?	How do I assess and manage compliance controls as Customer Administrator?\nBulk assess controls\nControl effectiveness assessment\nLink controls to evidence and risks\nControl status management\nCreate and delete controls\nMulti-select column filtering for controls\nManage compliance controls derived from adopted frameworks. Assess control effectiveness, link to evidence and risks, and perform bulk assessments.\nNavigate to **Compliance** > **Controls** from the sidebar\nView all controls with status indicators: Compliant, Partially Compliant, Non-Compliant, Not Assessed\nClick **Create Control** to add a new control — enter code, name, description, domain, category\nClick on any control to view details and assess effectiveness\nLink controls to **evidence items** for compliance proof\nMap controls to **risks** for risk-control coverage\nUse **multi-select column filtering** to filter by framework, domain, or status\nPerform **bulk assessment** across multiple controls at once\nUse **Assigned To** to delegate controls to department users\nEdit or delete controls as needed\nCompliant percentage is calculated from controls associated with frameworks\nControl compliance is determined by reviewing published policies or evidence\nPagination support is available for large control sets\ncontrols\nassess\nbulk\neffectiveness\nevidence\nrisks\nstatus\ncreate\ndelete\nfilter	{0.007425926625728607,0.05532709881663322,0.0577072836458683,0.002674669492989779,-0.02380182594060898,-0.02179810032248497,-0.01305457297712564,-0.00913212914019823,0.02289104089140892,0.09370147436857224,0.03201102837920189,-0.01122693251818419,0.03082093596458435,-0.01219236385077238,0.03723285719752312,-0.02904794178903103,-0.006648724433034658,0.004563028458505869,0.009472155012190342,0.05401557311415672,0.08471506834030151,0.014669696800