cmn2wa2bn002ajc3o1auugaj1	ca-comp-governance	compliance	Governance	grc	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage governance documents as Customer Administrator?	How do I manage governance documents as Customer Administrator?\nCreate policies procedures and standards\nDocument review and approval workflow\nVersion history tracking for documents\nSet policy recurrence and review schedule\nUpload governance document attachments\nLink governance documents to frameworks\nManage policies, procedures, standards, and guidelines with full lifecycle support including creation, review, approval, versioning, and linkage to frameworks and controls.\nNavigate to **Compliance** > **Governance** from the sidebar\nView all governance documents with version and status\nClick **New Policy** to create a new document — select type: Policy, Procedure, Standard, or Guideline\nFill in document properties: code, name, version, document type\nAssign **department**, **owner**, and **reviewers**\nSet **recurrence** (weekly, monthly, quarterly) and **review date**\nUpload **attachments** in the Attachments section — AI will review for relevant information\nLink the document to **frameworks** and **controls**\nAdd **evidence** attachments to support the document\nSubmit for **review and approval** workflow\n**Approve** and **Publish** the document when ready\nTrack **version history** across revisions\nAssigned To is limited to departmental contributors and reviewers\nApprovers are limited to department reviewers\nDocuments can be downloaded for offline review\ngovernance\npolicies\nprocedures\nstandards\nguidelines\napproval\nversion\nrecurrence\nreview\nattachments	{0.005989412311464548,0.04209273681044579,0.05850177258253098,0.006553256884217262,-0.01126538868993521,-0.03475124761462212,-0.0407579205930233,-0.005391046404838562,0.01667369529604912,0.05380690097808838,0.03065474331378937,-0.03850254416465759,0.001256424468010664,-0.04186259582638741,-0.01506271027028561,-0.005589542910456657,0.0