cmn2wa2c0002bjc3oaqa9u4r0	ca-comp-evidence	compliance	Evidence	grc	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage evidence collection as Customer Administrator?	How do I manage evidence collection as Customer Administrator?\nCreate evidence requests\nUpload compliance evidence files\nEvidence review and approval workflow\nAI-powered evidence suggestions\nLink evidence to controls and frameworks\nTrack evidence collection due dates\nCollect and manage evidence demonstrating compliance with controls. Create evidence requests, upload files, link to controls, and manage review workflows with AI-powered suggestions.\nNavigate to **Compliance** > **Evidence** from the sidebar\nView the evidence dashboard showing total count and status breakdown\nClick **Create New Evidence** to add a new evidence item\nAssign the evidence to a **contributor** and set a **due date**\nLink evidence to specific **controls** and **frameworks**\nUpload evidence files — documents, screenshots, exports\nTrack status progression: Pending > Submitted > Approved/Rejected\nReview submitted evidence and **approve** or **reject** with comments\nEnable **KPI Required** if KPI tracking is needed for this evidence\nUse **AI-powered evidence suggestions** for recommendation assistance\nFilter by status, assignee, control, department, or framework\nUse **Export** to download evidence data\nEvidence versioning is supported for updated submissions\nAI review analyzes uploaded attachments for relevant information\nAssigned To is limited to departmental contributors and reviewers\nevidence\ncollection\nupload\nreview\napprove\nreject\nai\nsuggestions\ndue dates\nstatus	{0.010235914029181,0.02227994985878468,0.04790917411446571,-0.00160334340762347,-0.02507101185619831,-0.0267941877245903,-0.02752229198813438,0.0201805867254734,-0.0003769449540413916,0.08358621597290039,0.0544135607779026,-0.01479262486100197,0.0225469209253788,-0.01093974709510803,0.008088010363280773,-0.001990148099139333,0.02457347512245178,-0.0122