cmn2wa2cb002cjc3onp3et7ih	ca-comp-exceptions	compliance	Exception Management	grc	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage compliance exceptions as Customer Administrator?	How do I manage compliance exceptions as Customer Administrator?\nCreate compliance exception requests\nException approval workflow\nSpecify compensating controls for exceptions\nTrack exception expiry dates\nException status indicators\nLink exceptions to controls\nDocument and track compliance exceptions where controls cannot be fully implemented. Manage exception requests with justification, compensating controls, and approval workflows.\nNavigate to **Compliance** > **Exceptions** from the sidebar\nView all exceptions with status indicators and visual charts (pie chart, status timeline)\nClick **Add New** to create an exception request with justification\nSet exception properties: code, description, severity, department, owner\nSpecify **compensating controls** that offset the exception risk\nSet **exception expiry/target remediation dates**\nLink the exception to the relevant **control**\nTrack approval workflow: Open > In-Progress > Closed\nEdit or delete exceptions as needed\nExceptions can also be linked from Control Detail and Policy Detail pages\nVisual status indicators show exception health at a glance\nPagination support is available for large exception lists\nexceptions\ncompliance\ncompensating\ncontrols\napproval\nexpiry\nseverity\nstatus\nremediation	{-0.01904633454978466,0.05095136165618896,0.05602716282010078,0.009619849734008312,-0.02989887818694115,-0.004021362867206335,-0.03253345936536789,-0.03074484504759312,0.05235325172543526,0.04892104491591454,0.03543391823768616,-0.04140402376651764,0.02328825369477272,-1.996896753553301e-05,0.01417598407715559,-0.02185011096298695,0.01955391466617584,0.02389251627027988,0.01890131272375584,0.0627465546131134,0.04708408564329147,0.04428031295537949,0.01237528398633003,0.05361011624336243,-0.02377166226506233,0.009190823882818222,-0.01244