cmn2wa2co002djc3ozjr2ybta	ca-comp-kpis	compliance	KPI	grc	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I track compliance KPIs as Customer Administrator?	How do I track compliance KPIs as Customer Administrator?\nDefine compliance KPI targets\nMonitor KPI health\nKPI status tracking\nCompliance performance indicators\nKPI review dates\nDepartment KPI tracking\nDefine and track Key Performance Indicators for compliance programs. Monitor compliance health through measurable metrics with targets, thresholds, and department associations.\nNavigate to **Compliance** > **KPIs** from the sidebar\nView all compliance KPIs with current values and targets\nReview KPI properties: code, objective, description, expected score, actual score\nCheck the **department association** for each KPI\nReview **evidence linkage** to KPIs\nMonitor **review date tracking** for upcoming reviews\nTrack KPI status: Scheduled, Missed, Overdue, or Achieved\nUse visual indicators to assess overall KPI health\nFilter KPIs by **status** and **department**\nUse **Search** to find specific KPIs\nKPIs are linked to evidence — enable 'KPI Required' on evidence to create KPIs\nStatus: Scheduled (awaiting response), Missed (expected > actual), Achieved (expected < actual), Overdue (no response by review date)\nkpi\ncompliance\ntargets\nhealth\nperformance\nindicators\nstatus\ndepartment\nreview	{-0.003658166155219078,0.06974699348211288,0.0456000380218029,-0.01338368374854326,-0.008130618371069431,-0.009214293211698532,-0.02025307714939117,-0.01946940273046494,0.05314289778470993,0.05436738952994347,0.05182044953107834,-0.003348982194438577,-0.01062858011573553,-0.05294698104262352,0.03227757662534714,-0.02477144822478294,0.00295408396050334,-0.01056735496968031,-0.005038779694586992,0.0590694360435009,0.05921637266874313,0.02430614270269871,0.02887349203228951,-0.001517603290267289,-0.01200000941753387,-0.001465562381781638,-0.01305307168513536,0.002814798150211573,0.0007702812436036766,-0.01065919175744057,0.064359232