cmn2wa2d1002ejc3o0i6ezqu9	ca-comp-risk-matrix	compliance	Risk Matrix	grc	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I use the compliance Risk Matrix?	How do I use the compliance Risk Matrix?\nMap risks to controls\nRisk control coverage gaps\nIdentify unmitigated risks\nCompliance risk matrix view\nControl effectiveness per risk\nResidual risk assessment view\nThe Risk Matrix maps relationships between risks and controls, helping you visualize coverage, identify unmitigated risks, and assess control effectiveness per risk.\nNavigate to **Compliance** > **Risk Matrix** from the sidebar\nView the **matrix view** showing risks vs. controls\n**Link** or **unlink** controls to risks as needed\nIdentify **unmitigated risks** (gaps) that have no controls assigned\nReview **control effectiveness** per risk with status indicators\nCheck status indicators: Compliant, Non-Compliant, Partially Compliant, Not Applicable\nExpand/collapse **risk groups** for focused analysis\nReview the **residual risk assessment** view\nUse **search and filter** to find specific risk-control mappings\nGaps in coverage indicate risks that need additional controls\nThe matrix helps prioritize control implementation efforts\nrisk\nmatrix\ncontrols\ncoverage\ngaps\nunmitigated\neffectiveness\nresidual	{-0.0136020565405488,0.0745629221200943,0.0448276475071907,0.02774819545447826,-0.0358857735991478,-0.03631157800555229,-0.001046027755364776,-0.03297611698508263,0.04345561191439629,0.05956517904996872,-0.004414754454046488,-0.0009942807955667377,0.03527072444558144,-0.004692709539085627,0.03087075427174568,-0.05313081666827202,0.01697300001978874,-0.007114466745406389,0.008320909924805164,0.05166415870189667,0.03673737868666649,0.02476757019758224,0.003320676041767001,0.04603409022092819,-0.01100583747029305,0.000822037342004478,-0.009349935688078403,-0.001443000743165612,0.01425259001553059,0.0325266569852829,0.03307073935866356,-0.01110046077519655,0.02002459205687046,-0.001893938519060612,0.005287060048431158,