cmn2wa2e5002hjc3o1jm8wph8	ca-risk-dashboard	risk-management	Dashboard	grc	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I use the Risk Dashboard as Customer Administrator?	How do I use the Risk Dashboard as Customer Administrator?\nRisk statistics and analytics\nRisk by status chart\nRisk by strategy chart\nRisk by rating and category charts\nReal-time risk monitoring\nRisk dashboard overview for admin\nThe Risk Dashboard provides a summary view with interactive charts for risk by status, strategy, rating, and category. As Customer Administrator, you see all risks across all departments.\nNavigate to **Risk Management** > **Dashboard** from the sidebar\nReview **total risk count** and **status breakdown** metrics\nAnalyze the **Risk by Status** chart — Open, In Progress, Completed, etc.\nReview the **Risk by Strategy** chart — Mitigate, Accept, Transfer, Avoid\nCheck the **Risk by Rating** chart — Low, Medium, High, Very High\nExamine the **Risk by Category** chart — Cyber, Operations, Legal, Physical, Cloud, etc.\nAll statistics are **real-time** and update as risks are modified\nAs Customer Administrator, you have global scope and see all department risks\nCategory names are translated based on the selected language\ndashboard\nrisk\nstatistics\nanalytics\ncharts\nstatus\nstrategy\nrating\ncategory\nmonitoring	{0.008434184826910496,0.04693705588579178,0.02380729652941227,0.04100275412201881,-0.005729871802031994,-0.01850380562245846,-0.04298864305019379,0.004716484807431698,0.03705434128642082,0.05826830118894577,-0.01409980747848749,-0.01522125024348497,-0.007225128822028637,-0.00578243937343359,0.0310966745018959,-0.03266202285885811,-0.02672772109508514,0.02591000124812126,-0.04446053504943848,0.04086257144808769,0.03226484358310699,0.01527965813875198,0.01761599816381931,0.02399420365691185,-0.02915751375257969,0.03427409753203392,0.00583792757242918,-0.01366758439689875,0.01559506449848413,0.01950843259692192,0.04714732617139816,-0.03640016540884972,-0.01338722370564938,0.0