cmn2wa2kc002ijc3o2hf96t7u	ca-risk-register	risk-management	Risk Register	grc	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage the Risk Register as Customer Administrator?	How do I manage the Risk Register as Customer Administrator?\nCreate and manage risks\nRisk import and export\nAI-powered risk suggestions\nRisk scoring likelihood impact\nAssign risk owners\nCategorize risks by type\nBulk risk management\nThe Risk Register is the central repository for all identified risks. As Customer Administrator, you have full CRUD access to create, assess, respond to, and track all risks across departments.\nNavigate to **Risk Management** > **Risk Register** from the sidebar\nView all risks with severity indicators, status, and ownership details\nClick **New Risk** to create a risk — enter name, description, risk sources, category, type\nSet **risk scoring**: likelihood (1-5) x impact (1-5) = risk score\nDefine **inherent risk rating** (before controls) and **residual risk rating** (after controls)\nAssign **risk owners** with contact info and department\nCategorize risks: Strategic, Operational, Financial, Compliance, Technology\nTrack status: Open, In-Progress, Completed, Mitigate, Accept, Transfer, Avoid\nUse **AI-powered risk suggestions** for intelligent risk identification\nLink risks to **controls** and **processes**\nUse **Import/Export** (Excel) for bulk risk management\nUse **Search**, **Filter**, and **Pagination** to navigate large risk lists\nRating badges are color-coded for quick visual assessment\nRisks can be edited and deleted from the register\nAfter creating a risk, assess it from the Risk Assessment page\nregister\nrisks\ncreate\nimport\nexport\nai\nscoring\nlikelihood\nimpact\nowners\ncategorize\nbulk	{-0.00952911376953125,0.06439208984375,0.04730224609375,0.0093841552734375,-0.0207061767578125,-0.029754638671875,-0.00891876220703125,0.0125579833984375,0.001297950744628906,0.056793212890625,-0.016845703125,-0.00408172607421875,0.00933074951171875,-0.002878189086