cmn2wa2ks002jjc3opmvegr5y	ca-risk-assessment	risk-management	Risk Assessment	grc	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I perform risk assessments as Customer Administrator?	How do I perform risk assessments as Customer Administrator?\nRisk assessment wizard\nLikelihood and impact assessment\nRisk heatmap visualization\nInherent vs residual risk assessment\nThreat and vulnerability mapping\nDepartment-scoped risk assessment\nAssessment approval workflow\nPerform detailed risk assessments using the step-by-step assessment wizard with likelihood/impact matrices, heatmap visualization, and structured workflows supporting draft through approval stages.\nNavigate to **Risk Management** > **Risk Assessment** from the sidebar\nView all risks being tracked with search and filter options\nClick the action button next to a risk to start assessment\nUse the **assessment wizard** for structured input:\n**Step 1**: Define risk context — link to assets and assign owner\n**Step 2**: Assess **likelihood** — Rare to Very Likely\n**Step 3**: Assess **impact** — Low to High across categories (Financial, Operational, etc.)\n**Step 4**: Review **risk rating** — auto-calculated from Likelihood x Impact\n**Step 5**: Select **risk response strategy** — Transfer, Avoid, Accept, or Treat\nReview the **risk heatmap** visualization for overall risk landscape\nMap **threats** and **vulnerabilities** to risks\nTrack assessment status: Draft, Submitted, Approved, Rejected, In-Progress\nSubmit assessment for **approval**\nInherent risk is assessed before controls; residual risk is assessed after controls are applied\nThe 5x5 likelihood vs. impact matrix determines risk severity\nAs Customer Administrator, you can assess risks across all departments\nassessment\nwizard\nlikelihood\nimpact\nheatmap\ninherent\nresidual\nthreat\nvulnerability\napproval	{-0.0328369140625,0.038330078125,0.05389404296875,0.038177490234375,-0.0450439453125,-0.0386962890625,-0.0291900634765625,0.0037689208984375,0.019744873046875,