cmn2wa2l6002kjc3ohaa8zybq	ca-risk-response	risk-management	Risk Response	grc	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage risk response strategies as Customer Administrator?	How do I manage risk response strategies as Customer Administrator?\nPlan risk treatment actions\nAssign risk response owners\nTrack risk mitigation progress\nRisk response approval workflow\nDocument response effectiveness\nLink controls to risk response\nPlan and track risk treatment actions including defining mitigation strategies, assigning responsibilities, monitoring implementation, and submitting for approval.\nNavigate to **Risk Management** > **Risk Response** from the sidebar\nUse the **Risk Response Strategy dropdown** to filter by method: Mitigate, Accept, Transfer, Avoid\nUse the **Risk Response Progress dropdown** to filter by status\nView charts showing visual representation of risks by method and status\nClick **Respond/Resume** on a risk to open the response page\nDefine the **response strategy** with a detailed action plan and due dates\nAssign **action owners** and set target dates\nLink required **controls** to the risk response\nTrack **implementation status**: Open, In-Progress, Completed\n**Submit for approval** when the response strategy is complete\nUse the **View** button to see all data and changes made\nAs Customer Administrator, you have access to risk responses across all departments\nResponse effectiveness should be documented for continuous improvement\nresponse\ntreatment\nmitigation\nstrategy\nowners\nprogress\napproval\neffectiveness\ncontrols	{-0.0281219482421875,0.042633056640625,0.056549072265625,0.02117919921875,-0.03973388671875,-0.04547119140625,-0.0204010009765625,0.0300750732421875,0.018157958984375,0.052276611328125,0.019683837890625,-0.0116729736328125,0.0188140869140625,-0.018524169921875,0.00189971923828125,-0.0462646484375,0.004062652587890625,0.01324462890625,-0.0142974853515625,0.0361328125,0.040313720703125,0.0224151611328125,0.00727081298828125,0.02