cmn2wa2lk002ljc3o0bf007ph	ca-risk-control-matrix	risk-management	Risk Control Matrix	grc	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I use the Risk Control Matrix?	How do I use the Risk Control Matrix?\nMap risks to controls in risk management\nRisk control coverage analysis\nIdentify risk coverage gaps\nRisk control linkage management\nResidual risk calculation from controls\nControl effectiveness for risk mitigation\nThe Risk Control Matrix maps relationships between risks and controls in the risk management module, helping visualize coverage, identify gaps, and calculate residual risk after controls.\nNavigate to **Risk Management** > **Risk Control Matrix** from the sidebar\nView the **matrix view** of risks vs. controls\n**Link** controls to risks or **unlink** as needed\nIdentify **unmitigated risks** — gaps where no controls are assigned\nReview **control effectiveness** per risk\nView **residual risk calculation** after controls are applied\nCheck **status indicators** for each control-risk link\nExpand/collapse **risk groups** for focused analysis\nUse **search and filter** to find specific mappings\nThis matrix is in the Risk Management module — the Compliance module has a similar Risk Matrix\nGaps highlight areas requiring additional control implementation\nrisk\ncontrol\nmatrix\ncoverage\ngaps\nlinkage\nresidual\ncalculation\neffectiveness\nmitigation	{-0.025970458984375,0.07843017578125,0.043731689453125,0.0303955078125,-0.0457763671875,-0.0248260498046875,-0.00551605224609375,-0.00940704345703125,0.0298309326171875,0.062164306640625,-0.016998291015625,-0.0201416015625,0.01187896728515625,-0.0159912109375,0.021820068359375,-0.053985595703125,0.01087188720703125,0.0089263916015625,0.00463104248046875,0.05084228515625,0.03155517578125,0.0221405029296875,0.0009450912475585938,0.04901123046875,-0.01293182373046875,0.007404327392578125,0.002655029296875,-0.01593017578125,0.001024246215820312,0.029022216796875,0.04156494140625,-0.016021728515625,0.0194549560546875,0.00606