cmn2wa2mr002ojc3om8avugl5	ca-asset-inventory	asset-management	Inventory	grc	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage the asset inventory as Customer Administrator?	How do I manage the asset inventory as Customer Administrator?\nCreate and manage organizational assets\nAsset types and categories\nBulk import and export assets\nLink assets to risks and processes\nAsset owner and department assignment\nAsset acquisition and status tracking\nMaintain a comprehensive inventory of all organizational assets including hardware, software, data, networks, personnel, and facilities with full CRUD, import/export, and risk/process linkage.\nNavigate to **Asset Management** > **Inventory** from the sidebar\nView all assets with type, owner, classification, and status columns\nClick **New Asset** to create — enter name, type, category, sub-category, group, owner, location\nSelect **asset type**: Package, Server, Monitor, Database, Users, Building, Wrench\nAssign **department** and **owner** for accountability\nSet **acquisition date** and **status** for lifecycle tracking\nEdit or delete assets using the action column\nUse **Import** to bulk upload assets via Excel\nUse **Export** to download the full asset inventory\nLink assets to **risks** and **processes** for cross-module traceability\nUse **Search**, **Filter**, and **Pagination** to navigate\nFields marked with asterisk (*) are required when creating assets\nAsset criticality and sensitivity can be set during creation\nasset\ninventory\ncreate\nmanage\ntypes\ncategories\nimport\nexport\nowner\ndepartment\nacquisition	{-0.031402587890625,0.050079345703125,0.0247650146484375,0.0002421140670776367,-0.0201416015625,-0.043487548828125,-0.022552490234375,-0.016998291015625,-0.00919342041015625,0.034637451171875,0.01548004150390625,-0.018646240234375,0.022430419921875,-0.05926513671875,0.044158935546875,0.001283645629882812,-0.0176544189453125,0.0212860107421875,-0.056488037109375,0.003725051879882812,0.061187744140625,0.0387268066