cmn2wa2vt002ujc3olt96zw7r	ca-audit-risk-identification	internal-audit	Risk Identification	audit	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I identify audit risks as Customer Administrator?	How do I identify audit risks as Customer Administrator?\nAI-powered audit risk identification\nSuggest risks with AI for audit\nStructured risk entry for audits\nLink audit risks to planning\nRisk assessment methodology for audits\nIdentify and document risks for audit planning using structured risk entry forms and AI-powered risk suggestions based on department context.\nNavigate to **Internal Audit** > **Risk Identification** from the sidebar\nSelect the **Department** from the dropdown\nOptionally enter **Audit Focus** details to refine AI suggestions\nClick **Suggest Risks with AI** to generate AI-recommended risks\nReview the AI-generated risk suggestions displayed below\nSelect relevant risks to include in your audit planning\nClick **Add to Register** to add selected risks to the Audit Risk Register\nAlternatively, use **structured risk entry forms** for manual risk documentation\nConfigure the **assessment methodology** as needed\nAI suggestions are contextual based on the selected department and audit focus\nRisks can be modified after being added to the register\nIdentified risks link directly to audit planning for risk-based audit approaches\nrisk\nidentification\naudit\nai\nsuggest\nstructured\nentry\nmethodology	{-0.01183319091796875,0.018402099609375,0.042449951171875,0.002796173095703125,-0.029388427734375,-0.037078857421875,-0.02740478515625,0.027313232421875,0.00927734375,0.04437255859375,-0.02239990234375,-0.0174713134765625,0.0258636474609375,-0.0079803466796875,0.0096893310546875,-0.0193939208984375,-0.025604248046875,0.028228759765625,-0.018768310546875,0.0118255615234375,0.050933837890625,0.0516357421875,0.00262451171875,-0.004581451416015625,0.003032684326171875,0.005435943603515625,0.00469970703125,-0.0224761962890625,-0.01332855224609375,0.007076263427734375,0.062622