cmn2wa2w8002vjc3on6kwtuz9	ca-audit-risk-register	internal-audit	Risk Register	audit	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage the audit risk register as Customer Administrator?	How do I manage the audit risk register as Customer Administrator?\nCreate audit risks manually\nAI-recommended audit risks\nImport export audit risks\nAudit risk probability and impact\nAudit risk register overview\nThe Audit Risk Register maintains all audit-specific risks. Create risks manually or use AI recommendations, assess probability and impact, and manage via import/export.\nNavigate to **Internal Audit** > **Risk Register** from the sidebar\nView audit risks with columns: Risk ID, Name, Likelihood, Impact, Department, Category, Status\nClick **+ Add Risk Manually** to create a new risk\nFill in: Risk Name, Department, Section/Process, Sub-Process, Activity, Category\nEnter the **Risk Description** with potential causes and impacts\nSet **Inherent Risk Scoring**: Inherent Likelihood and Inherent Impact\nDefine **Controls**: Control Description and Control Effectiveness (Effective, Needs Improvement, Ineffective)\nSet **Residual Risk Scoring**: Residual Likelihood and Residual Impact\nAdd **Audit Information**: Audit Comment, Status (Open, Under Review, Closed)\nUpload **Evidence Files** as attachments\nClick **Save** to add the risk\nUse **Import** to bulk upload risks and **Export** to download in Excel\nUse filters by **Year** and **Department** to narrow results\nRisk ID is auto-generated (e.g., RID001) and cannot be edited\nUse the AI risk identification feature to generate risk suggestions before adding to register\naudit\nrisk\nregister\ncreate\nmanual\nai\nimport\nexport\nprobability\nimpact	{-0.002655029296875,0.038177490234375,0.0595703125,-0.0204925537109375,-0.0364990234375,-0.0265350341796875,0.0004150867462158203,-0.00433349609375,0.01297760009765625,0.05413818359375,-0.01163482666015625,-0.001207351684570312,0.0287017822265625,0.006221771240234375,0.0270538330078125,-0.0