cmn2wa2x1002xjc3oc4qoq76v	ca-audit-fieldwork	internal-audit	Field Work	audit	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage audit fieldwork as Customer Administrator?	How do I manage audit fieldwork as Customer Administrator?\nExecute audit fieldwork\nAdd work papers and observations\nTrack fieldwork completion\nEvidence requests during audit\nUpload audit supporting documents\nFieldwork task list management\nExecute audit fieldwork by conducting testing, gathering evidence, documenting observations, managing task lists, and uploading supporting documents linked to engagements.\nNavigate to **Internal Audit** > **Fieldwork** from the sidebar\nView engagements with title, department, status, dates, and assigned auditor\nClick **Add/View Details** on an audit to access fieldwork documentation\nUse **Comments** to write and save collaboration notes\nUse **Work Papers** to attach and organize supporting audit documents\nManage the **Audit Engagement Task List**: Ref No, Task, Document, Executed status, Comments\nAdd more tasks using **+ Add Task**\nCreate **Evidence Requests** specifying title, sample size, and description\nUpload **Other Documents** — policies, evidence, reports\nMove audits through workflow: Planned > In Progress > Completed\nFilter by **department**, **status**, or **auditor**\nAll fieldwork documentation is linked to the parent audit engagement\nEach task row can be marked as executed with a checkbox\nEvidence requests create formal documentation requirements for auditees\nfieldwork\nexecute\nwork papers\nobservations\nevidence\ndocuments\ntasks\ncompletion	{-0.0187225341796875,0.043121337890625,0.035858154296875,-0.031219482421875,-0.054229736328125,-0.023956298828125,0.006809234619140625,0.0158233642578125,0.00966644287109375,0.044403076171875,0.04498291015625,0.00769805908203125,0.0277557373046875,-0.03900146484375,-0.0003011226654052734,0.0220947265625,0.0113372802734375,-0.0126800537109375,-0.026397705078125,0.0281829833984375,0.0517578125,0.045440673