cmn2wa2xg002yjc3oi8lk26xm	ca-audit-findings	internal-audit	Findings	audit	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage audit findings as Customer Administrator?	How do I manage audit findings as Customer Administrator?\nCreate audit findings from fieldwork\nClassify finding severity\nAssign finding remediation owners\nTrack finding status and remediation\nLink findings to controls and risks\nSet remediation due dates for findings\nDocument and manage audit findings identified during fieldwork. Classify by severity, assign remediation owners, set due dates, and track progress from Open through Closed.\nNavigate to **Internal Audit** > **Fieldwork** and open the relevant audit\nGo to the **Findings** section\nClick **Add Finding** to create a new finding\nEnter details: **issue description**, **severity rating** (Critical, High, Medium, Low, Informational)\nDocument **criteria**, **condition**, **cause**, and **effect**\nAdd **recommendations** for corrective action\nAssign **CAPA** by designating responsible personnel\nSet the **Target Closure Date** for remediation\nAttach **supporting documents** as evidence\nClick **Save** to record the finding\nTrack finding status: Open, In Progress, Closed, Overdue\nLink findings to **controls** and **risks**\nFindings severity levels: Critical, High, Medium, Low, Informational\nCAPA assignment ensures accountability for issue resolution\nFindings can be edited and deleted as needed\nfindings\naudit\nseverity\nremediation\nowners\nstatus\ncontrols\nrisks\ndue dates	{-0.007678985595703125,0.05230712890625,0.0660400390625,0.000165104866027832,-0.033172607421875,-0.028594970703125,-0.00917816162109375,-0.0443115234375,0.00995635986328125,0.0294342041015625,0.040069580078125,-0.0248870849609375,-0.0240478515625,-0.00930023193359375,0.047271728515625,-0.0279388427734375,0.01204681396484375,-0.01416015625,-0.05029296875,0.0489501953125,0.08892822265625,0.0577392578125,-0.002199172973632812,0.016510009765625,-0.0051422119140625,-0.03939819