cmn2wa2xv002zjc3oadnrdbud	ca-audit-capa	internal-audit	CAPA Tracking	audit	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I track CAPA as Customer Administrator?	How do I track CAPA as Customer Administrator?\nCorrective and preventive action tracking\nCAPA implementation monitoring\nVerify CAPA effectiveness\nEscalate overdue CAPAs\nCAPA comments and attachments\nTrack CAPA completion percentage\nTrack Corrective and Preventive Actions (CAPA) arising from audit findings. Monitor implementation progress, verify effectiveness, manage escalations, and track completion percentages.\nNavigate to **Internal Audit** > **CAPA Tracking** from the sidebar\nView all CAPA items with status, severity, due dates, and responsible persons\nClick **Edit** on a CAPA to update its details\nUpdate action tracking: type, description, **completion percentage**, and status\nAssign or change **responsible persons** and **target completion dates**\nAdd **comments** and **discussion notes** for collaboration\nUpload **file attachments** as evidence of corrective action\nVerify **action effectiveness** once CAPA is implemented\n**Escalate overdue CAPAs** that have not been completed by their target date\nFilter CAPA items by **status** (Open/Closed)\nUse **search** and **pagination** to navigate\nCAPA items are linked to specific audit findings\nMonitoring open vs. closed items ensures timely remediation\nCompletion percentage allows tracking partial progress on CAPAs\ncapa\ncorrective\npreventive\ntracking\nimplementation\neffectiveness\nescalate\noverdue\ncompletion	{-0.02001953125,0.044036865234375,0.04913330078125,-0.005329132080078125,-0.036468505859375,-0.01232147216796875,-0.01177978515625,-0.0282135009765625,0.047332763671875,0.00951385498046875,0.045379638671875,-0.003404617309570312,0.01082611083984375,0.0001490116119384766,0.01381683349609375,-0.041473388671875,0.0112762451171875,-0.003847122192382812,-0.0298309326171875,0.0418701171875,0.036712646484375,0.033966064453125,0.0269622802734375,0.013