cmn2wa2ya0030jc3ock7etxgq	ca-audit-reports	internal-audit	Report	audit	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I generate audit reports as Customer Administrator?	How do I generate audit reports as Customer Administrator?\nGenerate draft audit report\nCompile audit findings into report\nDownload audit report PDF\nAudit report review and approval\nReport executive summary and methodology\nAuditee comments in audit report\nGenerate and manage audit reports by compiling findings, recommendations, management responses, and conclusions into formal reports with PDF download capability.\nNavigate to **Internal Audit** > **Report** from the sidebar\nView all audit reports with status (Draft, Submitted, Approved)\nClick **Generate Draft Report** for a completed audit engagement\nReview the report including: **report code**, **title**, **executive summary**, **scope**, **objectives**, **methodology**\nReview **observations** and **recommendations** sections\nAdd **management response** and **auditee comments**\nReview the **conclusion** and **overall result**\nClick **Edit** to modify report content before finalization\nUse **report preview** to verify formatting\nClick **Download** to save as PDF for distribution\nUse **search** and **pagination** for large report lists\nOnly completed audits have the Generate Draft Report option\nDraft reports can be circulated for review before finalization\nReports can be edited by authorized users before final submission\naudit\nreports\ngenerate\ndraft\npdf\nfindings\nexecutive\nsummary\nmethodology\napproval	{-0.0305023193359375,0.02490234375,0.05291748046875,-0.035064697265625,-0.06640625,-0.004497528076171875,-0.039459228515625,-0.00140380859375,0.0187530517578125,0.01337432861328125,0.01494598388671875,-0.043243408203125,0.001948356628417969,-0.02520751953125,0.02874755859375,0.0162200927734375,1.07884407043457e-05,-0.01116943359375,-0.041656494140625,0.053863525390625,0.06610107421875,0.05194091796875,0.02117919921875,0.031280517578125,-0.0