cmn2wa37x0038jc3o95ey744z	dr-org-bia	organization	Business Impact Analysis	grc	{DepartmentReviewer}	How do I view Business Impact Analysis (BIA) as a Department Reviewer?	How do I view Business Impact Analysis (BIA) as a Department Reviewer?\nView BIA records in my department\nCheck business impact analysis for department processes\nSee RTO and RPO for my department\nDepartment reviewer BIA access\nReview BIA impact ratings\nView process criticality in my department\nAs a Department Reviewer, you can view BIA records for processes within your department, including RTO/RPO targets, impact ratings, and process criticality.\nNavigate to **Organization** > **Settings** > **BIA** from the sidebar\nView the list of BIA records — you will only see BIA entries for processes within your assigned department\nReview **RTO (Recovery Time Objective)** and **RPO (Recovery Point Objective)** targets\nView **impact ratings** — financial, operational, reputational, and legal\nCheck process criticality based on the impact analysis\nYou will only see BIA records for processes within your department\nYou cannot create or modify BIA records — this requires a Contributor or Administrator role\nBIA categories and methodology are configured at the organization level by administrators\nBIA\nbusiness impact analysis\nRTO\nRPO\ncriticality\nimpact\ndepartment\nrecovery	{-0.0294342041015625,0.060760498046875,0.05615234375,0.03192138671875,-0.041900634765625,-0.032684326171875,-0.0150299072265625,0.017486572265625,-0.004810333251953125,-0.00553131103515625,0.033843994140625,-0.00897979736328125,-0.017333984375,-0.046783447265625,0.006855010986328125,0.03173828125,-0.002712249755859375,0.015106201171875,-0.0257568359375,0.042449951171875,0.046875,0.02337646484375,-0.01369476318359375,0.00817108154296875,0.01227569580078125,-0.002126693725585938,-0.0184478759765625,0.01213836669921875,-0.00620269775390625,-0.03997802734375,0.0266876220703125,0.006069183349609375,-0.035430908203125,-0.006198883056