cmn2wa399003bjc3om08ddzt7	dr-comp-controls	compliance	Controls	grc	{DepartmentReviewer}	How do I review compliance controls as a Department Reviewer?	How do I review compliance controls as a Department Reviewer?\nView controls in my department\nReview department compliance controls\nCheck control assessment status\nDepartment reviewer control access\nAssess controls within my department\nView control effectiveness for my department\nReview department control compliance\nAs a Department Reviewer, you can view and review compliance controls within your department. Review control status, effectiveness, and linked evidence to support department-level compliance reviews.\nNavigate to **Compliance** > **Controls** from the sidebar\nView the list of controls — you will only see controls assigned to your department\nReview control details: code, name, description, domain, category, and status\nCheck control status: **Compliant**, **Partially Compliant**, **Non-Compliant**, or **Not Assessed**\nReview linked **evidence items** for each control\nUse filters to narrow by framework, domain, or status\nReview control effectiveness and approve/reject as needed\nYou will only see controls owned by or assigned to your department\nYou can review and approve/reject control assessments within your department scope\nYou cannot create or delete controls — this requires a Contributor or Administrator role\nUse multi-select column filtering to efficiently review controls by category\ncompliance\ncontrols\nassessment\ndepartment\nreview\nstatus\ncompliant\neffectiveness	{-0.004482269287109375,0.04034423828125,0.03790283203125,0.0289306640625,-0.0242767333984375,0.0105133056640625,0.0092010498046875,0.01082611083984375,0.02056884765625,0.05450439453125,0.049346923828125,-0.0301666259765625,0.038482666015625,-0.002611160278320312,0.011749267578125,-0.019561767578125,0.0041351318359375,0.0152130126953125,0.0435791015625,0.07403564453125,0.06231689453125,0.0118865966796875,0.022125244140625,0.