cmn2wa3fz003cjc3onri9ekt2	dr-comp-governance	compliance	Governance Documents	grc	{DepartmentReviewer}	How do I review governance documents as a Department Reviewer?	How do I review governance documents as a Department Reviewer?\nView policies and procedures in my department\nReview department governance documents\nCheck document approval status\nDepartment reviewer governance access\nApprove or reject department policies\nView governance document versions\nReview department standards and guidelines\nAs a Department Reviewer, you can view and review governance documents (policies, procedures, standards, guidelines) within your department. You can participate in document review and approval workflows.\nNavigate to **Compliance** > **Governance** from the sidebar\nView the list of governance documents — you will only see documents within your assigned department\nReview document details: code, name, version, document type, and status\nCheck the **review and approval workflow** status for each document\nReview **version history** to track changes over time\nView attached supporting files and evidence\n**Approve or reject** documents submitted for review within your department scope\nYou will only see governance documents owned by or assigned to your department\nYou can approve or reject documents as part of the review workflow\nYou cannot create, edit, or delete governance documents — this requires a Contributor or Administrator role\nReview schedules and due dates are set by document owners or administrators\ngovernance\ndocuments\npolicies\nprocedures\nstandards\nguidelines\nreview\napproval\ndepartment	{4.863739013671875e-05,0.059356689453125,0.04156494140625,0.028350830078125,0.0009608268737792969,0.0169677734375,-0.0185546875,0.0001220107078552246,0.0184478759765625,0.031494140625,0.041259765625,-0.04095458984375,-0.005558013916015625,-0.012237548828125,-0.004543304443359375,0.0117034912109375,-0.001114845275878906,0.02593994140625,0.04840087890625,0.0606689453125,