cmn2wa3ge003djc3o8z4aauod	dr-comp-evidence	compliance	Evidence	grc	{DepartmentReviewer}	How do I review evidence as a Department Reviewer?	How do I review evidence as a Department Reviewer?\nView evidence items in my department\nReview department evidence submissions\nApprove or reject evidence for department controls\nDepartment reviewer evidence access\nCheck evidence status for my department\nReview submitted evidence files\nEvidence review workflow department scope\nAs a Department Reviewer, you can view and review evidence items for controls within your department. You can approve or reject submitted evidence as part of the compliance review workflow.\nNavigate to **Compliance** > **Evidence** from the sidebar\nView the list of evidence items — you will only see evidence for controls within your assigned department\nReview evidence details: linked control, status, due date, and assignee\nCheck evidence status: **Pending**, **Submitted**, **Approved**, or **Rejected**\nOpen submitted evidence to review uploaded files and documentation\n**Approve or reject** submitted evidence within your department scope\nUse filters to find evidence by status, assignee, or control\nYou will only see evidence items linked to controls within your department\nYou can approve or reject evidence as part of the review workflow\nYou cannot create evidence requests or upload evidence files — this requires a Contributor role\nEvidence due dates are set by the evidence requestor or administrator\nevidence\nreview\napprove\nreject\ndepartment\nsubmissions\nfiles\ncontrols\ncompliance	{0.005535125732421875,0.019866943359375,0.0122222900390625,0.0116119384765625,-0.0406494140625,0.004589080810546875,-0.00121307373046875,0.018890380859375,-0.01543426513671875,0.068359375,0.052886962890625,-0.0125274658203125,0.02777099609375,0.01418304443359375,0.00742340087890625,-0.005802154541015625,0.0310821533203125,0.017181396484375,0.00334930419921875,0.05902099609375,0.05615234375,-0.01849365234375,0