cmn2wa3kv003kjc3o92b8vpbf	dr-risk-register	risk-management	Risk Register	grc	{DepartmentReviewer}	How do I review risks in the risk register as a Department Reviewer?	How do I review risks in the risk register as a Department Reviewer?\nView risks in my department\nReview department risk register\nCheck risk status for my department\nDepartment reviewer risk register access\nSee risk details and ratings in my department\nApprove or reject risks in my department\nView department risk owners\nAs a Department Reviewer, you can view and review risks in the risk register within your department. Review risk details, ratings, and approve or reject risks as part of the review workflow.\nNavigate to **Risk Management** > **Risk Register** from the sidebar\nView the list of risks — you will only see risks within your assigned department\nReview risk details: name, description, risk sources, category, and type\nCheck **inherent risk rating** and **residual risk rating** (likelihood x impact)\nReview risk owner assignment and contact information\nCheck risk status: open, in-progress, completed, mitigate, accept, transfer, avoid\nView **rating badges** with color coding for quick assessment\n**Approve or reject** risks submitted for review within your department scope\nUse search, filter, and pagination to navigate department risks\nYou will only see risks assigned to or owned by your department\nYou can approve or reject risks as part of the department review workflow\nYou cannot create, edit, or delete risks — this requires a Contributor or Administrator role\nRisk scoring uses a 5x5 matrix: likelihood (1-5) x impact (1-5)\nrisk\nregister\ndepartment\nreview\nstatus\nrating\nowner\napprove\nreject	{-0.021636962890625,0.0543212890625,0.04913330078125,0.040252685546875,-0.018218994140625,-0.001179695129394531,0.005535125732421875,0.00771331787109375,0.0191650390625,0.04388427734375,0.00829315185546875,-0.0268707275390625,0.0157470703125,0.0110321044921875,0.003755569458007812,-0