cmn2wa3la003ljc3o1b60zxdf	dr-risk-assessment	risk-management	Risk Assessment	grc	{DepartmentReviewer}	How do I review risk assessments as a Department Reviewer?	How do I review risk assessments as a Department Reviewer?\nView risk assessments in my department\nReview risk assessment results department scope\nCheck risk assessment status for my department\nDepartment reviewer risk assessment access\nView risk heatmap for my department\nReview inherent vs residual risk in my department\nApprove department risk assessments\nAs a Department Reviewer, you can view and review risk assessments within your department, including the risk heatmap, inherent vs. residual comparisons, and assessment status.\nNavigate to **Risk Management** > **Risk Assessment** from the sidebar\nView risk assessments — you will only see assessments for risks within your assigned department\nReview the **5x5 risk assessment matrix** (likelihood vs. impact)\nCompare **inherent risk** levels with **residual risk** levels (after controls)\nView the **risk heatmap** visualization for your department\nCheck assessment status: draft, submitted, approved, rejected, in-progress\nReview threat and vulnerability mappings\n**Approve or reject** risk assessments submitted for department review\nYou will only see risk assessments scoped to your department\nYou can approve or reject assessments as part of the review workflow\nThe assessment wizard is available for structured assessment input\nAssessment rationale documentation helps justify risk ratings\nrisk\nassessment\ndepartment\nheatmap\ninherent\nresidual\nlikelihood\nimpact\nreview\napprove	{-0.0278778076171875,0.048370361328125,0.05731201171875,0.04974365234375,-0.026275634765625,-0.0133056640625,-0.01275634765625,-0.002170562744140625,0.03228759765625,0.0439453125,0.00649261474609375,-0.031402587890625,0.017425537109375,0.0082550048828125,0.007843017578125,-0.01202392578125,0.00339508056640625,0.0203399658203125,-0.01462554931640625,0.0242767333984375