cmn2wa3rm003mjc3ohr4w84p2	dr-risk-response	risk-management	Risk Response	grc	{DepartmentReviewer}	How do I review risk responses as a Department Reviewer?	How do I review risk responses as a Department Reviewer?\nView risk treatment plans in my department\nCheck risk response status for my department\nDepartment reviewer risk response access\nReview mitigation actions in my department\nSee risk treatment progress department scope\nView risk response strategies for my department\nAs a Department Reviewer, you can view and review risk response plans within your department, including treatment strategies, action plans, and implementation progress.\nNavigate to **Risk Management** > **Risk Response** from the sidebar\nView risks requiring response — you will only see risks within your assigned department\nReview the **response strategy** for each risk: Mitigate, Accept, Transfer, or Avoid\nView **treatment action plans** with assigned owners and due dates\nCheck action implementation status: open, in-progress, or completed\nReview **response progress** tracking and effectiveness documentation\nYou will only see risk responses scoped to your department\nYou can review and approve/reject response plans within your department\nYou cannot create or modify risk treatment plans — this requires a Contributor or Administrator role\nResponse effectiveness should be reviewed periodically\nrisk\nresponse\ntreatment\nmitigation\ndepartment\naction plans\nstrategy\nreview	{-0.04327392578125,0.046478271484375,0.040924072265625,0.03106689453125,-0.039825439453125,-0.01174163818359375,-0.0004715919494628906,0.039520263671875,0.024322509765625,0.0234527587890625,0.022247314453125,-0.0295257568359375,0.030029296875,0.002428054809570312,0.0005230903625488281,-0.03802490234375,0.01229095458984375,0.012908935546875,-0.0110015869140625,0.055206298828125,0.028350830078125,0.01373291015625,0.017852783203125,-0.006465911865234375,-0.0341796875,0.050933837890625,-0.007602691650390625,0.018173217