cmn2wa3s1003njc3oseexdhol	dr-risk-control-matrix	risk-management	Risk Control Matrix	grc	{DepartmentReviewer}	How do I view the risk control matrix as a Department Reviewer?	How do I view the risk control matrix as a Department Reviewer?\nView risk-control mapping in my department\nCheck risk control matrix department scope\nDepartment reviewer risk control matrix access\nSee control coverage for department risks\nView unmitigated risks in my department\nRisk control matrix department view\nAs a Department Reviewer, you can view the risk control matrix to see how risks and controls are mapped within your department, and identify any coverage gaps.\nNavigate to **Risk Management** > **Risk Control Matrix** from the sidebar\nView the matrix of risks vs. controls — you will only see data within your assigned department\nReview which controls mitigate which risks in your department\nIdentify **unmitigated risks** (gaps without linked controls)\nCheck control effectiveness per risk\nView **residual risk calculation** for each risk-control pairing\nUse collapsible risk groups and search/filter to navigate the matrix\nYou will only see risk-control mappings for your department\nYou cannot link or unlink controls from risks — this requires an Administrator or Contributor role\nThe matrix helps identify where additional controls may be needed in your department\nrisk\ncontrol\nmatrix\nmapping\ndepartment\ncoverage\ngaps\nunmitigated	{-0.0246124267578125,0.0655517578125,0.034088134765625,0.040069580078125,-0.036346435546875,0.001691818237304688,0.00324249267578125,0.00872802734375,0.0112762451171875,0.0281982421875,0.00218963623046875,-0.0355224609375,0.0226898193359375,0.0173492431640625,0.02386474609375,-0.04443359375,0.01238250732421875,-0.0081634521484375,-0.000957489013671875,0.050140380859375,0.040802001953125,0.0253448486328125,0.0177764892578125,0.0297698974609375,-0.0277862548828125,0.0309295654296875,-0.01708984375,-0.00823974609375,0.00589752197265625,0.04168701171