cmn2wa3sh003ojc3od327ql12	dr-risk-settings	risk-management	Settings	grc	{DepartmentReviewer}	How do I view risk management settings as a Department Reviewer?	How do I view risk management settings as a Department Reviewer?\nView risk categories and types\nCheck risk settings department scope\nDepartment reviewer risk settings access\nSee risk rating matrix configuration\nView risk threshold settings\nAs a Department Reviewer, you can view risk management settings including risk categories, types, rating matrix, and threshold configurations — but you cannot modify them.\nNavigate to **Risk Management** > **Settings** from the sidebar\nView **risk categories** — Strategic, Operational, Financial, Compliance, Technology\nView **risk type definitions**\nView the **risk rating matrix** customization\nView **threshold configurations** for risk levels\nYou have view-only access to risk settings\nModifying risk settings requires a Customer Administrator role\nRisk settings apply organization-wide, not per department\nrisk\nsettings\ncategories\ntypes\nthresholds\nrating matrix\nconfiguration\ndepartment	{-0.045745849609375,0.0416259765625,0.028961181640625,0.01776123046875,-0.038055419921875,-0.001938819885253906,0.006366729736328125,0.0136871337890625,0.033477783203125,0.017822265625,-0.00711822509765625,-0.035614013671875,0.0203857421875,0.0255126953125,0.046142578125,-0.009979248046875,0.004261016845703125,0.0279388427734375,0.0125732421875,0.05859375,0.0487060546875,0.0206146240234375,0.004955291748046875,0.0214691162109375,-0.0277557373046875,0.031402587890625,0.001220703125,0.019561767578125,0.0125885009765625,0.0191650390625,0.005992889404296875,-0.0173492431640625,-0.0078887939453125,0.04827880859375,0.001018524169921875,-0.0158538818359375,-0.0107879638671875,-0.003955841064453125,0.036346435546875,0.032928466796875,0.007701873779296875,0.03375244140625,-0.01464080810546875,-0.001471519470214844,-0.0006036758422851562,0.0479736328125,0.032684326171875,-0.0144729614