cmn2wa3tp003rjc3ongqvay1x	dr-asset-classification	asset-management	Classification	grc	{DepartmentReviewer}	How do I view asset classifications as a Department Reviewer?	How do I view asset classifications as a Department Reviewer?\nView asset classification in my department\nCheck CIA ratings for department assets\nDepartment reviewer asset classification access\nSee confidentiality integrity availability for my assets\nView classification hierarchy department scope\nReview asset security classification\nAs a Department Reviewer, you can view asset classifications within your department, including CIA (Confidentiality, Integrity, Availability) ratings and the classification hierarchy.\nNavigate to **Asset Management** > **Classification** from the sidebar\nView the classification hierarchy: **Category** > **Sub-Category** > **Group**\nReview classification levels: Public, Internal, Confidential, Restricted\nCheck **CIA impact** ratings for assets within your department: Confidentiality, Integrity, Availability\nView handling and protection requirements per classification level\nReview asset grouping and organization within your department\nYou will only see classification data relevant to your department's assets\nYou cannot create or modify classifications — this requires an Administrator role\nCIA classification helps determine the security controls needed for each asset\nasset\nclassification\nCIA\nconfidentiality\nintegrity\navailability\ndepartment\nhierarchy	{-0.0259246826171875,0.031494140625,0.04034423828125,0.0160980224609375,-0.006710052490234375,0.0228118896484375,0.001117706298828125,-0.01043701171875,0.010345458984375,-0.01580810546875,0.024383544921875,-0.037841796875,0.0160064697265625,-0.002407073974609375,-0.001989364624023438,-0.0261383056640625,0.00994110107421875,0.040740966796875,-0.01087188720703125,0.04486083984375,0.002672195434570312,0.03466796875,-0.017181396484375,0.00336456298828125,-0.023590087890625,0.01519775390625,-0.0261077880859375,