cmn2wa403003wjc3ojysag2i3	ga-admin-compliance-master-data	grc-admin	Compliance Master Data	grc	{GRCAdministrator}	How do I manage system-wide compliance master data?	How do I manage system-wide compliance master data?\nManage framework definitions\nCreate control templates system-wide\nConfigure governance document templates\nSet up evidence templates\nDefine domains and categories for compliance\nSystem-wide compliance configuration\nManage compliance templates across tenants\nThe Compliance Master Data page lets you manage system-wide compliance definitions including framework definitions, control templates, governance document templates, evidence templates, and domain/category definitions. These master data items are available to all customer tenants.\nNavigate to **GRC Administration** > **Compliance Master Data** from the sidebar (Sidebar → GRC → Compliance Master Data)\nManage **framework definitions** — add, edit, or remove compliance frameworks (e.g., ISO 27001, NIST, SOC 2, GDPR) available system-wide\nConfigure **control templates** — define reusable control definitions that tenants can adopt\nSet up **governance document templates** — create standard templates for policies, procedures, and guidelines\nDefine **evidence templates** — configure standard evidence collection templates\nManage **domain and category definitions** — organize compliance areas into domains and categories for consistent classification\nOnly GRC Administrators can manage system-wide compliance master data\nChanges to master data affect all customer tenants — modifications should be carefully planned\nFramework definitions added here become available for all tenants to adopt in their compliance programs\nIndividual tenants can customize their own compliance data within the Compliance module, but master data provides the system-wide baseline\nThis is separate from tenant-level Compliance Master Data (accessible to Customer Administrators under Compliance > Master Data)\ncompliance\nmaster data\nframeworks\ncontrols\ntemplates\ngovernance\nevidence\ndomains\ncategories\nsystem-wide\ndefinitions	{0.0178985595703125,0.0595703125,0.1182861328125,-0.0063629150390625,0.001233100891113281,-0.0081787109375,-0.0175323486328125,-0.00408172607421875,0.0059356689453125,0.038116455078125,0.037078857421875,-0.00408935546875,0.0196685791015625,-0.01076507568359375,0.0251007080078125,-0.032135009765625,-0.0003490447998046875,0.0171661376953125,0.0198211669921875,0.04998779296875,0.08563232421875,0.043975830078125,0.00946807861328125,0.0177154541015625,-0.0377197265625,-0.017242431640625,-0.033050537109375,0.054046630859375,-0.002283096313476562,-0.0005407333374023438,0.044342041015625,-0.018646240234375,0.004547119140625,-0.01763916015625,0.032257080078125,0.01255035400390625,-0.0183868408203125,0.006946563720703125,-0.0189971923828125,0.0116729736328125,0.0101776123046875,0.007770538330078125,-0.04620361328125,0.010162353515625,-0.021759033203125,-0.0248870849609375,-0.0162353515625,-0.0134735107421875,-0.0111083984375,-0.014312744140625,-0.00470733642578125,-0.035400390625,0.015655517578125,-0.0384521484375,-0.01763916015625,0.03369140625,-0.0082855224609375,-0.01399993896484375,-0.021087646484375,0.01000213623046875,0.004039764404296875,-0.0308685302734375,-0.0269012451171875,0.0006136894226074219,0.001008033752441406,-0.002775192260742188,-0.005840301513671875,0.0212249755859375,0.00498199462890625,0.0164031982421875,0.036529541015625,-0.00864410400390625,-0.003635406494140625,-0.029449462890625,0.01389312744140625,0.0004804134368896484,0.05096435546875,0.05181884765625,-0.041839599609375,-0.01023101806640625,0.0045928955078125,-0.03924560546875,-0.034027099609375,-0.01049041748046875,-0.0121002197265625,-0.001515388488769531,-0.0175323486328125,0.022308349609375,-0.007167816162109375,-0.025482177734375,0.018524169921875,0.01180267333984375,-0.033447265625,0.0265350341796875,-0.01198577880859375,-0.0213165283203125,0.005565643310546875,-0.010284423828125,-0