cmn2wa40w003yjc3o7xl9imwb	ga-admin-system-config	grc-admin	System Configuration	grc	{GRCAdministrator}	How do I configure system settings like SSO, import/export, and PDF reports?	How do I configure system settings like SSO, import/export, and PDF reports?\nSet up Single Sign-On SSO\nConfigure Excel import settings\nManage Excel export templates\nConfigure PDF report generation\nSystem reflection settings\nSystem-wide configuration options\nHow to enable SSO login\nImport and export configuration\nThe System Configuration page provides system-wide settings for SSO (Single Sign-On), Excel import/export, PDF report generation, and system reflection. These settings affect all tenants and system behavior globally.\nNavigate to **GRC Administration** > **Configuration** from the sidebar (Sidebar → GRC → Configuration)\nConfigure **SSO (Single Sign-On)** — set up identity provider integration (e.g., Microsoft Entra ID, Google) for federated authentication across the system\nSet up **Excel Import** — configure import settings and mappings for bulk data ingestion from spreadsheets\nConfigure **Excel Export** — define export templates and formatting for data downloads\nManage **PDF Report** settings — configure report generation templates, branding (logos, headers), and formatting options\nReview **Reflection** settings — system reflection/analysis configuration for diagnostic and monitoring purposes\nOnly GRC Administrators can access system configuration — changes affect all tenants\nSSO configuration requires coordination with your identity provider (IdP) — have your IdP metadata, client ID, and client secret ready\nExcel import/export settings define the default format and field mappings for bulk operations\nPDF report settings control the appearance of generated reports including logos, headers, and page layout\nChanges to system configuration take effect immediately — test in a non-production environment first if possible\nsystem\nconfiguration\nsso\nsingle sign-on\nexcel\nimport\nexport\npdf\nreport\nreflection\nsettings	{-0.02154541015625,0.03314208984375,0.11297607421875,0.004180908203125,-0.01971435546875,0.0080413818359375,0.003330230712890625,0.0106964111328125,-0.009552001953125,0.01248931884765625,-0.002981185913085938,-0.01554107666015625,0.0080718994140625,0.016937255859375,0.0269775390625,0.018829345703125,-0.033050537109375,0.0312042236328125,-0.0293426513671875,0.062164306640625,0.06341552734375,0.0259857177734375,-0.0258636474609375,0.0518798828125,-0.04425048828125,0.00737762451171875,0.002408981323242188,0.038970947265625,0.0003719329833984375,-0.037200927734375,0.003629684448242188,-0.0222015380859375,0.0002424716949462891,-0.046356201171875,0.04718017578125,0.0298919677734375,0.007190704345703125,0.041656494140625,0.034210205078125,0.0172576904296875,0.01355743408203125,0.01038360595703125,-0.04150390625,0.0281524658203125,0.0189361572265625,-0.003265380859375,-0.0128936767578125,-0.06646728515625,0.0267181396484375,-0.0129547119140625,-0.0321044921875,-0.025238037109375,0.01953125,0.029998779296875,-0.005558013916015625,0.015655517578125,-0.00605010986328125,-0.0255889892578125,-0.0209808349609375,-0.0114288330078125,0.002901077270507812,-0.06207275390625,-0.01111602783203125,0.036224365234375,0.0289764404296875,-0.002843856811523438,-0.00269317626953125,0.019683837890625,0.00399017333984375,-0.0236053466796875,0.007793426513671875,-0.02349853515625,0.0406494140625,-0.050689697265625,0.00505828857421875,0.00923919677734375,0.0199127197265625,0.0736083984375,-0.01302337646484375,0.0003581047058105469,-0.0183868408203125,-0.04119873046875,-0.042694091796875,0.01110076904296875,0.02313232421875,0.0124053955078125,-0.0272064208984375,-0.029083251953125,0.002443313598632812,0.002733230590820312,-0.001201629638671875,-0.007030487060546875,-0.0146026611328125,0.047271728515625,0.03082275390625,-0.034515380859375,0.005405426025390625,0.002254486083984375,-0.00373077392578125,0.07745361328125,-0.003416061401367188,-0.05