cmn2wa41q0040jc3o8w1ul610	dc-comp-frameworks	compliance	Framework Selection	grc	{DepartmentContributor}	How do I browse compliance frameworks as a Department Contributor?	How do I browse compliance frameworks as a Department Contributor?\nHow do I view frameworks?\nWhere can I see adopted frameworks?\nHow to check framework compliance percentage?\nCan I select a framework?\nHow to view ISO 27001 or NIST framework?\nWhere are compliance frameworks listed?\nHow to track framework compliance?\nBrowse and view adopted compliance frameworks (ISO 27001, NIST, SOC 2, GDPR, etc.) from the Frameworks page. You can see compliance percentage, policy percentage, and evidence percentage per framework within your department's scope.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Frameworks**\nBrowse available frameworks displayed in a cards/grid view\nView framework details including code, name, description, type, status, country, and industry\nCheck **compliance percentage**, **policy percentage**, and **evidence percentage** for each framework\nClick on a framework to view its full details and associated controls\nYour view is scoped to your department — you see framework data relevant to your department's controls and evidence\nAs a Department Contributor you can view frameworks but framework adoption and import are typically managed by administrators\nCustom vs. standard framework differentiation is visible in the framework cards\nUse pagination to browse through a large number of frameworks\nframework\ncompliance\nISO 27001\nNIST\nSOC 2\nGDPR\nadopt\nbrowse\ncompliance percentage	{-0.0252838134765625,0.0003950595855712891,0.04425048828125,-0.0311126708984375,0.033172607421875,-0.028900146484375,-0.034210205078125,-0.020050048828125,0.0309906005859375,0.06658935546875,0.049346923828125,-0.0001034736633300781,-0.00878143310546875,0.006137847900390625,0.06182861328125,-0.0039215087890625,-0.00716400146484375,-0.0108642578125,0.01261138916015625,0.06280517578125,0.055816650390625,0.01809