cmn2wa43t0045jc3odok572cr	dc-comp-kpis	compliance	KPIs	grc	{DepartmentContributor}	How do I view and track compliance KPIs for my department?	How do I view and track compliance KPIs for my department?\nWhere do I see compliance KPIs?\nHow to check KPI status?\nHow to track compliance metrics?\nWhat KPIs are available for my department?\nHow to filter KPIs by department?\nHow do I monitor compliance health?\nView and track Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) for your department's compliance programs. Monitor compliance health through measurable metrics with targets, thresholds, and status tracking.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → KPIs**\nView the list of compliance KPIs with current values and targets for your department\nReview KPI properties: code, objective, description, expected score, and actual score\nCheck the **status** of each KPI: Scheduled, Missed, Overdue, or Achieved\nUse **visual indicators** to quickly assess KPI health\nFilter KPIs by **status** or **department** to focus on specific areas\nUse the search function to find specific KPIs\nReview linked evidence items for each KPI\nKPIs are scoped to your department — you see metrics relevant to your department's compliance posture\nAs a Department Contributor you can view and contribute to KPI data but KPI definition is typically managed by administrators\nReview dates are tracked to ensure KPIs are evaluated on schedule\nEvidence can be linked to KPIs to support metric reporting\nkpi\ncompliance\nmetric\ntarget\nscore\ndepartment\nperformance\nindicator\nhealth	{0.0024566650390625,0.056884765625,0.0279083251953125,-0.0159454345703125,-0.002828598022460938,0.00792694091796875,-0.0335693359375,-0.018829345703125,0.0604248046875,0.0570068359375,0.06634521484375,0.004154205322265625,-0.01180267333984375,-0.049591064453125,0.0506591796875,-0.019073486328125,-0.001752853393554688,0.00939178466796875,-0.01123809814453125,0.07647705078125,0.0330810546875,0.024078369140625,0.00891876220703125,0.011367797851