cmn2wa49f0046jc3o47zkema7	dc-comp-risk-matrix	compliance	Risk Matrix	grc	{DepartmentContributor}	How do I use the compliance Risk Matrix as a Department Contributor?	How do I use the compliance Risk Matrix as a Department Contributor?\nHow to view risks mapped to controls?\nHow to see which controls mitigate risks?\nWhere is the risk-control mapping?\nHow to identify unmitigated risks?\nHow to view risk coverage gaps?\nWhat is the compliance risk matrix?\nView the compliance Risk Matrix to see how risks map to controls within your department. Identify unmitigated risks (coverage gaps) and review control effectiveness per risk.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Risk Matrix**\nView the matrix showing **risks vs. controls** for your department\nReview status indicators for each mapping: Compliant, Non-Compliant, Partially Compliant, or Not Applicable\nIdentify **unmitigated risks** — risks without linked controls that represent gaps\nCheck **control effectiveness** per risk to assess coverage quality\nUse **collapsible risk groups** to organize and focus on specific areas\nUse search and filter to find specific risk-control relationships\nThe matrix is scoped to your department's risks and controls\nAs a Department Contributor you can link/unlink controls to risks within your department — unlike the view-only Department Reviewer\nResidual risk assessment view shows the remaining risk after controls are applied\nGaps in the matrix highlight areas where additional controls may be needed\nrisk matrix\ncontrol\nmapping\nrisk\nmitigate\ngap\ncoverage\ncompliance	{-0.002660751342773438,0.058135986328125,0.0479736328125,0.0240936279296875,-0.018310546875,-0.0262603759765625,0.006572723388671875,-0.01385498046875,0.034088134765625,0.049652099609375,0.01097869873046875,-0.0107879638671875,0.0249176025390625,-0.00583648681640625,0.027191162109375,-0.046142578125,0.010101318359375,-0.01131439208984375,0.001887321472167969,0.048095703125,0.041900634765625,0.03875732421875,0.00