cmn2wa4a90048jc3ovs5mk3qq	dc-comp-master-data	compliance	Compliance Master Data	grc	{DepartmentContributor}	How do I view compliance master data as a Department Contributor?	How do I view compliance master data as a Department Contributor?\nWhere are compliance definitions?\nHow to view framework templates?\nWhere is compliance configuration?\nHow to see control templates?\nWhat is compliance master data?\nView centralized compliance master data including framework definitions, control templates, domain/category definitions, evidence templates, and governance templates.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Master Data**\nBrowse **framework definitions and templates** used across the organization\nView **control templates** that define standard control structures\nReview **domain and category definitions** used for control classification\nCheck **evidence templates** that guide evidence collection requirements\nView **governance document templates** for policies, procedures, and standards\nAs a Department Contributor you can view master data definitions but creating or modifying templates requires administrator access\nMaster data provides the foundation for all compliance activities in your department\nUnderstanding these templates helps you create properly structured records\nmaster data\ncompliance\ntemplate\ndefinition\nframework\ncontrol\nconfiguration	{0.040069580078125,0.03948974609375,0.08685302734375,-0.011016845703125,0.001995086669921875,-0.00974273681640625,-0.024444580078125,-0.00445556640625,0.0238494873046875,0.041015625,0.06365966796875,0.004627227783203125,0.033538818359375,-0.02752685546875,0.04638671875,-0.016876220703125,0.025054931640625,0.00921630859375,0.036865234375,0.0780029296875,0.0838623046875,0.0176239013671875,-0.0002765655517578125,0.023712158203125,-0.0217132568359375,-0.002588272094726562,-0.06170654296875,0.025146484375,0.0002896785736083984,0.003728866577148438,0.037017822265625,-0.0192413330078125,0.007965087890625,0.0200500488281