cmn2wa4an0049jc3onnefohl9	dc-risk-dashboard	risk-management	Risk Dashboard	grc	{DepartmentContributor}	How do I use the Risk Dashboard as a Department Contributor?	How do I use the Risk Dashboard as a Department Contributor?\nWhere is the risk dashboard?\nHow to see risk statistics for my department?\nHow to view risk breakdown by category?\nHow to check risk status summary?\nWhat charts are on the risk dashboard?\nHow to see risk analytics?\nView the Risk Dashboard for a summary of your department's risk statistics and analytics, including total risks, status breakdown, risk by strategy, risk by rating, and risk by category.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Dashboard**\nView **summary metrics**: total risks and status breakdown for your department\nReview the **Risk by Status** chart to see how many risks are open, in-progress, or completed\nCheck the **Risk by Strategy** chart (Mitigate, Accept, Transfer, Avoid) to understand treatment approaches\nAnalyze the **Risk by Rating** chart to see the distribution of risk severity\nReview the **Risk by Category** chart (Strategic, Operational, Financial, Compliance, Technology)\nDashboard data is scoped to your department — you see only risks belonging to your department\nCharts update in real-time as risks are created, edited, or their status changes\nCategory names are translated based on your selected language\nrisk\ndashboard\nstatistics\nchart\ncategory\nstatus\nrating\nstrategy\nanalytics	{0.0009560585021972656,0.0288848876953125,0.0338134765625,0.0236053466796875,-0.00849151611328125,-0.01502227783203125,-0.045867919921875,0.0042266845703125,0.0347900390625,0.044952392578125,-0.0008521080017089844,-0.00948333740234375,-0.002628326416015625,-0.02056884765625,0.029296875,-0.015899658203125,-0.01837158203125,0.02801513671875,-0.03863525390625,0.0506591796875,0.006862640380859375,0.0196380615234375,0.019683837890625,0.0308380126953125,-0.0445556640625,0.05206298828125,-0.007373809814453125,-0.015731811523437