cmn2wa4b3004ajc3oz9yojljb	dc-risk-register	risk-management	Risk Register	grc	{DepartmentContributor}	How do I create and manage risks in the Risk Register as a Department Contributor?	How do I create and manage risks in the Risk Register as a Department Contributor?\nHow to create a new risk?\nHow to edit a risk in my department?\nHow to add a risk to the register?\nHow to assign risk owners?\nHow to set risk ratings?\nCan I import risks from Excel?\nHow to categorize a risk?\nWhere do I manage department risks?\nCreate, edit, and manage risks within your department's scope in the Risk Register. You can add new risks, set ratings, assign owners, categorize risks, and link them to controls — a key capability that distinguishes your role from view-only roles.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Risk Register**\nView all risks in your department with severity indicators and status\nClick **Create** to add a new risk for your department\nEnter risk details: **name**, **description**, **risk sources**, **category**, and **type**\nSet **risk scoring**: likelihood (1-5) × impact (1-5) = risk score\nSet **inherent risk rating** and **residual risk rating**\n**Assign a risk owner** with contact information and department\nCategorize the risk: Strategic, Operational, Financial, Compliance, or Technology\nSet the **status**: open, in-progress, completed, mitigate, accept, transfer, or avoid\n**Link the risk to controls** and processes for traceability\nClick **Save** to submit the new risk\nAs a Department Contributor you can **create and edit** risks — this is a core responsibility not available to view-only roles like Department Reviewer\nAll risks you create are scoped to your department\nRisk scores are automatically calculated from likelihood × impact\nRating badges use color coding for quick visual assessment\nAI-powered risk suggestions may help identify additional risk factors\nBulk import/export via Excel is available for efficient data management\nUse search, filters, and pagination to navigate large risk registers\nrisk\nregister\ncreate\nedit\nowner\nrating\ncategory\ndepartment\nlikelihood\nimpact\nscore	{0.0009365081787109375,0.04840087890625,0.05224609375,0.01593017578125,-0.01288604736328125,-0.0173492431640625,0.0068511962890625,0.01012420654296875,-0.00473785400390625,0.05474853515625,0.00801849365234375,0.00489044189453125,0.020782470703125,-0.0190582275390625,0.025115966796875,-0.0199737548828125,-0.005985260009765625,0.04364013671875,0.00897216796875,0.058563232421875,0.011077880859375,0.035797119140625,0.0206451416015625,0.01467132568359375,-0.024810791015625,0.05584716796875,-0.016845703125,-0.006786346435546875,-0.0257568359375,-0.003711700439453125,0.043792724609375,-0.0196380615234375,-0.0306549072265625,0.042266845703125,0.00922393798828125,0.0162353515625,-0.0048675537109375,0.0181732177734375,0.021759033203125,0.008331298828125,0.0177154541015625,0.015777587890625,0.0144195556640625,0.015472412109375,-0.0266876220703125,0.0276336669921875,0.00972747802734375,-0.040496826171875,0.02874755859375,-0.006130218505859375,-0.026947021484375,-0.0141448974609375,0.0438232421875,-0.021514892578125,-0.00588226318359375,0.03515625,-0.0242462158203125,0.027374267578125,-0.048309326171875,-0.031494140625,0.0227203369140625,-0.06298828125,-0.04803466796875,-0.026031494140625,-0.00823974609375,-0.01517486572265625,-0.052459716796875,0.02740478515625,-0.005626678466796875,-0.0260772705078125,0.0221710205078125,-0.01544189453125,0.0287322998046875,0.002117156982421875,0.003353118896484375,-0.0088043212890625,0.01190185546875,0.0146636962890625,-0.031951904296875,0.01102447509765625,-0.002553939819335938,0.007171630859375,-0.059967041015625,-0.01244354248046875,-0.0268707275390625,-0.01971435546875,-0.030792236328125,-0.02447509765625,0.001847267150878906,-0.0733642578125,-0.02886962890625,-0.0006361007690429688,-0.0440673828125,0.01068878173828125,0.01457977294921875,-0.001859664916992188,-0.00539398193359375,-0.0166473