cmn2wa4cw004ejc3o4co880bc	dc-risk-settings	risk-management	Risk Settings	grc	{DepartmentContributor}	How do I view risk settings as a Department Contributor?	How do I view risk settings as a Department Contributor?\nWhere are risk categories defined?\nHow to see risk types?\nWhere is the risk rating matrix configured?\nWhat risk thresholds are set?\nWhere are risk management settings?\nView risk management settings including risk categories, types, thresholds, and the rating matrix. These configurations define how risks are categorized and scored across your department.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Settings**\nView **risk categories** (Strategic, Operational, Financial, Compliance, Technology)\nReview **risk type definitions** used for classifying risks\nCheck the **risk rating matrix** customization settings\nReview **threshold configurations** that determine risk severity levels\nAs a Department Contributor you can view risk settings but modifying configuration typically requires administrator access\nUnderstanding these settings helps you properly categorize and score risks when creating them\nRisk categories and types defined here appear as options when creating or editing risks\nrisk settings\ncategory\ntype\nthreshold\nrating matrix\nconfiguration	{-0.030487060546875,0.0128631591796875,0.032135009765625,0.00396728515625,-0.0242919921875,-0.0196533203125,0.01305389404296875,0.006122589111328125,0.0169219970703125,0.0307464599609375,-0.0079345703125,-0.003263473510742188,0.0220489501953125,0.005664825439453125,0.04718017578125,0.006107330322265625,-0.0170745849609375,0.02142333984375,0.0006318092346191406,0.06622314453125,0.0234527587890625,0.0259857177734375,-0.0005030632019042969,0.0401611328125,-0.0242919921875,0.0275115966796875,-0.00872802734375,0.001842498779296875,-0.02215576171875,0.0266265869140625,0.0190887451171875,-0.0137786865234375,-0.007354736328125,0.03338623046875,0.001953125,-0.015411376953125,-0.001193046569824219,0.0222015380859