cmn2wa4ir004gjc3o1j7hl59a	dc-asset-inventory	asset-management	Asset Inventory	grc	{DepartmentContributor}	How do I manage assets in the Asset Inventory as a Department Contributor?	How do I manage assets in the Asset Inventory as a Department Contributor?\nHow to create a new asset?\nHow to edit asset information?\nHow to add an asset for my department?\nHow to update asset details?\nWhere do I manage department assets?\nHow to link assets to risks?\nCan I import assets from Excel?\nHow to assign an asset owner?\nCreate, edit, and manage organizational assets within your department's scope in the Asset Inventory. Add new assets, update details, assign owners, and link assets to risks and processes.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Asset Management → Inventory**\nView all assets in your department with type, owner, classification, and status\nClick **Create** to add a new asset for your department\nEnter asset details: **name**, **type**, **category**, **sub-category**, **group**, **owner**, and **location**\nSelect the **asset type**: Package, Server, Monitor, Database, Users, Building, Wrench\n**Assign a department and owner** for the asset\nSet the **acquisition date** and current status\n**Link the asset to risks** and processes for traceability\nClick **Save** to create the asset\nTo update an existing asset, click **Edit** and modify the relevant fields\nAs a Department Contributor you can **create and edit** assets — this distinguishes you from the Department Reviewer who can only view\nAll assets you manage are scoped to your department — you cannot see or modify assets in other departments\nBulk import/export via Excel is available for efficient data management\nUse search, filters, and pagination to navigate large asset inventories\nasset\ninventory\ncreate\nedit\nhardware\nsoftware\ndata\nowner\ndepartment\nclassification	{-0.01209259033203125,0.023193359375,0.037261962890625,0.006496429443359375,-0.0145721435546875,-0.037384033203125,-0.0245361328125,0.0005545616