cmn2wa4kv004ljc3oxkoipflk	rv-org-profile	organization	Profile	grc	{Reviewer}	How do I view the organization profile as a Reviewer?	How do I view the organization profile as a Reviewer?\nWhere can I see company information?\nHow to view organization details?\nCan I edit the organization profile?\nOrganization profile view for Reviewer\nHow to see company logo and branding?\nWhere is the organization overview?\nView the organization's identity record including name, contact details, logo, branches, data centers, cloud providers, and social media links. As a Reviewer you have read-only access to this page across the entire organization.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Organization → Profile**\nView the organization's **name, email, phone, logo, established date, employee count, branch count, and head office location**\nReview **vision, mission, values**, and CEO message\nCheck the **branches** section to see all office locations and addresses\nCheck the **data centers** section to see hosting details (location type, address, vendor)\nReview **cloud providers** (name, service type) and **social media links**\nAs a Reviewer you have read-only access — you cannot edit the organization profile\nYou see the complete organization profile across all locations and branches (organization-wide visibility)\nTo request changes, contact your Customer Administrator\nThis is different from DepartmentReviewer who may only see department-specific information\norganization\nprofile\nview\ncompany\nidentity\nlogo\nbranches\ndata centers	{0.01013946533203125,0.03759765625,-0.01045989990234375,0.0379638671875,-0.0214385986328125,-0.00934600830078125,0.004093170166015625,0.023956298828125,-0.00640106201171875,0.0452880859375,0.01983642578125,-0.02862548828125,0.049163818359375,-0.0208740234375,-0.0097808837890625,0.028778076171875,0.036956787109375,0.0179443359375,0.001542091369628906,0.057769775390625,0.01119232177734375,0.02044677734375,-0.0098419189453125,0.06256103515625,-0.00385284423828125,0