cmn2wa4st004sjc3o9gqeac1u	rv-comp-controls	compliance	Control Assessment	grc	{Reviewer}	How do I review compliance controls?	How do I review compliance controls?\nWhere can I see control assessment status?\nHow to check control effectiveness?\nHow to view control compliance status?\nControl assessment for Reviewer\nHow to filter controls by framework?\nWhere to see non-compliant controls?\nCan I review control evidence linkages?\nReview all compliance controls and their assessment status (Compliant, Partially Compliant, Non-Compliant, Not Assessed). As a Reviewer you can view control details, evidence linkages, and risk mappings across the entire organization.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Controls**\nView the **controls list** with status indicators for each control\nUse **filters** to narrow by framework, domain, or status (e.g., show only Non-Compliant)\nClick on a control to review **details** (code, name, description, domain, category, status)\nCheck **evidence items linked** to each control\nReview **risk mappings** to see which risks a control addresses\nUse **multi-select column filtering** for efficient review\nYou see controls across all frameworks and departments (organization-wide visibility)\nAs a Reviewer you cannot create, edit, delete, or assess controls\nFocus on identifying controls that are Non-Compliant or Not Assessed — these may need attention\nUnlike DepartmentReviewer, you can compare control status across all departments\ncontrols\nassessment\ncompliant\nnon-compliant\neffectiveness\nframework\ndomain	{0.0051116943359375,0.0513916015625,0.04241943359375,0.0193634033203125,-0.0360107421875,-0.01477813720703125,0.003271102905273438,0.003986358642578125,0.034271240234375,0.074462890625,0.04022216796875,-0.02227783203125,0.040863037109375,0.007434844970703125,0.033935546875,-0.04046630859375,0.0032196044921875,0.0083770751953125,0.04296875,0.061676025390625,0.06396484375,-0.007061004638671875,0.01322174072265625,0.018524169921875,-0.0064