cmn2wa4t8004tjc3on5999qtt	rv-comp-governance	compliance	Governance Documents	grc	{Reviewer}	How do I review governance documents for approval?	How do I review governance documents for approval?\nWhere can I approve or reject policies?\nHow to review governance documents?\nHow to check document versions?\nGovernance document review workflow\nHow to see document approval status?\nWhere to review procedures and standards?\nCan I approve governance documents?\nReview governance documents (policies, procedures, standards, guidelines) and participate in the document review and approval workflow. As a Reviewer you can view all documents organization-wide and approve or reject those assigned to you for review.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Governance**\nView the **document list** with version and status for all governance documents\nClick on a document to review its **content, metadata, and version history**\nCheck the **review and approval workflow** status for each document\nIf a document is **assigned to you for review**, open it and review the content\nUse the **Approve** or **Reject** action to complete your review\nAdd **comments** to provide feedback on the document\nReview **linked frameworks and controls** for each document\nYou have organization-wide visibility into all governance documents across all departments\nYou CAN approve/reject governance documents assigned to you — this is a key Reviewer capability\nYou cannot create new documents, edit document content, or delete documents\nDocument review is one of the primary responsibilities of the Reviewer role\nCheck the review schedule and due dates to ensure timely reviews\ngovernance\ndocuments\npolicy\nprocedure\nstandard\nguideline\napproval\nreview\nversion	{0.017669677734375,0.06781005859375,0.041107177734375,0.0162353515625,-0.02044677734375,-0.003437042236328125,-0.0187530517578125,-0.01328277587890625,0.031707763671875,0.04656982421875,0.0418701171875,-0.0352783203125,-0.01015472412109375,0.004364