cmn2wa4tm004ujc3o9i5algsg	rv-comp-evidence	compliance	Evidence Management	grc	{Reviewer}	How do I approve or reject evidence submissions?	How do I approve or reject evidence submissions?\nWhere can I review submitted evidence?\nHow to approve evidence?\nHow to reject evidence with feedback?\nEvidence review workflow for Reviewer\nWhere to see pending evidence?\nHow to check evidence status?\nCan I approve evidence as a Reviewer?\nHow to review evidence files?\nReview, approve, or reject evidence submissions across the organization. As a Reviewer you can view all evidence items, check uploaded files, and approve or reject submitted evidence — this is one of your key responsibilities.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Evidence**\nView the **evidence list** showing status (Pending, Submitted, Approved, Rejected) and due dates\nUse **filters** to find evidence by status, assignee, or control (e.g., filter for 'Submitted' to see items awaiting review)\nClick on an evidence item to review the **uploaded files and details**\nReview the **linked controls and framework** to understand context\nClick **Approve** to accept the evidence or **Reject** to send it back with feedback\nAdd **comments** explaining your approval or rejection rationale\nEvidence approval/rejection is a primary Reviewer responsibility\nYou see evidence from ALL departments across the organization\nYou cannot create evidence requests, upload evidence files, or delete evidence records\nFocus on 'Submitted' status evidence that is awaiting review\nRejected evidence goes back to the assigned contributor for rework\nUnlike DepartmentReviewer, you review evidence across all departments, not just one\nevidence\napprove\nreject\nreview\nsubmitted\npending\nfiles\ncompliance	{0.030487060546875,0.038482666015625,0.02734375,0.002840042114257812,-0.057525634765625,-0.0007486343383789062,-0.004787445068359375,0.005611419677734375,0.0008654594421386719,0.0782470703125,0.0614013671875,-0.0004110336303710938,0.0127