cmn2wa5yv005wjc3osk8o0b7l	aud-audit-document-library	internal-audit	Document Library	audit	{Auditor}	How do I use the Document Library as an Auditor?	How do I use the Document Library as an Auditor?\nWhere is the audit document repository?\nHow to find audit documents?\nWhere are audit templates stored?\nHow to access shared audit files?\nWhere to find reference documents for audits?\nThe Document Library is a centralized repository for audit-related documents. Access reference materials, templates, and shared files relevant to your audit engagements.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Document Library**\nBrowse the repository to find audit-related documents\nSearch for specific documents by name or type\nDownload documents needed for your fieldwork reference\nThe Document Library is managed by the Audit Head — you may have limited upload capabilities\nUse this repository to find standard templates, checklists, and reference materials\nUpload audit evidence and work papers through the Fieldwork page rather than here\ndocument library\nrepository\nfiles\ndocuments\ntemplates\nupload	{-0.02880859375,0.032928466796875,0.032989501953125,-0.01409912109375,-0.0241851806640625,-0.002450942993164062,-0.03424072265625,-0.02056884765625,-0.0284881591796875,-0.0322265625,0.004337310791015625,-0.0129547119140625,0.01495361328125,-0.0430908203125,0.0114288330078125,0.0367431640625,0.060943603515625,0.001759529113769531,-0.03448486328125,0.0626220703125,0.05389404296875,0.025970458984375,-0.0185699462890625,0.00142669677734375,0.01297760009765625,-0.048187255859375,-0.0251312255859375,-0.022674560546875,-0.01461029052734375,-0.027557373046875,-0.00325775146484375,-0.03887939453125,0.0164794921875,0.02783203125,-0.006500244140625,0.075927734375,-0.004596710205078125,-0.036285400390625,0.0178680419921875,-0.0006890296936035156,-0.0124053955078125,-0.0188751220703125,0.004123687744140625,0.0283966064453125,-0.0006146430969238281,-0.022125244140625,0.0303497314453125,0.0364685