cmn2wa4vj004xjc3og0qms4tk	rv-comp-risk-matrix	compliance	Risk Matrix	grc	{Reviewer}	How do I review the compliance risk matrix?	How do I review the compliance risk matrix?\nWhere can I see risk-to-control mappings?\nHow to identify unmitigated risks?\nHow to check control coverage gaps?\nRisk matrix for Reviewer\nWhere to see risk vs control relationships?\nHow to review residual risk assessment?\nReview the compliance risk matrix showing relationships between risks and controls. Identify unmitigated risks (coverage gaps) and review control effectiveness across the organization.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Risk Matrix**\nView the **matrix of risks vs controls** to understand coverage\nIdentify **unmitigated risks** (gaps) that have no linked controls\nReview **control effectiveness** per risk using status indicators (compliant, non-compliant, partial, not applicable)\nExpand **collapsible risk groups** to see detailed mappings\nCheck the **residual risk assessment view** for post-control risk levels\nUse **search and filter** to focus on specific risk areas\nThe risk matrix provides organization-wide visibility into risk-control relationships\nAs a Reviewer you cannot link/unlink controls — that requires edit permissions\nFocus on identifying gaps where risks have no mitigating controls\nThis view complements the Risk Control Matrix in the Risk Management module\nrisk matrix\nrisk\ncontrol\nmapping\ncoverage\ngaps\nunmitigated\nresidual	{-0.00807952880859375,0.08966064453125,0.054290771484375,0.03143310546875,-0.049041748046875,-0.01629638671875,0.00841522216796875,0.001979827880859375,0.039764404296875,0.04205322265625,-0.007266998291015625,-0.03143310546875,0.0290374755859375,0.01068115234375,0.0171966552734375,-0.0428466796875,0.031005859375,-0.01007843017578125,0.012481689453125,0.0494384765625,0.047821044921875,0.006175994873046875,0.001540184020996094,0.050750732421875,-0.0138702392578125,0.01282501220703125,-0.004764556884765625,0.011993408203125,0.