cmn2wa53k0051jc3o635ssydr	rv-risk-register	risk-management	Risk Register	grc	{Reviewer}	How do I review the risk register?	How do I review the risk register?\nWhere can I see all identified risks?\nHow to view risk details and ratings?\nHow to check risk owners and treatment status?\nRisk register for Reviewer\nHow to review risk severity?\nWhere to see inherent and residual risk ratings?\nCan I comment on risks?\nReview the central repository of all identified risks across the organization, including inherent and residual ratings, owners, treatment status, and linkages to controls and processes. As a Reviewer you can view all risks and review/comment on them.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Risk Register**\nView the **risk list** with severity indicators and status for all organizational risks\nClick on a risk to see **full details** — name, description, risk sources, category, type\nReview **risk scoring**: likelihood (1-5) x impact (1-5) = risk score\nCheck **inherent risk rating** and **residual risk rating** (after controls)\nReview **risk owner** assignment, department, and contact information\nCheck **risk category** (Strategic, Operational, Financial, Compliance, Technology)\nReview **linkages to controls and processes** for each risk\nUse **search, filter, and pagination** to navigate large risk registers\nYou see risks from all departments — full cross-department organization-wide visibility\nAs a Reviewer you can view and comment on risks but cannot create, edit, or delete them\nReview and comment capability is a key Reviewer function — use it to flag concerns\nUnlike DepartmentReviewer, you can compare risk profiles across all departments\nRating badges are color-coded for quick visual identification of severity\nrisk register\nrisks\ninherent\nresidual\nrating\nowner\nseverity\nstatus	{-0.01138130761682987,0.0680299773812294,0.0410008393228054,0.03164730221033096,-0.0312487818300724,-0.006546303164213896,0.007988013327121735,-0.00063257978763