cmn2wa53z0052jc3opqab1chf	rv-risk-assessment	risk-management	Risk Assessment	grc	{Reviewer}	How do I review risk assessments?	How do I review risk assessments?\nWhere can I see the risk assessment matrix?\nHow to view the risk heatmap?\nHow to check assessment status?\nRisk assessment for Reviewer\nWhere to compare inherent vs residual risk?\nHow to review threat and vulnerability mapping?\nReview risk assessments using the 5x5 likelihood vs impact matrix, compare inherent and residual risk levels, and view the risk heatmap. As a Reviewer you have organization-wide read-only access to all assessments.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Risk Assessment**\nView the **risk assessment matrix** (5x5 likelihood vs impact)\nReview **inherent risk assessment** scores before controls\nReview **residual risk assessment** scores after controls are applied\nCompare **inherent vs residual** risk levels to gauge control effectiveness\nView the **risk heatmap** visualization for a graphical overview\nCheck **assessment status** (draft, submitted, approved, rejected, in-progress)\nReview **threat and vulnerability mapping** per risk\nAssessments span all departments — you see the organization-wide risk landscape\nAs a Reviewer you cannot perform assessments or change assessment status\nThe heatmap is useful for quickly identifying areas of highest risk concentration\nDepartment-scoped assessments are visible to you even though they belong to specific departments\nrisk assessment\nmatrix\nheatmap\nlikelihood\nimpact\ninherent\nresidual\nthreat\nvulnerability	{-0.02012694254517555,0.06139069423079491,0.04884951934218407,0.04488049820065498,-0.0341007225215435,-0.01595829240977764,-0.01305785309523344,-0.0177079513669014,0.04675932601094246,0.03597955033183098,-0.0006711671594530344,-0.02367322891950607,0.0402303971350193,-0.001993318786844611,0.005671711172908545,-0.01042749360203743,0.004015994258224964,-0.00463542016223073,-0.01490145269781351,0.02178265899419785,0.02426036