cmn2wa54e0053jc3od69hnngg	rv-risk-response	risk-management	Risk Response	grc	{Reviewer}	How do I review risk response and treatment plans?	How do I review risk response and treatment plans?\nWhere can I see risk treatment actions?\nHow to check risk response strategies?\nHow to monitor treatment implementation?\nRisk response for Reviewer\nWhere to see action plan progress?\nHow to review mitigation strategies?\nReview risk treatment plans and response strategies (Mitigate, Accept, Transfer, Avoid) across the organization. Monitor action implementation status and progress for all departments.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Risk Response**\nView risks that **require response/treatment**\nReview the **response strategy** assigned to each risk (Mitigate, Accept, Transfer, Avoid)\nCheck **treatment action plans** with assigned owners and due dates\nMonitor **action implementation status** (open, in-progress, completed)\nReview **response progress tracking** to gauge treatment effectiveness\nYou see risk responses from all departments (organization-wide visibility)\nAs a Reviewer you cannot define response strategies or create action plans\nFocus on overdue actions and incomplete treatments that may need escalation\nYour cross-department view lets you identify inconsistencies in treatment approaches\nrisk response\ntreatment\nmitigation\naction plan\nstrategy\nimplementation\nprogress	{-0.03840994089841843,0.06078420206904411,0.04652238264679909,0.03254438191652298,-0.054398313164711,-0.01849542744457722,-0.003932051826268435,0.03474396467208862,0.03062861599028111,0.02385247871279716,0.02190123312175274,-0.006456843111664057,0.03966346755623817,-0.0113940816372633,-0.0008861899259500206,-0.04947881400585175,0.02087239548563957,0.00827800389379263,-0.01453381031751633,0.05510785803198814,0.02622944675385952,0.003509282600134611,0.01914584077894688,0.006817527581006289,-0.03519334271550179,0.04084603860974312,-0.002348883775994182,0.02288276888430119,-0.014309