cmn2wa54s0054jc3oi6rl4n6j	rv-risk-control-matrix	risk-management	Risk Control Matrix	grc	{Reviewer}	How do I review the risk control matrix?	How do I review the risk control matrix?\nWhere can I see risk-to-control mappings in risk management?\nHow to identify control gaps for risks?\nRisk control matrix for Reviewer\nHow to check control effectiveness per risk?\nWhere to see unmitigated risks?\nReview the risk control matrix to see relationships between risks and controls, identify coverage gaps, and assess control effectiveness. This matrix provides organization-wide visibility into how well risks are mitigated.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Risk Control Matrix**\nView the **matrix of risks vs controls**\nIdentify **unmitigated risks** (gaps) — risks without any linked controls\nReview **control effectiveness** per risk using status indicators\nCheck **residual risk calculation** after controls are factored in\nExpand **collapsible risk groups** for detailed analysis\nUse **search and filter** to focus on specific risk or control areas\nYou see the complete matrix across all departments (organization-wide visibility)\nAs a Reviewer you cannot link/unlink controls to risks\nGaps in coverage are important findings to communicate to risk owners and administrators\nThis view complements the Compliance Risk Matrix from the Compliance module\nrisk control matrix\nrisk\ncontrol\nmapping\ngaps\neffectiveness\nunmitigated	{-0.0118562625721097,0.0908234491944313,0.0439576543867588,0.04521039128303528,-0.04773823544383049,-0.01305307447910309,0.01468610670417547,0.00471454206854105,0.03514375165104866,0.03621752560138702,-0.003123454051092267,-0.03764922544360161,0.0149657353758812,0.00779045931994915,0.01790743134915829,-0.04778297618031502,0.01063708122819662,-0.002090225461870432,0.01606187969446182,0.04248121380805969,0.04724608734250069,0.009982749819755554,-0.007913496345281601,0.0547177717089653,-0.02137482911348343,0.02041290514171124,-0.0004865541704930