cmn2wa55z0057jc3osphh89bf	rv-asset-inventory	asset-management	Asset Inventory	grc	{Reviewer}	How do I review the asset inventory?	How do I review the asset inventory?\nWhere can I see all organizational assets?\nHow to view asset details and owners?\nHow to check asset types and classifications?\nAsset inventory for Reviewer\nHow to search for specific assets?\nWhere to see asset linkages to risks?\nReview the comprehensive inventory of all organizational assets including hardware, software, data, networks, personnel, and facilities. As a Reviewer you have organization-wide read-only access to the full asset register.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Asset Management → Inventory**\nView the **asset list** showing type, owner, classification, and status for all assets\nUse **search, filter, and pagination** to find specific assets\nClick on an asset to view **detailed information** — name, type, category, sub-category, group, owner, location\nReview **department and owner assignment** for each asset\nCheck **acquisition dates** and current status\nReview **linkages to risks and processes** associated with each asset\nYou see assets from ALL departments across the organization (not limited to your department)\nAs a Reviewer you cannot create, edit, or delete assets\nAsset linkages to risks help inform your review of the risk register\nUnlike DepartmentReviewer, you can compare asset portfolios across all departments\nasset inventory\nassets\nhardware\nsoftware\ndata\nowner\nclassification\ntype	{-0.02579633891582489,0.06970808655023575,0.02379156835377216,0.01550678815692663,-0.0378732793033123,-0.02120710350573063,-0.02036171779036522,-0.01405755616724491,-0.00123411207459867,0.0256272628903389,0.02130371890962124,-0.0271248035132885,0.02722141891717911,-0.04806621372699738,0.00792247150093317,-0.02044625580310822,0.008550472557544708,0.04350113123655319,-0.01678694412112236,0.02319979853928089,0.03845297172665596,0.01539809629321098,-0.005676161032170057,0.00859274156391620