cmn2wa56e0058jc3obk9yscws	rv-asset-classification	asset-management	Asset Classification	grc	{Reviewer}	How do I review asset classifications?	How do I review asset classifications?\nWhere can I see CIA classification levels?\nHow to view asset classification hierarchy?\nHow to check confidentiality, integrity, availability ratings?\nAsset classification for Reviewer\nWhere to see handling requirements?\nHow to review protection requirements per asset?\nReview asset classifications based on Confidentiality, Integrity, and Availability (CIA) requirements. View the classification hierarchy (Category, Sub-Category, Group) and handling/protection requirements.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Asset Management → Classification**\nReview the **classification hierarchy**: Category → Sub-Category → Group\nCheck **classification levels** (Public, Internal, Confidential, Restricted)\nReview **CIA impact ratings** (Confidentiality, Integrity, Availability) for each asset\nCheck **handling and protection requirements** per classification level\nReview **asset grouping and organization** structure\nClassification data spans the entire organization (cross-department visibility)\nAs a Reviewer you cannot create, edit, or delete classifications\nCIA ratings inform risk assessments — use this data when reviewing risk register entries\nasset classification\nCIA\nconfidentiality\nintegrity\navailability\nhierarchy\ncategory\ngroup	{-0.02731149829924107,0.04832572489976883,0.0565355010330677,0.007784126792103052,-0.01854196563363075,0.01864692009985447,0.009959017857909203,-0.0110435476526618,0.01367907226085663,-0.00221133348532021,0.02693832665681839,-0.03638423234224319,0.01357411779463291,0.008454669266939163,-0.0146819707006216,-0.02593542821705341,0.01055375952273607,0.05457634851336479,-0.01851864159107208,0.03510145470499992,0.01236130949109793,0.03414520248770714,-0.01191816851496696,0.02525905333459377,-0.02191217057406902,0.002301710890606046,0.006792889442294836,-0.01041965093463659