cmn2wa5e5005bjc3onf81ld1z	rv-audit-dashboard	internal-audit	Dashboard	audit	{Reviewer}	How do I review the audit dashboard?	How do I review the audit dashboard?\nWhere can I see audit statistics?\nHow to view CAPA status by department?\nAudit dashboard for Reviewer\nWhere to see annual audit plan calendar?\nHow to check auditor schedules?\nWhere are risk statistics for audit?\nView the audit dashboard with risk statistics, audit statistics, CAPA status by department, annual audit plan calendar, and auditor schedule visualization. As a Reviewer you have organization-wide read-only access to the entire audit function overview.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Dashboard**\nReview **risk statistics** — total, extreme, high, medium, low risk counts\nCheck **audit statistics** — ongoing, completed, and planned audits\nView **CAPA status by department** (open/closed breakdown) to monitor remediation progress\nReview the **annual audit plan calendar** for upcoming and past engagements\nCheck the **auditor schedule visualization** to see team workload\nReview **department-wise audit metrics** for cross-department comparison\nThe dashboard shows data from all departments (full organization-wide visibility)\nAs a Reviewer you have read-only access — you cannot modify audit data from the dashboard\nUse the dashboard to identify departments with high open CAPA counts needing attention\nUnlike DepartmentReviewer, you see audit metrics for every department, not just one\naudit dashboard\nstatistics\nCAPA\naudit plan\ncalendar\nauditor schedule\nrisk	{-0.0142974853515625,0.03826904296875,0.03802490234375,0.00284576416015625,-0.04010009765625,0.024505615234375,-0.033416748046875,-0.01294708251953125,0.027008056640625,0.0094146728515625,0.01715087890625,-0.048858642578125,0.04010009765625,0.0211029052734375,0.0338134765625,-0.01232147216796875,0.01251220703125,0.02166748046875,-0.017333984375,0.05340576171875,0.04766845703125,0.007049560546875,0.019378662109375,0.01070404052