cmn2wa5fq005fjc3orpyzwpuw	rv-audit-planning	internal-audit	Audit Planning	audit	{Reviewer}	How do I review audit planning and engagements?	How do I review audit planning and engagements?\nWhere can I see the annual audit plan?\nHow to view audit engagements?\nHow to check audit team assignments?\nAudit planning for Reviewer\nWhere to see engagement status?\nHow to review planned audit hours?\nReview audit engagements and the annual audit plan including scope, objectives, timeline, team assignments, and risk linkages. As a Reviewer you have organization-wide read-only access to all audit plans.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Audit Planning**\nView the **list of audit engagements** with title, department, start/end dates, and status\nReview **engagement details** — scope, objectives, and risk linkages\nCheck **auditor assignments** (single or multiple auditors per engagement)\nReview **planned hours** allocated to each engagement\nCheck **engagement status** (Planned, In Progress, Completed, Cancelled)\nUse **search and pagination** to navigate the plan\nYou see audit plans across all departments (organization-wide visibility)\nAs a Reviewer you cannot create, edit, or delete engagements\nUnderstanding the audit plan helps you anticipate upcoming reviews and findings\naudit planning\nengagement\nannual plan\nauditors\nplanned hours\nstatus\nschedule	{-0.0162353515625,0.0535888671875,0.027984619140625,-0.01406097412109375,-0.06829833984375,-0.0061187744140625,-0.001759529113769531,0.0090179443359375,0.002515792846679688,-0.0012054443359375,0.039886474609375,-0.03717041015625,0.056427001953125,-0.01271820068359375,0.016082763671875,0.0157928466796875,-0.003313064575195312,0.005096435546875,-0.0240325927734375,0.044891357421875,0.06878662109375,-0.001129150390625,0.009521484375,-0.004444122314453125,-0.021820068359375,-0.0297393798828125,-0.03363037109375,0.0121917724609375,0.002613067626953125,-0.029449462890625,0.016571044921875,-0.02191162109375,-0.00443267