cmn2wa5g5005gjc3orwgkxjrj	rv-audit-fieldwork	internal-audit	Fieldwork	audit	{Reviewer}	How do I review audit fieldwork?	How do I review audit fieldwork?\nWhere can I see fieldwork tasks and evidence?\nHow to view work papers?\nHow to check fieldwork completion?\nAudit fieldwork for Reviewer\nWhere to see audit observations?\nHow to review interview notes?\nReview audit fieldwork including engagements, work papers, observations, evidence, interview notes, and fieldwork completion status. As a Reviewer you have organization-wide read-only access to all fieldwork data.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Fieldwork**\nView the **engagement list** with title, department, status, dates, and assigned auditor\nClick on an engagement to review **work papers and observations**\nCheck **uploaded audit evidence** and supporting files\nReview **interview notes** recorded during fieldwork\nMonitor **fieldwork completion status** for each engagement\nReview **findings identified** from fieldwork activities\nUse **filters** by department, status, or auditor\nYou see fieldwork data from all departments (organization-wide visibility)\nAs a Reviewer you cannot create work papers, upload evidence, or modify fieldwork records\nFieldwork review helps you prepare for findings review and CAPA tracking\nfieldwork\nwork papers\nobservations\nevidence\ninterview\ntesting\naudit	{-0.01306915283203125,0.058624267578125,0.01611328125,-0.004352569580078125,-0.0589599609375,-0.0188140869140625,0.019805908203125,0.00940704345703125,-0.0097503662109375,0.02215576171875,0.036163330078125,-0.0170745849609375,0.019805908203125,-0.00888824462890625,0.017547607421875,0.028839111328125,0.0277557373046875,-0.00872039794921875,-0.00972747802734375,0.0474853515625,0.025848388671875,0.01122283935546875,0.0143280029296875,-0.011016845703125,-0.009368896484375,-0.06060791015625,-0.059906005859375,0.031402587890625,-0.03009033203125,-0.038665771484375,0.019378662109375,-0.023223876953125,-0.003194808959960