cmn2wa5za005xjc3oipeieftp	aud-audit-settings-view	internal-audit	Audit Settings	audit	{Auditor}	Can I access audit settings as an Auditor?	Can I access audit settings as an Auditor?\nCan I change audit settings?\nWhere are audit configuration options?\nCan I modify audit types or categories?\nDo I have access to audit settings?\nCan I manage departments in audit settings?\nAudit Settings are managed by the Audit Head. As an Auditor, you may have view-only access to see configuration like audit types, departments, periodicity, and escalation policies, but you cannot modify them.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Settings** (if visible in your sidebar)\nIf accessible, review the configuration for reference only\nView **Audit Types**, **Departments**, **Periodicity**, **Categories**, and **Escalation** policies\nYou cannot create, edit, or delete any audit settings — this is an Audit Head responsibility\nIf the Settings menu item is not visible in your sidebar, your role does not have access\nUnderstanding audit types and categories helps you correctly classify findings during fieldwork\nEscalation policies affect how overdue findings and CAPAs are handled\nsettings\nconfiguration\naudit types\ndepartments\nescalation\ncategories	{-0.03460693359375,0.00286865234375,0.06475830078125,-0.0162200927734375,-0.045440673828125,0.0211029052734375,-0.01641845703125,-0.034027099609375,0.031036376953125,-0.0257568359375,0.0396728515625,-0.04443359375,0.028839111328125,0.01149749755859375,0.0164031982421875,0.01534271240234375,-0.0244598388671875,0.036895751953125,-0.01535797119140625,0.08197021484375,0.045257568359375,0.030975341796875,0.0007338523864746094,0.033935546875,-0.006778717041015625,-0.029998779296875,-0.005184173583984375,0.026885986328125,-0.0240936279296875,0.0095062255859375,0.0007071495056152344,-0.037628173828125,-0.03363037109375,0.0094757080078125,0.000522613525390625,0.0257110595703125,-0.0198822021484375,-0.02679443359375,0.055938720703125,-0.00074529