cmn2wa5gj005hjc3ojwoyq0qb	rv-audit-findings	internal-audit	Findings	audit	{Reviewer}	How do I review audit findings?	How do I review audit findings?\nWhere can I see audit findings?\nHow to view finding severity and status?\nHow to review remediation progress?\nAudit findings for Reviewer\nWhere to see critical findings?\nCan I comment on audit findings?\nHow to check finding recommendations?\nReview all audit findings across the organization, classified by severity (Critical, High, Medium, Low, Informational). View recommendations, remediation status, and linkages to controls and risks. As a Reviewer you can view and comment on findings.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Findings** (accessed via Fieldwork)\nView the **findings list** with severity and status indicators\nReview finding details — **finding ID, title, description, severity, recommendation**\nCheck **severity classification**: Critical, High, Medium, Low, Informational\nReview the **assigned finding owner** responsible for remediation\nCheck **remediation due dates** and current status (Open, In Progress, Closed, Overdue)\nReview **linkages to controls and risks** for each finding\nAdd **comments** to provide your review feedback on findings\nYou see findings from all departments (organization-wide visibility)\nReview and comment on findings is a key Reviewer capability\nYou cannot create, edit, or delete findings — that is done by Auditors and Audit Heads\nFocus on Critical and High severity findings and overdue items\nUnlike DepartmentReviewer, you see findings across all audit engagements\nfindings\naudit findings\nseverity\ncritical\nhigh\nremediation\nrecommendations\nstatus	{-0.002481460571289062,0.0361328125,0.0694580078125,0.023956298828125,-0.0271759033203125,-0.0055694580078125,-0.003129959106445312,-0.021209716796875,-0.006053924560546875,0.038177490234375,0.0195465087890625,-0.0255126953125,0.001832962036132812,-0.0058746337890625,0.03424072265625,-0.03472900390625,0.036834716796875