cmn2wa5gy005ijc3o70bgeek4	rv-audit-capa	internal-audit	CAPA Tracking	audit	{Reviewer}	How do I review CAPA tracking?	How do I review CAPA tracking?\nWhere can I see corrective and preventive actions?\nHow to monitor CAPA implementation progress?\nHow to check overdue CAPAs?\nCAPA tracking for Reviewer\nWhere to see CAPA completion status?\nHow to review CAPA effectiveness?\nCan I comment on CAPAs?\nReview Corrective and Preventive Actions (CAPA) arising from audit findings across the organization. Monitor implementation progress, verify effectiveness, and identify overdue items. As a Reviewer you have full cross-department visibility.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → CAPA Tracking**\nView the **CAPA list** with status, severity, and due dates\nReview CAPA details — **type, description, completion percentage, status**\nCheck **responsible persons** and **target completion dates**\nMonitor **implementation progress** for each CAPA item\nReview **comments and discussion** threads on CAPAs\nCheck **file attachments** submitted as evidence of completion\nFilter by **status** to focus on open or overdue CAPAs\nYou see CAPAs from all departments (organization-wide visibility)\nAs a Reviewer you can view CAPAs and their progress but cannot create, edit, or delete them\nFocus on overdue CAPAs and those with low completion percentages\nCross-department view helps identify systemic issues appearing in multiple departments\nCAPA\ncorrective action\npreventive action\ntracking\nimplementation\noverdue\neffectiveness	{-0.00988006591796875,0.058868408203125,0.040283203125,0.00458526611328125,-0.04296875,0.00115966796875,0.0006480216979980469,-0.003705978393554688,0.04876708984375,0.005168914794921875,0.031829833984375,-0.01715087890625,0.01953125,0.0186767578125,0.0253753662109375,-0.03875732421875,0.017364501953125,0.0128021240234375,-4.106760025024414e-05,0.0423583984375,0.05426025390625,0.00939178466796875,0.0219573974609375,0.0255279541015625,-0.043853759765625,-0.017