cmn2wa5hc005jjc3oeeqlf8cc	rv-audit-reports	internal-audit	Audit Reports	audit	{Reviewer}	How do I review audit reports?	How do I review audit reports?\nWhere can I see formal audit reports?\nHow to view audit report status?\nHow to download audit reports?\nAudit reports for Reviewer\nWhere to see executive summaries?\nHow to review management responses?\nCan I download audit report PDFs?\nReview formal audit reports including executive summaries, scope, objectives, methodology, observations, recommendations, management responses, and conclusions. As a Reviewer you can view, preview, and download all audit reports across the organization.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Report**\nView the **audit report list** with status indicators (Draft, Submitted, Approved)\nClick on a report to review its **full content** — report code, title, executive summary\nReview **scope, objectives, and methodology** sections\nCheck **observations and recommendations** documented in the report\nReview **management response** and **auditee comments**\nRead the **conclusion and overall result**\nUse **report preview** to see the formatted version\n**Download** reports as PDF for offline review or distribution\nYou see audit reports from all departments (organization-wide visibility)\nAs a Reviewer you can view and download reports but cannot generate, edit, or approve them\nReport review is valuable for understanding audit outcomes and systemic issues\nCheck the status column to see which reports are in Draft, Submitted, or Approved stage\naudit reports\nexecutive summary\nobservations\nrecommendations\nmanagement response\nPDF\ndownload	{-0.03399658203125,0.034210205078125,0.0255584716796875,-0.0138092041015625,-0.057525634765625,0.00408172607421875,-0.017822265625,0.0159912109375,0.028289794921875,0.0293426513671875,0.003185272216796875,-0.044189453125,0.016998291015625,-0.021728515625,0.01206207275390625,0.00656890869140625,0.019744873046875,0.0204620361328125,-0.00754928588867