cmn2wa5om005mjc3ouie4x9lf	aud-role-overview	general	Roles & Access	both	{Auditor}	What can I do as an Auditor?	What can I do as an Auditor?\nWhat is the Auditor role?\nWhat access does an Auditor have?\nWhat pages can an Auditor see?\nAuditor permissions overview\nWhat modules are available to me as an Auditor?\nWhat can't I access as an Auditor?\nAuditor capabilities summary\nThe Auditor role is a hands-on fieldwork role focused on conducting audit tasks, documenting observations, creating findings, and gathering evidence. You have access to Internal Audit (fieldwork, findings) and Compliance (view controls/evidence).\nYour primary workspace is **Internal Audit → Fieldwork** where you conduct assigned audit tasks\nYou can **create work papers**, **upload evidence**, **record interview notes**, and **create draft findings**\nYou can **view compliance controls and evidence** for testing purposes via the Compliance module\nYou can **view audit planning** information for engagements you are assigned to\nYou can **view the Audit Dashboard** for an overview of audit statistics and schedules\nYou do NOT have access to Organization, Risk Management, Asset Management, or GRC Administration modules\nYou cannot manage audit settings, create audit plans, or approve reports — those are Audit Head/Manager responsibilities\nYour scope is limited to engagements and fieldwork tasks assigned to you\nYou can create draft findings but final approval is handled by the Audit Head or Manager\nCompliance access is view-only — you cannot create or modify controls, evidence, or governance documents\nauditor\nrole\npermissions\naccess\ncapabilities\nfieldwork\nmodules	{0.00370025634765625,0.041412353515625,0.035888671875,0.003671646118164062,-0.0408935546875,0.01019287109375,-0.014373779296875,-0.0229644775390625,0.0200653076171875,-0.005481719970703125,0.01904296875,-0.025238037109375,-0.00998687744140625,0.0007328987121582031,-0.01727294921875,0.007549285888671875,-0.0095672607421875,0.006