cmn2wa5p0005njc3o9mmzb5i4	aud-audit-dashboard	internal-audit	Dashboard	audit	{Auditor}	How do I use the Audit Dashboard as an Auditor?	How do I use the Audit Dashboard as an Auditor?\nWhere do I see audit statistics?\nHow to view the audit overview?\nAuditor dashboard overview\nWhere can I see CAPA status by department?\nHow to check the annual audit plan calendar?\nWhere do I see auditor schedule?\nThe Audit Dashboard gives you an overview of audit activity including risk statistics, audit statistics, CAPA status by department, the annual audit plan calendar, and auditor schedule visualization.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Dashboard**\nReview **Risk Statistics** showing total, extreme, high, medium, and low risk counts\nCheck **Audit Statistics** for ongoing, completed, and planned audits\nView **CAPA Status by Department** to see open/closed breakdowns\nReview the **Annual Audit Plan Calendar** for upcoming audit engagements\nCheck the **Auditor Schedule** to see your assignments and timelines\nThe dashboard is read-only for Auditors — you cannot modify any dashboard settings\nUse the dashboard to understand the overall audit landscape and where your fieldwork fits\nCAPA statistics help you understand the remediation status of findings you may have raised\ndashboard\naudit\nstatistics\nCAPA\ncalendar\nschedule\noverview	{-0.00226593017578125,0.0177764892578125,0.03424072265625,-0.00237274169921875,-0.042236328125,0.0185699462890625,-0.053619384765625,-0.033782958984375,0.036895751953125,0.0162506103515625,0.0140838623046875,-0.014984130859375,0.0308380126953125,0.01556396484375,0.03643798828125,-0.003255844116210938,-0.00836944580078125,0.02783203125,-0.0262603759765625,0.057952880859375,0.03765869140625,0.0241851806640625,0.0116119384765625,0.02227783203125,-0.047332763671875,-0.01441192626953125,-0.004650115966796875,-0.0149688720703125,-0.01253509521484375,0.0269622802734375,0.006877899169921875,-0.0400390625,-0.02105712890625,0.005893707275390625,