cmn2wa5pe005ojc3o89leab9d	aud-audit-universe	internal-audit	Audit Universe	audit	{Auditor}	How do I view the Audit Universe as an Auditor?	How do I view the Audit Universe as an Auditor?\nWhat is the audit universe?\nHow to see auditable entities?\nWhere do I find the department-based audit scope?\nHow to view planned vs actual hours?\nWhere to see all auditable areas?\nHow do I check audit scope?\nThe Audit Universe shows the complete set of auditable entities, processes, and functions organized by department. Use it to understand the scope of audits you may be assigned to.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Audit Universe**\nReview the **department-based audit scope** view\nView departments with their associated audits\nCheck **audit metrics** including planned hours vs actual hours\nReview **status tracking** per audit\nCheck **timeline view** with start and end dates\nUse search to find specific audits or departments\nThe Audit Universe is view-only for Auditors — you cannot add or modify auditable entities\nUnderstanding the audit universe helps you see where your assigned engagements fit within the organization\nAudit universe entries are managed by the Audit Head\naudit universe\nauditable entities\ndepartments\nscope\nplanned hours\nactual hours	{-0.042572021484375,-0.003091812133789062,0.0266571044921875,-0.0208587646484375,-0.0509033203125,-0.01387786865234375,-0.0296783447265625,-0.01462554931640625,0.01467132568359375,0.0293731689453125,0.01690673828125,-0.046722412109375,0.01206207275390625,-0.002462387084960938,0.0308990478515625,0.0272216796875,-0.02777099609375,0.00839996337890625,-0.030029296875,0.0357666015625,0.064208984375,0.00537109375,0.019317626953125,0.02130126953125,-0.0140380859375,-0.0675048828125,-0.053253173828125,0.032989501953125,-0.0009531974792480469,0.0274200439453125,0.0245361328125,-0.0271453857421875,0.0171051025390625,0.04510498046875,-0.002782821655273438,0.0290679931640625,-0.01849365234375,-0.0180816650390625,0.0303039