cmn2wa5qh005qjc3orfymw15l	aud-audit-risk-register	internal-audit	Risk Register	audit	{Auditor}	How do I view the Audit Risk Register?	How do I view the Audit Risk Register?\nWhere to see all audit risks?\nHow to check risk likelihood and impact?\nWhere is the audit risk inventory?\nHow do I view risk categories for audits?\nWhat risks are linked to my audit engagement?\nHow to search audit risks?\nThe Audit Risk Register is the risk inventory for the audit function. It lists risks with their IDs, names, likelihood, and impact ratings.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Risk Register**\nReview the list of audit risks with **risk ID, name, likelihood, and impact**\nCheck **probability and impact assessments** for each risk\nView **audit category and type** assignments\nUse **search and pagination** to find specific risks\nAs an Auditor, you can view risks to understand what drives the audits you are assigned to\nRisks may be created manually or via AI recommendations — both types are visible here\nRisk creation and deletion are handled by the Audit Head or Manager\nrisk register\naudit risks\nlikelihood\nimpact\nrisk inventory\nAI recommendations	{-0.0125274658203125,0.038330078125,0.053466796875,-0.005603790283203125,-0.054443359375,-0.0133209228515625,0.01105499267578125,-0.01007080078125,0.0208892822265625,0.0197601318359375,0.01119232177734375,0.003362655639648438,0.026123046875,0.001044273376464844,0.0176849365234375,-0.0308074951171875,0.0112762451171875,0.060882568359375,-0.0242767333984375,0.07122802734375,0.018524169921875,0.035125732421875,0.00495147705078125,-0.001646041870117188,-0.0159912109375,0.013702392578125,-0.01496124267578125,-0.03826904296875,-0.0218353271484375,-0.007671356201171875,0.032562255859375,-0.0216522216796875,0.0005626678466796875,0.0007977485656738281,-0.017578125,0.0311431884765625,-0.013458251953125,-0.035980224609375,0.0274200439453125,0.0159454345703125,0.03704833984375,0.0125274658203125,0.003038406372070312,0.020126342773