cmn2wa5qv005rjc3ok4rp2usb	aud-audit-planning	internal-audit	Audit Planning	audit	{Auditor}	How do I view audit planning for my assigned engagements?	How do I view audit planning for my assigned engagements?\nWhere to see my audit assignments?\nHow to check which engagements I'm assigned to?\nWhere do I view the annual audit plan?\nHow to see engagement details and scope?\nHow to check audit engagement dates?\nWhere to find audit plan documents?\nThe Audit Planning page shows audit engagements including those you are assigned to. You can view engagement details, scope, timelines, and assigned team members.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Audit Planning**\nReview the list of audit engagements with **title, department, dates, and status**\nLook for engagements where you are listed as an assigned auditor\nView engagement details including **scope, objectives, and risk linkage**\nCheck **planned hours** and **engagement status** (Planned, In Progress, Completed, Cancelled)\nDownload any attached engagement documents for reference\nUse **search and pagination** to find specific engagements\nAs an Auditor you can view audit plans but cannot create, edit, or delete engagements\nAudit plans are created and managed by the Audit Head or Manager\nYour assigned engagements determine which fieldwork tasks appear in the Fieldwork page\nReview engagement scope and objectives before starting fieldwork\naudit planning\nengagements\nassignments\nannual plan\nscope\ntimeline\naudit team	{-0.0086517333984375,0.03729248046875,0.039825439453125,-0.0389404296875,-0.060760498046875,-0.018280029296875,-0.003610610961914062,-0.025634765625,-0.0135650634765625,0.00965118408203125,0.041473388671875,-0.0223388671875,0.058807373046875,-0.01934814453125,0.01195526123046875,0.0140228271484375,-0.0191192626953125,-0.00765228271484375,-0.041839599609375,0.047760009765625,0.063720703125,0.0274658203125,0.0121002197265625,-0.019256591796875,-0.0152587890625,-0.05670166015625,-0.04525756835937