cmn2wa5y2005ujc3o8zmbrdbw	aud-audit-capa	internal-audit	CAPA Tracking	audit	{Auditor}	How do I view CAPA tracking as an Auditor?	How do I view CAPA tracking as an Auditor?\nWhere do I see corrective actions?\nHow to check CAPA status for my findings?\nWhat is CAPA tracking?\nHow to view remediation progress?\nWhere to check overdue CAPAs?\nHow to see preventive actions?\nCAPA Tracking lets you monitor Corrective and Preventive Actions arising from audit findings. View remediation progress, completion percentages, and status of actions linked to your findings.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → CAPA Tracking**\nReview the list of CAPA items with **status, severity, and due dates**\nCheck **action type** (corrective or preventive), **description**, and **completion percentage**\nView **responsible persons** and **target completion dates**\nMonitor **implementation progress** for actions related to your findings\nReview **comments and discussions** for updates on remediation\nCheck for **file attachments** providing evidence of corrective action\nUse **filters** to view by status (open, in progress, completed, overdue)\nUse **search and pagination** to find specific CAPA items\nAs an Auditor, you can view CAPA items to track how your findings are being addressed\nCAPA entries are typically created by the Audit Head or Manager and assigned to responsible persons\nOverdue CAPAs may be escalated according to escalation policies\nUnderstanding CAPA progress helps you assess whether issues are being effectively remediated\nCAPA\ncorrective action\npreventive action\nremediation\ntracking\noverdue\ncompletion	{0.0020294189453125,0.041107177734375,0.056915283203125,-0.001917839050292969,-0.04620361328125,-0.00566864013671875,-0.0092010498046875,-0.04541015625,0.03240966796875,-0.005832672119140625,0.04986572265625,-0.001878738403320312,0.004886627197265625,-0.0140380859375,0.0232391357421875,-0.036346435546875,0.010498046875,0.001616477966308594,-0.0225372314453125,0.0