cmn2wa5yh005vjc3odoj40ja9	aud-audit-reports	internal-audit	Audit Reports	audit	{Auditor}	How do I view audit reports as an Auditor?	How do I view audit reports as an Auditor?\nWhere to see audit reports?\nHow to check report status?\nCan I download audit reports?\nWhere to view engagement reports?\nHow do I see the final audit report?\nHow to read audit conclusions?\nView audit reports compiled from engagement data including observations, recommendations, management responses, and conclusions. Reports can be previewed and downloaded.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Report**\nReview the list of audit reports with their **status** (Draft, Submitted, Approved)\nClick a report to view its details: **report code, title, executive summary, scope, objectives, methodology**\nReview **observations and recommendations** included in the report\nCheck **management response** and **auditee comments**\nRead the **conclusion and overall result**\nUse **report preview** to see the formatted report\n**Download** the report as PDF if needed\nUse **search and pagination** to find specific reports\nAs an Auditor, you can view reports but cannot create, edit, or approve them\nReports are generated and managed by the Audit Head or Manager\nYour fieldwork observations and findings contribute to the content of these reports\nReport statuses: Draft (being compiled), Submitted (under review), Approved (finalized)\nreports\naudit report\nPDF\ndownload\nexecutive summary\nobservations\nconclusions	{-0.00457763671875,0.0170135498046875,0.041748046875,-0.028900146484375,-0.0667724609375,-0.006946563720703125,-0.01168060302734375,-0.0268096923828125,0.027923583984375,-0.002664566040039062,0.006591796875,-0.043914794921875,0.0125732421875,-0.0293426513671875,0.01023101806640625,0.0153656005859375,0.01520538330078125,0.0237274169921875,-0.026824951171875,0.0975341796875,0.039337158203125,0.0262603759765625,0.021392822265625,0.00727081298828125,-0.00782012939453125,-0.025848388671875,-0.08