cmn2wa5zp005yjc3ol625uhnc	aud-comp-frameworks	compliance	Frameworks	grc	{Auditor}	How do I view compliance frameworks as an Auditor?	How do I view compliance frameworks as an Auditor?\nWhere to see compliance frameworks?\nHow to check framework compliance percentages?\nCan I view ISO 27001 or NIST frameworks?\nWhere to browse adopted frameworks?\nHow to see framework coverage for audit testing?\nHow do I review framework details?\nView adopted compliance frameworks to understand which standards your organization follows. This helps you align your audit testing with framework requirements.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Frameworks**\nBrowse the available frameworks displayed in a **cards/grid view**\nReview framework details: **code, name, description, type, status, country, industry**\nCheck **compliance percentage, policy percentage, and evidence percentage** per framework\nClick a framework to view its controls and requirements\nAs an Auditor, you have view-only access to frameworks — you cannot select, adopt, import, or modify them\nUnderstanding framework requirements helps you know what to test during fieldwork\nFramework compliance percentages give you context about your organization's compliance posture\nUse this information to identify areas where audit testing should focus\nframeworks\ncompliance\nISO 27001\nNIST\nSOC 2\nGDPR\ncompliance percentage	{-0.05499267578125,0.0235748291015625,0.052001953125,-0.0278472900390625,0.0097808837890625,-0.022613525390625,-0.02294921875,-0.03826904296875,0.039215087890625,0.04803466796875,0.035430908203125,-0.00605010986328125,-0.01009368896484375,0.00493621826171875,0.054962158203125,-0.01497650146484375,0.007045745849609375,-0.02679443359375,0.020965576171875,0.048126220703125,0.061309814453125,0.0225982666015625,-0.00960540771484375,0.057769775390625,-0.01494598388671875,-0.06744384765625,-0.042144775390625,0.037445068359375,-0.01207733154296875,-0.0221710205078125,0.00823211669921875,-0.01239776611328125,-0.014