cmn2wa603005zjc3o2fjdsmgu	aud-comp-controls	compliance	Controls	grc	{Auditor}	How do I view compliance controls for audit testing?	How do I view compliance controls for audit testing?\nWhere to see compliance controls?\nHow to check control status for my audit?\nWhere do I review control effectiveness?\nHow to find controls linked to my audit scope?\nHow to filter controls by framework or status?\nWhere to view control compliance status?\nView compliance controls and their assessment status to support your audit testing. Controls are derived from adopted frameworks and show their compliance status.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Controls**\nReview the list of controls with **status indicators** (Compliant, Partially Compliant, Non-Compliant, Not Assessed)\nView control details: **code, name, description, domain, category, status**\nUse **filters** to narrow by framework, domain, or status\nCheck which controls are **linked to evidence items**\nReview **control-to-risk mappings** for your audit scope\nUse **multi-select column filtering** and **search** to find specific controls\nAs an Auditor, you can view controls but cannot create, edit, delete, or assess them\nUse control status information to identify areas needing audit attention — Non-Compliant and Not Assessed controls may warrant closer examination\nControls linked to your audit engagement's risks are particularly relevant for your fieldwork\nCross-reference control status with evidence to validate compliance claims during testing\ncontrols\ncompliance\nassessment\ncompliant\nnon-compliant\neffectiveness\ntesting	{0.0088958740234375,0.042694091796875,0.057098388671875,-0.00940704345703125,-0.05084228515625,-0.003932952880859375,-0.001008033752441406,-0.033660888671875,0.0274505615234375,0.06732177734375,0.0328369140625,-0.003202438354492188,0.042022705078125,-0.0107574462890625,0.0300140380859375,-0.030303955078125,-0.0064239501953125,0.01715087890625,0.02001953125,0.0767822265625,0.06976318359375,0.0