cmn2wa60i0060jc3o0lrukspg	aud-comp-governance	compliance	Governance Documents	grc	{Auditor}	How do I view governance documents as an Auditor?	How do I view governance documents as an Auditor?\nWhere to see policies and procedures?\nHow to find governance documents for audit review?\nWhere to check document versions?\nHow to review policy approval status?\nWhere are organizational standards documented?\nHow to view document review schedules?\nView governance documents including policies, procedures, standards, and guidelines. Review document versions, approval status, and review schedules to support your audit testing.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Governance**\nReview the list of governance documents with **version and status**\nView document properties: **code, name, version, document type** (policy, procedure, standard, guideline)\nCheck **document review and approval workflow** status\nReview **version history** to understand document changes\nCheck **review schedules and due dates** for policy recurrence\nView **linked frameworks and controls** for each document\nAs an Auditor, you have view-only access — you cannot create, edit, or delete governance documents\nReviewing governance documents helps you understand the policies against which you are auditing\nCheck whether policies are current (approved) or overdue for review — this could be an audit finding\nDocument version history can reveal gaps in governance practices\ngovernance\ndocuments\npolicies\nprocedures\nstandards\nguidelines\nversion\napproval	{0.001242637634277344,0.0416259765625,0.04351806640625,-0.003536224365234375,-0.039031982421875,0.0209197998046875,-0.046417236328125,-0.04608154296875,0.0153961181640625,0.024688720703125,0.04132080078125,-0.029998779296875,0.00426483154296875,-0.0289764404296875,0.0007538795471191406,0.01544952392578125,0.005672454833984375,0.022613525390625,0.0286865234375,0.05438232421875,0.06005859375,0.03692626953125,-0.00714874267578125,0.0552978515625,-0.0190582