cmn2wa60x0061jc3ous9g2616	aud-comp-evidence	compliance	Evidence	grc	{Auditor}	How do I view compliance evidence for audit testing?	How do I view compliance evidence for audit testing?\nWhere to review compliance evidence?\nHow to check evidence status?\nWhere to see submitted evidence?\nHow do I validate compliance evidence during auditing?\nWhere to find evidence linked to controls?\nHow to check evidence due dates?\nView compliance evidence items to validate compliance claims during your audit testing. Evidence items are linked to controls and show their collection and review status.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Evidence**\nReview the list of evidence items with **status and due dates**\nCheck evidence **status**: Pending, Submitted, Approved, or Rejected\nView which **controls and frameworks** each evidence item is linked to\nReview **uploaded evidence files** (documents, screenshots, exports)\nCheck **assignee** information to know who provided the evidence\nUse **filters** (status, assignee, control) to find specific evidence\nAs an Auditor, you have view-only access to compliance evidence — you cannot create, edit, approve, or reject evidence items\nUse compliance evidence to cross-reference and validate claims during your audit fieldwork\nEvidence items with Rejected status or past-due dates may indicate compliance gaps worth investigating\nUpload audit-specific evidence through the Fieldwork page, not through Compliance Evidence\nevidence\ncompliance\nfiles\nsubmitted\napproved\nrejected\ndue dates\nreview	{0.018524169921875,0.04437255859375,0.062408447265625,-0.00685882568359375,-0.06964111328125,0.001162528991699219,-0.003278732299804688,-0.011993408203125,-0.011138916015625,0.05572509765625,0.056243896484375,0.01534271240234375,0.041290283203125,-0.00281524658203125,0.0097198486328125,-0.01001739501953125,0.0268402099609375,0.005077362060546875,-0.01399993896484375,0.051361083984375,0.06060791015625,-0.0125274658203125,0.016265869140625,0.0080947