cmn2wa61b0062jc3o716a5694	aud-comp-exceptions	compliance	Exceptions	grc	{Auditor}	How do I view compliance exceptions as an Auditor?	How do I view compliance exceptions as an Auditor?\nWhere to see compliance exceptions?\nHow to check exception status?\nWhere to review risk acceptances?\nHow to find compensating controls?\nWhat exceptions exist for compliance controls?\nView compliance exceptions — situations where controls cannot be fully implemented and a risk acceptance or compensating control is applied. Useful for understanding known compliance gaps during audit testing.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Exceptions**\nReview the list of exceptions with **status indicators**\nView exception details: **code, description, severity, status**\nCheck **compensating controls** specified for each exception\nReview **exception expiry/target remediation dates**\nCheck **department and owner** assignments\nView **approval status** (open, in-progress, closed)\nReview **linked controls** affected by each exception\nAs an Auditor, you have view-only access — you cannot create, edit, or delete exceptions\nExceptions are important audit context — they explain why certain controls may not be fully compliant\nCheck whether exceptions have expired without remediation — this could be an audit finding\nCompensating controls should be tested to verify they provide adequate risk mitigation\nexceptions\ncompliance\nrisk acceptance\ncompensating controls\nexpiry\nseverity	{-0.0181732177734375,0.057464599609375,0.04150390625,0.0121002197265625,-0.050628662109375,0.00833892822265625,-0.030120849609375,-0.039581298828125,0.065185546875,0.0192413330078125,0.025787353515625,-0.03692626953125,0.0323486328125,0.003347396850585938,0.0244903564453125,-0.024932861328125,0.0172576904296875,0.0283355712890625,0.005542755126953125,0.08245849609375,0.045806884765625,0.0207977294921875,-0.00225830078125,0.041717529296875,-0.03936767578125,-0.035003662109375,-0.0172119140625,0.046905517578125,0.00