cmn2wa61p0063jc3o343aoue3	aud-comp-kpis	compliance	KPIs	grc	{Auditor}	How do I view compliance KPIs as an Auditor?	How do I view compliance KPIs as an Auditor?\nWhere to see compliance KPIs?\nHow to check compliance performance metrics?\nWhere to review KPI targets and scores?\nHow do I see compliance health indicators?\nWhat compliance metrics can I view?\nView compliance Key Performance Indicators to understand compliance health through measurable metrics, targets, and thresholds. This context helps inform your audit scope and focus areas.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → KPIs**\nReview the list of compliance KPIs with **current values and targets**\nCheck KPI details: **code, objective, description, expected score, actual score**\nView **department association** for each KPI\nCheck **review date tracking** and **status** (Scheduled, Missed, Overdue, Achieved)\nReview **visual indicators** for KPI health\nUse **filters** (status, department) and **search** to find specific KPIs\nAs an Auditor, you have view-only access to KPIs — you cannot create or modify them\nKPIs with Missed or Overdue status may indicate areas where deeper audit testing is warranted\nCompare KPI targets vs actual scores to identify compliance performance gaps\nKPI data can support your audit findings and recommendations\nKPIs\nkey performance indicators\ncompliance\nmetrics\ntargets\nscores\nhealth	{-0.0087738037109375,0.0582275390625,0.04632568359375,-0.01065826416015625,-0.01555633544921875,0.005645751953125,-0.040283203125,-0.0306396484375,0.046234130859375,0.0304107666015625,0.031585693359375,-0.01042938232421875,0.0125732421875,-0.037322998046875,0.0443115234375,-0.029693603515625,-0.0004856586456298828,-0.010894775390625,0.0009441375732421875,0.070556640625,0.04412841796875,0.0280303955078125,0.006622314453125,0.0131072998046875,-0.012603759765625,-0.0204010009765625,-0.0261688232421875,-0.01104736328125,0.001084327697753906,0.010986328125,0.0089874267578125,-0.0079193115234375,-0.