cmn2wa6ao0064jc3oz6lhp59q	aud-comp-risk-matrix	compliance	Risk Matrix	grc	{Auditor}	How do I view the Risk Matrix as an Auditor?	How do I view the Risk Matrix as an Auditor?\nWhere to see the risk-control matrix?\nHow to check which controls mitigate which risks?\nWhere to identify unmitigated risks?\nHow do I review control effectiveness per risk?\nWhere to find gaps in control coverage?\nView the Risk Matrix to see how risks map to controls. Identify unmitigated risks and gaps in control coverage to focus your audit testing.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Risk Matrix**\nReview the **matrix view of risks vs controls**\nIdentify **unmitigated risks** (gaps where no controls exist)\nCheck **control effectiveness per risk**\nReview **status indicators** (compliant, non-compliant, partially compliant, not applicable)\nExpand **collapsible risk groups** for detail\nReview **residual risk assessment** view\nUse **search and filter** to focus on specific areas\nAs an Auditor, you have view-only access — you cannot link/unlink controls to risks\nUnmitigated risks (gaps) are prime candidates for audit findings\nThe risk matrix helps you understand the relationship between risks and controls relevant to your engagement\nUse this view to prioritize which controls to test during fieldwork\nrisk matrix\nrisks\ncontrols\ncoverage\ngaps\nunmitigated\neffectiveness	{-0.01908457465469837,0.0707661584019661,0.03905140608549118,0.02227694541215897,-0.05414261296391487,-0.02456384524703026,-0.01677445881068707,-0.02871973067522049,0.02883581817150116,0.04346268251538277,-0.01172470860183239,-0.0141625190153718,0.01810945011675358,0.001963308313861489,0.02200994826853275,-0.05400330945849419,0.01968822255730629,-0.01286235358566046,-0.01761027984321117,0.0458076223731041,0.04608622938394547,0.01815588586032391,0.0128159187734127,0.03775123879313469,-0.01432503946125507,-0.02686235122382641,-0.005366085562855005,-0.008213100023567677,-0.001854477450251579,0.03967827185988426,0.02