cmn2wa6bi0066jc3o84azgq0n	aud-comp-master-data	compliance	Master Data	grc	{Auditor}	Can I access compliance master data as an Auditor?	Can I access compliance master data as an Auditor?\nWhere to see compliance configuration?\nCan I view framework definitions?\nWhere are control templates?\nCan I access domain and category definitions?\nWhere to see evidence templates?\nCompliance Master Data contains centralized configuration like framework definitions, control templates, and domain/category definitions. As an Auditor, you may have limited or no access to this area.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Master Data** (if visible in your sidebar)\nIf accessible, review **framework definitions and templates**\nReview **control templates** and **domain/category definitions**\nCheck **evidence templates** and **governance document templates**\nMaster Data configuration is managed by administrators — you cannot modify any settings\nIf Master Data is not visible in your sidebar, your role does not have access\nUnderstanding master data definitions helps you interpret controls and evidence during testing\nmaster data\ncompliance\nconfiguration\ntemplates\ndefinitions\ndomains\ncategories	{0.0396115630865097,0.04921220988035202,0.09154988080263138,-0.0126704853028059,-0.02323119714856148,0.007935350760817528,-0.03911375254392624,0.0002827968564815819,0.02799596451222897,0.02446387335658073,0.04349923133850098,-0.003647653618827462,0.03387488052248955,-0.006074483972042799,0.04103388264775276,-0.01112964004278183,0.008723551407456398,0.01945020258426666,0.01428244542330503,0.07116331905126572,0.0919765755534172,0.0131801487877965,-0.005908546969294548,0.001334164175204933,-0.005464072339236736,-0.04473190754652023,-0.04397333785891533,0.01935538090765476,0.01086295582354069,0.009203583933413029,0.03506014496088028,-0.02823301590979099,0.0006374504300765693,0.01319200173020363,0.006115968339145184,0.02301784977316856,-0.02605212852358818,-0.02700034156441689,-0.0131327379494