cmn2wa6bw0067jc3o1ngy6ly1	aud-audit-evidence-upload	internal-audit	Fieldwork	audit	{Auditor}	How do I upload audit evidence during fieldwork?	How do I upload audit evidence during fieldwork?\nHow to attach files to fieldwork?\nWhere to upload supporting documents for my audit?\nHow to add screenshots as audit evidence?\nHow to upload work papers?\nWhat file types can I upload as evidence?\nUpload audit evidence and supporting files directly through the Fieldwork page when conducting your assigned audit tasks. Attach documents, screenshots, and exports to support your observations.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Fieldwork**\nOpen the engagement you are working on\nLocate the **evidence upload** section within the fieldwork detail\nClick the **upload** button to attach files\nSelect the files from your computer (documents, screenshots, exports)\nAdd a description or label for each uploaded file\nSave to confirm the evidence attachment to the engagement\nAlways upload audit evidence through Fieldwork, not through Compliance Evidence\nEnsure evidence files are clearly named and described for easy reference\nSupported file types typically include PDF, Word, Excel, images (PNG, JPG), and other common formats\nEvidence should directly support your observations and findings\nKeep file sizes reasonable — large files may take longer to upload\nupload\nevidence\nfiles\nattachments\nwork papers\nscreenshots\ndocuments	{0.01889492943882942,0.03329581022262573,0.05211325734853745,-0.01277372520416975,-0.05153766646981239,-0.03573101013898849,0.02113088592886925,-0.002980351448059082,-0.03201179578900337,0.04283736273646355,0.02718567475676537,0.0102056972682476,0.02585738524794579,-0.04126555100083351,-0.02835899777710438,0.02426343597471714,0.03395995497703552,0.0002616801066324115,-0.03593025356531143,0.01034959591925144,0.01779909059405327,0.01073147915303707,-0.005260583013296127,-0.01336038671433926,0.00424776179715991,-0.06544043868780136,-0.05144911259412766,-0.