cmn2wa6cb0068jc3oifmcehaz	aud-audit-interview-notes	internal-audit	Fieldwork	audit	{Auditor}	How do I record interview notes during an audit?	How do I record interview notes during an audit?\nWhere to document interview results?\nHow to capture meeting notes during fieldwork?\nHow to record discussions with auditees?\nWhere to log interview observations?\nHow to document stakeholder conversations?\nRecord interview notes within the Fieldwork page as part of your audit engagement. Document key points, attendees, and dates from discussions with auditees and process owners.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Fieldwork**\nOpen the engagement for which you conducted the interview\nLocate the **work papers** or **notes** section\nCreate a new work paper entry for the interview\nRecord the **date, attendees, and interview subject**\nDocument **key points, observations, and follow-up items**\nAttach any supporting materials if applicable\nSave the interview notes to the engagement\nInterview notes are part of your audit working papers and should be thorough\nInclude the names and roles of all attendees for the record\nNote any discrepancies between interview responses and documented procedures\nInterview notes may be referenced in findings and the final audit report\nEnsure notes are objective and fact-based rather than opinion-based\ninterview\nnotes\nmeetings\ndiscussions\nauditees\nobservations\ndocumentation	{0.0129984300583601,0.03800379484891891,0.04079306125640869,-0.03589005023241043,-0.06772693991661072,-0.00370449828915298,0.01886025443673134,-0.001570325926877558,-0.003143375739455223,-0.007000411860644817,0.008498555049300194,-0.00820437353104353,0.02093041501939297,-0.04096738994121552,-0.003404869697988033,-0.004224762320518494,0.006575484294444323,-0.00512364786118269,0.001995253609493375,0.01918712072074413,0.0122684258967638,0.03074733540415764,-0.001613908214494586,0.03185868263244629,0.01900189742445946,-0.06110242754220963,-0.04567428305745125,-0.