cmn2wa6cp0069jc3oc0pngosi	aud-audit-no-access	general	Roles & Access	both	{Auditor}	What modules can I NOT access as an Auditor?	What modules can I NOT access as an Auditor?\nWhy can't I see Organization module?\nWhy is Risk Management not visible?\nCan I access Asset Management as an Auditor?\nWhy don't I see GRC Administration?\nWhat is restricted for the Auditor role?\nWhy can't I access certain pages?\nAs an Auditor, you do not have access to Organization, Risk Management, Asset Management, or GRC Administration modules. Your access is limited to Internal Audit (fieldwork focus) and Compliance (view-only).\nYour sidebar will only show **Internal Audit** and **Compliance** menu items\n**Organization module** (profile, users, processes, BIA) is not accessible — managed by Customer Administrator\n**Risk Management module** (risk register, assessment, response) is not accessible — managed by risk roles\n**Asset Management module** (inventory, classification) is not accessible — managed by asset roles\n**GRC Administration** (customer accounts, email, configuration) is not accessible — managed by GRC Administrator\nIf you need access to additional modules, contact your Customer Administrator or GRC Administrator\nThis is by design — the Auditor role is focused on fieldwork and audit execution\nMenu items are hidden based on your permissions; you cannot access restricted pages even by URL\nPermissions are enforced at both the UI level and API level for security\nIf you believe you need additional access, discuss with your Audit Head who can request role changes\nno access\nrestricted\nunavailable\norganization\nrisk management\nasset management\nadministration	{-0.01324488129466772,0.06593890488147736,0.07279098778963089,0.02396988496184349,-0.03723959252238274,0.006889324635267258,-0.0613708458840847,-0.008962328545749187,0.01652196608483791,-0.01752743497490883,0.007770661730319262,-0.02788004092872143,0.00414600782096386,0.01681988313794136,-0.03105781972408295,-0.