cmn2wa6d4006ajc3opy713j4c	ah-role-overview	general	Roles & Access	both	{AuditHead}	What can I do as an Audit Head?	What can I do as an Audit Head?\nWhat is the Audit Head role?\nWhat access does an Audit Head have?\nWhat pages can an Audit Head see?\nAudit Head permissions overview\nWhat modules are available to me as an Audit Head?\nAudit Head capabilities summary\nWhat is the scope of the Audit Head role?\nThe Audit Head is the top audit role with full CRUD access to all Internal Audit activities. You oversee audit planning, execution, reporting, and CAPA management, and have read access to Organization, Compliance, and Risk Management for audit planning context.\nYou have **full access to Internal Audit** — Universe, Planning, Fieldwork, Findings, CAPA, Reports, Document Library, and Settings\nYou can **create, edit, and delete** audit engagements, assign auditors, and manage all audit activities\nYou can **approve and finalize** audit reports and manage the audit report lifecycle\nYou can **configure all audit settings** — types, periodicity, escalation, risk assessment matrices, categories, and more\nYou have **view access to Organization** — profile, users, processes, BIA, and settings for organizational context\nYou have **view access to Compliance** — frameworks, controls, governance, evidence, exceptions, KPIs, and reports\nYou have **view access to Risk Management** — dashboard, risk register, assessment, response, and risk control matrix\nYou can **manage the audit risk register** and risk identification for audit-specific risks\nYou do NOT have access to Asset Management or GRC Administration modules\nOrganization, Compliance, and Risk Management access is **view-only** — for audit planning context\nYou are the only audit role that can configure audit settings and approve final reports\nAs Audit Head, you can assign and reassign auditors to engagements and manage team schedules\nPermissions are enforced at both UI and API levels for security\naudit head\nrole\npermissions\naccess\ncapabilities\nmodules\nfull access\ninternal audit	{0.001899029361084104,0.04396731033921242,0.04047457873821259,-0.003039017785340548,-0.02270274609327316,-0.006374803371727467,-0.01435900200158358,-0.01970082521438599,0.02206355333328247,-0.04159316420555115,0.05122670903801918,-0.03036164119839668,-0.003504144260659814,-0.0002987297193612903,0.004100533667951822,-0.008834552951157093,-0.03225639089941978,0.01730385236442089,-0.001860506599768996,0.07076773792505264,0.04618165269494057,0.01663041859865189,0.009462331421673298,0.03161719813942909,-0.001569445710629225,-0.0533725693821907,-0.02157274447381496,0.01522647682577372,-0.004234650172293186,-0.02201789617538452,0.01297788973897696,-0.03316952288150787,-0.006951218005269766,-0.004277452826499939,0.01247566659003496,-0.00269516627304256,-0.01071218028664589,-0.03510992974042892,0.01935840025544167,-0.01479273941367865,0.0214015319943428,0.01144268643110991,-0.007932835258543491,0.01362849585711956,-0.04234649986028671,-0.02374143339693546,0.04022346809506416,0.01971223764121532,0.001991769298911095,0.02046557329595089,-0.01546617411077023,0.07652046531438828,0.0267319418489933,0.04106811434030533,-0.01397092081606388,0.03113780356943607,-0.01947254128754139,0.005698514636605978,-0.04734589904546738,0.01723536849021912,-0.01733809523284435,-0.02150426059961319,-0.0371188186109066,-0.02346749417483807,-0.003250179346650839,-0.04449236020445824,-0.04730024188756943,0.005290458910167217,0.02956265024840832,-0.004859574604779482,0.01940405741333961,0.039378821849823,-0.01778324693441391,-0.01529496256262064,-0.02085365355014801,-0.04816771671175957,0.06688692420721054,0.02120749279856682,-0.04549680650234222,-0.006768591236323118,0.01837678253650665,0.05318994447588921,-0.03374022990465164,-0.04042892158031464,0.01091192848980427,-0.002973386319354177,-0.04857862740755081,-0.04426407814025879,-0.002897767582908273,-0.02374143339693546,0.001509521505795419,0.03951578959822655,-0.0213901