cmn2wa6dj006bjc3ofoaa4cci	ah-audit-dashboard	internal-audit	Dashboard	audit	{AuditHead}	How do I use the Audit Dashboard as Audit Head?	How do I use the Audit Dashboard as Audit Head?\nWhere is the audit dashboard?\nHow do I see audit statistics?\nAudit overview metrics\nHow do I view CAPA status by department?\nWhere is the annual audit plan calendar?\nHow do I view auditor schedules?\nThe Audit Dashboard provides a comprehensive overview of your audit function including risk statistics, audit statistics, CAPA status by department, annual audit plan calendar, and auditor schedule visualization.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Dashboard**\nReview **Risk Statistics** — total risks broken down by extreme, high, medium, and low\nReview **Audit Statistics** — ongoing, completed, and planned audit counts\nCheck **CAPA Status by Department** to identify departments with open corrective actions\nUse the **Annual Audit Plan Calendar** to see planned audits across the year\nView the **Auditor Schedule** to monitor team workload and availability\nUse dashboard insights to make audit planning and resource allocation decisions\nAs Audit Head, you see metrics across all departments and all auditors\nDashboard data updates in real time as audits progress\nUse this view to identify overdue CAPAs and escalation needs\ndashboard\naudit statistics\nCAPA status\nannual plan\ncalendar\nauditor schedule\nmetrics\nrisk statistics	{-0.01254043821245432,0.01420213561505079,0.03643780201673508,-0.008075372315943241,-0.04028720408678055,0.01240893639624119,-0.05441761016845703,-0.03043656423687935,0.04143485054373741,-0.002450705273076892,0.01977300643920898,-0.02847599983215332,0.0356966145336628,0.003586397971957922,0.02534387819468975,-0.00949797686189413,-0.01996428146958351,0.01929482072591782,-0.02349090576171875,0.0521223172545433,0.02904982306063175,0.03340131789445877,0.01759725995361805,0.03933082893490791,-0.02316812984645367,-0.003490760689601302,0.002851186320185661,-0