cmn2wa6dz006cjc3ou0g0usuq	ah-audit-universe	internal-audit	Universe	audit	{AuditHead}	How do I manage the Audit Universe?	How do I manage the Audit Universe?\nWhat is the audit universe?\nHow do I define auditable entities?\nHow do I view audit scope by department?\nWhere do I see planned vs actual hours?\nHow do I set up the audit universe?\nHow do I navigate audit universe?\nThe Audit Universe defines the complete set of auditable entities, processes, and functions. As Audit Head, you manage this universe to support risk-based audit planning.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Audit Universe**\nView the department-based audit scope showing all departments with associated audits\nReview **planned hours vs actual hours** for each audit to track resource usage\nCheck the **status** of each audit (Planned, In Progress, Completed)\nReview **timeline** information (start/end dates) for each audit\nUse the **search** function to find specific audits or departments\nClick on an audit to navigate to its detailed engagement view\nThe Audit Universe forms the foundation for your annual audit plan\nAs Audit Head, you have full control to create and modify the universe scope\nUse this view to ensure comprehensive audit coverage across all departments\naudit universe\nauditable entities\ndepartment\nscope\nplanned hours\nactual hours\naudit scope	{-0.04537953808903694,0.009517097845673561,0.03719747066497803,-0.02281582355499268,-0.04531078040599823,-0.01861019432544708,-0.01143083069473505,-0.01580262184143066,0.01505775563418865,0.03811422735452652,0.02890080586075783,-0.04315640032291412,0.01348780747503042,-0.01524110790342093,0.01993949338793755,0.0198478177189827,-0.04886322095990181,0.02649431675672531,-0.01443894393742085,0.02475247532129288,0.05450128391385078,0.0142441326752305,0.02106252312660217,0.02411074377596378,-0.01691419072449207,-0.0528511181473732,-0.04201045259833336,0.03449303284287453,-0.002403625752776861,0.01023904513567686,0.03547854721546173,-0