cmn2wa6ef006djc3o57xcd0o2	ah-audit-risk-identification	internal-audit	Risk Identification	audit	{AuditHead}	How do I manage Risk Identification for audits?	How do I manage Risk Identification for audits?\nHow do I identify audit risks?\nWhere do I document audit risks?\nHow do I create risk entries for audit planning?\nWhat is risk identification in internal audit?\nHow do I link risks to audit planning?\nHow do I configure assessment methodology?\nRisk Identification allows you to identify and document risks for audit planning purposes using structured risk entry and assessment methodology. As Audit Head, you have full CRUD access to create, edit, and manage all risk entries.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Risk Identification**\nUse structured **risk entry forms** to document identified risks\nConfigure the **assessment methodology** to match your organization's risk framework\nCreate new risk entries with details such as risk name, description, likelihood, and impact\nEdit existing risk entries as new information becomes available\nLink identified risks to **audit planning** to ensure risk-based audit coverage\nReview and prioritize risks to inform your annual audit plan\nAs Audit Head, you manage the full risk identification process for the audit function\nRisks identified here feed directly into audit planning and engagement scoping\nYou can also view organizational risks via Risk Management (view-only) for additional context\nrisk identification\naudit risk\nrisk entry\nassessment methodology\naudit planning\nrisk linkage	{-0.006060561165213585,0.03272178396582603,0.06481389701366425,0.0146607868373394,-0.03383420035243034,-0.04793877899646759,-0.01562627777457237,0.004748751409351826,-0.001324272016063333,0.0164448469877243,-0.005352184176445007,-0.004391939379274845,0.04277549311518669,-0.02678190916776657,0.0127088138833642,-0.04178901389241219,-0.02940552867949009,0.03962714970111847,-0.0188375897705555,0.05028954148292542,0.05108712241053581,0.0