cmn2wa6kk006ejc3o2v22ygkh	ah-audit-risk-register	internal-audit	Risk Register	audit	{AuditHead}	How do I manage the Audit Risk Register?	How do I manage the Audit Risk Register?\nWhere is the audit-specific risk register?\nHow do I create audit risks?\nHow do I use AI risk recommendations?\nHow do I assess audit risk probability and impact?\nWhat is the audit risk register?\nHow do I add risks to the audit risk register?\nThe Audit Risk Register is a risk inventory specific to the audit function. As Audit Head, you can create risks manually or use AI-recommended risks, assess probability and impact, and manage the full risk lifecycle.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Risk Register**\nView the list of audit risks with **risk ID, name, likelihood, and impact**\nClick **Create** to add a new risk manually — enter name, description, category, type, probability, and impact\nUse the **AI Recommendations** feature to get suggested risks based on your audit context\nAssign **audit category and type** to each risk for proper classification\nEdit existing risks to update assessments as new information emerges\nDelete risks that are no longer relevant\nUse **search and pagination** to navigate large risk inventories\nThis is separate from the organization-wide Risk Management risk register\nAs Audit Head, you have full CRUD access — create, edit, delete all audit risks\nAI recommendations can accelerate risk identification but should be reviewed before adoption\nAudit risks here inform engagement scoping and audit planning priorities\naudit risk register\nrisk inventory\nAI recommendations\nprobability\nimpact\naudit risk\nrisk creation	{0.0107269287109375,0.035430908203125,0.05853271484375,-0.01422119140625,-0.031341552734375,-0.017974853515625,0.023895263671875,-0.014068603515625,0.027191162109375,0.04559326171875,-0.0205841064453125,-0.0048370361328125,0.020965576171875,-0.002126693725585938,0.0002727508544921875,-0.051055908203125,-0.002519607543945312,0.061767578