cmn2wa6ld006gjc3oqtgwi9q1	ah-audit-fieldwork	internal-audit	Fieldwork	audit	{AuditHead}	How do I oversee audit fieldwork?	How do I oversee audit fieldwork?\nHow do I monitor fieldwork progress?\nHow do I view fieldwork tasks?\nHow do I manage work papers?\nHow do I review audit evidence?\nHow do I track fieldwork completion?\nWhere do I see fieldwork status by auditor?\nThe Fieldwork module is where audit execution happens. As Audit Head, you can oversee all fieldwork activities, create and review work papers, upload evidence, document observations, and add findings from fieldwork.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Fieldwork**\nView all engagements with **title, department, status, dates, and assigned auditor**\nFilter engagements by **department, status, or auditor** to focus on specific areas\nClick into an engagement to view assigned fieldwork tasks and progress\nCreate **work papers** and document audit observations\n**Upload audit evidence** and supporting files gathered during fieldwork\n**Record interview notes** from audit interviews\n**Add findings** directly from fieldwork observations\nTrack **fieldwork completion status** across all engagements\nUse **pagination** to manage large numbers of engagements\nAs Audit Head, you can view and manage fieldwork for ALL engagements across all auditors\nAuditors see only their assigned engagements; you see everything\nFindings created here flow into the Findings and CAPA modules\nRegularly review fieldwork progress to ensure audits stay on schedule\nfieldwork\nwork papers\nevidence\nobservations\ninterview notes\ntesting\naudit execution\nfieldwork status	{-0.01479339599609375,0.052032470703125,0.03900146484375,-0.019775390625,-0.0574951171875,-0.0181427001953125,0.0265960693359375,-0.00873565673828125,0.006938934326171875,0.01123809814453125,0.0487060546875,-0.0045166015625,-0.0108184814453125,-0.043212890625,0.00730133056640625,-0.001822471618652344,-0.003263473510742188,-0.0168914794921875,-0.013038635253