cmn2wa6ls006hjc3o0cogydzu	ah-audit-findings	internal-audit	Findings	audit	{AuditHead}	How do I manage audit findings?	How do I manage audit findings?\nHow do I create an audit finding?\nHow do I classify finding severity?\nHow do I assign finding owners?\nHow do I track finding remediation?\nWhere do I see all audit findings?\nHow do I link findings to controls and risks?\nThe Findings module lets you document and manage audit findings identified during fieldwork. As Audit Head, you have full CRUD access to create, classify, assign, and track all findings across the audit function.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Findings** (via Fieldwork engagement details)\nView all audit findings with **severity and status** indicators\nClick **Create** to add a new finding — enter finding ID, title, description, severity, and recommendation\nClassify severity: **Critical, High, Medium, Low, or Informational**\n**Assign finding owners** responsible for remediation\nSet **remediation due dates** for each finding\nTrack finding status: **Open, In Progress, Closed, Overdue**\n**Link findings to controls and risks** for traceability\nEdit findings as remediation progresses or new information is gathered\nDelete findings if they are determined to be invalid\nAs Audit Head, you review and approve findings before they are finalized in reports\nFindings with Critical or High severity should be escalated promptly\nEach finding should include a clear recommendation for remediation\nFindings flow into CAPA tracking for corrective and preventive action management\nfindings\nseverity\ncritical\nhigh\nmedium\nlow\nremediation\nfinding owner\naudit finding\ngap	{0.001889228820800781,0.04693603515625,0.0911865234375,0.001431465148925781,-0.0250244140625,-0.018463134765625,-0.005420684814453125,-0.05572509765625,0.004241943359375,0.0171356201171875,0.054718017578125,-0.0251922607421875,-0.0279998779296875,-0.022735595703125,0.032470703125,-0.05120849609375,0.0225067138671875,0.010223388