cmn2wa6ml006jjc3oy864p276	ah-audit-reports	internal-audit	Reports	audit	{AuditHead}	How do I create and approve audit reports?	How do I create and approve audit reports?\nHow do I generate an audit report?\nHow do I finalize an audit report?\nHow do I approve a draft report?\nHow do I download an audit report as PDF?\nWhere do I manage audit reports?\nHow do I include findings in a report?\nWhat is the audit report lifecycle?\nThe Audit Reports module lets you generate, review, approve, and finalize audit reports. As Audit Head, you have full authority to manage the entire report lifecycle from draft to approval, including PDF generation and download.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Report**\nView all audit reports with their current **status** (Draft, Submitted, Approved)\nClick **Create** to generate a new report from engagement data\nEnter report details: **report code, title, executive summary, scope, objectives, methodology**\nInclude **observations and recommendations** from audit findings\nAdd **management response** and **auditee comments** sections\nWrite the **conclusion and overall result**\nReview the report using **report preview** before finalizing\nMove the report through statuses: **Draft → Submitted → Approved**\n**Approve** the final report as Audit Head\n**Generate PDF** and **download** the completed report\nUse **search and pagination** to manage all reports\nAs Audit Head, you are the only role that can give final approval on audit reports\nEnsure all findings, recommendations, and management responses are complete before approval\nApproved reports become the official record of the audit engagement\nReports can include auditee comments for a balanced perspective\naudit report\ngenerate\napprove\nfinalize\nPDF\ndraft\nsubmitted\nexecutive summary\nreport lifecycle	{-0.011505126953125,0.033966064453125,0.064697265625,-0.037506103515625,-0.06671142578125,-0.01100921630859375,-0.01540374755859375,-0.01152801513671875,0.0265045166015625,0.