cmn2wa6mz006kjc3osndtzbao	ah-audit-document-library	internal-audit	Document Library	audit	{AuditHead}	How do I use the Audit Document Library?	How do I use the Audit Document Library?\nWhere do I store audit documents?\nHow do I upload audit documents?\nWhere is the centralized audit document repository?\nHow do I manage audit files?\nHow do I organize audit documents?\nThe Document Library is a centralized audit document repository for uploading, organizing, and managing audit-related documents. As Audit Head, you have full access to manage the entire library.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Document Library**\nView all uploaded audit documents in the repository\n**Upload** new documents — audit procedures, templates, guidelines, reference materials\n**Organize** documents by category or type for easy retrieval\n**Manage** existing documents — edit metadata, replace files, or delete outdated documents\nUse this library to share standard templates and procedures with your audit team\nAs Audit Head, you manage the full document library — other audit roles may have limited access\nKeep the library organized to support efficient audit execution\nThis is separate from evidence files attached to specific engagements or findings\ndocument library\nupload\nrepository\nfiles\ndocuments\naudit documents\norganize	{-0.032867431640625,0.0158233642578125,0.0261077880859375,-0.0181732177734375,-0.0238189697265625,0.0004594326019287109,-0.03265380859375,-0.0213165283203125,-0.021453857421875,-0.01497650146484375,0.0323486328125,-0.03125,0.0136871337890625,-0.044708251953125,0.00909423828125,0.0175323486328125,0.032806396484375,0.0057373046875,-0.031524658203125,0.058685302734375,0.0528564453125,0.026885986328125,0.00295257568359375,-0.002170562744140625,0.0189971923828125,-0.037994384765625,-0.0284576416015625,-0.0092926025390625,-0.0171051025390625,-0.020965576171875,0.01189422607421875,-0.04083251953125,0.00926971435546875,0.018524169921875,-0.01047515869140625,0.0592