cmn2wa6nt006mjc3obc6il55q	ah-org-profile	organization	Profile	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view the Organization Profile as Audit Head?	How do I view the Organization Profile as Audit Head?\nCan I see the organization profile?\nWhere do I find organization details?\nHow do I view company information for audit context?\nWhat organization info is available to me?\nHow do I access the organization profile?\nAs Audit Head, you can view the Organization Profile to understand the organization's identity, structure, and context for audit planning. This is view-only access — you cannot edit organization details.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Organization → Profile**\nView organization details: **name, industry, size, location, contact information**\nReview **branches** (locations and addresses) to understand audit scope geography\nReview **data centers** (location type, address, vendor) for IT audit planning\nReview **cloud providers** (name, service type) for technology audit context\nNote the **regulatory jurisdiction** and compliance requirements for audit planning\nThis is **view-only** access — editing the organization profile requires Customer Administrator role\nUse this information to understand the organizational context when planning audits\nBranch and data center information is valuable for scoping IT and operational audits\norganization profile\ncompany info\nbranches\ndata centers\naudit context\nview only	{8.982419967651367e-05,0.0180511474609375,0.01392364501953125,0.01702880859375,-0.031463623046875,-0.004428863525390625,-0.026031494140625,0.00820159912109375,0.0047149658203125,0.0039215087890625,0.03900146484375,-0.039306640625,0.0721435546875,-0.037322998046875,-0.0058746337890625,0.00777435302734375,0.003932952880859375,0.0093841552734375,-0.0252685546875,0.071044921875,0.01611328125,0.034515380859375,-0.0061798095703125,0.027130126953125,0.0102081298828125,-0.0159454345703125,-0.056396484375,-0.001305580139160156,0.022491455078125,-0.001042366027832031,0.01153564