cmn2wa6o7006njc3o9e3imrkd	ah-org-context	organization	Context	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view Organization Context for audit planning?	How do I view Organization Context for audit planning?\nWhere do I see internal and external context?\nHow do I view stakeholders?\nWhere do I find context factors for audits?\nHow do I review organization context issues?\nCan I see stakeholder information?\nAs Audit Head, you can view the Organization Context to understand internal and external factors, stakeholders, and context issues that may affect audit planning. This is view-only access.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Organization → Context**\nReview **internal context factors** (culture, governance, capabilities)\nReview **external context factors** (regulatory, market, technology)\nView **stakeholders** and interested parties with their type and status\nReview **context issues** and their preventive/corrective actions\nUse this information to identify areas that may require audit attention\nThis is **view-only** access — you cannot create or edit context records\nContext factors help identify emerging risks that should be included in audit planning\nStakeholder information can inform audit communication and reporting plans\norganization context\ninternal context\nexternal context\nstakeholders\ncontext factors\naudit planning	{-0.0155792236328125,0.0002474784851074219,0.02984619140625,0.0140380859375,-0.044891357421875,-0.01262664794921875,-0.004695892333984375,0.005584716796875,-0.021148681640625,0.006244659423828125,0.04193115234375,-0.02777099609375,0.06488037109375,-0.050567626953125,0.027557373046875,-0.00637054443359375,0.001196861267089844,0.00823211669921875,-0.0203704833984375,0.0538330078125,0.039764404296875,0.01226043701171875,-0.006961822509765625,0.0239105224609375,0.005847930908203125,-0.0162811279296875,-0.024078369140625,0.0220947265625,-0.0076141357421875,0.0205078125,0.027618408203125,-0.0270538330078125,-0.003725051879882812,-0.0080413818359375,-0.0163116455078125