cmn2wa6uk006pjc3olm6weqyu	ah-org-processes	organization	Business Processes	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view Business Processes for audit planning?	How do I view Business Processes for audit planning?\nWhere do I see business processes?\nHow do I review processes for audit scoping?\nCan I see process criticality?\nWhere are business processes documented?\nHow do I view process details?\nAs Audit Head, you can view Business Processes to understand organizational operations for audit scoping and planning. View process details, criticality, owners, and BIA assessments. This is view-only access.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Organization → Process**\nView all business processes with **filtering and search** capabilities\nReview process details: **name, code, owner, department, description**\nCheck **process criticality** to prioritize audit coverage\nReview **BIA (Business Impact Analysis)** data per process for impact context\nNote process **KPI tracking** information for audit evaluation criteria\nIdentify processes linked to **risks and controls** for risk-based audit planning\nThis is **view-only** — creating or editing processes requires appropriate organizational roles\nCritical processes should receive higher audit priority in your annual plan\nProcess-risk-control linkages help identify areas with potential control gaps\nbusiness processes\nprocess list\ncriticality\nprocess owner\naudit scoping\nBIA	{-0.02817217074334621,0.05725381895899773,0.08432162553071976,0.008239439688622952,-0.04229073971509933,-0.03854455426335335,-0.02082055620849133,0.00293414993211627,-0.002273695543408394,0.009733582846820354,0.0394756868481636,-0.0108866710215807,0.01549361180514097,-0.03059744648635387,0.01666294038295746,0.005307996645569801,-0.02451260387897491,0.04077494144439697,-0.01657632365822792,0.01654384285211563,0.05820660665631294,0.01467075012624264,-0.03358573094010353,0.04164111241698265,0.004463480785489082,-0.03181008249521255,-0.01203975919634104,-0.01209389511495829,-0.0