cmn2wa6uz006qjc3og51iz9h2	ah-org-bia	organization	BIA	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view Business Impact Analysis as Audit Head?	How do I view Business Impact Analysis as Audit Head?\nWhere do I see BIA records?\nHow do I review RTO and RPO targets?\nCan I view impact ratings for processes?\nWhere is the business impact analysis?\nHow do I check process criticality from BIA?\nAs Audit Head, you can view BIA records to understand process criticality, RTO/RPO targets, and impact ratings. This information supports audit planning by identifying critical processes that need audit coverage.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Organization → Settings → BIA** or via Business Processes\nView BIA records with **impact ratings** (financial, operational, reputational, legal)\nReview **RTO (Recovery Time Objective)** targets for each process\nReview **RPO (Recovery Point Objective)** targets for data loss tolerance\nCheck **process criticality** determinations based on impact analysis\nUse BIA data to prioritize which processes need audit attention\nThis is **view-only** — editing BIA records requires organizational roles\nProcesses with high impact ratings and tight RTO/RPO should be prioritized for audit\nBIA data is essential for IT audit planning and business continuity assessments\nBIA\nbusiness impact analysis\nRTO\nRPO\nimpact ratings\ncriticality\nrecovery	{-0.01861174218356609,0.06733449548482895,0.07444696873426437,0.008457755669951439,-0.04955332353711128,-0.04000763967633247,-0.02090457640588284,0.005120860878378153,0.005828598514199257,-0.02648459002375603,0.03401819244027138,0.009475493803620338,-0.006714732851833105,-0.06761524826288223,-0.004764067474752665,0.009440399706363678,-0.01647098176181316,0.03376083448529243,-0.03984386473894119,0.04152840003371239,0.02919855900108814,0.02983025833964348,-0.02343137562274933,0.01223625522106886,0.02414496243000031,-0.03231026232242584,0.0008656624122522771,-0.01059851516038179,-0.01077398750931025,-0.03822952136397362,0.024495905265212