cmn2wa6vd006rjc3o5fdy1z8o	ah-org-settings	organization	Settings	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view Organization Settings as Audit Head?	How do I view Organization Settings as Audit Head?\nCan I see organization settings?\nWhere are BIA categories configured?\nHow do I view organization-level configuration?\nCan I view BIA methodology settings?\nWhere are BCP labels configured?\nAs Audit Head, you can view Organization Settings to understand how BIA categories, methodology, BCP labels, and translations are configured. This is view-only access for awareness of organizational configuration.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Organization → Settings**\nView **BIA Categories** — assessment categories with sort order and active status\nView **BIA Methodology** — the configured BIA assessment approach\nView **BCP Labels** — business continuity planning labels\nView **Translations** — organization-level translation settings\nThis is **view-only** — configuring organization settings requires Customer Administrator role\nUnderstanding BIA methodology helps when evaluating business continuity in audits\norganization settings\nBIA categories\nBIA methodology\nBCP labels\ntranslations\nconfiguration	{-0.01756753586232662,0.041322972625494,0.05620674043893814,0.006187898106873035,-0.06492605060338974,-0.03262709826231003,-0.01250471081584692,-0.00891268253326416,0.01168434508144855,-0.01367666106671095,0.03794775530695915,-0.01951297372579575,0.02193891070783138,-0.0309394896030426,0.01984111964702606,0.04148704558610916,-0.0137000996619463,0.002430332126095891,-0.00511849345639348,0.07772374898195267,0.05236274376511574,0.01617291569709778,-0.008772049099206924,0.05400347337126732,0.02458751946687698,-0.04195582494139671,-0.02568915300071239,0.007635256741195917,0.005352883599698544,-0.02629856765270233,0.03663516789674759,-0.01716907322406769,-0.008303268812596798,-0.02444688603281975,-0.01544630620628595,-0.001219560857862234,-0.006768013350665569,-0.02540788426995277,0.06286341696977615,-0.