cmn2wa6vs006sjc3o3kd5et60	ah-comp-frameworks	compliance	Frameworks	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view Compliance Frameworks as Audit Head?	How do I view Compliance Frameworks as Audit Head?\nCan I see compliance frameworks?\nWhere do I view adopted frameworks?\nHow do I check framework compliance percentage?\nHow do I review framework coverage for audit?\nWhat frameworks are available to me?\nAs Audit Head, you can view Compliance Frameworks to understand which frameworks are adopted, their compliance percentages, and coverage metrics. This view-only access supports compliance audit planning.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Frameworks**\nBrowse available compliance frameworks in **cards/grid view**\nReview framework details: **code, name, description, type, status, country, industry**\nCheck **compliance percentage, policy percentage, and evidence percentage** per framework\nIdentify frameworks with low compliance percentages that may need audit attention\nUse pagination to browse all available frameworks\nThis is **view-only** — adopting or modifying frameworks requires Compliance roles\nLow compliance or evidence percentages may indicate areas requiring audit focus\nFramework information is essential when planning compliance audits\ncompliance frameworks\nISO 27001\nNIST\nSOC 2\nGDPR\nframework compliance\naudit context	{-0.03700797259807587,0.02674230374395847,0.06060963869094849,-0.02578136324882507,0.00324903754517436,-0.01814070343971252,-0.02097665332257748,-0.02458604425191879,0.0495939664542675,0.02716418169438839,0.04617207497358322,-0.01723835617303848,0.01106254849582911,0.003609390696510673,0.04066424071788788,-0.02385947853326797,0.002362803323194385,-0.02505479753017426,0.04211737215518951,0.0642659068107605,0.03274232894182205,0.0298595055937767,-0.004710957873612642,0.0509064719080925,-0.001756355282850564,-0.04141424223780632,-0.04467206820845604,0.02125790528953075,-0.01246880460530519,-0.02234775386750698,0.01130278408527374,-0.02186728268861771