cmn2wa6w6006tjc3o6wrmjvf6	ah-comp-controls	compliance	Controls	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view Control Assessments as Audit Head?	How do I view Control Assessments as Audit Head?\nCan I see compliance controls?\nWhere do I review control effectiveness?\nHow do I check control compliance status?\nHow do I view controls for audit testing?\nWhere are control assessments?\nAs Audit Head, you can view Control Assessments to review control effectiveness, compliance status, and linkages to evidence and risks. This view-only access supports audit testing and control evaluation.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Controls**\nView all controls with **status indicators** (Compliant, Partially Compliant, Non-Compliant, Not Assessed)\nReview control details: **code, name, description, domain, category, status**\nFilter controls by **framework, domain, or status** to focus on specific areas\nIdentify **Non-Compliant or Not Assessed** controls that may need audit attention\nReview control-to-evidence linkages to verify evidence adequacy\nReview control-to-risk mappings for risk-based audit focus\nThis is **view-only** — assessing or modifying controls requires Compliance roles\nNon-compliant controls are prime candidates for audit findings\nUse control status to inform fieldwork testing priorities\ncontrols\ncontrol assessment\ncompliance controls\ncontrol effectiveness\ncompliant\nnon-compliant	{0.005547323729842901,0.03408519178628922,0.05853201821446419,0.01744029484689236,-0.04468271508812904,-0.007187834475189447,-0.00980797316879034,-0.03768788278102875,0.04026123136281967,0.04526756703853607,0.04575884342193604,-0.02099619805812836,0.05015693232417107,-0.02627156488597393,-0.0016551319276914,-0.04547811299562454,-0.009451213292777538,0.01410663686692715,0.03230724111199379,0.07654546946287155,0.03619065880775452,0.01453942805528641,0.01931182295084,0.003204990644007921,0.001652207691222429,-0.0553504191339016,-0.03682230040431023,0.002158104907721281,-0.001722389948554337,