cmn2wa6wl006ujc3oregy3ybx	ah-comp-governance	compliance	Governance	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view Governance Documents as Audit Head?	How do I view Governance Documents as Audit Head?\nCan I see policies and procedures?\nWhere do I review governance documents?\nHow do I check document review status?\nHow do I view policies for audit?\nWhere are governance documents?\nAs Audit Head, you can view Governance Documents including policies, procedures, standards, and guidelines. Review document status, version history, and review schedules for governance audit context.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Governance**\nView all governance documents with **version and status** information\nReview document details: **code, name, version, document type**\nCheck **review schedules and due dates** to identify overdue reviews\nReview **version history** for document change tracking\nCheck which documents are linked to **frameworks and controls**\nThis is **view-only** — creating or editing governance documents requires Compliance roles\nOverdue document reviews may be flagged as audit findings\nDocument version history supports audit trail verification\ngovernance documents\npolicies\nprocedures\nstandards\nguidelines\ndocument review\nversion history	{0.00965181551873684,0.04677043855190277,0.05673080682754517,-0.002555051585659385,-0.03066061995923519,0.006842341739684343,-0.03535931557416916,-0.02444621361792088,0.02574539370834827,0.002561818109825253,0.04304612427949905,-0.03302079439163208,0.01704089529812336,-0.02695796079933643,-0.001571194385178387,0.005954569671303034,-0.01166012976318598,0.02648159489035606,0.05010499432682991,0.07409650087356567,0.04157372191548347,0.06236058101058006,0.0114436000585556,0.05655758455395699,-0.000427984690759331,-8.597755368100479e-05,-0.007183376234024763,0.0367451086640358,0.01958511956036091,-0.01706254854798317,0.0001135935599450022,-0.02193446829915047,0.008038668893277645,0.008303917944431305,-0.01352228596806526,0.008341810666