cmn2wa6x0006vjc3ou1e8o8ee	ah-comp-evidence	compliance	Evidence	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view Evidence Management as Audit Head?	How do I view Evidence Management as Audit Head?\nCan I see compliance evidence?\nWhere do I review evidence items?\nHow do I check evidence collection status?\nHow do I view evidence for audit?\nWhere are evidence records?\nAs Audit Head, you can view Evidence Management to review evidence items, their collection status, and linkages to controls. This view-only access helps assess compliance evidence adequacy during audits.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Evidence**\nView evidence items with **status and due dates**\nCheck evidence status: **Pending, Submitted, Approved, Rejected**\nReview evidence linked to specific **controls and frameworks**\nIdentify evidence gaps where items are **Pending or Rejected**\nFilter by **status, assignee, or control** to focus on specific areas\nThis is **view-only** — creating or approving evidence requires Compliance roles\nMissing or rejected evidence may indicate compliance gaps worth auditing\nEvidence adequacy is a key factor in compliance audit assessments\nevidence\nevidence management\nevidence collection\nevidence status\ncompliance evidence	{0.03448696061968803,0.0437266044318676,0.05890271440148354,-0.001092154532670975,-0.07109904289245605,0.02174780704081059,-0.005647731013596058,0.001102982205338776,0.003692969214171171,0.02644847333431244,0.06624823063611984,-0.01266985852271318,0.03894509002566338,-0.002797879045829177,0.001668910263106227,-0.01135898474603891,0.02008467167615891,0.006438875105232,0.002887387992814183,0.06647922098636627,0.03187676519155502,0.02774202451109886,0.0256631039083004,0.01864097639918327,0.006802686024457216,-0.04622130841016769,-0.04051582887768745,0.00764580350369215,0.006213658954948187,-0.03684306889772415,0.03439456596970558,-0.02441575191915035,0.02497013099491596,0.0429181344807148,-0.01074108295142651,0.01651585847139359,-0.02203654497861862,-0.0349