cmn2wabe400b8jc3ohzx12mam	tca-factory-user-management	tprm	User Management	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage Factory users as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I manage Factory users as a TPRM Administrator?\nFactory Administrator user management\nHow to assign FactoryAdmin or FactoryAssessor roles?\nWhere to manage factory team members?\nHow to set up Assessment Factory users?\nFactory team user administration\nThe Factory User Management page allows administration of Assessment Factory team members, including assigning FactoryAdmin and FactoryAssessor roles. As Customer Administrator, you have full access.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Factory → User Management**\nView existing factory team users\nManage factory team members and their assignments\nAssign **FactoryAdmin** or **FactoryAssessor** roles to users\nAs Customer Administrator, you can set up the Assessment Factory team for batch assessment operations\nFactoryAdmin users can manage factory settings and initiate batch assessments\nFactoryAssessor users can process assessments created through the factory\nfactory user management\nfactory admin\nfactory assessor\nfactory team\nrole assignment	{-0.0216217041015625,0.0413818359375,0.04754638671875,-0.01605224609375,-0.0125885009765625,-0.02923583984375,-0.001329421997070312,0.0060272216796875,0.0276336669921875,0.006855010986328125,0.022918701171875,-0.01218414306640625,0.0160675048828125,-0.0219879150390625,0.019561767578125,-0.0075531005859375,-0.028472900390625,-0.00862884521484375,-0.0235748291015625,0.09039306640625,0.03790283203125,0.01873779296875,-0.029541015625,-0.01556396484375,-0.002988815307617188,-0.0224456787109375,0.00891876220703125,0.0496826171875,-0.0655517578125,-0.0322265625,0.019439697265625,-0.031494140625,-0.047149658203125,0.03948974609375,0.050506591796875,-0.019287109375,0.0114593505859375,0.039031982421875,0.0171661376953125,0.04071044921875,-0.030914306640625,0.0081329345703125,-0.0283660888671875,0.0294952392578125,-0.021514