cmn2wa6xe006wjc3o1bjz5j1t	ah-comp-exceptions	compliance	Exceptions	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view Compliance Exceptions as Audit Head?	How do I view Compliance Exceptions as Audit Head?\nCan I see compliance exceptions?\nWhere do I review exception requests?\nHow do I check exception status?\nHow do I view risk acceptances?\nWhere are compensating controls documented?\nAs Audit Head, you can view Compliance Exceptions to understand where controls cannot be fully implemented and risk acceptances or compensating controls are applied. This is view-only access for audit context.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Exceptions**\nView all exceptions with **status indicators**\nReview exception details: **code, description, severity, status**\nCheck **compensating controls** specified for each exception\nReview **expiry/target remediation dates** to identify long-standing exceptions\nCheck **approval status** (open, in-progress, closed)\nIdentify high-severity exceptions that may require audit scrutiny\nThis is **view-only** — managing exceptions requires Compliance roles\nLong-standing or high-severity exceptions are common audit findings\nReview compensating controls to ensure they adequately mitigate the risk\nexceptions\ncompliance exceptions\nrisk acceptance\ncompensating controls\nexception status	{-0.009570201858878136,0.0525590255856514,0.05720774829387665,0.0160214900970459,-0.0413404256105423,0.01115930546075106,-0.03669170290231705,-0.03628849610686302,0.06631544977426529,0.008325007744133472,0.02172566205263138,-0.04271606728434563,0.05137312784790993,0.003700003493577242,0.004832536913454533,-0.01968591660261154,0.01823912002146244,0.02782118134200573,0.01936572417616844,0.09074495732784271,0.03088079951703548,0.04402055591344833,0.00839616172015667,0.04418658092617989,-0.01646027155220509,-0.01502533536404371,-0.02305386774241924,0.03545836731791496,0.0226032268255949,-0.009012829512357712,0.003317551221698523,-0.01852373592555523,0.003305692225694656,0.0277