cmn2wa6xt006xjc3o30xvs417	ah-comp-kpis	compliance	KPIs	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view Compliance KPIs as Audit Head?	How do I view Compliance KPIs as Audit Head?\nCan I see compliance KPIs?\nWhere do I review compliance metrics?\nHow do I check KPI performance?\nHow do I view compliance health indicators?\nWhere are compliance KPIs tracked?\nAs Audit Head, you can view Compliance KPIs to monitor compliance program health through measurable metrics with targets and thresholds. This view-only access informs audit risk assessment.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → KPIs**\nView compliance KPIs with **current values and targets**\nReview KPI details: **code, objective, description, expected score, actual score**\nCheck KPI status: **Scheduled, Missed, Overdue, Achieved**\nFilter by **status and department** to identify underperforming areas\nUse KPI data to inform audit planning — missed or overdue KPIs may indicate compliance issues\nThis is **view-only** — managing KPIs requires Compliance roles\nMissed or overdue KPIs are indicators of potential compliance weaknesses\nKPI trends can help prioritize audit focus areas\nKPIs\ncompliance KPIs\nmetrics\nperformance\ncompliance health\ntargets	{-0.0008894158527255058,0.05264629051089287,0.05169599503278732,-0.01312593650072813,-0.0115995267406106,0.004142688121646643,-0.04178918153047562,-0.02929281443357468,0.0670432448387146,0.01046511344611645,0.05046061426401138,-0.005375100765377283,0.02580048330128193,-0.02810494601726532,0.01975423842668533,-0.04176542535424232,-0.007744896691292524,-0.002326735528185964,0.01419501751661301,0.0815352275967598,0.02594302780926228,0.04989043623209,0.008528889156877995,0.01785364933311939,-0.01567985117435455,0.003801176324486732,-0.02286645025014877,-0.01196776609867811,0.005499826744198799,0.006681755185127258,0.005523584317415953,-0.005737400148063898,-0.01705777831375599,-0.004421837162226439,0.04499642178416252,0.01918406039476395,-0.02919778414070606,0.01495525240898132,0.01804