cmn2wa73w006yjc3o2wrq5ty9	ah-comp-risk-matrix	compliance	Risk Matrix	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view the Compliance Risk Matrix as Audit Head?	How do I view the Compliance Risk Matrix as Audit Head?\nCan I see the risk-control matrix?\nWhere do I review risk-control mappings?\nHow do I identify unmitigated risks?\nHow do I check control coverage?\nWhere is the compliance risk matrix?\nAs Audit Head, you can view the Compliance Risk Matrix to see risk-control mappings, identify unmitigated risks, and assess control coverage gaps. This view-only access is valuable for risk-based audit planning.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Risk Matrix**\nView the **matrix of risks vs controls**\nIdentify **unmitigated risks** (gaps) — risks without adequate control coverage\nReview **control effectiveness** per risk\nCheck **status indicators** (compliant, non-compliant, partial compliant, not applicable)\nUse **collapsible risk groups** to navigate large matrices\nUse this information to identify control gaps that should be audited\nThis is **view-only** — modifying risk-control links requires Compliance roles\nUnmitigated risks and control gaps are prime targets for audit engagements\nThis matrix provides a clear picture of the organization's control environment\nrisk matrix\nrisk-control mapping\nunmitigated risks\ncontrol coverage\ngaps	{0.00986480712890625,0.082763671875,0.06341552734375,0.020965576171875,-0.046295166015625,-0.003826141357421875,-0.01497650146484375,-0.0252685546875,0.0452880859375,0.02423095703125,0.0166473388671875,-0.012908935546875,0.0408935546875,0.00616455078125,0.01125335693359375,-0.053802490234375,0.005756378173828125,-0.0193634033203125,0.00444793701171875,0.06317138671875,0.03692626953125,0.041748046875,-0.0001596212387084961,0.03717041015625,-0.00191497802734375,-0.002077102661132812,-0.0232391357421875,-0.01433563232421875,0.0158538818359375,0.032684326171875,0.00975799560546875,-0.00943756103515625,0.02862548828125,-0.007686614990234375,0.005