cmn2wa7540071jc3orn0iyip2	ah-risk-dashboard	risk-management	Dashboard	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view the Risk Dashboard as Audit Head?	How do I view the Risk Dashboard as Audit Head?\nCan I see risk statistics?\nWhere do I view risk analytics?\nHow do I check risk by category?\nHow do I review risk metrics for audit planning?\nWhere is the risk dashboard?\nAs Audit Head, you can view the Risk Dashboard to see summary statistics, risk breakdowns by status, strategy, rating, and category. This view-only access supports risk-based audit planning.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Dashboard**\nReview **summary metrics** — total risks and status breakdown\nCheck the **Risk by Status** chart for open/in-progress/completed distribution\nReview **Risk by Strategy** (Mitigate, Accept, Transfer, Avoid) for treatment approach overview\nCheck **Risk by Rating** chart to identify concentration of high/extreme risks\nReview **Risk by Category** chart for strategic, operational, financial, compliance, and technology risk distribution\nUse these insights to prioritize audit planning around high-risk areas\nThis is **view-only** — managing risks requires Risk Management roles\nHigh concentrations of extreme or high-rated risks should inform your annual audit plan\nRisk strategy distribution helps identify areas where accepted risks may need audit review\nrisk dashboard\nrisk statistics\nrisk analytics\nrisk by category\nrisk by rating\nrisk by strategy	{0.01062774658203125,0.040069580078125,0.054962158203125,0.00865936279296875,-0.03692626953125,-0.00510406494140625,-0.053924560546875,0.003164291381835938,0.042449951171875,0.0207061767578125,0.005817413330078125,-0.002323150634765625,0.0369873046875,-0.001544952392578125,0.016632080078125,-0.04248046875,-0.02227783203125,0.032562255859375,-0.008209228515625,0.062286376953125,0.011016845703125,0.024322509765625,0.025543212890625,0.0207977294921875,-0.0267181396484375,0.028076171875,-0.0003278255462646484,-0.036529541015625,0.