cmn2wa75h0072jc3ojxl8ny1q	ah-risk-register	risk-management	Risk Register	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view the Risk Register as Audit Head?	How do I view the Risk Register as Audit Head?\nCan I see all organizational risks?\nWhere do I review the risk register?\nHow do I check risk ratings and owners?\nHow do I view risks for audit context?\nWhere is the organizational risk register?\nAs Audit Head, you can view the organizational Risk Register to see all identified risks with their inherent and residual ratings, owners, treatment status, and control linkages. This view-only access provides essential context for risk-based audit planning.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Risk Register**\nView all risks with **severity indicators and status**\nReview risk details: **name, description, risk sources, category, type**\nCheck **inherent risk rating** (likelihood x impact) and **residual risk rating**\nReview **risk owners** and their department assignments\nCheck risk **status** (open, in-progress, completed) and **strategy** (mitigate, accept, transfer, avoid)\nUse **search, filter, and pagination** to navigate the risk inventory\nIdentify high-rated risks that should be covered in audit engagements\nThis is **view-only** — creating or modifying risks requires Risk Management roles\nThis is the organization-wide risk register, separate from your Audit Risk Register\nRisks with high inherent ratings but low residual ratings suggest strong controls — verify through audit\nRisks with 'Accept' strategy should be reviewed to ensure acceptance is still appropriate\nrisk register\norganizational risks\nrisk ratings\nrisk owners\ninherent risk\nresidual risk	{0.00829315185546875,0.07220458984375,0.058258056640625,0.01044464111328125,-0.04229736328125,-0.0069580078125,-0.0120086669921875,-0.0197296142578125,0.004810333251953125,0.02996826171875,0.0180511474609375,-0.00823974609375,0.046142578125,-0.0269012451171875,-0.00919342041015625,-0.046630859375,0.0146331787109375,0.