cmn2wa75u0073jc3o18wzlmr6	ah-risk-assessment	risk-management	Risk Assessment	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view Risk Assessments as Audit Head?	How do I view Risk Assessments as Audit Head?\nCan I see risk assessment results?\nWhere do I view risk heatmaps?\nHow do I review inherent vs residual risk?\nHow do I check risk assessment status?\nWhere are risk assessments?\nAs Audit Head, you can view Risk Assessments to review likelihood/impact evaluations, risk heatmaps, and assessment status. This view-only access supports understanding the organization's risk posture for audit planning.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Risk Assessment**\nView the **risk assessment matrix** (5x5 likelihood vs impact)\nReview **inherent risk assessments** before controls\nReview **residual risk assessments** after controls are applied\nCheck the **risk heatmap visualization** for risk concentration\nReview **assessment status** (draft, submitted, approved, rejected, in-progress)\nCompare inherent vs residual risk levels to evaluate control effectiveness\nThis is **view-only** — performing or modifying assessments requires Risk Management roles\nLarge gaps between inherent and residual risk suggest strong control reliance — verify through audit\nRisks in 'draft' or 'rejected' status may indicate incomplete risk management processes\nrisk assessment\nlikelihood\nimpact\nheatmap\ninherent risk\nresidual risk\nrisk matrix	{-0.0091400146484375,0.0521240234375,0.061767578125,0.0215301513671875,-0.052734375,-0.0263214111328125,-0.037689208984375,-0.034027099609375,0.0411376953125,0.024871826171875,0.01068115234375,-0.0074005126953125,0.041259765625,-0.01134490966796875,-0.005924224853515625,-0.0360107421875,-0.00942230224609375,0.023468017578125,-0.01397705078125,0.05462646484375,0.0238800048828125,0.01323699951171875,0.01543426513671875,0.0224151611328125,-0.0223846435546875,-0.0093994140625,-0.0322265625,-0.038116455078125,-0.001708984375,0.00783538818359375,0.00501251220703125,-0.0334