cmn2wa7670074jc3on56m6ai7	ah-risk-response	risk-management	Risk Response	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view Risk Responses as Audit Head?	How do I view Risk Responses as Audit Head?\nCan I see risk treatment plans?\nWhere do I review risk mitigation actions?\nHow do I check risk response status?\nHow do I view risk treatment progress?\nWhere are risk responses tracked?\nAs Audit Head, you can view Risk Responses to review treatment strategies, action plans, and implementation progress. This view-only access helps assess whether risks are being adequately addressed.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Risk Response**\nView risks requiring **response/treatment**\nReview the **response strategy** for each risk (Mitigate, Accept, Transfer, Avoid)\nCheck **treatment action plans** with assigned owners and due dates\nReview **action implementation status** (open, in-progress, completed)\nMonitor **response progress** across the risk inventory\nThis is **view-only** — defining or modifying risk responses requires Risk Management roles\nOverdue treatment actions may be flagged as audit findings\nVerify that risk response strategies are actually being implemented through fieldwork\nrisk response\nrisk treatment\nmitigation\naction plans\nresponse strategy\ntreatment status	{-0.02362060546875,0.056732177734375,0.064208984375,0.009185791015625,-0.06439208984375,-0.031402587890625,-0.0291290283203125,0.0231170654296875,0.048614501953125,0.002710342407226562,0.0227203369140625,-0.00817108154296875,0.037689208984375,-0.023040771484375,-0.0264739990234375,-0.06048583984375,0.01021575927734375,0.0196533203125,-0.0237274169921875,0.07403564453125,0.019500732421875,0.0222320556640625,0.017822265625,-0.004974365234375,-0.0233917236328125,0.024658203125,-0.01418304443359375,-0.00946807861328125,-0.0157318115234375,-0.005413055419921875,0.031951904296875,-0.0238494873046875,0.0087432861328125,0.0281524658203125,0.0251007080078125,-0.0222320556640625,-0.0205841064453125,-0.015251159667