cmn2wa76k0075jc3oa26ipuxq	ah-risk-control-matrix	risk-management	Risk Control Matrix	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view the Risk Control Matrix as Audit Head?	How do I view the Risk Control Matrix as Audit Head?\nCan I see risk-control mappings?\nWhere do I review control coverage for risks?\nHow do I identify unmitigated risks?\nHow do I view the risk-control matrix?\nWhere is the risk control matrix?\nAs Audit Head, you can view the Risk Control Matrix to see how risks map to controls, identify coverage gaps, and assess control effectiveness. This view-only access is critical for risk-based audit planning.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Risk Control Matrix**\nView the **matrix of risks vs controls**\nIdentify **unmitigated risks** — risks without adequate control coverage\nReview **control effectiveness** per risk-control linkage\nCheck **residual risk calculations** after controls\nUse **status indicators** for each control-risk link to assess compliance\nUse **collapsible risk groups** and **search/filter** to navigate the matrix\nThis is **view-only** — modifying risk-control links requires Risk Management roles\nUnmitigated risks are high-priority areas for audit engagement coverage\nThe risk control matrix provides a comprehensive view of the control environment from a risk perspective\nrisk control matrix\nrisk-control mapping\ncontrol coverage\nunmitigated risks\ncontrol gaps	{0.00023651123046875,0.07879638671875,0.04425048828125,0.022216796875,-0.05804443359375,-0.0160369873046875,-0.0219879150390625,-0.01291656494140625,0.024322509765625,0.0240936279296875,0.003820419311523438,-0.0217437744140625,0.0333251953125,0.005588531494140625,0.012054443359375,-0.0577392578125,-0.00733184814453125,-0.00916290283203125,-0.00914764404296875,0.06439208984375,0.0305633544921875,0.02593994140625,0.010772705078125,0.03472900390625,-0.01200103759765625,0.001719474792480469,-0.001385688781738281,-0.027923583984375,0.0006666183471679688,0.04095458984375,0.02252197265