cmn2wa76y0076jc3ohq1hzk8i	ah-risk-settings	risk-management	Settings	grc	{AuditHead}	How do I view Risk Settings as Audit Head?	How do I view Risk Settings as Audit Head?\nCan I see risk categories?\nWhere do I view risk configuration?\nHow do I check risk rating matrix settings?\nWhere are risk thresholds configured?\nAs Audit Head, you can view Risk Settings to understand how risk categories, types, rating matrices, and thresholds are configured. This view-only access provides context for interpreting risk data during audits.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Settings**\nView **Risk Categories** — how risks are classified (Strategic, Operational, etc.)\nView **Risk Types** — risk type definitions used across the organization\nReview the **Risk Rating Matrix** — how likelihood and impact combine to determine risk level\nView **Threshold Configuration** — boundaries between risk levels\nThis is **view-only** — configuring risk settings requires Risk Management roles\nUnderstanding risk rating methodology helps when evaluating risk assessments during audits\nThreshold settings determine what constitutes Critical, High, Medium, and Low risk levels\nrisk settings\nrisk categories\nrisk types\nrisk rating matrix\nthresholds	{-0.026702880859375,0.046539306640625,0.0325927734375,-0.004802703857421875,-0.0439453125,-0.013336181640625,-0.0201873779296875,-0.0109100341796875,0.032501220703125,0.0174102783203125,-0.0084686279296875,-0.00385284423828125,0.035491943359375,0.005611419677734375,0.03741455078125,-0.0186004638671875,-0.017425537109375,0.041015625,-0.001639366149902344,0.09063720703125,0.041412353515625,0.024383544921875,0.01470947265625,0.03179931640625,-0.001972198486328125,-0.00591278076171875,0.01525115966796875,-0.02703857421875,-0.006725311279296875,0.0248565673828125,0.001896858215332031,-0.02093505859375,0.0241241455078125,0.0006418228149414062,-0.002666473388671875,-0.012237548828125,-0.01001739501953125,0.003833770751953125,0.034088134765625,0.0267