cmn2wa7db0078jc3oj6t6co96	ah-no-access	general	Roles & Access	both	{AuditHead}	What modules are NOT accessible to the Audit Head?	What modules are NOT accessible to the Audit Head?\nWhat can't I access as Audit Head?\nWhy don't I see Asset Management?\nWhy can't I access GRC Administration?\nWhat is restricted for the Audit Head role?\nWhy can't I access certain pages?\nWhat modules are hidden for Audit Head?\nAs Audit Head, you do not have access to Asset Management or GRC Administration modules. Your access covers Internal Audit (full CRUD), and Organization, Compliance, and Risk Management (view-only).\nYour sidebar shows **Internal Audit** (full access), **Organization**, **Compliance**, and **Risk Management** (view-only)\n**Asset Management** (inventory, classification) is not accessible — managed by asset management roles\n**GRC Administration** (customer accounts, email, configuration) is not accessible — managed by GRC Administrator\nOrganization, Compliance, and Risk Management are **view-only** — you can browse but not create, edit, or delete records in these modules\nIf you need to make changes in view-only modules, contact the appropriate module owner or administrator\nThis is by design — the Audit Head role focuses on the Internal Audit function\nView-only access to Organization, Compliance, and Risk provides context for audit planning without creating conflicts of interest\nMenu items are hidden based on your permissions; restricted pages cannot be accessed even by URL\nPermissions are enforced at both the UI level and API level for security\nno access\nrestricted\nunavailable\nasset management\nadministration\nhidden\nnot accessible	{-0.01141357421875,0.07159423828125,0.0733642578125,0.01136016845703125,-0.006832122802734375,-0.001175880432128906,-0.052886962890625,-0.01522064208984375,0.026519775390625,-0.031402587890625,0.043365478515625,-0.017578125,0.00662994384765625,0.01386260986328125,-0.020111083984375,-0.0196685791015625,-0.020294189453125,-