cmn2wa7do0079jc3oo3o7c260	am-role-overview	general	Roles	audit	{AuditManager}	What can I do as an Audit Manager?	What can I do as an Audit Manager?\nWhat is the Audit Manager role?\nWhat are my permissions as Audit Manager?\nWhat modules can I access as Audit Manager?\nAudit Manager capabilities\nWhat is available to the Audit Manager?\nWhat does an Audit Manager do in this system?\nAudit Manager role overview\nThe Audit Manager manages audit engagements, assigns work to auditors, reviews fieldwork, oversees finding resolution, and generates audit reports. You have full access to Internal Audit and view-only access to Compliance and Risk Management.\n**Internal Audit** — Full access: create/manage engagements, assign fieldwork, review work papers, create/manage findings, track CAPA, generate reports\n**Compliance** — View-only: browse frameworks, controls, governance documents, evidence, exceptions, KPIs, risk matrix, and reports for audit context\n**Risk Management** — View-only: view risk dashboard, register, assessments, responses, risk control matrix, and reports for audit planning context\n**Key management capabilities**: assign auditors, review and approve work papers, manage auditor schedules, escalate overdue CAPA items\nUnlike Audit Head, you do **NOT** have access to Audit Settings or Audit Universe/Risk Universe configuration\nCompliance and Risk Management are view-only — you cannot create, edit, or delete records in those modules\nYou do not have access to Organization, Asset Management, or GRC Administration modules\nPermissions are enforced at both the UI level and API level\naudit manager\nrole\npermissions\ncapabilities\naccess\noverview\nmodules	{-0.0122528076171875,0.06597900390625,0.0243682861328125,-0.004650115966796875,-0.046875,0.00505828857421875,-0.0160369873046875,-0.0283203125,0.0167694091796875,0.0001778602600097656,0.0220947265625,-0.04327392578125,-0.0128021240234375,-0.00611114501953125,-0.00890350341796875,-0.001654624938964844,-0.024