cmn2wa7ef007bjc3o11otavkp	am-audit-dashboard	internal-audit	Dashboard	audit	{AuditManager}	How do I use the Audit Dashboard as Audit Manager?	How do I use the Audit Dashboard as Audit Manager?\nWhere is the audit dashboard?\nHow do I see audit statistics?\nWhere can I view CAPA status by department?\nHow do I check the annual audit plan calendar?\nWhere is the auditor schedule?\nHow do I see risk statistics in audit?\nAudit Manager dashboard overview\nThe Audit Dashboard provides an overview of your audit function with risk statistics, audit statistics, CAPA status by department, annual audit plan calendar, and auditor schedule visualization.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Dashboard**\nReview **risk statistics**: total risks, extreme, high, medium, low counts\nCheck **audit statistics**: ongoing, completed, and planned audits\nView **CAPA status by department** showing open/closed breakdown\nUse the **annual audit plan calendar** to see planned and in-progress engagements\nCheck the **auditor schedule visualization** to manage team workload and assignments\nUse department-wise audit metrics to identify areas needing attention\nDashboard data refreshes in real-time as engagements and CAPAs are updated\nUse CAPA status charts to identify departments with overdue corrective actions for escalation\nThe auditor schedule helps you avoid overloading team members when assigning new fieldwork\naudit dashboard\nstatistics\nCAPA\ncalendar\nauditor schedule\nrisk statistics\noverview\nmetrics	{-0.01446533203125,0.038177490234375,0.037567138671875,-0.01522064208984375,-0.05072021484375,0.02618408203125,-0.0406494140625,-0.033050537109375,0.0338134765625,0.0218658447265625,0.01067352294921875,-0.03857421875,0.03009033203125,0.0008192062377929688,0.030853271484375,-0.004734039306640625,-0.02142333984375,0.01910400390625,-0.0369873046875,0.04913330078125,0.03668212890625,0.046142578125,0.01617431640625,0.02923583984375,-0.0411376953125,-0.00923919677734375,-0.01628112792