cmn2wa7es007cjc3oizp95dt0	am-audit-universe	internal-audit	Audit Universe	audit	{AuditManager}	How do I view the Audit Universe as Audit Manager?	How do I view the Audit Universe as Audit Manager?\nWhere do I see auditable entities?\nHow do I browse the audit universe?\nWhere are departments and audit scopes listed?\nCan I see the audit universe?\nHow do I review audit scope?\nWhere is the audit universe page?\nThe Audit Universe shows the complete set of auditable entities, processes, and departments. As Audit Manager, you can view this data to understand audit scope, but configuration is managed by the Audit Head.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Audit Universe**\nView the **department-based audit scope** listing\nReview departments with their **associated audits**\nCheck **audit metrics**: planned hours vs actual hours per audit\nView **status tracking** per audit engagement\nReview **timeline** (start/end dates) for each audit\nUse **search** to find specific departments or audits\nYou can **view** the Audit Universe but **cannot configure** it — configuration is managed by the Audit Head\nUse this page to understand the overall audit scope when planning new engagements\nPlanned vs actual hours comparison helps identify under- or over-estimated audits\naudit universe\nauditable entities\ndepartments\nscope\nplanned hours\nactual hours	{-0.031005859375,0.017181396484375,0.03955078125,-0.0268096923828125,-0.0533447265625,-0.001173019409179688,-0.022857666015625,-0.00872802734375,0.0161590576171875,0.03277587890625,0.01375579833984375,-0.062286376953125,0.00618743896484375,-0.00542449951171875,0.0253448486328125,0.022735595703125,-0.046417236328125,0.014495849609375,-0.0232391357421875,0.035430908203125,0.070556640625,0.0189056396484375,0.0246429443359375,0.03668212890625,-0.0195159912109375,-0.053497314453125,-0.06707763671875,0.030181884765625,0.001246452331542969,0.0131988525390625,0.02606201171875,-0.0264434814453125,0.0156707763671875,0.05062866210937