cmn2wa7f5007djc3ocbu5nfw3	am-audit-risk-identification	internal-audit	Risk Identification	audit	{AuditManager}	How do I use Risk Identification as Audit Manager?	How do I use Risk Identification as Audit Manager?\nWhere do I identify risks for audit?\nHow do I document audit risks?\nHow do I create risk entries for audit planning?\nWhere is risk identification?\nHow do I link risks to audits?\nCan I create audit risks?\nRisk Identification lets you identify and document risks for audit planning purposes using structured risk entry forms and assessment methodology.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Risk Identification**\nView existing identified risks relevant to audit planning\nUse **structured risk entry forms** to document new risks\nApply the **assessment methodology** to evaluate risk significance\n**Create, edit, and view** risk entries as needed\n**Link risks to audit planning** to inform engagement scope and priorities\nRisks identified here feed into audit planning and help prioritize engagements\nUse this in conjunction with the Risk Management module (view-only) for a comprehensive risk picture\nRisk Universe configuration is managed by the Audit Head\nrisk identification\naudit risks\nrisk entry\nassessment methodology\nrisk documentation	{0.0008177757263183594,0.03387451171875,0.0570068359375,-0.0001212358474731445,-0.056610107421875,-0.0438232421875,-0.026702880859375,0.001409530639648438,0.0002503395080566406,0.0219879150390625,-0.0295562744140625,-0.007099151611328125,0.03485107421875,-0.027069091796875,0.01523590087890625,-0.028778076171875,-0.0283355712890625,0.050994873046875,-0.035919189453125,0.036041259765625,0.048492431640625,0.037567138671875,0.005279541015625,0.005519866943359375,0.0282440185546875,-0.0283660888671875,-0.015716552734375,-0.02911376953125,0.004375457763671875,-0.01318359375,0.0633544921875,-0.0230560302734375,0.01320648193359375,0.02105712890625,0.01494598388671875,0.0162200927734375,-0.0141448974609375,-0.052947998046