cmn2wa7fi007ejc3odop7pvm3	am-audit-risk-register	internal-audit	Risk Register	audit	{AuditManager}	How do I manage the Audit Risk Register as Audit Manager?	How do I manage the Audit Risk Register as Audit Manager?\nWhere is the audit risk register?\nHow do I create audit risks?\nCan I use AI to recommend risks?\nHow do I assess audit risk probability and impact?\nWhere do I manage audit-specific risks?\nHow do I add risks to the audit risk register?\nThe Audit Risk Register is the risk inventory specific to the audit function. You can create risks manually or use AI-recommended risks, assess probability and impact, and manage the full risk lifecycle.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Risk Register**\nView the list of audit risks with **risk ID, name, likelihood, and impact**\nClick **Create** to add a new risk manually\nAlternatively, use **AI Recommendations** to generate suggested risks\nSet **probability and impact** assessment for each risk\nAssign **audit category and type** to classify the risk\nUse **search and pagination** to find specific risks\n**Edit or delete** risks as needed\nAI-recommended risks are suggestions — review and customize before adopting\nRisks in this register are specific to the audit function and separate from the enterprise Risk Management register\nLink audit risks to engagements during audit planning for risk-based auditing\naudit risk register\nrisk inventory\nAI recommendations\nprobability\nimpact\nrisk creation\naudit risks	{-0.001863479614257812,0.0382080078125,0.062744140625,-0.0266265869140625,-0.039093017578125,-0.0193939208984375,0.0233917236328125,-0.01392364501953125,0.0162200927734375,0.050079345703125,-0.024169921875,-0.001474380493164062,0.0142059326171875,-0.001746177673339844,0.0005698204040527344,-0.053070068359375,-0.01007843017578125,0.053436279296875,0.0024261474609375,0.046112060546875,0.00695037841796875,0.053131103515625,0.00955963134765625,0.0035247802734375,-0.01532745361328125,0.0203399658203125,-0.