cmn2wa7g5007gjc3otnm9lb5b	am-audit-fieldwork	internal-audit	Fieldwork	audit	{AuditManager}	How do I manage fieldwork as Audit Manager?	How do I manage fieldwork as Audit Manager?\nHow do I assign fieldwork to auditors?\nWhere do I review work papers?\nHow do I track fieldwork progress?\nHow do I upload audit evidence?\nWhere is the fieldwork page?\nHow do I review auditor work?\nHow do I manage audit testing?\nHow do I approve work papers?\nFieldwork is where audit testing is executed. As Audit Manager, you can assign work to auditors, review and approve work papers, upload evidence, document observations, and track completion status across all engagements.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Fieldwork**\nView the list of engagements with **title, department, status, dates, and assigned auditor**\nClick an engagement to view its **fieldwork details**\n**Assign fieldwork tasks** to auditors for specific testing areas\n**Review work papers** submitted by auditors and approve or request revisions\n**Create work papers** and document audit observations\n**Upload audit evidence** and supporting files\n**Record interview notes** from audit interviews\nTrack **fieldwork completion status** across all engagements\n**Add findings** directly from fieldwork observations\n**Filter** by department, status, or auditor to focus on specific areas\nReviewing and approving work papers is a key Audit Manager responsibility\nEnsure auditors upload sufficient evidence to support their conclusions\nFindings created from fieldwork are automatically linked to the engagement\nUse filters to monitor progress across multiple concurrent audits\nfieldwork\nwork papers\naudit evidence\ntesting\nobservations\nassign\nreview\napprove	{0.0008335113525390625,0.057647705078125,0.036529541015625,-0.0310821533203125,-0.062744140625,-0.00789642333984375,0.031768798828125,-0.01194000244140625,-0.001283645629882812,0.03704833984375,0.055389404296875,0.001312255859375,0.00399017333984375,-0.024581909