cmn2wa7o5007ljc3o7vevnl6c	am-comp-frameworks	compliance	Framework Selection	grc	{AuditManager}	How do I view compliance frameworks as Audit Manager?	How do I view compliance frameworks as Audit Manager?\nCan I see compliance frameworks?\nWhere do I browse frameworks like ISO 27001?\nHow do I check framework compliance percentage?\nCan I view adopted frameworks?\nWhere are compliance frameworks listed?\nHow do I review framework coverage?\nAs Audit Manager, you can view compliance frameworks to understand the organization's compliance posture and inform audit planning. This is view-only access — framework management is handled by compliance roles.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Frameworks**\nBrowse available frameworks in **cards/grid view** (ISO 27001, NIST, SOC 2, GDPR, etc.)\nView framework details: **code, name, description, type, status, country, industry**\nCheck **compliance percentage, policy percentage, and evidence percentage** per framework\nIdentify frameworks with **low compliance or evidence coverage** for potential audit focus\nUse **pagination** to browse through all available frameworks\nThis is **view-only** — adopting, importing, or modifying frameworks requires compliance roles\nLow compliance or evidence percentages may indicate areas requiring audit attention\nUnderstanding adopted frameworks helps align audit scope with compliance requirements\ncompliance frameworks\nISO 27001\nNIST\nSOC 2\nGDPR\nframework selection\ncompliance percentage	{-0.050933837890625,0.046051025390625,0.050750732421875,-0.039154052734375,0.002706527709960938,-0.02166748046875,-0.0198516845703125,-0.038421630859375,0.03399658203125,0.0506591796875,0.032440185546875,-0.016998291015625,0.005092620849609375,0.001794815063476562,0.051605224609375,-0.001707077026367188,-0.0130462646484375,-0.015716552734375,0.01456451416015625,0.054046630859375,0.056854248046875,0.05523681640625,-0.0008425712585449219,0.051116943359375,-0.019439697265625,-0.04327392578125,-0.0690307617