cmn2wa7nc007jjc3oqzlzwm0l	am-audit-reports	internal-audit	Audit Reports	audit	{AuditManager}	How do I generate and manage audit reports as Audit Manager?	How do I generate and manage audit reports as Audit Manager?\nHow do I create an audit report?\nWhere do I compile findings into a report?\nHow do I generate a PDF audit report?\nHow do I submit an audit report for approval?\nWhere are audit reports managed?\nHow do I include recommendations in a report?\nHow do I download an audit report?\nAudit Reports lets you generate and manage formal audit reports. You can compile findings, recommendations, management responses, and conclusions into structured reports for submission and approval.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Report**\nView the list of all audit reports with **status**\nClick **Create** to generate a new report from engagement data\nEnter report properties: **report code, title, executive summary**\nDefine **scope, objectives, and methodology**\nInclude **observations and recommendations** from findings\nAdd **management response** and **auditee comments**\nWrite the **conclusion and overall result**\n**Preview** the report before finalizing\n**Generate PDF** for formal distribution\nSet report **status**: Draft, Submitted, Approved\n**Download** the report for offline distribution\nUse **search and pagination** to find specific reports\nReports pull data from linked engagements and findings — ensure fieldwork is complete before generating\nDraft reports can be revised multiple times before submission\nInclude actionable recommendations tied to specific findings\nManagement responses should be documented for accountability\naudit report\nreport generation\nPDF\nexecutive summary\nfindings report\nrecommendations\nmanagement response	{-0.029937744140625,0.03155517578125,0.06982421875,-0.034149169921875,-0.07489013671875,-0.01027679443359375,-0.0138092041015625,-0.036346435546875,0.0230712890625,0.0253753662109375,0.00469207763671875,-0.033264160156