cmn2wa87y0087jc3omcyjqn52	ae-audit-risk-identification	internal-audit	Risk Identification	audit	{Auditee}	Can I access Risk Identification as an Auditee?	Can I access Risk Identification as an Auditee?\nAuditee risk identification\nView risks as Auditee\nAudit risk entries for Auditee\nRisk identification access\nCan Auditee see risks\nRisk Identification is used for identifying and documenting risks for audit planning purposes. As an Auditee, you have very limited or no access to this page — it is primarily for Audit Heads and Auditors.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Risk Identification** (if visible)\nView existing risk entries in the list (if accessible)\nReview risk details including assessment methodology\nThis page is **view-only at most** for Auditees — you cannot create, edit, or delete risk entries\nThis page may not be visible in your sidebar depending on permissions\nRisk identification is primarily a planning activity performed by the audit team, not Auditees\nrisk identification\nrisks\naudit risks\nview risks\nrisk entry	{0.027069091796875,-0.002492904663085938,0.02813720703125,0.00826263427734375,-0.045928955078125,-0.0240631103515625,-0.0545654296875,-0.007144927978515625,0.002410888671875,-0.00970458984375,0.0007381439208984375,-0.032958984375,0.0255126953125,0.018890380859375,-0.001435279846191406,-0.03240966796875,0.0067138671875,0.0280914306640625,-0.040863037109375,0.068115234375,0.04412841796875,0.050689697265625,-0.007244110107421875,0.005565643310546875,0.0167999267578125,-0.036407470703125,0.002180099487304688,-0.0209503173828125,0.0193939208984375,0.002681732177734375,0.057342529296875,-0.035675048828125,0.0279541015625,0.00865936279296875,-0.00977325439453125,-0.0003829002380371094,-0.0133056640625,-0.069580078125,0.002946853637695312,-0.006702423095703125,-0.01093292236328125,0.0232391357421875,0.00696563720703125,0.035400390625,-0.00928497314453125,0.027862548828125,0.0289154052734375,0.0012054443359375,0.0111846923828125,-0.0