cmn2wa7ok007mjc3olap33rtp	am-comp-controls	compliance	Control Assessment	grc	{AuditManager}	How do I view control assessments as Audit Manager?	How do I view control assessments as Audit Manager?\nCan I see compliance controls?\nWhere do I review control effectiveness?\nHow do I check control status?\nCan I view control-evidence linkages?\nWhere are compliance controls listed?\nHow do I review non-compliant controls?\nAs Audit Manager, you can view compliance controls and their assessment status to understand control effectiveness across frameworks. This view-only access helps identify weak controls for audit focus.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Controls**\nView the list of all controls with **status indicators** (Compliant, Partially Compliant, Non-Compliant, Not Assessed)\nReview control details: **code, name, description, domain, category, status**\nCheck **control-evidence linkages** to see supporting documentation\nCheck **control-risk mappings** to understand risk coverage\n**Filter** by framework, domain, or status to focus on specific areas\nUse **multi-select column filtering** for detailed analysis\nThis is **view-only** — assessing or modifying controls requires compliance roles\nNon-Compliant or Not Assessed controls are priority areas for audit testing\nControls with weak evidence linkages may need audit verification\ncontrol assessment\ncontrols\ncompliant\nnon-compliant\npartially compliant\neffectiveness\nevidence linkage	{0.006378173828125,0.05084228515625,0.045501708984375,-0.003118515014648438,-0.049896240234375,0.007343292236328125,-0.01036834716796875,-0.03192138671875,0.0272369384765625,0.0657958984375,0.0297393798828125,-0.0301361083984375,0.040740966796875,-0.0227508544921875,0.02301025390625,-0.0289154052734375,-0.01245880126953125,0.0106353759765625,0.0132293701171875,0.06842041015625,0.055877685546875,0.0295867919921875,0.01580810546875,0.003606796264648438,-0.0117645263671875,-0.054473876953125,-0.06121826171875,0.0010719299316406