cmn2wa7oy007njc3oa2lqia8u	am-comp-governance	compliance	Governance Documents	grc	{AuditManager}	How do I view governance documents as Audit Manager?	How do I view governance documents as Audit Manager?\nCan I see policies and procedures?\nWhere do I review governance documents?\nHow do I check document review status?\nCan I view policy versions?\nWhere are governance documents listed?\nHow do I review document approvals?\nAs Audit Manager, you can view governance documents (policies, procedures, standards, guidelines) to understand the organization's documented controls and review their lifecycle status.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Governance**\nView all governance documents with **version and status**\nReview document properties: **code, name, version, document type**\nCheck **review and approval workflow** status\nView **version history** to understand document evolution\nReview **review schedules and due dates** for policy recurrence\nCheck **framework and control linkages** for each document\nThis is **view-only** — creating or modifying documents requires compliance roles\nDocuments with overdue reviews may indicate governance process gaps worth auditing\nCheck version history to verify that policies are being regularly reviewed and updated\ngovernance documents\npolicies\nprocedures\nstandards\nguidelines\ndocument review\nversion history\napproval	{-0.004093170166015625,0.07122802734375,0.047088623046875,-0.001140594482421875,-0.04595947265625,0.0229339599609375,-0.034393310546875,-0.032928466796875,0.022979736328125,0.03558349609375,0.0406494140625,-0.052642822265625,0.00913238525390625,-0.0271759033203125,-0.002811431884765625,0.004741668701171875,-0.0123291015625,0.0190277099609375,0.0267181396484375,0.060943603515625,0.06671142578125,0.07171630859375,-0.0072021484375,0.047027587890625,-0.0198211669921875,-0.0065765380859375,-0.04266357421875,0.038238525390625,0.001558303833007812,-0.02349853515625,0.01137542724609375,-0.0096435546875,-0.00732421