cmn2wa7pc007ojc3o2d97nixk	am-comp-evidence	compliance	Evidence Management	grc	{AuditManager}	How do I view evidence items as Audit Manager?	How do I view evidence items as Audit Manager?\nCan I see compliance evidence?\nWhere do I review collected evidence?\nHow do I check evidence status?\nCan I view evidence linked to controls?\nWhere is evidence management?\nHow do I review evidence submissions?\nAs Audit Manager, you can view evidence items to review what documentation has been collected to demonstrate compliance. This view-only access helps you assess evidence quality and completeness for audit purposes.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Evidence**\nView evidence items with **status and due dates**\nReview evidence status: **Pending, Submitted, Approved, Rejected**\nCheck **control and framework linkages** for each evidence item\nReview **uploaded evidence files** (documents, screenshots, exports)\n**Filter** by status, assignee, or control to find specific evidence\nThis is **view-only** — creating, uploading, or approving evidence requires compliance roles\nEvidence with 'Rejected' status or overdue collection dates may indicate compliance process weaknesses\nUse this page to assess whether sufficient evidence exists to support control assertions during audits\nevidence\nevidence management\nevidence status\npending\nsubmitted\napproved\nrejected\nevidence collection	{0.01708984375,0.0543212890625,0.036773681640625,-0.0122222900390625,-0.0748291015625,0.01568603515625,-0.00830841064453125,-0.00891876220703125,-0.003721237182617188,0.0606689453125,0.0621337890625,-0.0166778564453125,0.0367431640625,0.00246429443359375,0.01071929931640625,-0.004642486572265625,0.012664794921875,0.0141143798828125,-0.0182037353515625,0.058685302734375,0.059326171875,0.017059326171875,0.012451171875,0.00702667236328125,0.001479148864746094,-0.049896240234375,-0.059356689453125,-0.001354217529296875,-0.004512786865234375,-0.032318115234375,0.03924560546875,-0.0209503173828125,