cmn2wa7qm007rjc3oleou77e6	am-comp-risk-matrix	compliance	Risk Matrix	grc	{AuditManager}	How do I view the compliance Risk Matrix as Audit Manager?	How do I view the compliance Risk Matrix as Audit Manager?\nCan I see the risk-control matrix in compliance?\nWhere do I review risk-control mappings?\nHow do I identify unmitigated risks?\nWhere is the compliance risk matrix?\nHow do I check control coverage gaps?\nAs Audit Manager, you can view the compliance Risk Matrix to understand how risks map to controls and identify coverage gaps. This view-only access helps prioritize audit areas where controls may be insufficient.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Risk Matrix**\nView the **matrix of risks vs controls**\nReview **control effectiveness per risk**\nIdentify **unmitigated risks** (gaps) where no controls are mapped\nCheck **status indicators** (compliant, non-compliant, partial compliant, not applicable)\nUse **collapsible risk groups** to organize the view\nReview **residual risk assessment** view\nUse **search and filter** to find specific risks or controls\nThis is **view-only** — linking/unlinking controls to risks requires compliance roles\nGaps in the risk-control matrix are strong candidates for audit findings\nCross-reference with the Risk Management module for a complete risk picture\nrisk matrix\nrisk-control mapping\nunmitigated risks\ncoverage gaps\ncontrol effectiveness	{-0.00946807861328125,0.09637451171875,0.060211181640625,0.00751495361328125,-0.054290771484375,-0.00821685791015625,-0.006435394287109375,-0.033477783203125,0.046966552734375,0.0423583984375,-0.002553939819335938,-0.0200958251953125,0.03582763671875,-0.0009593963623046875,0.017303466796875,-0.04345703125,0.006191253662109375,-0.0123443603515625,0.00243377685546875,0.05401611328125,0.05126953125,0.05609130859375,-0.0008754730224609375,0.037261962890625,-0.003049850463867188,-0.001321792602539062,-0.035919189453125,-0.01160430908203125,0.007389068603515625,0.024322509765625,0.0170593