cmn2wa7x0007ujc3onlywv3r9	am-risk-dashboard	risk-management	Dashboard	grc	{AuditManager}	How do I view the Risk Dashboard as Audit Manager?	How do I view the Risk Dashboard as Audit Manager?\nWhere is the risk dashboard?\nHow do I see risk statistics?\nCan I view risk by category charts?\nHow do I review risk status breakdown?\nWhere do I see risk analytics?\nHow do I check risk by strategy?\nAs Audit Manager, you can view the Risk Dashboard to see summary statistics, status breakdown, and risk analytics. This view-only access provides context for risk-based audit planning.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Dashboard**\nReview **summary metrics**: total risks and status breakdown\nView **risk by status chart** to understand the current state of risk management\nCheck **risk by strategy chart** (Mitigate, Accept, Transfer, Avoid)\nReview **risk by rating chart** to identify high and extreme risks\nView **risk by category chart** (Strategic, Operational, Financial, Compliance, Technology)\nThis is **view-only** — managing risks requires Risk Management roles\nAreas with high concentrations of extreme or high-rated risks should be prioritized for audit\nRisk trends inform risk-based audit planning decisions\nrisk dashboard\nrisk statistics\nrisk by category\nrisk by status\nrisk by strategy\nrisk by rating\nrisk analytics	{0.004718914162367582,0.06404922157526016,0.04491530358791351,0.009190794080495834,-0.03716741129755974,0.003949739504605532,-0.04338818415999413,-0.0006849583587609231,0.03238393366336823,0.03379876539111137,-0.00668676570057869,-0.01127374079078436,0.0219635833054781,-0.002499817404896021,0.0135082770138979,-0.03629156574606895,-0.02470341697335243,0.02719621546566486,-0.01500171143561602,0.06279159337282181,0.02098667435348034,0.0368979200720787,0.01514768600463867,0.02048137784004211,-0.03227164596319199,0.02674706280231476,-0.01676463708281517,-0.01990870758891106,-0.001162885222584009,0.02271591499447823,0.01554069481790066,-0.026814436