cmn2wa7xe007vjc3o4atr8q0b	am-risk-register	risk-management	Risk Register	grc	{AuditManager}	How do I view the Risk Register as Audit Manager?	How do I view the Risk Register as Audit Manager?\nCan I see enterprise risks?\nWhere is the risk register?\nHow do I review identified risks?\nHow do I check risk ratings?\nWhere do I view risk details?\nCan I see risk owners and categories?\nAs Audit Manager, you can view the Risk Register to review all identified enterprise risks, their ratings, owners, and treatment status. This view-only access supports risk-based audit planning.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Risk Register**\nView all risks with **severity indicators and status**\nReview risk details: **name, description, risk sources, category, type**\nCheck **risk scoring**: likelihood (1-5) x impact (1-5) = risk score\nReview **inherent risk rating** and **residual risk rating**\nCheck **risk owners** with contact info and department\nView **categories**: Strategic, Operational, Financial, Compliance, Technology\nCheck **status**: open, in-progress, completed, mitigate, accept, transfer, avoid\nUse **search, filter, and pagination** to find specific risks\nThis is **view-only** — creating or modifying risks requires Risk Management roles\nHigh inherent risk with low residual risk suggests heavy reliance on controls — verify through audit\nCross-reference enterprise risks with audit risk register for comprehensive coverage\nrisk register\nenterprise risks\nrisk ratings\nrisk owners\nrisk categories\ninherent risk\nresidual risk	{-0.007161866873502731,0.06520388275384903,0.06336145848035812,0.001572802197188139,-0.04830749705433846,0.005707025062292814,-0.008487514220178127,-0.007897714152932167,0.0016767195193097,0.03727541118860245,-0.008206657133996487,-0.01380695588886738,0.02797340974211693,-0.01743563637137413,-0.004246565978974104,-0.03714060038328171,0.001319328206591308,0.03480386361479759,-0.002957429736852646,0.06978747993707657,0.0417017266154289