cmn2wa7xt007wjc3o0nx5xw8a	am-risk-assessment	risk-management	Risk Assessment	grc	{AuditManager}	How do I view Risk Assessments as Audit Manager?	How do I view Risk Assessments as Audit Manager?\nCan I see risk assessment results?\nWhere do I view risk heatmaps?\nHow do I review inherent vs residual risk?\nHow do I check risk assessment status?\nWhere are risk assessments?\nAs Audit Manager, you can view Risk Assessments to review likelihood/impact evaluations, risk heatmaps, and assessment status. This view-only access supports understanding the organization's risk posture for audit planning.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Risk Assessment**\nView the **risk assessment matrix** (5x5 likelihood vs impact)\nReview **inherent risk assessments** before controls\nReview **residual risk assessments** after controls are applied\nCheck the **risk heatmap visualization** for risk concentration\nReview **assessment status** (draft, submitted, approved, rejected, in-progress)\nCompare inherent vs residual risk levels to evaluate control effectiveness\nThis is **view-only** — performing or modifying assessments requires Risk Management roles\nLarge gaps between inherent and residual risk suggest strong control reliance — verify through audit\nRisks in 'draft' or 'rejected' status may indicate incomplete risk management processes\nrisk assessment\nlikelihood\nimpact\nheatmap\ninherent risk\nresidual risk\nrisk matrix\nassessment status	{-0.01851119846105576,0.06251715123653412,0.0524723120033741,0.01351269707083702,-0.05811655521392822,-0.01741104945540428,-0.0262839887291193,-0.03362628445029259,0.03611357882618904,0.03568308427929878,-0.0004798203008249402,-0.02187143638730049,0.0411359965801239,-0.01255604531615973,-0.005994017235934734,-0.0252555888146162,-0.01894169114530087,0.01952764019370079,-0.02348578348755836,0.04847829416394234,0.0397249348461628,0.02480117976665497,0.00807174388319254,0.01824812032282352,-0.02477726340293884,-0.01303437072783709,-0.051180