cmn2wa7y7007xjc3o5n4y0ifx	am-risk-response	risk-management	Risk Response	grc	{AuditManager}	How do I view Risk Responses as Audit Manager?	How do I view Risk Responses as Audit Manager?\nCan I see risk treatment plans?\nWhere do I review risk mitigation actions?\nHow do I check risk response status?\nHow do I view risk treatment progress?\nWhere are risk responses tracked?\nAs Audit Manager, you can view Risk Responses to review treatment strategies, action plans, and implementation progress. This view-only access helps assess whether risks are being adequately addressed.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Risk Response**\nView risks requiring **response/treatment**\nReview **response strategies** (Mitigate, Accept, Transfer, Avoid)\nCheck **treatment action plans** with due dates\nReview **action owner assignments** and due dates\nTrack **action implementation status** (open, in-progress, completed)\nReview **response progress** and effectiveness documentation\nThis is **view-only** — creating or modifying responses requires Risk Management roles\nOverdue or incomplete treatment actions are potential audit observations\nVerify that chosen response strategies are appropriate for the risk level\nrisk response\nrisk treatment\nmitigation\naction plans\nresponse strategy\ntreatment status	{-0.03365843370556831,0.06367936730384827,0.05493093281984329,-0.001725225010886788,-0.06994140148162842,-0.02280347421765327,-0.02106530033051968,0.02031707763671875,0.03925282508134842,0.01824508234858513,0.005562735721468925,-0.02208978682756424,0.04086437821388245,-0.02440351620316505,-0.01413562148809433,-0.04958978667855263,0.001279889605939388,0.01466513238847256,-0.03098786063492298,0.06865215301513672,0.02926119789481163,0.03409585729241371,0.005726768635213375,-0.01105064898729324,-0.03107994981110096,0.01887819170951843,-0.02645249105989933,-0.01149382628500462,-0.01753139495849609,-0.005427480209618807,0.03368145599961281,-0.01703641749918461,-8.683905434736516e-07