cmn2wa7ym007yjc3oezbo1ezr	am-risk-control-matrix	risk-management	Risk Control Matrix	grc	{AuditManager}	How do I view the Risk Control Matrix as Audit Manager?	How do I view the Risk Control Matrix as Audit Manager?\nCan I see risk-control mappings?\nWhere is the risk control matrix?\nHow do I identify control gaps in risk management?\nHow do I review control effectiveness per risk?\nWhere do I check risk-control coverage?\nAs Audit Manager, you can view the Risk Control Matrix to understand risk-control mappings, identify coverage gaps, and review control effectiveness. This view-only access informs audit scope and testing priorities.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Risk Control Matrix**\nView the **matrix of risks vs controls**\nReview **control effectiveness per risk**\nIdentify **unmitigated risks** (gaps) where no controls are mapped\nCheck **residual risk calculations** after control application\nReview **status indicators** for each control-risk link\nUse **collapsible risk groups** for organized viewing\nUse **search and filter** to find specific mappings\nThis is **view-only** — linking/unlinking controls to risks requires Risk Management roles\nRisks without mapped controls are high-priority audit areas\nCompare this with the compliance Risk Matrix for a comprehensive control coverage view\nrisk control matrix\nrisk-control mapping\ncontrol gaps\ncontrol effectiveness\nresidual risk\ncoverage	{-0.01424001809209585,0.09014904499053955,0.04036558419466019,0.01490787230432034,-0.05424337461590767,-0.0113139096647501,-0.01386647205799818,-0.02569542080163956,0.0236578993499279,0.03155895695090294,-0.006440834607928991,-0.03140048310160637,0.02863851003348827,-0.007533173076808453,0.01313070021569729,-0.04767802357673645,-0.01632281765341759,-0.0065087522380054,-0.00272801611572504,0.05428865179419518,0.05157195776700974,0.04131642729043961,0.004595744889229536,0.03144576400518417,-0.02057897672057152,-0.003540195291861892,-0.01863201148808002,-0.018