cmn2wa7z0007zjc3o4egl3kip	am-risk-settings	risk-management	Risk Settings	grc	{AuditManager}	Can I access Risk Settings as Audit Manager?	Can I access Risk Settings as Audit Manager?\nCan I configure risk categories?\nWhere are risk management settings?\nCan I modify risk thresholds?\nCan I change the risk rating matrix?\nDo I have access to risk settings?\nAs Audit Manager, you can view Risk Settings to understand the configured risk categories, types, thresholds, and rating matrix. This is view-only — configuration requires Risk Management administration roles.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Settings**\nView configured **risk categories** and their definitions\nReview **risk type definitions**\nCheck **risk rating matrix** customization (likelihood x impact scales)\nReview **threshold configuration** for risk tolerance levels\nThis is **view-only** — modifying risk settings requires Risk Management administration roles\nUnderstanding risk thresholds helps calibrate audit risk assessments\nThe rating matrix defines how inherent and residual risk scores are calculated\nrisk settings\nrisk categories\nrisk types\nthresholds\nrating matrix\nrisk configuration	{-0.02592002414166927,0.05113112181425095,0.02144494280219078,0.001477385987527668,-0.04603573307394981,0.001044693286530674,-0.006701544392853975,-0.001539693679660559,0.03648741915822029,0.02481232956051826,-0.01399016659706831,-0.02397048287093639,0.02966402657330036,0.002569848438724875,0.0319901816546917,-0.01330339722335339,-0.01497601345181465,0.04149419069290161,-0.01834340207278728,0.06717052310705185,0.05666958913207054,0.03518034145236015,-0.004012619145214558,0.009376623667776585,-0.01390155125409365,0.001478770631365478,0.00523938937112689,-0.02310648187994957,-0.005699082277715206,0.02290709875524044,0.01884186267852783,-0.01473232079297304,-0.002006309572607279,0.008224623277783394,0.00360554177314043,-0.01125416439026594,-0.01293785776942968,-0.008817238733172417,0.02875571884214878,0.0