cmn2wa7zt0081jc3oxjgyuxcv	ae-role-overview	internal-audit	Role Overview	audit	{Auditee}	What is the Auditee role and what can I do?	What is the Auditee role and what can I do?\nWhat is an Auditee\nAuditee role overview\nWhat does the Auditee do\nAuditee capabilities\nWhat access does an Auditee have\nAuditee permissions summary\nWhat can I do as an Auditee\nThe Auditee is the subject of an audit — you provide information, respond to findings, and implement corrective actions. This is the most limited audit role with access only to the Internal Audit module.\nAs an Auditee, you are the **subject** of audits, not the conductor\nYou can **view audit findings** assigned to you\nYou can **provide management responses** to findings\nYou can **view and update CAPA items** assigned to you\nYou can **upload corrective action evidence** for your CAPA items\nYou can **view audit engagement details** relevant to you\nYou can **add comments** to CAPA discussions\nYou do NOT create engagements, findings, or audit reports\nYou do NOT have access to Organization, Compliance, Risk Management, Asset Management, or GRC Administration modules\nYour access is scoped to items assigned to you — you cannot view all findings or all CAPA items\nThis is primarily a **responding and reactive** role\nauditee\nrole\noverview\ncapabilities\npermissions\naccess\nsubject	{-0.01942316256463528,0.008219298906624317,0.005281737074255943,-0.00422421470284462,-0.04568496719002724,-0.00785504188388586,-0.03868182003498077,-0.01063397526741028,0.0123495114967227,0.001020068535581231,0.0426769033074379,-0.05673020333051682,-0.01471131201833487,0.00873631052672863,0.01505206897854805,-0.01033434458076954,0.007091275416314602,-0.01083960477262735,-0.01354803703725338,0.07313355058431625,0.05757622048258781,0.01894140243530273,0.001978448126465082,0.01690860837697983,-0.01142124179750681,-0.06030227988958359,-0.04112587124109268,0.04742400720715523,-0.02216096967458725,-0.01840089075267315,0.01593333855271339