cmn2wa85w0082jc3o7o5pc4zo	ae-no-access	internal-audit	Role Overview	audit	{Auditee}	What modules and pages can I NOT access as an Auditee?	What modules and pages can I NOT access as an Auditee?\nAuditee restricted pages\nWhat is blocked for Auditee\nAuditee module restrictions\nWhy can't I see Organization module\nWhy can't I access Risk Management\nAuditee no access list\nPages not available to Auditee\nWhy is my sidebar so limited\nAs an Auditee, you have the most limited access in the system. You can only access the Internal Audit module, and even within that module, most pages are view-only or not accessible.\n**Organization module** — NOT accessible (Profile, Context, Users, Processes, BIA)\n**Compliance module** — NOT accessible (Frameworks, Controls, Governance Documents, Evidence, Exceptions, KPIs)\n**Risk Management module** — NOT accessible (Dashboard, Register, Assessment, Response, Risk Control Matrix, Settings, Reports)\n**Asset Management module** — NOT accessible (Inventory, Classification)\n**GRC Administration** — NOT accessible (Customer Accounts, Email Configuration)\n**Organization Dashboard** — NOT accessible\n**Organization Settings** — NOT accessible\n**Audit Planning creation** — You can view engagements relevant to you but cannot create or modify audit plans\n**Audit Report creation** — You can view reports but cannot generate or approve them\n**Audit Settings** — NOT accessible (Types, Departments, Risk Assessment, Categories, User Management, Escalation)\n**Risk Identification / Risk Register** — NOT accessible for creation; view-only at most\nIf a sidebar menu item is not visible, your role does not have permission to access it\nPermissions are enforced at both the UI level (hidden options) and the API level (blocked requests)\nContact your Audit Head or Customer Administrator if you believe you need additional access\nno access\nrestricted\nblocked\ncannot\nunavailable\nhidden\nlimited\nsidebar	{-0.0150299072265625,0.041107177734375,0.05