cmn2wa86b0083jc3omf6ztzb7	ae-audit-login	internal-audit	Getting Started	audit	{Auditee}	How do I log in as an Auditee?	How do I log in as an Auditee?\nAuditee login\nHow to sign in as Auditee\nAuditee first login\nAccess the system as Auditee\nAuditee credentials\nLog in to audit system\nLog in using the credentials provided by your administrator. After login, you will see a limited sidebar with only the Internal Audit module available.\nOpen your browser and navigate to the application URL provided by your administrator\nEnter your **Username** in the username field\nEnter your **Password** in the password field\nClick **Sign In** to access the application\nAfter login, you will be redirected to your default view — note that your sidebar will only show **Internal Audit** items\nYour sidebar will be much more limited than other roles — this is expected\nIf you cannot log in, contact your administrator for credential assistance\nSSO login may be available if configured by your organization\nlogin\nsign in\nauditee\ncredentials\naccess\nauthenticate	{-0.03045654296875,0.0022735595703125,0.0264434814453125,-0.0185089111328125,-0.054229736328125,-0.01061248779296875,-0.034332275390625,-0.0002228021621704102,0.003894805908203125,-0.01274871826171875,0.02801513671875,-0.04754638671875,0.0195159912109375,-0.0173187255859375,0.0240631103515625,-0.007160186767578125,0.0066070556640625,-8.702278137207031e-06,-0.051727294921875,0.05126953125,0.0173187255859375,0.05322265625,0.002141952514648438,0.04693603515625,0.0009479522705078125,-0.03173828125,-0.0684814453125,0.00858306884765625,0.001329421997070312,-0.036956787109375,-0.005718231201171875,-0.036529541015625,0.005615234375,0.031494140625,0.01268768310546875,0.02294921875,-0.016204833984375,0.001539230346679688,0.040679931640625,-0.01543426513671875,-0.022918701171875,0.029083251953125,0.01136016845703125,0.0239715576171875,-0.0103912353515625,0.0006146430969238281,-0.0173492431640625,-0.00110626220703125,-0.01974487304687