cmn2wa86q0084jc3oel68xqy2	ae-audit-navigation	internal-audit	Getting Started	audit	{Auditee}	How do I navigate the application as an Auditee?	How do I navigate the application as an Auditee?\nAuditee navigation\nWhere can I go as an Auditee\nAuditee sidebar menu\nAuditee menu items\nWhat pages can I see as Auditee\nAuditee application layout\nAs an Auditee, you navigate using the sidebar on the left side. Your visible menu items are limited to Internal Audit pages relevant to your role.\nUse the **sidebar menu** on the left to navigate between pages\nThe **header bar** at the top contains notifications, language switcher, and your user profile\nUse the **breadcrumb trail** to understand your current location\nPress **Ctrl+K** (or **Cmd+K** on Mac) to open **Global Search** — results are filtered to only pages you can access\nClick the **bell icon** in the top bar to view notifications about findings or CAPA items assigned to you\nSearch results are filtered to your permissions — you will only see pages you have access to\nThe language selector in the header lets you switch between English, Arabic (RTL), and Latvian\nnavigation\nsidebar\nmenu\nlayout\nauditee\npages\nnavigate	{-0.031951904296875,0.0251617431640625,0.0406494140625,-0.01465606689453125,-0.03607177734375,-0.0098876953125,-0.042755126953125,-0.017791748046875,-0.0050506591796875,0.01270294189453125,0.00820159912109375,-0.05291748046875,0.01512908935546875,0.006473541259765625,0.0300140380859375,0.012420654296875,0.010284423828125,-0.0091094970703125,-0.0226593017578125,0.0455322265625,0.0262908935546875,0.040496826171875,0.002710342407226562,0.05194091796875,0.003267288208007812,-0.058624267578125,-0.052825927734375,0.0421142578125,0.004146575927734375,0.01088714599609375,-0.002237319946289062,-0.02618408203125,0.015655517578125,0.0440673828125,-0.0189056396484375,-0.0198974609375,0.0108489990234375,-0.021026611328125,0.031280517578125,-0.02349853515625,-0.03204345703125,0.0279693603515625,0.024475097656