cmn2wa8750085jc3ofzf0ixvi	ae-audit-dashboard	internal-audit	Dashboard	audit	{Auditee}	Can I access the Audit Dashboard as an Auditee?	Can I access the Audit Dashboard as an Auditee?\nAuditee audit dashboard\nView audit dashboard as Auditee\nAudit overview for Auditee\nAudit statistics for Auditee\nCAPA status dashboard\nAudit risk statistics\nThe Audit Dashboard provides an overview of the audit function including risk statistics, audit statistics, CAPA status by department, and audit plan calendar. As an Auditee, this page may be view-only or restricted depending on your organization's configuration.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Dashboard**\nView **risk statistics** — total, extreme, high, medium, low risk counts\nView **audit statistics** — ongoing, completed, and planned audits\nView **CAPA status by department** — open vs closed breakdown\nView the **annual audit plan calendar**\nView **auditor schedule visualization** and department-wise audit metrics\nThis page is **view-only** for Auditees — you cannot modify any dashboard data\nYour access to this page depends on your organization's permission configuration\nThe dashboard shows aggregate data; it does not filter to only your items\ndashboard\naudit\nstatistics\noverview\ncapa\nstatus\nmetrics	{0.015899658203125,-0.006622314453125,0.0039520263671875,-0.005954742431640625,-0.0220794677734375,0.037445068359375,-0.06500244140625,-0.0121002197265625,0.03271484375,-0.0128936767578125,0.0144500732421875,-0.05438232421875,0.0399169921875,0.0232696533203125,0.0043487548828125,-0.0188140869140625,0.006839752197265625,0.01097869873046875,-0.0188446044921875,0.052703857421875,0.040985107421875,0.026763916015625,0.00653076171875,0.01085662841796875,-0.04327392578125,-0.033050537109375,-0.005558013916015625,-0.015228271484375,-0.001382827758789062,0.029876708984375,0.01348876953125,-0.044891357421875,-0.01049041748046875,0.01117706298828125,0.00208282470703125,-0.002170562744140625,0.001170158386230469,-0.015