cmn2wa88r0089jc3ott7ynml3	ae-audit-planning	internal-audit	Audit Planning	audit	{Auditee}	Can I view audit plans and engagements as an Auditee?	Can I view audit plans and engagements as an Auditee?\nAuditee audit planning\nView audit engagements as Auditee\nAudit plan for my department\nCan I see my audit schedule\nWhen is my department being audited\nAudit engagement details for Auditee\nView audit timeline as Auditee\nAudit Planning shows audit engagements including scope, objectives, timeline, and team assignments. As an Auditee, you can view engagements relevant to you but cannot create or modify audit plans.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Audit Planning**\nView the list of audit engagements with **title, department, dates, and status**\nClick on an engagement to see its details: scope, objectives, assigned auditors, and linked risks\nReview the **engagement status**: Planned, In Progress, Completed, or Cancelled\nCheck **planned hours** and **timeline** (start/end dates)\nUse **search and pagination** to find specific engagements\nThis page is **view-only** for Auditees — you cannot create, edit, or delete engagements\nYou cannot assign auditors, link risks, or modify engagement documents\nEngagements relevant to your department help you prepare for upcoming audits\naudit planning\nengagement\nschedule\ntimeline\nplanned\naudit plan	{-0.01041412353515625,-0.00855255126953125,0.0180816650390625,-0.047576904296875,-0.05096435546875,0.001415252685546875,-0.022552490234375,-0.003480911254882812,-0.005458831787109375,-0.0008053779602050781,0.047576904296875,-0.052093505859375,0.0670166015625,0.00521087646484375,0.006763458251953125,-0.0003199577331542969,-0.0084686279296875,-0.005191802978515625,-0.0274658203125,0.056304931640625,0.0753173828125,0.039276123046875,0.016754150390625,-0.01239013671875,-0.0148162841796875,-0.052459716796875,-0.04302978515625,0.001300811767578125,0.01039886474609375,0.016357421875,-0.001545906066894531,-0.031494140625,-0.00600