cmn2wa896008ajc3ol4c23cio	ae-audit-fieldwork	internal-audit	Fieldwork	audit	{Auditee}	Can I view fieldwork activities as an Auditee?	Can I view fieldwork activities as an Auditee?\nAuditee fieldwork\nView fieldwork as Auditee\nAudit testing for my department\nFieldwork details for Auditee\nCan I see audit fieldwork\nView audit observations\nFieldwork is where auditors conduct testing, gather evidence, and document observations. As an Auditee, you may be able to view fieldwork details for engagements involving your department, but you cannot create work papers or add findings.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Fieldwork**\nView the list of engagements with **title, department, status, dates, and auditor**\nClick on an engagement to see fieldwork details\nReview any **observations** or **evidence** documented by auditors\nUse **filters** (department, status, auditor) to narrow the list\nThis page is **view-only** for Auditees — you cannot create work papers, upload evidence, or add findings\nFieldwork is conducted by auditors; your role is to cooperate and provide requested information\nFindings arising from fieldwork will appear on the Findings page and may be assigned to you\nfieldwork\ntesting\nobservations\naudit evidence\nwork papers	{-0.0258331298828125,0.0003392696380615234,-0.005260467529296875,-0.028228759765625,-0.040283203125,-0.0138702392578125,0.00176239013671875,-0.0042877197265625,-0.009765625,0.024261474609375,0.049835205078125,-0.0248565673828125,0.0081787109375,0.001873970031738281,0.0164642333984375,0.01220703125,0.01025390625,-0.0269622802734375,-0.020050048828125,0.054779052734375,0.055450439453125,0.038421630859375,0.01085662841796875,-0.0283355712890625,-0.0181884765625,-0.07244873046875,-0.0709228515625,0.0251007080078125,0.0004160404205322266,0.001622200012207031,-0.0090789794921875,-0.03155517578125,-0.002651214599609375,0.026458740234375,-0.032745361328125,0.0167236328125,-0.005702972412109375,-0.0350341796875,0.0240020751953125,-0.0