cmn2wa89k008bjc3oymtfwwft	ae-audit-findings	internal-audit	Findings	audit	{Auditee}	How do I view findings assigned to me as an Auditee?	How do I view findings assigned to me as an Auditee?\nAuditee findings\nView my audit findings\nFindings assigned to me\nAudit findings for Auditee\nWhat findings do I have\nHow to see my findings\nRespond to findings as Auditee\nAs an Auditee, you can view audit findings assigned to you. Findings identify gaps discovered during audits. You are expected to review them and provide management responses, but you cannot create or delete findings.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Findings** (accessed via Fieldwork)\nView the list of findings — look for those **assigned to you** as the finding owner\nReview each finding's **severity** (Critical, High, Medium, Low, Informational) and **status** (Open, In Progress, Closed, Overdue)\nClick on a finding to view its **details**: title, description, severity, recommendation, and remediation due date\nReview the **recommendation** provided by the auditor\nProvide your **management response** to the finding if prompted\nYou **cannot create, edit, or delete** findings — this is done by auditors\nYour primary action is to **review and respond** to findings assigned to you\nFindings linked to your name will generate CAPA items that you must action\nPay close attention to **remediation due dates** to avoid overdue status\nfindings\nassigned\nseverity\nremediation\nmanagement response\nopen\noverdue	{-0.00801849365234375,0.00821685791015625,0.046142578125,-0.01056671142578125,-0.023162841796875,-0.03173828125,-0.038055419921875,-0.049530029296875,-0.0218353271484375,0.00940704345703125,0.04302978515625,-0.023773193359375,-0.0262298583984375,-0.005283355712890625,0.037261962890625,-0.0270843505859375,0.02484130859375,-0.024322509765625,-0.0318603515625,0.07110595703125,0.06878662109375,0.03289794921875,0.0101165771484375,0.043182373046875,-0.01444244384765625,-0.06439208984375,-0.039398193359