cmn2wa8f3008cjc3oxqjj3r4i	ae-audit-capa-overview	internal-audit	CAPA Tracking	audit	{Auditee}	How do I view and manage my CAPA items as an Auditee?	How do I view and manage my CAPA items as an Auditee?\nAuditee CAPA tracking\nView my CAPA items\nCAPA items assigned to me\nCorrective actions for Auditee\nHow to respond to CAPA\nCAPA management for Auditee\nMy corrective action plan\nCAPA Tracking is where you manage Corrective and Preventive Actions arising from audit findings. As an Auditee, this is your primary workspace — you can view CAPA items assigned to you, update progress, upload evidence, and add comments.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → CAPA Tracking**\nView the list of CAPA items — focus on items **assigned to you** as the responsible person\nReview each CAPA item's **status**, **severity**, and **due date**\nClick on a CAPA item to open its details\nReview the **corrective and preventive actions** defined for the item\nUpdate the **completion percentage** as you make progress on the action\nAdd **comments** in the discussion section to communicate with the audit team\nUpload **evidence files** to demonstrate corrective action completion\nYou **cannot create** new CAPA items — these are created by auditors from findings\nYou **can update** CAPA items assigned to you: progress, comments, and evidence uploads\nMonitor your **due dates** closely — overdue items may be escalated\nUse the **filter by status** option to focus on open or in-progress items\ncapa\ncorrective\npreventive\naction\ntracking\nassigned\nremediation	{0.006123939529061317,0.0401993952691555,0.0401993952691555,-0.01027144864201546,-0.03809120133519173,-0.02346561849117279,-0.03037713468074799,-0.02272295951843262,0.0287959910929203,-0.001522749778814614,0.04858425259590149,-0.01818315871059895,0.028508510440588,-0.006270674522966146,0.01058887504041195,-0.03234158828854561,0.0256576593965292,-0.01636244729161263,-0.02865225076675415,0.04173262417316437,0.01600309647619724,0.0398