cmn2wa8fi008djc3ov65nblqk	ae-audit-capa-update-progress	internal-audit	CAPA Tracking	audit	{Auditee}	How do I update CAPA progress and completion percentage?	How do I update CAPA progress and completion percentage?\nUpdate CAPA completion\nChange CAPA status\nMark CAPA progress\nHow to update corrective action progress\nCAPA completion percentage\nTrack my CAPA progress\nYou can update the completion percentage and status of CAPA items assigned to you to reflect your remediation progress.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → CAPA Tracking**\nFind the CAPA item assigned to you in the list\nClick on the CAPA item to open its detail view\nUpdate the **completion percentage** to reflect your current progress\nUpdate the **action status** as appropriate (e.g., In Progress)\nAdd a **comment** describing what actions you have taken\nClick **Save** to record your progress update\nKeep your completion percentage accurate — the audit team monitors this\nRegular progress updates demonstrate due diligence and may prevent escalation\nYou cannot change the due date or severity — only the audit team can modify those fields\ncapa\nprogress\ncompletion\npercentage\nupdate\nstatus\ntrack	{0.01026757061481476,0.04317587241530418,0.03475352004170418,0.02431614324450493,-0.004610218573361635,0.01162601448595524,0.02122568339109421,-0.01419573742896318,0.05030770227313042,-0.01060718204826117,0.03475352004170418,0.01953895017504692,-0.001621642266400158,-0.001839559292420745,0.00386590464040637,-0.007895954884588718,0.01572398655116558,-0.0166635774075985,-0.02513121068477631,0.04926622658967972,0.0009204871603287756,0.01609755866229534,0.02185962535440922,0.05383965373039246,-0.01922198012471199,-0.007556343451142311,-0.01218071300536394,0.0307687520980835,-0.0501718558371067,0.01865596137940884,0.03149325400590897,-0.01493156142532825,-0.04777193814516068,0.01014304719865322,0.03737984597682953,0.02253884635865688,-0.02746320515871048,-0.02909333817660809,0.009961920790374279,-0.0