cmn2wa8fx008ejc3ocbow5sz4	ae-audit-capa-upload-evidence	internal-audit	CAPA Tracking	audit	{Auditee}	How do I upload evidence for a CAPA item?	How do I upload evidence for a CAPA item?\nUpload CAPA evidence\nAttach files to CAPA\nCAPA evidence upload\nProvide corrective action proof\nUpload documents for CAPA\nHow to attach evidence to corrective action\nYou can upload evidence files to CAPA items assigned to you to demonstrate that corrective actions have been implemented.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → CAPA Tracking**\nClick on the CAPA item you need to provide evidence for\nLook for the **file attachment** or **evidence upload** section in the CAPA detail view\nClick **Upload** or **Attach File** to select files from your computer\nSelect the relevant document(s) — e.g., policy updates, training records, configuration screenshots\nAdd a **comment** describing what the uploaded evidence demonstrates\nClick **Save** to confirm the upload\nUpload clear, well-named files that directly support your corrective action\nCommon evidence types: updated policies, training completion records, system configuration screenshots, procedure documents\nEvidence is reviewed by the audit team to verify action effectiveness\nYou may be asked to provide additional evidence if the initial upload is insufficient\nupload\nevidence\ncapa\nattachment\nfile\ndocument\nproof\ncorrective	{0.01923456229269505,0.03571813553571701,0.04705758020281792,-0.003841321216896176,-0.03524845466017723,-0.0428304523229599,-0.0299254022538662,-0.001392269274219871,0.001260171411558986,0.02849399298429489,0.06526331603527069,0.002500772709026933,0.03392887488007545,-0.01651712134480476,0.002223996445536613,-0.0194582212716341,0.04665499925613403,0.02048704586923122,-0.05376731231808662,0.01785906776785851,-0.0001249337947228923,-0.009634056128561497,0.006709731183946133,0.01383322943001986,-0.00489251222461462,-0.03688115626573563,-0.01656185276806355,-0.00440046563744545,-0.03209488093852997,-0.