cmn2wa8gc008fjc3o3pks0avz	ae-audit-capa-comments	internal-audit	CAPA Tracking	audit	{Auditee}	How do I add comments to a CAPA discussion?	How do I add comments to a CAPA discussion?\nCAPA comments\nAdd comment to CAPA\nDiscuss CAPA item\nCommunicate with auditors about CAPA\nCAPA discussion thread\nReply to CAPA comments\nYou can add comments to CAPA items to communicate with the audit team about progress, challenges, or questions related to corrective actions.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → CAPA Tracking**\nClick on the CAPA item you want to discuss\nScroll to the **Comments** or **Discussion** section\nType your message in the comment input field\nClick **Submit** or **Add Comment** to post your message\nPrevious comments from the audit team will be visible in the thread\nUse comments to ask clarifying questions about what is expected\nDocument any obstacles or delays you are encountering\nComments create an audit trail — be professional and factual\nThe audit team will be notified of your comments\ncomment\ndiscussion\ncapa\ncommunicate\nreply\nmessage\nthread	{0.01397708803415298,0.02842918410897255,0.02909419313073158,0.03588679805397987,-0.02176720649003983,0.02534163556993008,-0.0357917957007885,0.001692213350906968,0.06175094097852707,-0.02937919832766056,0.02364348620176315,-0.008657006546854973,0.00692916801199317,0.01686275750398636,-0.01012952905148268,-0.01599586941301823,0.02964045107364655,0.01018890552222729,0.0122314365580678,0.0453394427895546,0.01496272813528776,0.03890309482812881,-0.007689179852604866,0.04624195396900177,-0.04006686061620712,-0.02892794087529182,-0.02928419597446918,0.01084797829389572,-0.06018341705203056,-0.00625228276476264,0.02259846962988377,-0.0163164995610714,-0.03325050696730614,0.01835902966558933,0.02681415900588036,0.01732588931918144,0.003069734200835228,-0.008918261155486107,-0.02160095423460007,-0.00537648843601346,0.02228971570730209,0.04892574623227119,0.0361955501139164,0.02299034968018532,-0.01344270