cmn2wa8gq008gjc3oe45r6zen	ae-audit-reports	internal-audit	Audit Reports	audit	{Auditee}	Can I view audit reports as an Auditee?	Can I view audit reports as an Auditee?\nAuditee audit reports\nView audit reports\nRead audit report\nAudit report access for Auditee\nDownload audit report as Auditee\nSee audit conclusions\nAs an Auditee, you may be able to view audit reports relevant to engagements involving your department. Reports compile findings, recommendations, and management responses. You cannot create, edit, or approve reports.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Report**\nView the list of audit reports with their **status** (Draft, Submitted, Approved)\nClick on a report to view its details: executive summary, scope, objectives, methodology\nReview **observations** and **recommendations** documented in the report\nCheck the **management response** section — this may include your responses to findings\nReview the **conclusion and overall result**\nUse **Download** to save a PDF copy of the report (if permitted)\nYou **cannot create, edit, or approve** audit reports — this is done by the audit team\nReports marked as Draft may not yet be visible to Auditees\nThe **Auditee comments and response** section in the report may include your management responses\nYour access to reports depends on your organization's permission configuration\nreport\naudit report\nview\ndownload\nconclusions\nmanagement response	{-0.01855761930346489,0.0003772226045839489,0.02895219810307026,-0.02673222124576569,-0.03834084793925285,0.008134134113788605,-0.04370579123497009,0.01320423651486635,0.02210726961493492,-0.01204799860715866,0.01440672483295202,-0.05716440081596375,0.01083973050117493,-0.00364793068729341,-0.006226341240108013,-0.005038306582719088,0.01230237167328596,0.003523634979501367,-0.0134007977321744,0.08644034713506699,0.05166070908308029,0.05184570699930191,0.01580577157437801,0.004821511916816235,-0.02238476648926735,-0.02351787872612476,-0.06030936911702156,-0.