cmn2wa8h5008hjc3o1d5i0j37	ae-audit-document-library	internal-audit	Document Library	audit	{Auditee}	Can I access the Audit Document Library as an Auditee?	Can I access the Audit Document Library as an Auditee?\nAuditee document library\nView audit documents\nAudit document repository\nAccess audit files as Auditee\nDownload audit documents\nThe Document Library is a centralized repository for audit-related documents. As an Auditee, you may have view-only access to browse and download documents relevant to your engagements.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Document Library**\nBrowse the list of uploaded audit documents\nSearch for specific documents by name\nDownload documents relevant to your engagements (if permitted)\nYou **cannot upload, edit, or delete** documents in the library — this is managed by the audit team\nAccess may be limited to documents related to engagements involving your department\nThis page may not be visible in your sidebar depending on your permissions\ndocument\nlibrary\nrepository\nfiles\naudit documents\ndownload	{-0.03712322190403938,-0.008031254634261131,0.004279849585145712,-0.01599645428359509,-0.01819830574095249,0.02243687026202679,-0.04187922179698944,-0.003393604187294841,-0.0260038711130619,-0.04720770195126534,0.04084435105323792,-0.06698033213615417,0.02543138898909092,-0.005160590168088675,-0.00098532869014889,0.02835985086858273,0.06055092439055443,-0.003319291630759835,-0.02102768421173096,0.05870136991143227,0.06689225882291794,0.03591220453381538,-0.008878967724740505,-0.01017255522310734,-0.004455997608602047,-0.04800036922097206,-0.03575807437300682,-0.002248641103506088,0.007189046125859022,-0.02309742569923401,-0.002474331064149737,-0.03600027784705162,0.0064679398201406,0.03998563066124916,-0.02009189873933792,0.05324077606201172,-0.004981689620763063,-0.04641503840684891,0.01629370450973511,-0.01957446336746216,-0.01122394017875195,0.006715648341923952,-0.002199099631980062,0.01849555596709251,-0.000292433454