cmn2wa8hj008ijc3omarfnlme	ae-audit-settings	internal-audit	Audit Settings	audit	{Auditee}	Can I access Audit Settings as an Auditee?	Can I access Audit Settings as an Auditee?\nAuditee audit settings\nConfigure audit settings as Auditee\nAudit types for Auditee\nAudit departments for Auditee\nAudit user management as Auditee\nAudit Settings is NOT accessible to Auditees. This section is reserved for Audit Heads and administrators to configure audit types, departments, risk assessment matrices, categories, and escalation policies.\nAudit Settings includes: **Audit Types**, **Departments**, **Periodicity**, **Process**, **Risk Assessment**, **Categories**, **Nature of Controls**, **User Management**, and **Escalation**\nNone of these configuration pages are available to the Auditee role\nIf you need a configuration change, contact your **Audit Head** or **Customer Administrator**\nThis page is **NOT accessible** to Auditees\nSettings configuration is an administrative function outside the Auditee scope\nNavigation path (for reference): Sidebar → Internal Audit → Settings\nsettings\nconfiguration\naudit types\ndepartments\nescalation\nuser management	{-0.01500039454549551,-0.009107782505452633,0.04120347276329994,-0.04124828428030014,-0.03786507248878479,0.01699447259306908,0.001124469446949661,-0.01249099336564541,0.03967990726232529,-0.02805152162909508,0.01087780669331551,-0.0785532221198082,0.04207728058099747,0.03775304555892944,0.003836919320747256,-0.02124029025435448,-0.00091721978969872,0.02013122290372849,-0.004080577753484249,0.05825395882129669,0.06551329791545868,0.03952306881546974,-0.000197797387954779,0.01958229206502438,-0.01671440526843071,-0.04333198443055153,0.008738094009459019,0.01664718799293041,0.006206287071108818,0.002545810071751475,0.0240185558795929,-0.03470591455698013,0.002898694481700659,-0.002517803339287639,-0.006256699096411467,0.00733775831758976,-0.00700167752802372,-0.02292069233953953,0.03342881053686142,-0.01727453991770744,-0.00