cmn2wa8hy008jjc3ozenlvb3e	ae-audit-management-response	internal-audit	Findings	audit	{Auditee}	How do I provide a management response to a finding?	How do I provide a management response to a finding?\nManagement response as Auditee\nRespond to audit finding\nReply to finding\nHow to submit management response\nAuditee response to finding\nAnswer to audit finding\nAs an Auditee, you are expected to provide management responses to findings assigned to you. This is your opportunity to acknowledge the finding and outline your planned corrective actions.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → Findings** (via Fieldwork)\nLocate the finding assigned to you\nClick on the finding to open its detail view\nLook for the **Management Response** section\nEnter your response — acknowledge the finding and describe your planned corrective actions\nInclude a **target completion date** for your remediation plan\nClick **Save** or **Submit** to record your management response\nA management response should be professional, factual, and actionable\nInclude specific steps you plan to take to address the finding\nYour response becomes part of the formal audit record and may appear in the final audit report\nIf you disagree with a finding, state your position clearly with supporting evidence\nmanagement response\nrespond\nfinding\nreply\nauditee response\nanswer	{-0.01023396477103233,0.04572933912277222,0.0467645525932312,-0.001258850912563503,-0.03139391168951988,-0.01906139217317104,-0.0310338381677866,-0.03344183042645454,-0.01315393671393394,0.03274418786168098,0.04842989146709442,-0.01712599769234657,-0.006982050836086273,-0.0529308095574379,0.01647336408495903,-0.03161895647644997,0.01023396477103233,-0.003907360602170229,-0.02799571864306927,0.05414605885744095,0.02576776221394539,0.04102588072419167,0.001679405453614891,0.03337431699037552,-0.008129785768687725,-0.02799571864306927,-0.0615275651216507,0.003128138836473227,-0.02471004612743855,-0.007803468964993954,0.002426276681