cmn2wa8ic008kjc3oetmfcwqq	ae-audit-overdue-capa	internal-audit	CAPA Tracking	audit	{Auditee}	What happens if my CAPA items are overdue?	What happens if my CAPA items are overdue?\nOverdue CAPA consequences\nCAPA past due date\nLate CAPA actions\nCAPA escalation for Auditee\nWhat if I miss CAPA deadline\nOverdue corrective actions\nOverdue CAPA items may be escalated according to your organization's escalation policies. It is important to update your progress regularly and communicate any delays to the audit team.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Internal Audit → CAPA Tracking**\nUse the **filter by status** to identify any overdue items assigned to you\nFor each overdue item, **add a comment** explaining the delay and revised timeline\nUpdate the **completion percentage** to reflect any partial progress\nUpload any **partial evidence** to demonstrate ongoing effort\nContact your audit team directly if you need a deadline extension\nOverdue CAPA items are visible to the Audit Head and may trigger escalation\nThe organization may have automatic escalation policies for overdue items\nProactive communication about delays is always better than silent non-compliance\nYou cannot change the due date yourself — request an extension from the audit team\noverdue\nlate\ndeadline\nescalation\ndue date\ncapa\nmissed	{0.01285756938159466,0.04013010486960411,0.06886345148086548,-0.005299974698573351,-0.03822259604930878,-0.008680368773639202,-0.03143766149878502,-0.0521063543856144,-0.00354035897180438,-0.01082329638302326,0.0581427738070488,-0.01012910902500153,-0.01767463050782681,-0.01807303354144096,-0.0011506921146065,-0.01889398694038391,0.009314192458987236,-0.00229082047007978,-0.04239979758858681,0.03754651546478271,0.01540493778884411,0.02290216833353043,0.0110466443002224,0.04421072080731392,-0.02419396117329597,-0.02258827351033688,-0.0002135382674168795,0.01832656376063824,-0.01929238997399807,0.01283342391252518,0.0354216992855072,-0.02161037549376488,-0.07108484953641891,0.0