cmn2wa8qa008mjc3or8vinsmg	ae-audit-language	internal-audit	Settings	audit	{Auditee}	How do I change the language as an Auditee?	How do I change the language as an Auditee?\nAuditee language settings\nSwitch to Arabic as Auditee\nChange language in audit module\nRTL layout for Auditee\nAuditee Latvian language\nYou can switch the application language between English, Arabic (RTL), and Latvian using the language selector in the header. This changes all labels, buttons, and system text.\nLook for the **globe icon** in the top bar\nClick the globe icon to open the language dropdown\nSelect your preferred language: **English**, **Arabic**, or **Latvian**\nThe interface will update immediately — Arabic mode switches to right-to-left (RTL) layout\nYour language preference is saved automatically\nUser-entered data (finding descriptions, CAPA details) is also translated dynamically when records are created or edited\nAll system text including buttons, labels, and status badges will be translated\nlanguage\narabic\nlatvian\nenglish\nswitch\nrtl\ntranslate	{-0.08343505859375,0.001893043518066406,0.038360595703125,-0.029327392578125,-0.039306640625,-0.01861572265625,-0.04180908203125,-0.031463623046875,-0.022064208984375,-0.021209716796875,-0.0241546630859375,-0.053497314453125,0.00213623046875,0.031585693359375,0.055206298828125,-0.007190704345703125,0.006984710693359375,-0.017364501953125,-0.038665771484375,0.01421356201171875,-0.03436279296875,0.01206207275390625,-0.0002220869064331055,0.0267181396484375,0.0228424072265625,-0.035491943359375,-0.01038360595703125,-0.0052490234375,-0.01528167724609375,0.01084136962890625,0.001706123352050781,-0.03271484375,0.044158935546875,0.02960205078125,-0.04376220703125,-0.012603759765625,0.049072265625,-0.032958984375,0.04547119140625,-0.056854248046875,-0.06292724609375,-0.00098419189453125,-0.0192413330078125,0.003480911254882812,0.007411956787109375,0.06640625,0.0079345703125,0.045623779296875,-0.00412750244140625,0.00982666015625,-0.