cmn2wa8r4008ojc3otnnwtbig	co-no-access	general	Roles & Access	grc	{Contributor}	What modules are NOT accessible to the Contributor?	What modules are NOT accessible to the Contributor?\nWhat can't I access as Contributor?\nWhy don't I see Internal Audit?\nWhy can't I access GRC Administration?\nWhat is restricted for the Contributor role?\nWhy can't I see Organization Profile?\nWhy can't I manage users?\nWhy is BIA not visible?\nWhat modules are hidden for Contributor?\nAs a Contributor, you do not have access to Internal Audit, GRC Administration, or several Organization sub-modules (Profile, Context, Users, BIA, Settings). Your access focuses on actively contributing to Compliance, Risk Management, and Asset Management across the entire organization.\n**Internal Audit** (dashboard, universe, planning, fieldwork, findings, CAPA, reports, settings) is not accessible — managed by Audit Head, Audit Manager, Auditor, and Auditee roles\n**GRC Administration** (customer accounts, compliance master data, email settings, configuration) is not accessible — managed by GRC Administrator only\n**Organization Profile** (company identity, logo, branches, data centers) is not accessible — managed by Customer Administrator\n**Organization Context** (internal/external factors, stakeholders) is not accessible — managed by Customer Administrator\n**Organization Users** (user accounts, role assignment) is not accessible — managed by Customer Administrator\n**Business Impact Analysis (BIA)** is not accessible — managed by Customer Administrator\n**Organization Settings** (BIA categories, methodology, BCP labels) is not accessible — managed by Customer Administrator\nIf you need changes in restricted areas, contact your Customer Administrator or GRC Administrator\nThis is by design — the Contributor role focuses on hands-on data contribution rather than administration or audit\nMenu items for restricted modules are hidden from your sidebar; restricted pages cannot be accessed even by direct URL\nUnlike the Reviewer role which can view Internal Audit data, the Contributor role has no Internal Audit visibility\nYou DO have access to Organization → Process (view, create, edit) — this is the only Organization sub-module available to you\nno access\nrestricted\nunavailable\ninternal audit\nadministration\nhidden\nnot accessible\norganization profile\nusers\nbia	{0.00247955322265625,0.049407958984375,0.07672119140625,0.034088134765625,-0.015411376953125,-0.0140533447265625,-0.0152130126953125,0.0262451171875,0.0177001953125,0.004085540771484375,0.022247314453125,-0.01209259033203125,0.019805908203125,0.005718231201171875,-0.00894927978515625,0.02587890625,-0.01026153564453125,-0.004787445068359375,-0.03564453125,0.07293701171875,0.080322265625,0.01812744140625,-0.01947021484375,0.03717041015625,-0.007244110107421875,-0.00884246826171875,-0.049102783203125,0.03265380859375,0.003925323486328125,-0.0255126953125,0.056549072265625,-0.0124053955078125,-0.03082275390625,-0.0244293212890625,-0.001280784606933594,0.001359939575195312,0.0142059326171875,0.00669097900390625,0.056060791015625,0.0297393798828125,-0.011322021484375,0.0107421875,-0.03936767578125,-0.004444122314453125,-0.00734710693359375,0.0307769775390625,0.0130157470703125,-0.01226043701171875,0.010101318359375,-0.001032829284667969,-0.038482666015625,0.030853271484375,0.008697509765625,-0.01215362548828125,-0.0305938720703125,-0.0064697265625,-0.0237884521484375,0.0003807544708251953,-0.0872802734375,0.001338005065917969,-0.0294342041015625,-0.0501708984375,-0.0187530517578125,-0.00931549072265625,-0.00738525390625,-0.047576904296875,-0.01319122314453125,0.001585960388183594,-0.00899505615234375,-0.0229644775390625,-0.0269622802734375,0.00464630126953125,-0.003307342529296875,-0.0307769775390625,-0.002254486083984375,-0.00043487548828125,0.0863037109375,0.00847625732421875,-0.0253753662109375,-0.020416259765625,0.0002603530883789062,0.06439208984375,-0.054595947265625,-0.012481689453125,-0.0149459