cmn2wa8tj008ujc3oiu1sjnzf	co-comp-evidence	compliance	Evidence Management	grc	{Contributor}	How do I manage evidence as a Contributor?	How do I manage evidence as a Contributor?\nHow to upload evidence?\nHow to create an evidence item?\nHow to submit evidence for a control?\nHow to link evidence to controls?\nHow to track evidence status?\nWhere do I manage compliance evidence?\nHow to respond to evidence requests?\nHow does evidence review work?\nCreate, upload, and manage evidence items demonstrating compliance with controls. Link evidence to specific controls and frameworks, track submission status, and respond to evidence collection requests across the organization.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Evidence**\nView all evidence items with status (Pending, Submitted, Approved, Rejected) and due dates\nClick **Create** to add a new evidence item — specify title, description, and linked control\n**Upload evidence files** (documents, screenshots, exports) to support the evidence item\n**Link evidence to specific controls and frameworks** to demonstrate compliance\n**Set evidence collection due dates** to ensure timely submission\n**Track status** as evidence moves through the workflow: Pending → Submitted → Approved/Rejected\nUse **AI-powered evidence suggestions** for guidance on what evidence to collect\nFilter evidence by **status**, **assignee**, or **control** to find specific items\nAs a Contributor you can create and edit evidence items organization-wide — you are not limited to a single department\nEvidence approval/rejection is typically handled by Reviewers or Administrators — your role focuses on creating and submitting evidence\nEvidence versioning allows you to update evidence without losing previous submissions\nEvidence items directly impact the evidence percentage shown on framework cards\nDue dates trigger notifications to help ensure timely evidence collection\nevidence\nupload\nsubmit\ncompliance\ncontrol\nstatus\napproved\nrejected\npending	