cmn2wa8ri008pjc3oklpyuho1	co-org-processes	organization	Business Processes	grc	{Contributor}	How do I manage business processes as a Contributor?	How do I manage business processes as a Contributor?\nHow to create a business process?\nHow to edit a process?\nWhere do I view business processes?\nHow to link processes to risks?\nHow to link processes to controls?\nCan I create processes as a Contributor?\nHow to classify process criticality?\nView, create, and edit business processes across the organization. Processes can be linked to risks, controls, and assets for comprehensive traceability. This is the only Organization sub-module accessible to the Contributor role.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Organization → Process**\nView all business processes with filtering and search capabilities\nClick **Create** to add a new process — enter name, code, owner, department, and description\n**Edit** existing processes by clicking on them and modifying the details\n**Link processes to risks and controls** for traceability across modules\n**Classify process criticality** to prioritize based on business importance\nTrack **process KPIs** to monitor performance\nUse **export** to download process data for offline analysis\nThis is the only Organization page you can access — Profile, Context, Users, BIA, and Settings are restricted\nYour access is organization-wide — you can view and edit processes across all departments\nProcess hierarchy support allows organizing processes in parent-child relationships\nProcesses linked to risks and controls provide cross-module traceability used in compliance and risk management\nbusiness process\nprocess\ncreate\nedit\nKPI\nBIA\ncriticality\nlink\norganization	{-0.004360198974609375,0.039031982421875,0.07098388671875,0.02130126953125,-0.0244293212890625,-0.03021240234375,-0.01166534423828125,0.038787841796875,0.003667831420898438,0.048675537109375,0.03289794921875,-0.01502227783203125,0.02001953125,-0.0260772705078125,0.01444244384765625,0.01683044