cmn2wa8rx008qjc3o1amfl28i	co-comp-dashboard	compliance	Compliance Dashboard	grc	{Contributor}	How do I use the Compliance Dashboard as a Contributor?	How do I use the Compliance Dashboard as a Contributor?\nWhere is the compliance dashboard?\nHow to view compliance metrics?\nHow to check compliance status?\nCompliance overview for Contributor\nHow to see framework coverage?\nView the Compliance Dashboard for an organization-wide summary of compliance metrics, framework coverage, control status distribution, and evidence collection progress.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Dashboard**\nView **compliance percentage** across adopted frameworks\nReview **control status distribution** — Compliant, Partially Compliant, Non-Compliant, Not Assessed\nCheck **evidence collection progress** to see what is pending or submitted\nMonitor **policy coverage** and governance document status\nUse the dashboard as a starting point to identify areas needing your contribution\nThe dashboard provides a read-only overview — use it to identify where to focus your contribution efforts\nData reflects the entire organization, not just one department\nCharts and metrics update in real-time as records are created or updated\ncompliance\ndashboard\nmetrics\nstatus\noverview\nframework\ncoverage	{0.056915283203125,0.01265716552734375,0.043182373046875,0.01535797119140625,0.01416778564453125,-0.003198623657226562,-0.04107666015625,0.006488800048828125,0.048797607421875,0.06097412109375,0.045440673828125,0.0071868896484375,0.0273284912109375,-0.0220947265625,0.0304107666015625,0.00811004638671875,0.011322021484375,-0.00782012939453125,0.0224609375,0.08013916015625,0.01904296875,0.018829345703125,0.02362060546875,0.0655517578125,-0.033447265625,-0.0198516845703125,-0.043914794921875,0.03277587890625,-0.01214599609375,-0.0181427001953125,0.0273590087890625,-0.0158538818359375,-0.01959228515625,-0.005039215087890625,0.009033203125,0.01064300537109375,-0.01629638671875,0.0207061767578125,-0.00068