cmn2wa8sb008rjc3o6u7ut2sx	co-comp-frameworks	compliance	Framework Selection	grc	{Contributor}	How do I browse compliance frameworks as a Contributor?	How do I browse compliance frameworks as a Contributor?\nHow do I view frameworks?\nWhere can I see adopted frameworks?\nHow to check framework compliance percentage?\nHow to view ISO 27001 or NIST framework?\nWhere are compliance frameworks listed?\nHow to track framework compliance?\nBrowse and view adopted compliance frameworks (ISO 27001, NIST, SOC 2, GDPR, etc.) from the Frameworks page. You can see compliance percentage, policy percentage, and evidence percentage per framework across the entire organization.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Frameworks**\nBrowse available frameworks displayed in a cards/grid view\nView framework details including code, name, description, type, status, country, and industry\nCheck **compliance percentage**, **policy percentage**, and **evidence percentage** for each framework\nClick on a framework to view its full details and associated controls\nUse pagination to browse through a large number of frameworks\nAs a Contributor you have view-only access to frameworks — framework adoption, import, and management are handled by administrators\nYour view is organization-wide — you see framework data across all departments, unlike the Department Contributor who sees only their department's data\nCustom vs. standard framework differentiation is visible in the framework cards\nUse framework insights to understand which controls need evidence or attention\nframework\ncompliance\nISO 27001\nNIST\nSOC 2\nGDPR\nadopt\nbrowse\ncompliance percentage	{-0.019287109375,0.001782417297363281,0.046112060546875,-0.0272369384765625,0.03009033203125,-0.034912109375,-0.0423583984375,-0.021514892578125,0.039581298828125,0.06390380859375,0.047454833984375,0.0117950439453125,0.001505851745605469,0.0020294189453125,0.052581787109375,0.0003950595855712891,-0.01328277587890625,-0.012725830078125,0.009933471