cmn2wa92r008wjc3ogavi2y4i	co-comp-kpis	compliance	KPIs	grc	{Contributor}	How do I manage compliance KPIs as a Contributor?	How do I manage compliance KPIs as a Contributor?\nHow to create a compliance KPI?\nHow to update KPI scores?\nHow to track KPI status?\nWhere do I manage compliance metrics?\nHow to set KPI targets?\nHow to link KPIs to evidence?\nHow to view KPI health?\nDefine and track Key Performance Indicators for compliance programs across the organization. Create KPIs with targets and thresholds, update actual scores, link KPIs to evidence, and monitor compliance health.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → KPIs**\nView compliance KPIs with current values and targets\nClick **Create** to add a new KPI — enter code, objective, description, expected score, and actual score\n**Associate a department** with each KPI for organizational alignment\n**Link evidence** to KPIs to support measured performance claims\n**Set review dates** to ensure regular KPI assessment\nUpdate **actual scores** as new measurement data becomes available\nMonitor KPI **status**: Scheduled, Missed, Overdue, or Achieved\nUse **filters** to view KPIs by status or department\nYour access is organization-wide — you can create and edit KPIs across all departments\nVisual indicators show KPI health at a glance — green for achieved, red for missed/overdue\nRegular KPI updates help provide accurate compliance health metrics to stakeholders\nKPI evidence linkage creates a traceable connection between measured performance and supporting documentation\nKPI\ncompliance\nmetric\ntarget\nscore\nstatus\ncreate\nedit\nperformance	{0.02618408203125,0.054595947265625,0.040191650390625,-0.0147552490234375,-0.0005526542663574219,-0.00968170166015625,-0.023468017578125,-0.01009368896484375,0.0494384765625,0.04949951171875,0.0621337890625,0.01092529296875,-0.00586700439453125,-0.05267333984375,0.0305633544921875,-0.018707275390625,0.0007257461547851562,-0.00433349609375,0.00603485107421875,0.058654785156