cmn2wa935008xjc3ofgp0fnw2	co-comp-risk-matrix	compliance	Risk Matrix	grc	{Contributor}	How do I view the Compliance Risk Matrix as a Contributor?	How do I view the Compliance Risk Matrix as a Contributor?\nWhere is the risk-control matrix?\nHow to see which controls mitigate which risks?\nHow to identify unmitigated risks?\nHow to view control effectiveness per risk?\nWhere do I see risk and control mappings?\nView the mapping between risks and controls to understand coverage and identify gaps. The matrix shows which controls mitigate which risks and highlights unmitigated risk areas across the organization.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Compliance → Risk Matrix**\nView the matrix of risks vs. controls across the organization\nIdentify **unmitigated risks** (gaps) — risks without adequate control coverage\nReview **control effectiveness** per risk using status indicators (Compliant, Non-Compliant, Partial, N/A)\nUse **collapsible risk groups** to organize the view\nCheck the **residual risk assessment** view to see risk levels after controls are applied\nUse **search and filter** to focus on specific risk-control relationships\nThe Compliance Risk Matrix is view-only for the Contributor role — use Risk Management → Risk Control Matrix for edit capabilities\nOrganization-wide visibility lets you see all risk-control mappings, not just your department's\nGaps highlighted in the matrix indicate areas where additional controls may be needed\nrisk matrix\ncontrol\nmapping\ngap\nunmitigated\ncompliance\neffectiveness	{0.0221710205078125,0.065673828125,0.057098388671875,0.0279693603515625,-0.0264129638671875,-0.0303192138671875,0.002618789672851562,-0.0232696533203125,0.04254150390625,0.0455322265625,0.0097808837890625,0.001886367797851562,0.0307769775390625,-0.005645751953125,0.019989013671875,-0.045440673828125,0.004940032958984375,-0.0211639404296875,0.005710601806640625,0.05859375,0.048797607421875,0.0230560302734375,-0.0055694580078125,0.056396484375,-0.01898193359375,0.00