cmn2wa93j008yjc3obb3rzhu6	co-risk-dashboard	risk-management	Risk Dashboard	grc	{Contributor}	How do I use the Risk Dashboard as a Contributor?	How do I use the Risk Dashboard as a Contributor?\nWhere is the risk dashboard?\nHow to see risk statistics?\nHow to view risk breakdown by category?\nHow to check risk status summary?\nWhat charts are on the risk dashboard?\nHow to see risk analytics?\nView the Risk Dashboard for an organization-wide summary of risk statistics and analytics, including total risks, status breakdown, risk by strategy, risk by rating, and risk by category.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Dashboard**\nView **summary metrics**: total risks and status breakdown across the organization\nReview the **Risk by Status** chart to see how many risks are open, in-progress, or completed\nCheck the **Risk by Strategy** chart (Mitigate, Accept, Transfer, Avoid) to understand treatment approaches\nAnalyze the **Risk by Rating** chart to see the distribution of risk severity\nReview the **Risk by Category** chart (Strategic, Operational, Financial, Compliance, Technology)\nDashboard data is organization-wide — you see risks from all departments, not just one\nCharts update in real-time as risks are created, edited, or their status changes\nCategory names are translated based on your selected language\nUse the dashboard to identify high-priority areas before diving into the Risk Register\nrisk\ndashboard\nstatistics\nchart\ncategory\nstatus\nrating\nstrategy\nanalytics	{0.0280914306640625,0.0333251953125,0.0438232421875,0.031463623046875,-0.0177764892578125,-0.0172119140625,-0.05059814453125,0.003749847412109375,0.037567138671875,0.048797607421875,-0.0084228515625,0.006114959716796875,0.0109710693359375,-0.0195465087890625,0.016021728515625,-0.0223846435546875,-0.01543426513671875,0.0246429443359375,-0.03436279296875,0.057464599609375,0.005687713623046875,0.01171112060546875,0.011505126953125,0.0408935546875,-0.0391845703125,0.0401611328125,-2.592802