cmn2wa93w008zjc3ot8kguigo	co-risk-register	risk-management	Risk Register	grc	{Contributor}	How do I create and manage risks in the Risk Register as a Contributor?	How do I create and manage risks in the Risk Register as a Contributor?\nHow to create a new risk?\nHow to edit a risk?\nHow to add a risk to the register?\nHow to assign risk owners?\nHow to set risk ratings?\nCan I import risks from Excel?\nHow to categorize a risk?\nWhere do I manage risks?\nHow to use AI risk suggestions?\nCreate, edit, and manage risks across the entire organization in the Risk Register. Add new risks, set inherent and residual ratings, assign owners, categorize risks, and link them to controls and processes.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Risk Register**\nView all risks across the organization with severity indicators and status\nClick **Create** to add a new risk\nEnter risk details: **name**, **description**, **risk sources**, **category**, and **type**\nSet **risk scoring**: likelihood (1-5) x impact (1-5) = risk score\nSet **inherent risk rating** (before controls) and **residual risk rating** (after controls)\n**Assign a risk owner** with contact information and department\nCategorize the risk: Strategic, Operational, Financial, Compliance, or Technology\nSet the **status**: Open, In-Progress, Completed, Mitigate, Accept, Transfer, or Avoid\n**Link the risk to controls and processes** for traceability\nUse **AI-powered risk suggestions** for help identifying additional risk factors\nClick **Save** to submit the risk\nYour access is organization-wide — you can create and edit risks across all departments, unlike the Department Contributor who is limited to their department's risks\nRisk scores are automatically calculated from likelihood x impact\nRating badges use color coding: Critical (red), High (orange), Medium (yellow), Low (green)\nBulk import/export via Excel is available for efficient data management\nUse search, filters, and pagination to navigate large risk