cmn2wa94z0092jc3ocd97a85u	co-risk-control-matrix	risk-management	Risk Control Matrix	grc	{Contributor}	How do I use the Risk Control Matrix as a Contributor?	How do I use the Risk Control Matrix as a Contributor?\nWhere is the risk control matrix?\nHow to map controls to risks?\nHow to link controls and risks?\nHow to identify unmitigated risks?\nHow to view control effectiveness for risks?\nHow to use the risk-control mapping?\nMap relationships between risks and controls in the Risk Control Matrix. Link and unlink controls to risks, identify coverage gaps, and view control effectiveness — with full create and edit access across the organization.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Risk Control Matrix**\nView the matrix of risks vs. controls across the organization\n**Link controls to risks** by selecting a risk and associating relevant controls\n**Unlink controls** that are no longer relevant to a specific risk\nIdentify **unmitigated risks** — risks without adequate control coverage\nReview **control effectiveness** per risk using status indicators\nView **residual risk calculation** showing risk levels after controls\nUse **collapsible risk groups** to organize the matrix view\nUse **search and filter** to focus on specific relationships\nAs a Contributor you can create and edit risk-control mappings — this is a key capability for actively managing risk coverage\nYour access is organization-wide — you see and manage mappings across all departments\nGaps in the matrix highlight areas where additional controls or risk treatment may be needed\nChanges to the risk control matrix affect residual risk calculations and compliance metrics\nrisk control matrix\nmapping\ncontrol\nrisk\ngap\nunmitigated\nlink\neffectiveness	{0.01345062255859375,0.05975341796875,0.043426513671875,0.0274505615234375,-0.037200927734375,-0.042816162109375,-0.002786636352539062,0.005107879638671875,0.01513671875,0.05419921875,-0.0009412765502929688,-0.01383209228515625,0.02056884765625,-