cmn2wa95c0093jc3o3o9v41ae	co-risk-settings	risk-management	Risk Settings	grc	{Contributor}	How do I view risk settings as a Contributor?	How do I view risk settings as a Contributor?\nWhere are risk categories configured?\nHow to view risk rating thresholds?\nWhere do I see risk type definitions?\nHow to check risk assessment criteria?\nWhere is the risk matrix configuration?\nView risk configuration settings including risk categories, types, thresholds, and the rating matrix. These settings are view-only for the Contributor role — configuration changes are made by administrators.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → Risk Management → Settings**\nView **risk categories** (Strategic, Operational, Financial, Compliance, Technology)\nView **risk type definitions** used for classifying risks\nReview **risk rating matrix** customization including likelihood and impact scales\nCheck **threshold configuration** that determines risk severity boundaries\nRisk settings are view-only for the Contributor role — you can see the configuration but cannot modify it\nUnderstanding these settings helps you correctly categorize and score risks in the Risk Register and Assessment pages\nContact your Customer Administrator or GRC Administrator to request changes to risk settings\nrisk settings\ncategory\ntype\nthreshold\nrating\nmatrix\nconfiguration\nview	{-0.00989532470703125,0.0182342529296875,0.04974365234375,0.001506805419921875,-0.036834716796875,-0.0269622802734375,-0.00936126708984375,-0.001729965209960938,0.035247802734375,0.035430908203125,0.0003423690795898438,0.01557159423828125,0.032501220703125,0.009735107421875,0.0341796875,-0.00868988037109375,-0.001735687255859375,0.0052490234375,-0.0140533447265625,0.07879638671875,0.0350341796875,0.018310546875,-0.007617950439453125,0.0518798828125,-0.0196990966796875,0.018890380859375,-0.004486083984375,-0.003213882446289062,-0.0285186767578125,0.0175933837890625,0.02923583984375,-0.001833915710449219,0.004058837890625,-0.004871368408203125,-0.0