cmn2wa9de0099jc3ozw6twea6	tprm-rm-dashboard	tprm	Dashboard	tprm	{}	How do I use the Relationship Manager Dashboard?	How do I use the Relationship Manager Dashboard?\nRM Dashboard overview\nWhat charts are on the RM Dashboard?\nHow to see vendor criticality distribution\nWhere do I see assessment status for my vendors?\nRelationship Manager home page\nRM vendor risk overview\nThe RM Dashboard shows vendor criticality distribution and assessment status across all vendors managed by the Relationship Manager through two interactive bar charts.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → RM → Dashboard**\nView the **Vendor Criticality** bar chart showing distribution across Nominal, Low, Moderate, High, and Critical levels with color coding\nView the **Assessment Status** bar chart showing counts of Initiated, In Progress, and Completed assessments\nHover over chart bars to see interactive tooltips with exact vendor/assessment counts\nThe dashboard auto-refreshes data on page load\nA 'No Data to Display' message appears when no vendors exist in the system\nCriticality levels are color-coded for quick visual identification\nThis dashboard is available to Relationship Managers and TPRM Administrators\nrm\ndashboard\nrelationship manager\ncriticality\nassessment status\nchart\nvendor	{-0.02585490606725216,0.03618256002664566,0.05590765923261642,0.02814464084804058,0.003950386308133602,0.009618072770535946,-0.006749943364411592,-0.009129120036959648,0.007399893831461668,0.0200828704982996,0.002344889799132943,-0.02900329045951366,-0.03095910511910915,0.007477410603314638,0.04679642617702484,-0.008836939930915833,-0.01259353384375572,0.02252763882279396,-0.04338567703962326,0.08395688980817795,0.04758352413773537,0.0391162782907486,0.01390536036342382,0.007924624718725681,-0.01373840030282736,0.0597715824842453,0.00186189915984869,0.03422674536705017,0.01145462971180677,-0.01655286550521851,0.01256968267261982,-0.04634325206279755,0.02602186612784863,0.03155538812279701,0.003828148124739