cmn2wa9e4009bjc3oppx3af61	tprm-assessor-dashboard	tprm	Dashboard	tprm	{}	How do I use the Assessor Dashboard?	How do I use the Assessor Dashboard?\nAssessor Dashboard overview\nWhat charts are on the Assessor Dashboard?\nAssessor analytics page\nHow to see issue status and risk distribution\nAssessor home page with charts\nWhere do I see top 5 vendors by severity?\nAssessor dashboard domain distribution\nThe Assessor Dashboard is the most comprehensive dashboard with 6 analytical charts covering issue status, assessment progress, inherent risk, assessment results, top 5 vendors by severity, and domain distribution.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Dashboard**\nView the **Issue Status** bar chart showing Open, Overdue, and Closed issue counts\nView the **Assessment Progress** bar chart showing Initiated, In Progress, and Completed assessments\nView the **Inherent Risk** pie chart showing High, Medium, and Low risk distribution (mapped from VRR levels)\nView the **Assessment Result** pie chart showing Satisfactory, Unsatisfactory, and Deficient outcomes\nView the **Top 5 Vendors** stacked bar chart showing vendor severity breakdown (High, Medium, Low)\nView the **Domain Distribution** horizontal bar chart showing top 10 domains by issue count\nEach chart has its own empty state handling when no data exists\nDomain names strip the 'CUST.' prefix for cleaner display\nThe Approver Dashboard uses the same layout as the Assessor Dashboard\nThis dashboard is also available to TPRM Auditors in read-only mode\nassessor\ndashboard\nissue status\nassessment progress\ninherent risk\ntop vendors\ndomain\nchart\nanalytics	{0.0004701402503997087,0.02087276801466942,0.06412404775619507,0.03315239399671555,0.0001057714180205949,0.01754974015057087,-0.04130419343709946,-0.04145996272563934,0.04044747725129128,0.02689575403928757,0.03406103327870369,-0.04948195815086365,0.004724930040538311,-0.02502655237913132,0.04576951265335083,-0.02209294214844704,0.001830261317081749,-0.