cmn2wa9eh009cjc3oqlzmus4s	tprm-program-monitor	tprm	Program Monitor	tprm	{}	How do I use the Program Monitor?	How do I use the Program Monitor?\nWhat is the Program Monitor?\nExecutive overview of TPRM program\nHow to see assessment and vendor quotas\nProgram Monitor progress rings\nTPRM program summary page\nWhere do I see vendor totals and assessment totals?\nThe Program Monitor provides an executive summary view with circular progress rings showing assessment and vendor totals with detailed breakdowns by type, giving a high-level view of TPRM program utilization.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Program Monitor**\nView the **Total Assessments** summary with a circular progress ring showing usage percentage\nReview the assessment breakdown: Assessment Factory, Onboarding, Periodic, On-Demand\nView the **Total Vendors** summary with a circular progress ring showing vendor capacity usage\nReview the vendor breakdown: Onboarding, Onboarded, Offboarding, Offboarded\nMonitor color coding: green (<70% usage), amber (70-90%), red (>90%)\nEach category is shown in a 2×2 breakdown grid with icons\nUsage percentages are color-coded to indicate capacity concerns\nAvailable to TPRM Administrators and roles with program oversight permissions\nprogram monitor\nexecutive\noverview\nquota\nprogress\nassessment total\nvendor total\nsummary	{-0.03552781045436859,0.0473618395626545,0.07537761330604553,0.01750664412975311,0.01063133031129837,0.002230135491117835,0.002300882479175925,0.008463902398943901,0.03668548911809921,-0.002384492428973317,0.05711204931139946,-0.0185228269547224,-0.029893783852458,-0.001255757641047239,0.0419078953564167,-0.01158962957561016,-0.01980913430452347,0.001291934982873499,-0.04080167040228844,0.09179089963436127,0.059787567704916,0.04342573881149292,-0.02481286972761154,0.01252863369882107,-0.006228943821042776,0.004219088237732649,-0.03413859754800797,0.03357262164354324,-0.01214917376637459,-0.01955187320709229,0.04352864250540733,-0.0245298817753791