cmn2wa9ev009djc3oqrunjcff	tprm-control-center	tprm	Control Center	tprm	{}	How do I configure the Control Center?	How do I configure the Control Center?\nWhat is the TPRM Control Center?\nHow to set due diligence parameters\nHow to configure scorecard thresholds\nControl Center due diligence settings\nTPRM risk parameter configuration\nWhere do I set VRR cadence and remediation timelines?\nHow to edit scorecard score categories\nThe Control Center is the configuration hub for TPRM risk parameters, featuring two tabs: Due Diligence settings for VRR-based parameters and Scorecard settings for security score thresholds. Changes auto-save with debounced updates.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Control Center**\nSelect the **Due Diligence** tab to configure VRR-based parameters\nEdit the matrix: VRR levels (Critical, High, Moderate, Low, Nominal) × parameters (VRR, Cadence, Remediation, Reminder, Due Date)\nSelect the **Scorecard** tab to configure security score thresholds\nEdit score categories: Excellent, Good, Moderate, Low, Nominal with corresponding Security Score threshold values\nChanges auto-save with an 800ms debounce — watch for the save status indicator\nAll matrix cells support in-line editing\nColored category headers provide visual differentiation between risk levels\nChanges affect how vendors are categorized across the entire TPRM module\nOnly TPRM Administrators can modify Control Center settings\ncontrol center\ndue diligence\nscorecard\nvrr\ncadence\nremediation\nthreshold\nconfiguration\nmatrix	{-0.02600260265171528,0.05336186289787292,0.06944076716899872,0.003649157704785466,-0.0161793977022171,0.004826811607927084,0.003291150787845254,0.04007164388895035,-0.01126151345670223,0.03564994409680367,-8.047302981140092e-05,-0.0003220883954782039,0.04351353645324707,0.004839373286813498,0.02904252149164677,-0.03514748066663742,0.01418209634721279,-0.002820088993757963,9.872666851151735e-05,0.08516794443130493,0.01989764347672462,0.02962035685777664,-0.0307