cmn2wa9f8009ejc3ommhr99hm	tprm-vendor-management-admin	tprm	Vendor Management	tprm	{}	How do I manage vendors as an Administrator?	How do I manage vendors as an Administrator?\nAdmin vendor management\nHow to create a vendor in TPRM\nHow to add a new vendor\nVendor Management admin page\nHow to edit or delete a vendor\nHow to export vendor data\nVendor accordion details view\nThe Vendor Management page provides full CRUD capabilities with an accordion-based UI showing vendor details, risk profiles, security monitoring scores, and contract information. Supports creating vendors with 25+ fields across 6 sections.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Vendor Management**\nClick **Create Vendor** to open the multi-section form\nFill in vendor details across 6 sections: Info, Contact, Service Category, Department, Risk Profile, Contract Dates, and Certifications\nSet the **Vendor Risk Profile** toggles: Access to Network, Cloud, Access to Data, PII\nOptionally enable **Trigger Monitoring Scan** to run an automated security scan on creation\nClick **Save** to create the vendor\nClick any vendor row to expand the **accordion** and see full details including Security Monitoring scores (Overall Score, Security Posture, Threat Exposure)\nUse the **Export** button to download individual vendor or bulk CSV export\nUse the **Edit** or **Delete** buttons on each vendor record to modify or remove\nDynamic translation support translates vendor data when records are created or edited\nSecurity Monitoring displays Overall Score, Security Posture, and Threat Exposure for scanned vendors\nOnly TPRM Administrators have full vendor management capabilities\nvendor\nadmin\ncreate\nedit\ndelete\nexport\naccordion\nrisk profile\nsecurity monitoring\ncsv	{-0.07034219056367874,0.03758363798260689,0.05979322642087936,-0.01202723756432533,-0.01467630453407764,-0.02223324216902256,-0.02391256019473076,0.0175264161080122,0.01351733785122633,0.02481135167181492,4.799770977115259e-05,-0.01043070200830698,