cmn2wa9fl009fjc3oo5f2mhse	tprm-rm-vendor-inventory	tprm	Vendor Management	tprm	{}	How do I use the RM Vendor Inventory?	How do I use the RM Vendor Inventory?\nRelationship Manager vendor list\nHow to create a vendor as RM\nRM vendor risk rating view\nHow to initiate an assessment from vendor inventory\nRM vendor search and filter\nWhere do I see vendor VRR?\nThe RM Vendor Inventory lists all vendors with risk ratings (VRR), status, and assessment information. Relationship Managers can create, edit, delete vendors and initiate assessments directly from this page.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → RM → Vendor Inventory**\nView all vendors with their **VRR** (Vendor Risk Rating): Nominal, Low, Moderate, High, Critical\nUse **Search** and **Filter** to find specific vendors\nClick **Create New Vendor** and fill in: name, domain, vendor code, description\nClick a vendor to view details, or use **Edit** to modify\nClick **Initiate Assessment** to start a vendor assessment\nView **Assessment History** per vendor to see past and current assessments\nUse **Delete** to remove a vendor record\nVendor Risk Rating (VRR) is displayed as a color-coded badge\nAssessment initiation creates a new assessment linked to the selected vendor\nrm\nvendor\ninventory\ncreate\nedit\ndelete\nvrr\nrisk rating\nassessment\nrelationship manager	{-0.05986833944916725,0.04550769925117493,0.04279082268476486,0.006264586001634598,-0.03279659524559975,-0.03160795941948891,-0.0006276714848354459,0.004775761626660824,0.001281874952837825,0.03471296280622482,0.004518021829426289,-0.01519753411412239,-0.005078984424471855,0.00545498076826334,0.05069887638092041,-0.01148608513176441,0.00415112217888236,0.0568118505179882,-0.0698140487074852,0.06690311431884766,0.03592585399746895,0.05210583284497261,0.004997114185243845,-0.02969159185886383,-0.01121924910694361,0.03330601006746292,0.0007197754457592964,0.03102577105164528,0.009042108431458473,-0.05176622048020363,0.004411893896758556,-0.03813331946730614,0.0