cmn2wa9m0009gjc3oa2z6ota8	tprm-bo-vendor-inventory	tprm	Vendor Management	tprm	{}	How do I use the BO Vendor Inventory?	How do I use the BO Vendor Inventory?\nBusiness Owner vendor list\nBO vendor management page\nHow to manage vendors as a Business Owner\nBO vendor accordion view\nHow to manage contracts from BO inventory\nBusiness Owner vendor CSV export\nThe BO Vendor Inventory provides a complex UI with nested accordion, create/edit forms, contract management, and CSV bulk export for vendors within the Business Owner's business unit.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → BO → Vendor Inventory**\nView vendors in a **nested accordion** layout with expandable details\nClick **Create Vendor** to open the multi-section dialog form\nUse **Edit** to modify vendor details\nManage contracts: **download** or **upload** contract documents\nSet **Vendor Risk Profile** toggles for each vendor\nView **assessment status** and history for each vendor\nUse the **CSV bulk export** to download all vendor data\nUse **Search** and **Filter** to find specific vendors\nOnly vendors within the Business Owner's business unit are visible\nContract management is integrated directly into the vendor details\nbo\nbusiness owner\nvendor\ninventory\naccordion\ncontract\ncsv\nexport\nrisk profile	{-0.05181884765625,0.0294189453125,0.039825439453125,0.0081634521484375,-0.045013427734375,-0.05902099609375,-0.029541015625,-0.007110595703125,0.0059814453125,0.003589630126953125,0.0198822021484375,-0.020965576171875,0.030609130859375,-0.04217529296875,0.050140380859375,0.01129913330078125,-0.01326751708984375,0.042633056640625,-0.057647705078125,0.03643798828125,0.041412353515625,0.0195465087890625,-0.0029754638671875,-0.003435134887695312,-0.045684814453125,0.004119873046875,-0.062255859375,0.0009641647338867188,-0.003856658935546875,-0.0726318359375,0.03173828125,-0.01849365234375,0.003963470458984375,0.01739501953125,-0.0133819580078125,-0.01464080810546875,0.030181884765625,-0.0151519775390625,0.07574