cmn2wa9mu009ijc3ot4sj7i66	tprm-bo-contracts	tprm	Contract Management	tprm	{}	How do I manage contracts as a Business Owner?	How do I manage contracts as a Business Owner?\nBO contract management\nHow to renew a vendor contract\nHow to start vendor offboarding\nExpiring contracts view\nHow to upload a contract document\nBusiness Owner contract renewal\nWhere do I see expired contracts?\nThe BO Contracts page manages vendor contracts with tabs for expiring contracts and all vendor contracts. Supports offboarding initiation, contract renewal with new dates, and document upload/download.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → BO → Contracts**\nView the **Expiring Contracts** tab to see contracts nearing expiration with action buttons\nView the **All Vendor Contracts** tab for a complete contract listing\nTo renew a contract, click **Renew** and enter new start/end dates in the dialog\nTo start offboarding, click **Start Offboarding** (conditional on assessment status)\nUpload contract files (PDF, Word, Excel) using the upload action\nDownload existing contract documents using the download button\nWatch for date highlighting: **red** for expired, **amber** for expiring soon\nOffboarding can only be initiated when the assessment status permits it\nVendors with offboarding in progress show an 'Offboard Request Submitted' status badge\nDate highlighting helps identify urgent contract renewals at a glance\nbo\ncontract\nexpiring\nrenew\noffboarding\nupload\ndownload\nbusiness owner	{-0.03582763671875,0.041748046875,0.053466796875,0.019805908203125,-0.048828125,-0.004299163818359375,-0.067626953125,-0.0273895263671875,0.037384033203125,0.0228118896484375,0.0316162109375,-0.035186767578125,0.020660400390625,-0.02899169921875,0.02789306640625,-0.00493621826171875,0.0084991455078125,0.033599853515625,-0.027008056640625,0.0369873046875,0.0491943359375,0.0318603515625,-0.007152557373046875,0.00604248046875,-0.0150604248046875,0.021514892578125,-0.0250396728515625,-0.004688262939453125,-0