cmn2wa9nn009kjc3o3sn12r9x	tprm-rm-assessments	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{}	How do I manage assessments as a Relationship Manager?	How do I manage assessments as a Relationship Manager?\nRM assessment management\nHow to create a vendor assessment\nHow to assign an assessor to an assessment\nAssessment lifecycle tracking\nRM assessment status tracking\nHow to initiate a new assessment\nThe RM Assessments page lets Relationship Managers create assessments, assign assessors, and track the full assessment lifecycle from Draft through Completion.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → RM → Assessments**\nView all assessments with their status and assigned assessor\nClick **Create New Assessment** — select the vendor, assessment type, and assign an assessor\nTrack the assessment through its lifecycle: **Draft → In Progress → Submitted → Under Review → Approved/Completed**\nFilter assessments by status, vendor, or assessor using the filter options\nClick any assessment to view its details and results\nAssessment status progression follows a defined workflow\nOnce an assessor is assigned, they receive a notification about the new assessment\nrm\nassessment\ncreate\nassign\nassessor\nlifecycle\nstatus\ndraft\nin progress\nsubmitted\ncompleted	{-0.03485107421875,0.035797119140625,0.07586669921875,0.007965087890625,-0.01383209228515625,-0.0084075927734375,0.005191802978515625,-0.0364990234375,0.0252838134765625,0.032928466796875,0.0277862548828125,-0.062255859375,0.009796142578125,-0.00347900390625,0.01702880859375,0.007762908935546875,-0.016143798828125,0.00978851318359375,-0.0260162353515625,0.070556640625,0.0606689453125,0.04168701171875,0.0119781494140625,-0.0197296142578125,-0.0065460205078125,-0.0034637451171875,-0.029449462890625,0.012847900390625,-0.030059814453125,-0.0305328369140625,0.0194091796875,-0.044036865234375,-0.0103302001953125,0.036865234375,0.0247039794921875,0.03594970703125,-0.0156402587890625,0.032135009765625,0.003263473510742188,0.0157318115234375,-0.00