cmn2wa9o2009ljc3otlin20qk	tprm-bo-assessments	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{}	How do I view assessments as a Business Owner?	How do I view assessments as a Business Owner?\nBO assessment management\nBusiness Owner assessment tabs\nHow to see ongoing assessments\nBO completed assessments view\nBO offboard assessments\nHow to track assessment progress as BO\nThe BO Assessments page provides a tabbed interface with Ongoing, Completed, and Offboard assessment views, each with sub-tab navigation for detailed status filtering.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → BO → Assessments**\nSelect the **Ongoing Assessments** tab to see active assessments\nUse sub-tabs: **Awaiting Response** and **Pending with Assessor** for status filtering\nSelect the **Completed Assessments** tab to review finished assessments\nSelect the **Offboard Assessments** tab for offboarding workflows\nUse Offboard sub-tabs: **Offboard Approval** and **Terminated Vendors**\nView table columns: Assessment ID, Vendor, Type, Status, Initiated, Due Date, Action\nClick an offboard assessment to route to the **Offboard Review** page\nStatus is color-coded: Initiated (outline), In-Progress (secondary), Completed (default)\nOffboard assessments route to a dedicated offboard review page for approval workflow\nbo\nassessment\nongoing\ncompleted\noffboard\nbusiness owner\nawaiting response\npending	{-0.01413726806640625,0.0494384765625,0.0595703125,0.0198822021484375,-0.0209503173828125,0.003398895263671875,-0.0146942138671875,-0.050079345703125,0.0455322265625,0.022308349609375,0.0477294921875,-0.038818359375,0.02783203125,-0.017486572265625,0.0195159912109375,-0.0005006790161132812,0.006046295166015625,0.0072021484375,-0.00894927978515625,0.0631103515625,0.045745849609375,0.003087997436523438,-0.01363372802734375,-0.01324462890625,-0.04833984375,0.00426483154296875,-0.041839599609375,0.004673004150390625,-0.054931640625,-0.034637451171875,0.039093017578125,-0.020843505859375,-0.038177490234375,0.047027587890625,0.