cmn2wa9og009mjc3ochac7ih7	tprm-am-assessments	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{}	How do I manage assessments as an Account Manager?	How do I manage assessments as an Account Manager?\nAM assessment management\nAccount Manager assessments page\nHow to start or resume an assessment\nAM assessment tabs\nAccount Manager active assessments\nHow to handle offboard assessments as AM\nThe AM Assessments page has tabs for Active, Submitted, Past, and Offboard assessments. Account Managers can start (Draft) or resume assessments and handle offboard questionnaires.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → AM → Assessments**\nView **Active** assessments — those currently in progress or assigned\nView **Submitted** assessments — those sent for review\nView **Past** assessments — completed or archived\nView **Offboard** assessments — vendor offboarding questionnaires\nUse the **Search** bar to filter by assessment code or vendor name\nClick **Start** to begin a Draft assessment or **Resume** to continue an In-Progress one\nClick an Offboard assessment to route to the dedicated offboard questionnaire page\nStatus color coding: Gray (Draft), Blue (In Progress), Orange (Returned), Purple (Submitted), Indigo (Under Review), Green (Completed)\nOffboard assessments use a separate questionnaire page from regular assessments\nam\naccount manager\nassessment\nactive\nsubmitted\npast\noffboard\nstart\nresume\ndraft	{0.007568359375,0.07635498046875,0.063720703125,0.0226593017578125,-0.008758544921875,0.0174102783203125,0.01322174072265625,-0.034423828125,0.040985107421875,0.035614013671875,0.035614013671875,-0.06829833984375,0.01445770263671875,0.003778457641601562,0.0200958251953125,0.0214996337890625,-0.0285491943359375,0.00826263427734375,-0.0258026123046875,0.0440673828125,0.0302276611328125,0.050628662109375,-0.002161026000976562,0.00860595703125,-0.048431396484375,-0.01001739501953125,-0.057342529296875,-0.010650634765625,-0.050140380859375,-0.019744873046875,0.05096435546875,-0.04052734375,-0