cmn2wa9ou009njc3o797uli7r	tprm-assessor-assessments	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{}	How do I conduct assessments as an Assessor?	How do I conduct assessments as an Assessor?\nAssessor assessment workflow\nHow to answer CAIQ questions\nHow to submit an assessment for review\nAssessor questionnaire page\nHow to use AI-assisted question answering\nHow to save draft progress on an assessment\nHow to add evidence to assessment questions\nAssessors conduct vendor risk assessments by answering CAIQ questionnaire questions organized by domain, with AI-assisted answering, evidence attachment, and the ability to save drafts and submit for review.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessments**\nView the list of assessments assigned to you\nClick an assessment to open the **CAIQ questionnaire** organized by domain\nAnswer each question with a **compliance rating** (e.g., Compliant, Non-Compliant, Partially Compliant)\nOptionally click **Enable AI** to use AI-assisted question answering for guidance\nAdd **evidence** and **notes** to individual questions as needed\nClick **Save Draft** at any time to preserve your progress\nWhen all questions are answered, click **Submit** to send the assessment for review\nView vendor details within the assessment context for reference\nAI-assisted answering provides suggested responses but should be reviewed before submission\nDraft progress is saved automatically and can be resumed at any time\nOnce submitted, the assessment moves to the Approver for review\nAssessors can view but not edit vendor details from within the assessment\nassessor\nassessment\ncaiq\nquestionnaire\nai\nevidence\nsubmit\ndraft\ncompliance rating\ndomain	{0.02374267578125,0.001500129699707031,0.08099365234375,0.0221710205078125,-0.005893707275390625,-0.0270538330078125,-0.0260467529296875,-0.03125,0.0182037353515625,0.064208984375,0.034210205078125,-0.0306549072265625,0.027252197265625,-0.01380157470703125,0.0197296142578125,-0.006031036376953125,-0.007404