cmn2wa9p9009ojc3oc742jdhr	tprm-approver-assessments	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{}	How do I review and approve assessments?	How do I review and approve assessments?\nApprover assessment review\nHow to approve or reject a vendor assessment\nApprover workflow\nHow to add review comments to an assessment\nWhere do I see assessments awaiting approval?\nAssessment approval process\nThe Approver Assessments page lists submitted assessments awaiting review. Approvers can review all responses and evidence, then approve or reject with detailed review comments.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Approver → Assessments**\nView the list of assessments submitted for your approval\nClick an assessment to review all **responses and evidence** per question\nView the **assessment result summary** and overall score\nTo approve, click **Approve** and optionally add review comments\nTo reject, click **Reject** and provide detailed review comments explaining the rejection reason\nRejected assessments are returned to the assessor for revision\nApproved assessments move to Completed status\nApprovers receive notifications when new assessments are submitted for review\nThe Approver Dashboard mirrors the Assessor Dashboard layout with 6 charts\napprover\napprove\nreject\nreview\nassessment\ncomments\nscore\nsummary	{-0.0156402587890625,0.02545166015625,0.054779052734375,0.0195770263671875,-0.033477783203125,-0.006229400634765625,-0.01544952392578125,-0.004360198974609375,0.031707763671875,0.05291748046875,0.039276123046875,-0.0340576171875,0.008636474609375,0.004558563232421875,0.0097503662109375,-0.035888671875,0.033538818359375,-0.007415771484375,0.01255035400390625,0.06396484375,0.043426513671875,-0.00739288330078125,0.001507759094238281,0.002023696899414062,-0.0252227783203125,-0.02886962890625,-0.033416748046875,-0.020294189453125,-0.038299560546875,-0.0231475830078125,0.0207977294921875,-0.01256561279296875,-0.033111572265625,0.059234619140625,-0.0101165771484375,-0.020782470703125,0