cmn2wa9vi009qjc3o5five7uo	tprm-assessment-factory	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{}	How do I use the Assessment Factory?	How do I use the Assessment Factory?\nBatch assessment creation\nHow to create assessments for multiple vendors at once\nAssessment Factory page\nHow to schedule bulk assessments\nTemplate-based assessment generation\nMass assessment creation\nThe Assessment Factory enables batch creation and scheduling of assessments for multiple vendors simultaneously, using templates for standardized assessment generation at scale.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessment Factory**\nSelect the assessment template to use for batch creation\nChoose multiple vendors to include in the batch\nConfigure scheduling parameters if creating scheduled assessments\nInitiate the batch assessment generation\nMonitor the creation progress and verify all assessments were created successfully\nAssessment Factory is available to Assessors and Factory Administrators\nTemplates define the structure and questions used in batch-created assessments\nFactory Administrators can manage factory operations for their specific facility\nassessment factory\nbatch\nbulk\nschedule\nmulti-vendor\ntemplate\ngenerate	{-0.0278167724609375,-0.0005640983581542969,0.0916748046875,-0.0203094482421875,-0.01190948486328125,-0.01355743408203125,-0.0065460205078125,-0.034393310546875,0.01092529296875,0.00801849365234375,0.0184173583984375,-0.0384521484375,0.029388427734375,-0.036468505859375,0.0234222412109375,0.0072021484375,-0.029205322265625,0.03411865234375,-0.035430908203125,-0.002780914306640625,0.0318603515625,0.0118865966796875,-0.036407470703125,-0.02288818359375,-0.02044677734375,-0.04840087890625,-0.025299072265625,0.009124755859375,-0.033721923828125,-0.0113067626953125,0.0172882080078125,-0.037017822265625,-0.0224151611328125,0.0199127197265625,0.03289794921875,0.0125885009765625,0.010009765625,0.03570556640625,-0.001151084899902344,0.033172607421875,-0.033172607421875,0.0002281