cmn2wa9wc009sjc3oxb9s0nlx	tprm-assessor-issue-register	tprm	Issue & Remediation	tprm	{}	How do I use the Assessor Issue Register?	How do I use the Assessor Issue Register?\nAssessor issues page\nHow to view issues grouped by vendor\nIssue severity breakdown\nHow to drill into vendor issues\nIssue status tracking for assessors\nHow to add remediation comments\nWhere do I see issue details and risk recommendations?\nThe Assessor Issue Register shows issues grouped by vendor with severity breakdowns (High/Medium/Low). Drill into vendor-specific issues for detailed information including domain, risk, recommendation, and remediation comments.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Issue Register**\nView the **Issue Register** tab showing vendors grouped with High/Medium/Low severity counts and totals\nClick a **vendor name** to drill into their detailed issues list\nReview issue details: domain, severity, issue description, risk, and recommendation\nCheck **issue codes** and **status** (Open, Overdue, Closed)\nView **assessment code** linkage and **question number** reference\nTrack **due dates** for each issue\nAdd **remediation comments** to issues as needed\nIssues are linked back to specific assessment questions via question number references\nStatus tracking includes Open, Overdue, and Closed states\nRemediation comments provide an audit trail of issue resolution progress\nassessor\nissue\nregister\nseverity\nhigh\nmedium\nlow\nremediation\nvendor\ndomain\nstatus	{-0.04071044921875,0.0311431884765625,0.07672119140625,0.0171661376953125,-0.0252532958984375,0.004650115966796875,0.00600433349609375,-0.039642333984375,0.041595458984375,0.040557861328125,0.0281219482421875,-0.04620361328125,-0.0161590576171875,-0.00997161865234375,0.0419921875,-0.0306549072265625,0.01471710205078125,0.005481719970703125,-0.005199432373046875,0.0599365234375,0.031982421875,0.0281982421875,-0.0217742919921875,-0.026031494140625,-0.008514404296875,0.028533935546875,-0.035186767578125,-0