cmn2wa9wr009tjc3oil6agbzk	tprm-rm-issue-register	tprm	Issue & Remediation	tprm	{}	How do I use the RM Issue Register?	How do I use the RM Issue Register?\nRelationship Manager issues page\nHow to assign remediation owners\nRM issue tracking and remediation\nHow to set due dates for remediation\nHow to export the issue register\nRM issue comments\nThe RM Issue Register provides full remediation tracking with the ability to list issues by severity and status, assign remediation owners, set due dates, add comments, and export the issue register.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → RM → Issue Management**\nView all issues with their severity, status, and due dates\nClick an issue to view its details and remediation plan\n**Assign a remediation owner** to each issue\n**Set due dates** for remediation completion\nTrack **remediation status** as owners work on resolution\nAdd **comments** to issues for communication and audit trail\nUse **Export** to download the issue register as a report\nRemediation owners receive notifications when assigned to issues\nOverdue issues are highlighted for attention\nrm\nissue\nregister\nremediation\nassign\nowner\ndue date\nexport\ncomments\nrelationship manager	{0.0007524490356445312,0.09130859375,0.053863525390625,0.0002827644348144531,-0.033660888671875,-0.0112762451171875,0.034881591796875,-0.001115798950195312,0.003129959106445312,0.05816650390625,0.03515625,0.008453369140625,-0.010955810546875,-0.00390625,0.0240631103515625,-0.034332275390625,0.003408432006835938,0.00353240966796875,0.0242156982421875,0.1007080078125,0.04254150390625,0.0626220703125,-0.014923095703125,-0.0254364013671875,-0.0104827880859375,0.07012939453125,-0.00649261474609375,0.040496826171875,0.01788330078125,-0.00970458984375,0.0129241943359375,-0.041229248046875,-0.002582550048828125,0.003168106079101562,0.036712646484375,0.02044677734375,0.0086822509765625,0.01093292236328125,-0.035858154296875,0.019805908203125,-0.001265525817871094,-0.002920150756835938,-0.00496