cmn2waa6500a0jc3oc8gtho8g	tprm-user-management	tprm	User Management	tprm	{}	How do I manage TPRM users?	How do I manage TPRM users?\nTPRM user management page\nHow to create a TPRM user\nHow to assign TPRM roles\nHow to activate or deactivate a TPRM user\nManage TPRM team members\nWhere do I set department assignments for TPRM users?\nThe TPRM User Management page allows administrators to create, edit, and delete TPRM users, assign TPRM roles, set department assignments, and activate or deactivate user accounts.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → User Management**\nView the list of all TPRM users\nClick **Create User** to add a new TPRM user\nFill in user details and select a **TPRM role** from the 11 available roles\nAssign the user to a **department**\nClick **Save** to create the user\nUse **Edit** to modify user details or role assignments\nUse **Activate/Deactivate** to enable or disable user access\nUse **Delete** to permanently remove a user\nOnly TPRM Administrators can manage users\nThe 11 TPRM roles are: Administrator, Business Owner, Relationship Manager, Assessor, Approver, Auditor, Account Manager, SME, Factory Administrator, Factory Assessor, Internal IT Team\nDeactivated users cannot log in but their records are preserved\nuser\nmanagement\ncreate\nedit\ndelete\nrole\nassign\ndepartment\nactivate\ndeactivate	{-0.02703251503407955,0.0765329971909523,0.03876316174864769,-0.007402604911476374,-0.01459235511720181,-0.01292499527335167,0.01395379193127155,0.05264599993824959,0.01223913114517927,0.02050497941672802,0.0231774840503931,0.001059837755747139,0.01174838282167912,-0.01533734612166882,0.02031577564775944,-0.02257439680397511,-0.003077520523220301,0.01024066377431154,-0.01827000640332699,0.09715623408555984,0.0487673208117485,0.0331343412399292,-0.02561348490417004,0.01727668568491936,-0.01549107395112514,0.05695039033889771,-0.0152782192453742,0.03736777976155281,-0.04914572834968567,-0.04604751244187355,0.01628336496651173,-0.02949216589331627,-0.02