cmn2waa7d00a3jc3oh8x4jlri	tprm-am-sme-management	tprm	SME Management	tprm	{}	How do I manage Subject Matter Experts?	How do I manage Subject Matter Experts?\nSME management page\nHow to assign SMEs to assessment domains\nAccount Manager SME page\nHow to track SME availability\nManaging domain experts for assessments\nWhat is SME Management in TPRM?\nThe AM SME Management page lets Account Managers list and manage Subject Matter Experts, assign them to assessment domains, and track their availability and areas of expertise.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → AM → SME Management**\nView the list of Subject Matter Experts\nAssign SMEs to specific **assessment domains** based on their expertise\nTrack **SME availability** and expertise areas\nAdd or remove SMEs from the team as needed\nSMEs provide domain-specific expertise during vendor assessments\nAssigning SMEs to the right domains ensures thorough assessment coverage\nThis page is available to Account Managers\nsme\nsubject matter expert\ndomain\nassign\nexpertise\naccount manager\navailability	{0.01070230174809694,0.0392778068780899,0.06394955515861511,-0.02146466262638569,0.002240156289190054,0.01401749346405268,0.02164483442902565,0.02238955162465572,0.02153673022985458,0.02894786559045315,0.05222627148032188,-0.04586014524102211,0.00176119536627084,-0.007507226429879665,0.01245598960667849,0.02114035002887249,-0.03706768155097961,0.0114049781113863,0.01094253361225128,0.05549341812729836,0.07202132791280746,0.06404565274715424,-0.02688187547028065,0.02916407398879528,-0.02056379429996014,0.007789498195052147,-0.02013137750327587,-0.0006381142302416265,-0.009771405719220638,-0.03512180969119072,0.06265231221914291,-0.03264742717146873,-0.0403108038008213,0.02750647813081741,0.0474216490983963,0.04098344966769218,-0.004798619076609612,0.009981608018279076,-0.007164896931499243,0.04223265126347542,-0.01303254533559084,0.02464772574603558,-0.03704365715384483,0.06082655116915703,-0.03622687235474586,-0.003061446826905