cmn2waa8l00a6jc3ou33ua864	tprm-offboard-review	tprm	Offboarding	tprm	{}	How does the vendor offboarding process work?	How does the vendor offboarding process work?\nVendor offboarding workflow\nOffboard review page\nHow to offboard a vendor\nMulti-step offboard approval\nOffboard assessment questionnaire\nHow to terminate a vendor relationship\nThe Offboard Review page manages vendor offboarding through a multi-step approval workflow across roles (Assessor, RM, BO), including an offboard questionnaire, reason documentation, and final approval or rejection.\nInitiate offboarding from the **BO Contracts** page by clicking **Start Offboarding**\nThe offboard request appears in the **Offboard** tab of assessments for relevant roles\nComplete the **offboard review questionnaire** with relevant information\nDocument the **offboard reason** for the vendor termination\nThe request moves through **multi-step approval**: Assessor → RM → BO perspectives\nEach role reviews and either approves or rejects the offboard request\nUpon final approval, the vendor is marked as offboarded/terminated\nOffboarding requires assessment status conditions to be met before initiation\nEach role in the chain reviews from their perspective before approving\nRejected offboard requests return to the initiator with comments\nOffboarded vendors appear in the 'Terminated Vendors' sub-tab\noffboard\noffboarding\nreview\nterminate\nvendor\napproval\nworkflow\nquestionnaire	{-0.04623596370220184,0.0531737357378006,0.02986567653715611,0.04100887477397919,-0.04160286486148834,0.02813123352825642,-0.04797040671110153,-0.03036462515592575,0.04566573724150658,0.03421366214752197,0.05426666885614395,-0.06495843827724457,-0.05032259598374367,0.008992966264486313,0.03067349828779697,-0.007151606027036905,0.03832405433058739,0.03388103097677231,-0.0156099833548069,0.05179568380117416,0.02625423483550549,0.03378599137067795,0.009878006763756275,0.01110756024718285,-0.01721374876797199,0.02725213207304478,-0.00189