cmn2waa8z00a7jc3ouj8hjckm	tprm-notifications	tprm	Notifications & Support	tprm	{}	How do TPRM notifications work?	How do TPRM notifications work?\nTPRM notification center\nHow to view TPRM alerts\nAssessment assignment notifications\nDue date reminders in TPRM\nHow to mark notifications as read\nWhere do I see my TPRM notifications?\nThe TPRM Notification center provides role-specific alerts including assessment assignments, status changes, and due date reminders. Access notifications via the header bell icon or the dedicated notifications page.\nClick the **bell icon** in the header to see the notification dropdown with badge count\nAlternatively, navigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → [Your Role] → Notifications**\nView **unread notifications** with their badge count\nReview **assessment assignment** notifications when new assessments are assigned\nMonitor **status change alerts** for assessment and vendor status updates\nWatch for **due date reminders** for assessments and remediations\nClick **Mark as Read** to clear individual notification indicators\nEach TPRM role has its own notification page with role-relevant alerts\nThe header bell icon provides quick access across all pages\nDue date reminders help prevent missed deadlines\nnotification\nalert\nunread\nbadge\nassignment\nstatus change\ndue date\nreminder	{-0.0317654088139534,0.0476105622947216,0.05156559497117996,0.03559527918696404,-0.02025076001882553,-0.006439441349357367,0.01254721079021692,0.009349392727017403,0.01374248135834932,0.04660928994417191,-0.006739823613315821,0.04117738083004951,0.01583264023065567,0.01817311719059944,0.02239098213613033,0.005854322109371424,0.007290523964911699,0.003191559808328748,-0.02450617402791977,0.1213543713092804,0.02525712922215462,0.01598283089697361,-0.009774934500455856,0.01204031612724066,-0.01902420073747635,0.00118353683501482,-0.008041479624807835,0.03589566051959991,-0.0296627338975668,0.01618308573961258,0.0509648323059082,-0.01535703521221876,-0.014505952596