cmn2wab3000avjc3ox1hbya3m	tca-caiq-questions	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I view and manage CAIQ questions as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I view and manage CAIQ questions as a TPRM Administrator?\nWhat is the CAIQ question library?\nHow to search CAIQ questions by domain?\nWhere to view the assessment questionnaire?\nCAIQ questions organized by domain\nHow to filter assessment questions?\nThe CAIQ Questions page lets you view the complete Consensus Assessments Initiative Questionnaire library organized by domains. Search and filter questions used in vendor assessments.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → CAIQ Questions**\nBrowse all CAIQ questions organized by domain\nView question details: ID, question text, and associated domain\nUse the **search bar** to find questions by keyword\nUse **domain filters** to narrow to a specific assessment area\nCAIQ is the industry standard from the Cloud Security Alliance (CSA)\nQuestions are organized by domains such as Data Security, Access Control, Business Continuity, etc.\nAs Customer Administrator, you can view the full question library — these questions are used in all vendor assessments\ncaiq questions\nquestionnaire\ndomain\nquestion library\nsearch questions\nfilter	{0.007887744344770908,0.0009261682280339301,0.06053493916988373,0.02185465395450592,0.02749042399227619,-0.03124760463833809,-0.03997546434402466,-0.01840084791183472,-0.01144073065370321,0.05801459774374962,0.05204044654965401,-0.03925203159451485,0.02292813360691071,0.003897199407219887,0.03626495599746704,0.0004798572626896203,0.0245966948568821,-0.00827863160520792,-0.02574018575251102,0.07719721645116806,0.03414133191108704,0.01792244985699654,-0.04478278756141663,-0.0002246140356874093,-0.04188906028866768,0.006960118189454079,-0.05036021769046783,0.05726782605051994,-0.03122426755726337,-0.02487673424184322,0.03059418126940727,-0.02478338778018951,-0.07280994951725006,0.02732706815004349,0.01233335211873055,-0