cmn2waaio00aejc3ocx3656dq	tca-role-overview	tprm	Role Overview	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	What can I do as a TPRM Customer Administrator?	What can I do as a TPRM Customer Administrator?\nWhat is the TPRM Customer Admin role?\nWhat access does a TPRM administrator have?\nWhat are my capabilities as TPRM admin?\nWhat modules can I access as Customer Administrator?\nTPRM admin permissions and access\nWhat is the scope of the Customer Administrator role in TPRM?\nAs the TPRM Customer Administrator, you are the organization-level superadmin with full access to ALL TPRM functionality including vendor management, assessments, issues, monitoring, reports, control center, program monitor, user management, and system configuration.\n**Full CRUD access** on all vendor records — create, view, edit, and delete any vendor\n**Assessment management** — create and manage all assessments, assign assessors, approvers, and account managers\n**Issue & remediation management** — manage the full issue register and remediation tracking across all vendors\n**All dashboards** — access RM, BO, and Assessor dashboards for complete visibility\n**Monitoring & scanning** — configure monitoring, trigger vendor security scans, and review results\n**Control Center** — configure Due Diligence and Scorecard settings that govern risk parameters\n**Program Monitor** — view executive-level program overview with assessment and vendor quotas\n**Reports** — generate all report types (vendor risk, assessment completion, issue resolution, factory reports)\n**User management** — create and manage TPRM users, assign roles, manage departments\n**Configuration** — configure departments, service categories, master data, and system settings\nYou have Global permission scope — access to all records across the organization, not limited to a department\nYou can see all role-specific views (RM, BO, Assessor, AM, Approver) to monitor the entire program\nAs the admin, you are responsible for initial TPRM setup including Control Center configuration and user provisioning\ncustomer administrator\nadmin\nrole\naccess\npermissions\ntprm\ncapabilities\nfull access	{-0.01251220703125,0.05560302734375,0.075439453125,0.041900634765625,-0.001400947570800781,-0.01129150390625,-0.0053863525390625,0.0235595703125,0.0139617919921875,0.013946533203125,0.0203704833984375,-0.003599166870117188,-0.00945281982421875,-0.00299835205078125,-0.00518798828125,-0.01508331298828125,-0.01898193359375,0.0009589195251464844,-0.002887725830078125,0.08245849609375,0.07696533203125,0.0045318603515625,-0.0205535888671875,-0.0168914794921875,-0.020233154296875,0.0135498046875,-0.0081634521484375,0.06085205078125,-0.01186370849609375,-0.037353515625,0.039520263671875,-0.0408935546875,-0.052734375,0.012847900390625,0.039337158203125,-0.011505126953125,-0.006397247314453125,0.0156402587890625,0.00640106201171875,0.01119232177734375,-0.0228424072265625,0.037353515625,-0.0297088623046875,0.05413818359375,-0.006603240966796875,0.004802703857421875,-0.0217132568359375,0.037750244140625,-0.0104827880859375,-0.0111846923828125,-0.0054779052734375,-0.005489349365234375,0.0004303455352783203,0.047088623046875,-0.0302581787109375,-0.0007219314575195312,0.006870269775390625,-0.0001921653747558594,-0.038665771484375,-0.00954437255859375,-0.0238037109375,-0.0276641845703125,-0.0222625732421875,-0.038482666015625,0.0004439353942871094,-0.0049285888671875,-0.040985107421875,0.007167816162109375,-0.0007839202880859375,-0.01116180419921875,-0.00603485107421875,-0.01264190673828125,-0.00933837890625,-0.03271484375,0.03076171875,0.01381683349609375,0.08892822265625,0.055267333984375,-0.041015625,-0.0124359130859375,0.01904296875,0.0194549560546875,-0.01873779296875,-0.003797531127929688,-0.0028076171875,-0.0092315673828125,-0.0246429443359375,-0.0219573974609375,0.0245513916015625,-0.01428985595703125,-0.0185699462890625,0.00272369384765625,-0.0064849853515625,0.058349609375,0.03240966796875,-0.044219970703125,-0.0295562744140625,-0