cmn2waaj300afjc3oskxu52ng	tca-rm-dashboard	tprm	Dashboards	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I use the RM Dashboard as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I use the RM Dashboard as a TPRM Administrator?\nWhat does the Relationship Manager dashboard show?\nHow do I view vendor criticality distribution?\nWhere can I see assessment status overview?\nHow to access the RM dashboard?\nShow me the RM vendor risk overview\nRelationship Manager dashboard analytics\nThe RM Dashboard provides a Relationship Manager perspective showing vendor criticality distribution and assessment status across all managed vendors. As Customer Administrator, you have full access to this dashboard.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → RM → Dashboard**\nView the **Vendor Criticality** bar chart showing distribution across Nominal, Low, Moderate, High, and Critical levels with color coding\nView the **Assessment Status** bar chart showing counts for Initiated, In Progress, and Completed assessments\nHover over chart bars to see interactive tooltips with vendor/assessment counts\nThe dashboard auto-refreshes on page load to show the latest data\nAs Customer Administrator, you see all vendors across the organization — not filtered by relationship manager\nA 'No Data to Display' message appears when no vendors exist yet\nUse this dashboard to monitor whether RMs are keeping vendor assessments on track\nrm dashboard\nrelationship manager\nvendor criticality\nassessment status\nbar chart\nanalytics	{-0.0196990966796875,0.039093017578125,0.04852294921875,0.032958984375,-0.0084381103515625,0.0002028942108154297,-0.0157470703125,-0.002637863159179688,0.01885986328125,0.02996826171875,-0.0004494190216064453,-0.015380859375,-0.035400390625,-0.002614974975585938,0.047119140625,-0.0230865478515625,-0.0217437744140625,0.0160980224609375,-0.044891357421875,0.09063720703125,0.04742431640625,0.034393310546875,0.010894775390625,-0.004436492919921875,-0.00994110107421875,0.05645751953125,0.0112762451171875,0.035858154296875