cmn2waajw00ahjc3o4qbfuiks	tca-assessor-dashboard	tprm	Dashboards	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I use the Assessor Dashboard as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I use the Assessor Dashboard as a TPRM Administrator?\nWhat does the Assessor dashboard show?\nHow to view assessment analytics and issue charts?\nWhere can I see top vendors by risk severity?\nAssessor dashboard with 6 charts\nHow to see domain distribution of issues?\nAssessment progress and risk charts\nHow to view inherent risk distribution?\nThe Assessor Dashboard is the most comprehensive dashboard with 6 analytical charts covering issues, assessments, risks, results, top vendors, and domain distribution. As Customer Administrator, you have full access to all data.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Dashboard**\nReview the **Issue Status** bar chart showing Open, Overdue, and Closed issue counts\nReview the **Assessment Progress** bar chart showing Initiated, In Progress, and Completed assessments\nExamine the **Inherent Risk** pie chart showing High, Medium, and Low risk distribution (mapped from VRR levels)\nExamine the **Assessment Result** pie chart showing Satisfactory, Unsatisfactory, and Deficient outcomes\nAnalyze the **Top 5 Vendors** stacked bar chart showing vendors by severity (High, Medium, Low)\nReview the **Domain Distribution** horizontal bar chart showing top 10 domains by issue count\nAs Customer Administrator, all charts show organization-wide data, not filtered by assessor assignment\nEach chart has empty state handling — a message displays when no data exists for that metric\nThe Domain Distribution chart strips the 'CUST.' prefix from domain names for cleaner display\nThis is the richest dashboard — use it for executive reporting on the overall TPRM program health\nassessor dashboard\nissue status\nassessment progress\ninherent risk\ntop vendors\ndomain distribution\ncharts	{0.0009794235229492188,0.031463623046875,0.07958984375,0.03594970703125,0.00896453857421875,0.00560