cmn2waaka00aijc3oqikea64a	tca-program-monitor	tprm	Program Monitor	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I use the Program Monitor as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I use the Program Monitor as a TPRM Administrator?\nWhat is the Program Monitor?\nHow to view assessment and vendor quotas?\nWhere can I see TPRM program executive summary?\nHow to check program usage and capacity?\nProgram overview with progress rings\nHow to monitor TPRM program health?\nThe Program Monitor provides an executive-level summary with circular progress rings showing assessment and vendor totals with detailed breakdowns by type. As Customer Administrator, this is your go-to page for high-level program oversight.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Program Monitor**\nView the **Total Assessments** summary with circular progress ring showing overall count\nReview the assessment breakdown: Assessment Factory, Onboarding, Periodic, and On-Demand counts\nView the **Total Vendors** summary with circular progress ring\nReview the vendor breakdown: Onboarding, Onboarded, Offboarding, and Offboarded counts\nMonitor the **usage percentage** — green (<70%), amber (70-90%), red (>90%) indicates capacity utilization\nUse the 2×2 breakdown grid with icons for quick visual reference\nUsage percentage color coding helps you identify when you are approaching program capacity limits\nRed usage (>90%) means you may need to increase your program quota or prioritize assessments\nAs Customer Administrator, you see the complete program picture — use this for board and executive reporting\nprogram monitor\nexecutive summary\nquotas\nprogress rings\nassessment total\nvendor total\ncapacity	{-0.0276947021484375,0.049285888671875,0.06494140625,0.0196990966796875,0.0108184814453125,-0.0001735687255859375,-0.0232086181640625,0.0034332275390625,0.033447265625,-0.001107215881347656,0.05657958984375,-0.01495361328125,-0.0280303955078125,-0.00016021728515625,0.04168701171875,-0.0175933837890625,-0.018463134765625,0.004619598388671