cmn2waas200akjc3o82t7x3cs	tca-vendor-management-admin	tprm	Vendor Management	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage vendors as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I manage vendors as a TPRM Administrator?\nHow to create a new vendor?\nHow to edit or delete a vendor?\nHow to manage vendor records with full admin access?\nVendor management admin view\nHow to export vendor data?\nHow to set up vendor risk profiles?\nHow to trigger a monitoring scan when creating a vendor?\nAs Customer Administrator, you have full CRUD access to vendor management with an accordion-based UI showing vendor details, risk profiles, security monitoring scores, and contract information. You can create, edit, delete, and export all vendor records.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Vendor Management**\nView all vendors in the **accordion list** — click any vendor to expand details\nClick **Create Vendor** to open the creation form with 6 sections and 25+ fields\nFill in vendor sections: Info, Contact, Service Category, Department, Risk Profile, Contract Dates, and Certifications\nConfigure the **Vendor Risk Profile** using toggles: Access to Network, Cloud, Access to Data, PII\nOptionally enable **trigger monitoring scan** during vendor creation to immediately assess the vendor's security posture\nView **Security Monitoring** data for each vendor: Overall Score, Security Posture, Threat Exposure\nUse **Export** to download individual vendor details or perform a bulk CSV export of all vendors\nClick **Edit** on any vendor to modify details, or **Delete** to remove a vendor\nAs Customer Administrator, you can manage ALL vendors — not limited to a department or business unit\nThe vendor creation form supports dynamic translation — data entered in any language will be translated to all other languages\nTriggering a monitoring scan on creation initiates an AI-powered security assessment using 17+ web intelligence searches\nDeleting a vendor is permanent — ensure all related assessments and issues are r