cmn2waasg00aljc3o6ko2bwc9	tca-rm-vendor-inventory	tprm	Vendor Management	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I use the RM Vendor Inventory as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I use the RM Vendor Inventory as a TPRM Administrator?\nWhat is the RM vendor inventory view?\nHow to view vendors from the Relationship Manager perspective?\nRM view of vendor list with risk ratings\nHow to initiate assessments from the RM vendor view?\nRelationship Manager vendor management\nThe RM Vendor Inventory shows all vendors with risk ratings (VRR), status, and assessment information from a Relationship Manager perspective. As Customer Administrator, you can create, edit, delete vendors and initiate assessments from this view.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → RM → Vendor Inventory**\nView all vendors with their **risk rating (VRR)**: Nominal, Low, Moderate, High, Critical\nUse **search and filter** to find specific vendors\nClick **Create** to add a new vendor (name, domain, vendor code, description)\nClick **Edit** to modify vendor details or **Delete** to remove\nClick **Initiate Assessment** on a vendor to start a new assessment workflow\nView **assessment history** per vendor to see past and current assessments\nAs Customer Administrator, you see all vendors regardless of RM assignment\nThe VRR rating is calculated based on Control Center Due Diligence settings\nInitiating an assessment from here creates it in Draft status — you will then assign an assessor\nrm vendor inventory\nrelationship manager\nvendor list\nrisk rating\nvrr\ninitiate assessment	{-0.047698974609375,0.054901123046875,0.059173583984375,0.00713348388671875,-0.0274505615234375,-0.0247802734375,-0.0087127685546875,0.003940582275390625,0.008697509765625,0.03485107421875,0.013702392578125,-0.004459381103515625,-0.00652313232421875,-0.00650787353515625,0.043365478515625,-0.0183258056640625,-0.002187728881835938,0.040802001953125,-0.06280517578125,0.09271240234375,0.047271728515625,0.052093505859375,0.006687164306640625,-0