cmn2waasv00amjc3osgmx3dd6	tca-bo-vendor-inventory	tprm	Vendor Management	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I use the BO Vendor Inventory as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I use the BO Vendor Inventory as a TPRM Administrator?\nWhat is the BO vendor inventory view?\nHow to manage vendors from the Business Owner perspective?\nBO view with nested accordion and contract management\nBusiness Owner vendor inventory features\nHow to manage vendor contracts in BO view?\nThe BO Vendor Inventory provides a Business Owner view with a nested accordion, create/edit forms, and contract management. As Customer Administrator, you have full access to create, edit, export, and manage contracts.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → BO → Vendor Inventory**\nBrowse vendors in the **nested accordion** — expand to see full details\nUse the **Create/Edit dialog** with multi-section form to add or modify vendors\nManage **contracts**: download or upload contract documents for each vendor\nUse **CSV bulk export** to export all vendor data\nReview **Vendor Risk Profile** toggles and risk ratings\nView **assessment status and history** for each vendor\nUse **filter and search** to narrow the vendor list\nAs Customer Administrator, you see vendors across all business units — not limited to one BO's scope\nContract documents support PDF, Word, and Excel formats\nThis view is particularly useful for Business Owner-level reporting while maintaining admin-level access\nbo vendor inventory\nbusiness owner\nnested accordion\ncontract management\ncsv export	{-0.0428466796875,0.045928955078125,0.0662841796875,0.01898193359375,-0.03521728515625,-0.03857421875,-0.036102294921875,-0.0105438232421875,-0.001850128173828125,0.003841400146484375,0.02386474609375,-0.008453369140625,0.020477294921875,-0.040557861328125,0.035308837890625,0.01280975341796875,-0.002834320068359375,0.037078857421875,-0.04534912109375,0.05926513671875,0.047210693359375,0.0199737548828125,-0.0055389404296875,-0.0061187744140625,-0.0364379