cmn2waat900anjc3oad1bp1b5	tca-assessor-vendor-inventory	tprm	Vendor Management	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I view the Assessor Vendor Inventory as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I view the Assessor Vendor Inventory as a TPRM Administrator?\nWhat is the Assessor vendor inventory?\nHow to see vendors assigned for assessment?\nAssessor view of vendor list\nHow to check vendor assessment workload?\nView assessor vendor assignments\nThe Assessor Vendor Inventory shows vendors assigned for assessment with their assessment workload and status. As Customer Administrator, you can view all vendor assignments across all assessors.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Inventory**\nView vendors assigned for assessment with their current risk rating\nCheck assessment completion status for each vendor\nAccess assessment forms for any assigned vendor\nMonitor assessor workload distribution across vendors\nAs Customer Administrator, you see all assessor assignments — not limited to a single assessor's queue\nThis view helps you identify workload imbalances and reassign vendors if needed\nThe assessor view is read-focused — for full vendor management, use the Admin Vendor Management page\nassessor vendor inventory\nassigned vendors\nassessment workload\nassessor view	{-0.04827880859375,0.01361846923828125,0.06109619140625,0.01061248779296875,-0.032073974609375,-0.037445068359375,-0.0246429443359375,-0.0246734619140625,0.0282135009765625,0.01277923583984375,0.03778076171875,0.0001943111419677734,0.0293121337890625,-0.025238037109375,0.033935546875,-0.0191497802734375,-0.001893997192382812,-0.00754547119140625,-0.061798095703125,0.08056640625,0.026702880859375,0.003229141235351562,-0.0164642333984375,-0.034027099609375,-0.01308441162109375,-0.0108642578125,-0.05987548828125,-0.0006542205810546875,-0.001667022705078125,-0.028167724609375,-0.003099441528320312,-0.0288543701171875,0.01010894775390625,0.0384521484375,0.02978515625,0.0008172988891601562,0.001225471496582031,0.02