cmn2waato00aojc3ojg55agxy	tca-bo-contracts	tprm	Contract Management	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage vendor contracts as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I manage vendor contracts as a TPRM Administrator?\nHow to track expiring contracts?\nHow to renew vendor contracts?\nHow to initiate vendor offboarding from contracts?\nWhere to manage contract documents?\nBO contracts view with expiring and all contracts\nHow to upload contract files?\nContract management and renewal process\nManage vendor contracts through the BO Contracts view with tabs for expiring contracts and all vendor contracts. As Customer Administrator, you can renew contracts, upload documents, initiate offboarding, and manage all contract lifecycles.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → BO → Contracts**\nCheck the **Expiring Contracts** tab to see contracts approaching their end date\nLook for date highlighting: **red** for expired, **amber** for expiring soon\nClick **Renew Contract** to open the renewal dialog — enter new start and end dates\nUpload contract files (PDF/Word/Excel) using the file upload option\nClick **Start Offboarding** on a vendor (conditional on assessment status) to begin the offboarding process\nVendors with offboarding initiated show the 'Offboard Request Submitted' status badge\nSwitch to the **All Vendor Contracts** tab to see the complete contract list\nClick **Download** to retrieve contract documents\nAs Customer Administrator, you can manage contracts for all vendors — not limited to a single business unit\nOffboarding can only be initiated when specific assessment conditions are met\nMonitor expiring contracts proactively to avoid service disruptions or compliance gaps\nContract renewal does not automatically trigger a new assessment — create one manually if needed\ncontracts\nexpiring\nrenewal\noffboarding\ncontract upload\ncontract management\nbo contracts	{-0.0404052734375,0.0516357421875,0.08624267578125,0.01486968994140625,-0.052276611328125,0.0061187744140625,-