cmn2waauh00aqjc3omvckftqm	tca-rm-assessments	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage assessments from the RM view as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I manage assessments from the RM view as a TPRM Administrator?\nHow to create a new vendor assessment?\nHow to assign an assessor to an assessment?\nRM assessment management and lifecycle\nHow to track assessment status?\nHow to create assessments and assign assessors?\nRelationship Manager assessment workflow\nThe RM Assessments view lets you create assessments, assign assessors, and track the full assessment lifecycle from Draft through Completion. As Customer Administrator, you have full control over all assessments.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → RM → Assessments**\nView all assessments with their status and assignee\nClick **Create Assessment** — select the vendor, assessment type, and assign an assessor\nTrack assessment status through the lifecycle: **Draft → In Progress → Submitted → Under Review → Approved/Completed**\nUse **filters** to narrow by status, vendor, or assessor\nClick any assessment to view its details and results\nReassign assessors or modify assessment parameters as needed\nAs Customer Administrator, you can create and manage assessments for any vendor regardless of RM assignment\nThe assessment lifecycle is enforced — you cannot skip stages (e.g., jump from Draft to Completed)\nAssigning an assessor sends them a notification so they can begin working on the assessment\nrm assessments\ncreate assessment\nassign assessor\nassessment lifecycle\nstatus tracking\nrelationship manager	{-0.026824951171875,0.047698974609375,0.08544921875,0.0089263916015625,-0.014923095703125,-0.0120849609375,-0.007556915283203125,-0.02227783203125,0.01364898681640625,0.0439453125,0.023101806640625,-0.0308074951171875,0.0239410400390625,-0.0013885498046875,0.024810791015625,-0.01154327392578125,-0.0208892822265625,-0.0014801025390625,-0.0261993408203125,0.101806640625,0.060302734375,0.02307