cmn2waauv00arjc3ooxpv7jqc	tca-bo-assessments	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I use the BO Assessments view as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I use the BO Assessments view as a TPRM Administrator?\nBusiness Owner assessment management\nHow to view ongoing, completed, and offboard assessments?\nBO assessment tabs and sub-tabs\nHow to track assessments from BO perspective?\nWhere to see offboard assessments?\nBusiness Owner assessment tracking\nThe BO Assessments view provides a tabbed interface with Ongoing, Completed, and Offboard assessments with sub-tab navigation. As Customer Administrator, you can access all assessment categories.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → BO → Assessments**\nUse the **top tabs** to switch between: Ongoing Assessments, Completed Assessments, Offboard Assessments\nUnder **Ongoing**, use sub-tabs: Awaiting Response, Pending with Assessor\nUnder **Offboard**, use sub-tabs: Offboard Approval, Terminated Vendors\nReview table columns: Assessment ID, Vendor, Type, Status, Initiated, Due Date, Action\nNote status color coding: Initiated (outline), In-Progress (secondary), Completed (default)\nClick assessments in the **Offboard** tab to route to the offboard review page\nAs Customer Administrator, you see all assessments across all business units\nThe Offboard tab is critical for managing vendor exits — ensure all offboard assessments are reviewed\nThis view helps you understand the assessment pipeline from a business perspective\nbo assessments\nbusiness owner\nongoing\ncompleted\noffboard\ntabs\nassessment tracking	{-0.0210418701171875,0.055908203125,0.06939697265625,0.0263824462890625,-0.0247955322265625,0.0003204345703125,-0.01751708984375,-0.041595458984375,0.045806884765625,0.025909423828125,0.033355712890625,-0.033477783203125,0.034088134765625,-0.019561767578125,0.031524658203125,-0.0208892822265625,0.01052093505859375,0.0073394775390625,-0.0189208984375,0.07891845703125,0.046600341796875,-0.00501251220703125,-