cmn2waava00asjc3ow1xtiqtk	tca-am-assessments	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I use the AM Assessments view as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I use the AM Assessments view as a TPRM Administrator?\nWhat is the Account Manager assessment view?\nHow to start or resume assessments from AM view?\nAM assessment tabs (Active, Submitted, Past, Offboard)\nAccount Manager assessment management\nHow to manage AM assessments?\nThe AM Assessments view shows assessments from the Account Manager perspective with tabs for Active, Submitted, Past, and Offboard assessments. As Customer Administrator, you can start or resume any assessment.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → AM → Assessments**\nUse **tabs** to switch between: Active, Submitted, Past, Offboard assessments\nUse the **search bar** to filter by assessment code or vendor name\nClick **Start** to begin a Draft assessment or **Resume** to continue an in-progress one\nAccess **Offboard** tab to route to dedicated offboard questionnaire page\nReview status color coding: Gray (Draft), Blue (In Progress), Orange (Returned), Purple (Submitted), Indigo (Under Review), Green (Completed)\nAs Customer Administrator, you see all assessments — not limited to a specific Account Manager's assignments\nStarting an assessment changes its status from Draft to In Progress\nReturned assessments (Orange) need attention — they were sent back by the reviewer for corrections\nam assessments\naccount manager\nactive\nsubmitted\npast\noffboard\nstart assessment\nresume assessment	{-0.00725555419921875,0.0653076171875,0.072509765625,0.0250396728515625,-0.0116424560546875,-0.001199722290039062,0.016082763671875,-0.0187225341796875,0.0361328125,0.038818359375,0.03472900390625,-0.04278564453125,0.0285186767578125,-0.002710342407226562,0.02490234375,0.003728866577148438,-0.0195465087890625,0.006298065185546875,-0.029449462890625,0.07122802734375,0.03887939453125,0.02227783203125,-0.022125244140625,0.001376152038574219,-0.032562