cmn2waavo00atjc3ookfx7j7i	tca-assessor-assessments	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I use the Assessor Assessments view as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I use the Assessor Assessments view as a TPRM Administrator?\nHow to conduct a vendor assessment?\nHow to use the CAIQ questionnaire for assessments?\nHow does AI-assisted assessment answering work?\nAssessor assessment workqueue\nHow to answer assessment questions with AI help?\nHow to submit completed assessments?\nHow to save assessment progress?\nThe Assessor Assessments view is the assessment workqueue where CAIQ questionnaire questions are answered with compliance ratings, evidence, and optional AI assistance. As Customer Administrator, you can view and manage all assessor assignments.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessments**\nView all assessments assigned for completion\nOpen an assessment to access the **CAIQ questionnaire** organized by domain\nAnswer each question with a **compliance rating** (e.g., Compliant, Non-Compliant, Partially Compliant)\nAdd **evidence and notes** to individual questions to support your answers\nClick **Enable AI** to activate AI-assisted question answering for help with responses\nClick **Save Draft** at any time to preserve your progress\nWhen all questions are answered, click **Submit** to send the assessment for review\nView **vendor details** within the assessment context for reference\nAs Customer Administrator, you can access any assessor's assigned assessments and perform assessments if needed\nAI-assisted answering provides suggestions but the assessor should review and validate all AI-generated responses\nSaving as draft allows you to return and continue the assessment later\nSubmitted assessments move to the approver's queue for review\nassessor assessments\ncaiq questionnaire\nai assisted\nassessment answering\nsubmit\nevidence\ncompliance rating	{0.00359344482421875,0.00569915771484375,0.08709716796875,0.021697998046875,-0.