cmn2wab2l00aujc3o0culzs8i	tca-approver-assessments	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I review and approve assessments as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I review and approve assessments as a TPRM Administrator?\nHow to approve or reject an assessment?\nWhere to review submitted assessments?\nApprover assessment review process\nHow to add review comments to assessments?\nAssessment approval workflow\nHow to review assessment responses and evidence?\nThe Approver Assessments view shows submitted assessments awaiting review. As Customer Administrator, you can review responses and evidence, then approve or reject assessments with comments.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Approver → Assessments**\nView the list of assessments submitted for approval\nClick an assessment to review **responses and evidence** for each question\nReview the **assessment result summary** and overall score\nEnter **review comments** documenting your findings\nClick **Approve** to complete the assessment or **Reject** to return it to the assessor for corrections\nAs Customer Administrator, you can approve any submitted assessment regardless of the original approver assignment\nRejected assessments return to the assessor's queue with your comments for correction\nApproved assessments move to Completed status and their results are reflected in dashboards and reports\nEnsure you review evidence attachments thoroughly before approving\napprover assessments\napprove\nreject\nreview\ncomments\nassessment approval\nsubmitted assessments	{-0.01045138016343117,0.04858105629682541,0.06655696779489517,0.007305595558136702,-0.03768027946352959,-0.01525648031383753,-0.01041681133210659,0.005139267537742853,0.01968131959438324,0.06964513659477234,0.02760915830731392,0.003966799937188625,0.01319385878741741,0.003387768287211657,-0.002020849846303463,-0.03899390250444412,0.03627447038888931,-0.00742658693343401,0.01338975038379431,0.07867918908596039,0.04339569807052612,-0.0216748025268