cmn2wabdp00b7jc3o5ehy8h7j	tca-bo-user-management	tprm	User Management	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage BO User Management as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I manage BO User Management as a TPRM Administrator?\nBusiness Owner user management\nHow to manage team users within a business unit?\nBO team user role assignment\nWhere to manage Business Owner team members?\nHow to set up BO team users?\nThe BO User Management page lets Business Owners manage team members within their business unit. As Customer Administrator, you have access to manage users across all business units.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → BO → User Management**\nView team users within each business unit\nManage user roles and assignments for BO teams\nAs Customer Administrator, you can manage users across all business units from this view\nFor organization-wide user management, use the main TPRM User Management page instead\nbo user management\nbusiness owner\nteam users\nbusiness unit\nrole assignment	{-0.00991058349609375,0.058013916015625,0.038421630859375,0.0430908203125,-0.0292816162109375,-0.03399658203125,-0.016510009765625,0.0238189697265625,-0.0089263916015625,0.003408432006835938,0.01198577880859375,0.00670623779296875,-0.01120758056640625,-0.01416015625,0.0243072509765625,-0.0017852783203125,-0.01450347900390625,-0.004299163818359375,-0.037994384765625,0.06884765625,0.05865478515625,0.01275634765625,-0.0292816162109375,0.020904541015625,-0.0215301513671875,0.040618896484375,-0.01531219482421875,0.048614501953125,-0.043060302734375,-0.045166015625,0.0267791748046875,-0.020904541015625,-0.0139007568359375,0.028564453125,0.0340576171875,-0.0352783203125,-0.00656890869140625,0.0211029052734375,0.044891357421875,0.04119873046875,-0.0084686279296875,-0.0220489501953125,-0.0003676414489746094,0.037689208984375,-0.03619384765625,0.03265380859375,-0.0160064697265625,0.018829345703125,0.01345062255859375,-0.018646240234375,0.02984619140625,0.007617950439453125,0.001500129699707031,-0.0213