cmn2wab3f00awjc3oqm7yemk0	tca-assessment-factory	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I use the Assessment Factory as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I use the Assessment Factory as a TPRM Administrator?\nHow to batch create assessments?\nHow to create multiple assessments at once?\nAssessment Factory batch generation\nHow to schedule bulk assessments?\nHow to create assessments for multiple vendors simultaneously?\nTemplate-based batch assessment creation\nThe Assessment Factory allows you to batch create and schedule assessments for multiple vendors at scale. As Customer Administrator, you can generate assessments in bulk using templates.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessment Factory**\nSelect vendors for batch assessment generation\nChoose an **assessment template** to define the structure and questions\nConfigure **scheduling** for when assessments should be created\nInitiate **batch assessment creation** for all selected vendors\nMonitor the factory job progress and results\nAs Customer Administrator, you can create batch assessments for any vendor in the organization\nAssessment Factory is ideal for periodic assessments where many vendors need to be assessed on the same schedule\nTemplates ensure consistency across all batch-created assessments\nView factory results in the Assessment Factory Reports page\nassessment factory\nbatch\nbulk\nscheduled\nmulti-vendor\ntemplate-based\nscale	{-0.03743948042392731,0.01388205401599407,0.110660508275032,-0.009427919052541256,-0.01427797693759203,-0.01534202042967081,-0.0146244103088975,-0.01182820275425911,0.01359748467803001,0.02115714177489281,0.00984240137040615,-0.02561127580702305,0.03051082417368889,-0.04228953644633293,0.02374301478266716,-0.01322630606591702,-0.02885289676487446,0.02692277170717716,-0.04038415849208832,0.02167678996920586,0.05191541835665703,0.006263627205044031,-0.03117894567549229,-0.02900136820971966,-0.01433984003961086,-0.0191651526838541,-0.01777942292