cmn2wab3t00axjc3o4y2v9ftu	tca-assessment-templates	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage assessment templates as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I manage assessment templates as a TPRM Administrator?\nHow to create an assessment template?\nHow to define assessment structure and questions?\nWhere to manage assessment templates?\nHow to assign templates to assessment types?\nAssessment template management\nAssessment Templates define the structure and questions for vendor assessments. As Customer Administrator, you can create, manage, and assign templates to assessment types.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Template**\nView existing assessment templates\nClick **Create Template** to define a new assessment structure\nConfigure the **questions and domains** included in the template\nAssign templates to specific **assessment types** (Onboarding, Periodic, On-Demand)\nEdit or update templates as assessment requirements evolve\nTemplates are used by the Assessment Factory for batch assessment creation\nChanges to templates affect future assessments only — existing assessments retain their original template structure\nAs Customer Administrator, you control which templates are available for the organization\nassessment templates\ntemplate creation\nassessment structure\nquestions\ntemplate management	{-0.003885002806782722,0.03985609114170074,0.1068588867783546,-0.004794440232217312,-0.009907183237373829,-0.0306707751005888,-0.005899975076317787,-0.02910199575126171,0.01759761199355125,0.04465337470173836,-0.006502476986497641,-0.03021605685353279,0.06443363428115845,-0.03205766528844833,0.0103903217241168,-0.02206522412598133,-0.003848056774586439,-0.01073704473674297,0.007195923011749983,0.0691172406077385,0.06711647659540176,0.01074272859841585,-0.02419103309512138,-0.002323328284546733,-0.00869081076234579,0.001333604683168232,-0.04165223240852356,0.03233049809932709,-0.04801829159259796,-0.001996499253436923,0.04363025724887848