cmn2wab4800ayjc3ol5j8dq43	tca-assessor-issue-register	tprm	Issue & Remediation	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I use the Assessor Issue Register as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I use the Assessor Issue Register as a TPRM Administrator?\nHow to view issues grouped by vendor with severity breakdown?\nWhere to see issue details with domain and severity?\nAssessor issue register with High/Medium/Low counts\nHow to track issue remediation status?\nHow to view vendor-specific issues?\nIssue register with severity and status tracking\nThe Assessor Issue Register shows issues grouped by vendor with severity breakdowns (High/Medium/Low). As Customer Administrator, you can view all issues across all vendors and assessors with full details.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Issue Register**\nView the **issue register tab** with vendors grouped by High/Medium/Low severity counts and totals\nClick a **vendor** to drill into their detailed issues list\nReview issue details: domain, severity, issue description, risk, and recommendation\nTrack issue status: **Open, Overdue, Closed**\nView **assessment code linkage** to trace issues back to their source assessment\nCheck **due dates** for remediation deadlines\nView **question number reference** linking issues to specific CAIQ questions\nAdd **remediation comments** to track resolution progress\nAs Customer Administrator, you see all issues across the entire organization — not limited to one assessor's assignments\nIssue codes uniquely identify each issue for tracking and reporting\nOverdue issues (past their due date) need immediate attention\nUse severity breakdown to prioritize: address High severity issues first\nassessor issue register\nissues\nseverity\nhigh\nmedium\nlow\nvendor issues\nremediation\nstatus tracking	{-0.02726448886096478,0.04146047309041023,0.09691193699836731,0.02657262794673443,-0.01993587613105774,-0.00309896538965404,-0.008116566576063633,-0.03495184704661369,0.03282501175999641,0.0584239065647