cmn2wab4q00azjc3ojdanvkvb	tca-rm-issue-register	tprm	Issue & Remediation	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I use the RM Issue Register as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I use the RM Issue Register as a TPRM Administrator?\nRM issue management with remediation tracking\nHow to assign remediation owners?\nHow to set due dates for issue remediation?\nRelationship Manager issue register\nHow to export the issue register?\nHow to add comments to issues?\nThe RM Issue Register provides full remediation tracking capabilities including assigning owners, setting due dates, adding comments, and exporting. As Customer Administrator, you have full management access.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → RM → Issue Management**\nView all issues with their severity, status, and due dates\nClick an issue to view full details and remediation plans\n**Assign remediation owners** to each issue for accountability\n**Set due dates** for remediation completion\nTrack **remediation status** as owners work on resolution\n**Add comments** to issues for ongoing communication\nUse **Export** to download the issue register as a report\nAs Customer Administrator, you can assign remediation to any user in the organization\nExporting the issue register is useful for management reporting and audit evidence\nMonitor overdue issues regularly and escalate as needed\nrm issue register\nremediation tracking\nassign owner\ndue dates\nexport\ncomments\nrelationship manager	{-0.004446772392839193,0.09449086338281631,0.0660802572965622,0.0008429070003330708,-0.03706049546599388,-0.0107209850102663,0.01969981007277966,0.006877268198877573,0.007857995107769966,0.05633390322327614,0.03226041793823242,0.01203674264252186,-0.01220730412751436,-0.01256060879677534,0.02865426987409592,-0.03584220260381699,-0.0001152620170614682,0.005442727357149124,0.01365707349032164,0.1076971739530563,0.05501814559102058,0.05916034802794456,-0.005662020295858383,-0.03484320268034935,-0.01008747238665819,0.06481322646141052,-0.009734