cmn2wab5w00b2jc3ovuokoffg	tca-vendor-monitoring	tprm	Monitoring & Scanning	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I use Vendor Monitoring and trigger scans as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I use Vendor Monitoring and trigger scans as a TPRM Administrator?\nHow to run a vendor security scan?\nHow to view the vendor security scorecard?\nWhat KPIs does vendor monitoring track?\nHow to trigger an on-demand vendor scan?\nVendor monitoring with 14 KPI scorecard\nHow does AI-powered vendor scanning work?\nHow to view vendor security scores?\nVendor Monitoring provides automated security scanning and continuous monitoring with a 14-KPI scorecard. As Customer Administrator, you can trigger on-demand scans, view security scores, and manage monitoring records for all vendors.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Monitoring**\nReview **stat cards**: Vendors Monitored, Avg Security Score, High Risk Vendors, Active Scans\nExamine the **Vendor Scorecard** table with sticky vendor name column and 14 KPI columns\nKPIs include: Network Security, DNS Health, Patching Cadence, Endpoint Security, IP Reputation, Application Security, Cubit Score, Email Security, SSL/TLS Config, Privacy, Known Breach, Hacker Chatter, Information Leak, Social Engineering\nNote **KPI cell colors**: Green (≥80), Emerald (≥65), Yellow (≥50), Red (<50)\nClick **Trigger New Scan** to open the scan dialog — enter vendor name and domain URL\nThe scan runs a **two-phase intelligence process**: HTTP header scan + 17 web searches + GPT-4o assessment\nMonitor **scan status**: Queued/Processing indicators with background polling every 10 seconds\nView **domain scores breakdown**: Data Breaches, Vulnerabilities, Security Posture, Certifications, DNS/Email, SSL/TLS, IP Reputation, Privacy, Dark Web, News\nClick a vendor to view their **scan history** and detailed results\n**Delete** monitoring records if needed\nAs Customer Administrator, you can scan any vendor and view all monitoring results across the organization\nScans use AI-powered web intelligence gathering — results may take a few minutes to complete\nStale scans (processing >10 minutes) are automatically cleaned up\nOnly vendors with completed assessments appear in the scorecard\nSecurity Score badge per vendor uses color coding aligned with Control Center Scorecard thresholds\nvendor monitoring\nsecurity scan\nscorecard\nkpi\nnetwork security\ndns health\nai scanning\nsecurity score\ntrigger scan	{-0.04258392378687859,0.04783569276332855,0.06574621051549911,-0.01976845227181911,-0.009202982299029827,-0.006942492444068193,-0.06103943288326263,0.009097699075937271,0.02178741060197353,0.02431420609354973,0.01257823500782251,-0.02002856321632862,-0.01215710304677486,-0.01316658221185207,0.04506117105484009,-0.04872750118374825,-0.02658088877797127,0.01864130422472954,-0.04857886582612991,0.05051112174987793,0.06227805837988853,0.04042871668934822,-0.01250391826033592,-0.009413548745214939,-0.03696056455373764,0.02806723862886429,-0.02406648173928261,-0.003356673289090395,0.01249772496521473,-0.01227477192878723,0.03923963382840157,-0.02240672335028648,-0.02191127277910709,0.009636501781642437,-0.005007140804082155,0.006645222194492817,-0.02754701673984528,-0.01185363996773958,-0.002714136615395546,0.001806844025850296,-0.01501213293522596,0.06074216216802597,-0.009518831968307495,0.04887613654136658,0.008899519219994545,0.008100606501102448,-0.01430611684918404,-0.02928109094500542,-0.02478488348424435,-0.02521840110421181,-0.01163068693131208,0.03834782540798187,-0.01670905016362667,0.01148205250501633,-0.04102325439453125,0.00826162751764059,0.01524747163057327,0.007871461100876331,-0.04146916046738625,0.02615975774824619,0.006186930928379297,-0.03542467206716537,-0.01179790217429399,-0.02158923074603081,0.01591632887721062,0.0005434466293081641,-0.02848837152123451,0.02811678498983383,0.01163688022643328,-0.05350859463214874,0.03594489395618439,0.0474393330514431,0.02786905877292156,-0.007747598458081484,0.03596966713666916,0.008