cmn2wabei00b9jc3o7srfzint	tca-sme-management	tprm	SME Management	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage Subject Matter Experts (SMEs) as a TPRM Administrator?	How do I manage Subject Matter Experts (SMEs) as a TPRM Administrator?\nHow to assign SMEs to assessment domains?\nWhere to manage SME assignments?\nHow to track SME availability and expertise?\nSME management and domain assignment\nHow to set up Subject Matter Experts for assessments?\nAccount Manager SME management\nSME Management lets you manage Subject Matter Experts who provide domain expertise during vendor assessments. As Customer Administrator, you can assign SMEs to domains and track their availability.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → AM → SME Management**\nView the list of all SMEs with their expertise areas\n**Assign SMEs** to specific assessment domains (e.g., Data Security, Access Control, Business Continuity)\nTrack **SME availability** to ensure domain coverage during assessments\nAdd new SMEs or update existing SME details and expertise areas\nAs Customer Administrator, you can manage all SME assignments across the organization\nEnsure each critical assessment domain has at least one SME assigned for coverage\nSMEs provide specialized review during assessments — their input improves assessment quality\nsme management\nsubject matter expert\ndomain expertise\nsme assignment\navailability\naccount manager	{0.00946044921875,0.037139892578125,0.08160400390625,-0.027099609375,-0.0091094970703125,0.001801490783691406,0.00865936279296875,0.024261474609375,0.02935791015625,0.032379150390625,0.0396728515625,-0.0227508544921875,0.006809234619140625,-0.0265045166015625,0.017059326171875,0.0106201171875,-0.040496826171875,0.01236724853515625,0.007415771484375,0.0655517578125,0.072021484375,0.0689697265625,-0.0276641845703125,0.0260009765625,-0.00717926025390625,0.001383781433105469,-0.016021728515625,0.006595611572265625,0.003492355346679688,-0.0433349609375,0.067138671875,-0.02508544921875,-0.043365