cmn2wabex00bajc3ol61tg81a	tca-tprm-reports	tprm	Reports	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I generate TPRM reports as a Customer Administrator?	How do I generate TPRM reports as a Customer Administrator?\nWhat reports are available in TPRM?\nHow to generate vendor risk assessment reports?\nHow to export assessment completion reports?\nWhere to view issue resolution reports?\nTPRM reporting and analytics\nHow to generate reports for management review?\nHistorical trend analysis in TPRM\nAs Customer Administrator, you can generate all TPRM report types including vendor risk summaries, assessment completion reports, issue resolution tracking, and historical trend analysis for management review and audit purposes.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Reports**\nSelect the report type to generate: Vendor Risk Assessment, Assessment Completion, Issue & Remediation Status, or Historical Trends\nConfigure report parameters (date range, vendor filter, etc.) if applicable\nGenerate the report and review the results\nClick **Export** to download the report for stakeholder distribution\nUse historical trend analysis to track program improvements over time\nAs Customer Administrator, you have access to all report types — no restrictions\nReports can be used for board presentations, audit evidence, and regulatory compliance documentation\nExport reports regularly for archival and comparison purposes\ntprm reports\nvendor risk report\nassessment completion\nissue resolution\nexport\ntrend analysis\nmanagement review	{-0.033782958984375,0.06475830078125,0.10992431640625,-0.0204620361328125,-0.0321044921875,-0.0285186767578125,-0.03106689453125,0.00920867919921875,0.027130126953125,0.038665771484375,-0.01442718505859375,0.001080513000488281,0.0089111328125,-0.0360107421875,0.018646240234375,-0.00778961181640625,0.01264190673828125,-0.000316619873046875,-0.0288543701171875,0.0849609375,0.06304931640625,0.03936767578125,-0.039642333984375,-0.030731201171875,-0.01442718505859375,0.03857421