cmn2wabg500bdjc3o8rk39w7i	tca-notifications	tprm	Notifications & Support	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do TPRM notifications work for a Customer Administrator?	How do TPRM notifications work for a Customer Administrator?\nWhere to view TPRM notifications?\nWhat notifications does a Customer Administrator receive?\nHow to check unread TPRM alerts?\nNotification center for TPRM\nHow to manage TPRM notifications?\nDue date reminders and status alerts\nTPRM provides role-specific notifications for assessment assignments, status changes, due date reminders, and other activities. As Customer Administrator, you receive notifications for all critical TPRM events.\nCheck the **notification bell** in the header for unread notification count\nClick the bell to see a **quick access dropdown** of recent notifications\nNavigate to your role-specific notification page via **Sidebar → TPRM → [Role] → Notifications** for the full list\nReview notifications: assessment assignments, status change alerts, due date reminders\n**Mark notifications as read** after reviewing them\nAs Customer Administrator, you may receive notifications across multiple role contexts\nDue date reminders help you proactively manage upcoming assessment and remediation deadlines\nStatus change alerts keep you informed of assessment lifecycle transitions\nnotifications\nalerts\nunread\nbadge\ndue date reminder\nstatus change\nassessment notification	{-0.0172271728515625,0.05767822265625,0.0396728515625,0.0311279296875,-0.034515380859375,-0.0182647705078125,0.0126953125,0.0168914794921875,0.0217437744140625,0.0626220703125,-0.00861358642578125,0.04449462890625,0.01190185546875,0.01309967041015625,0.0172119140625,0.01113128662109375,0.00983428955078125,0.00543212890625,-0.037078857421875,0.1092529296875,0.04766845703125,0.0184783935546875,-0.004573822021484375,0.01641845703125,-0.002416610717773438,0.01078033447265625,-0.0087738037109375,0.054931640625,-0.031005859375,-0.0080718994140625,0.0654296875,-0.017227