cmn2wabnq00bfjc3oe1ncqm6z	tca-configurations	tprm	Configuration	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I configure TPRM system settings as a Customer Administrator?	How do I configure TPRM system settings as a Customer Administrator?\nHow to manage departments in TPRM?\nHow to manage service categories?\nWhere to configure TPRM system parameters?\nTPRM configuration and department management\nHow to set up departments and service categories?\nSystem configuration for TPRM module\nThe Configurations page lets you manage departments, service categories, and system parameters for the TPRM module. As Customer Administrator, this is your primary configuration interface.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Configurations**\nManage the **department list** — add, edit, or remove departments used across TPRM\nManage **service categories** — define the types of services vendors provide\nConfigure **system parameters** that control TPRM behavior\nOnly Customer Administrators can access the Configurations page\nDepartments configured here are used in vendor assignments, user management, and scoping\nService categories are used when creating vendors to classify the type of service provided\nChanges to configuration affect the entire TPRM module — review carefully before modifying\nconfigurations\ndepartments\nservice categories\nsystem parameters\ntprm config	{-0.044464111328125,0.031829833984375,0.058837890625,-0.0175628662109375,-0.01275634765625,-0.0241546630859375,-0.002218246459960938,0.0369873046875,0.002689361572265625,0.029876708984375,0.005733489990234375,-0.0090484619140625,0.0265045166015625,-0.01458740234375,0.019622802734375,-0.004756927490234375,0.005023956298828125,0.03680419921875,-0.0008678436279296875,0.0823974609375,0.048736572265625,0.0148773193359375,-0.00830078125,0.0261383056640625,-0.042755126953125,0.05450439453125,0.005847930908203125,0.056365966796875,-0.018035888671875,-0.050018310546875,0.044952392578125,-0.03106689453125,-0.032562255859375,0.01535797119140