cmn2wabo400bgjc3otu51xurk	tca-master-data	tprm	Configuration	tprm	{CustomerAdministrator}	How do I manage TPRM Master Data as a Customer Administrator?	How do I manage TPRM Master Data as a Customer Administrator?\nWhat is TPRM master data?\nHow to configure reference data in TPRM?\nWhere to manage lookup tables?\nTPRM master data setup and management\nHow to configure system defaults for TPRM?\nTPRM Master Data manages the reference data and lookup tables used across the module. As Customer Administrator, you can configure all master data including system defaults.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Master Data**\nView and manage **reference data** used across TPRM (risk categories, assessment types, etc.)\nConfigure **lookup tables** that populate dropdown menus throughout the module\nSet **system defaults** that control default values for new records\nOnly Customer Administrators can modify master data\nMaster data changes affect all users — modifications are reflected in dropdowns and forms across the module\nEnsure reference data is complete before onboarding new vendors or creating assessments\nmaster data\nreference data\nlookup tables\nsystem defaults\nconfiguration	{-0.038787841796875,0.06866455078125,0.0909423828125,-0.004283905029296875,-0.03607177734375,-0.0207061767578125,0.00244903564453125,0.037017822265625,-0.006885528564453125,0.0092926025390625,0.0002586841583251953,0.0009050369262695312,0.01345062255859375,-0.0185699462890625,0.02288818359375,-0.03668212890625,0.006732940673828125,0.01495361328125,-0.0303192138671875,0.08538818359375,0.047393798828125,0.0202178955078125,-0.009918212890625,0.00782012939453125,-0.01468658447265625,0.041534423828125,0.0167236328125,0.054168701171875,-0.00873565673828125,-0.022308349609375,0.03912353515625,-0.030914306640625,-0.0191802978515625,0.033294677734375,0.037933349609375,-0.0247344970703125,0.002428054809570312,0.0244598388671875,0.0001215338706970215,0.01116180419921875,-0.024810791015625,0.010711669921875,-0.0