cmn2wabps00bkjc3oy8bn9c05	tbo-bo-dashboard	tprm	Dashboard	tprm	{BusinessOwner}	How do I use the Business Owner Dashboard?	How do I use the Business Owner Dashboard?\nWhat does the BO Dashboard show?\nBusiness Owner home page\nHow to see vendor criticality for my business unit\nBO Dashboard charts overview\nWhere do I see assessment status as a Business Owner?\nBO vendor risk overview\nBusiness Owner analytics dashboard\nThe BO Dashboard displays vendor criticality distribution and assessment status for vendors within your business unit through two interactive bar charts, giving you an at-a-glance view of your vendor risk posture.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → BO → Dashboard**\nView the **Vendor Criticality** bar chart showing how your business unit vendors are distributed across Nominal, Low, Moderate, High, and Critical levels with color coding\nView the **Assessment Status** bar chart showing counts of Initiated, In Progress, and Completed assessments for your vendors\nHover over chart bars to see **interactive tooltips** with exact vendor and assessment counts\nThe dashboard **auto-refreshes** data on page load so you always see the latest status\nOnly vendors within your business unit are shown — this is scoped to your vendor relationships\nUse the criticality chart to identify vendors that may need attention or escalation\nUse the assessment status chart to track progress on vendor evaluations\nIf no vendors exist yet, a 'No Data to Display' message appears\nbo\ndashboard\nbusiness owner\ncriticality\nassessment status\nchart\nbusiness unit\nbar chart\nanalytics	{-0.011871337890625,0.0297393798828125,0.053924560546875,0.02978515625,-0.0006451606750488281,-0.00734710693359375,-0.036956787109375,-0.0247650146484375,0.0261077880859375,0.0129547119140625,0.03240966796875,-0.01580810546875,-0.03814697265625,-0.05010986328125,0.049835205078125,0.0128173828125,-0.02459716796875,0.0092315673828125,-0.0340576171875,0.06268310546875,0.06488037109375,0.0246429443359375,