cmn2wabqc00bljc3odo1s4xp1	tbo-bo-inventory	tprm	Vendor Management	tprm	{BusinessOwner}	How do I manage my vendor inventory as a Business Owner?	How do I manage my vendor inventory as a Business Owner?\nBO Vendor Inventory page\nHow to create a vendor as Business Owner\nHow to edit vendor details in BO inventory\nBusiness Owner vendor list and accordion\nHow to export vendor data as BO\nHow to manage vendor contracts from inventory\nBO vendor risk profile management\nHow to search and filter vendors as BO\nThe BO Vendor Inventory is your primary page for managing vendor relationships within your business unit. It features a nested accordion layout with create/edit forms, contract management, and bulk CSV export.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → BO → Vendor Inventory**\nView your vendors in a **nested accordion** layout — click any vendor row to expand and see full details\nClick **Create Vendor** to open the multi-section dialog form and add a new vendor to your business unit\nFill in vendor details across sections: Info, Contact, Service Category, Department, Risk Profile, Contract Dates, and Certifications\nSet **Vendor Risk Profile** toggles: Access to Network, Cloud, Access to Data, PII — these define the vendor's risk exposure\nUse the **Edit** button to modify existing vendor details\nManage contracts directly from vendor details: **download** or **upload** contract documents\nView **assessment status** and history for each vendor to track evaluation progress\nUse **Search** and **Filter** to quickly find specific vendors\nUse the **CSV bulk export** button to download all vendor data for reporting or analysis\nOnly vendors within your business unit are visible — you manage the business relationship, not the technical assessment\nContract management is integrated into vendor details for quick access\nVendor Risk Profile toggles help categorize the type of risk each vendor represents to your unit\nUse the bulk CSV export for periodic business unit reporting on vendor status\nbo\nvendor\ninventory\ncreate\nedit\naccordion\ncontract\ncsv\nexport\nrisk profile\nbusiness owner\nbusiness unit	{-0.05706787109375,0.033843994140625,0.04669189453125,0.006023406982421875,-0.036407470703125,-0.04193115234375,-0.032867431640625,-0.01318359375,-0.01084136962890625,0.011810302734375,0.033538818359375,-0.0180816650390625,0.0162506103515625,-0.035797119140625,0.052825927734375,0.021728515625,-0.0008649826049804688,0.045989990234375,-0.047210693359375,0.036956787109375,0.040008544921875,0.0256805419921875,0.0004887580871582031,0.003368377685546875,-0.054534912109375,0.023651123046875,-0.040557861328125,0.00531768798828125,0.001218795776367188,-0.06707763671875,0.040374755859375,-0.0169219970703125,0.00397491455078125,0.0234375,-0.01497650146484375,-0.0162200927734375,0.0200347900390625,-0.01715087890625,0.06561279296875,0.009307861328125,-0.00835418701171875,-0.005985260009765625,0.0189056396484375,0.0228271484375,0.0291290283203125,0.0304412841796875,-0.0213165283203125,0.01800537109375,-0.0088653564453125,-0.001128196716308594,0.003252029418945312,-0.003301620483398438,-0.0135345458984375,-0.03302001953125,-0.06451416015625,0.0022735595703125,0.0029144287109375,-0.007007598876953125,-0.0102691650390625,0.034576416015625,0.020782470703125,-0.033843994140625,-0.012298583984375,-0.006412506103515625,-0.0131072998046875,0.01485443115234375,-0.05224609375,0.029571533203125,0.0183868408203125,-0.057861328125,-0.001168251037597656,0.0091705322265625,0.00864410400390625,0.00408935546875,0.019927978515625,-0.01313018798828125,0.041595458984375,0.033172607421875,-0.039306640625,0.02276611328125,0.00799560546875,-0.01253509521484375,-0.01412200927734375,0.01422119140625,-0.0243988037109375,0.004718780517578125,-0.04315185546875,-0.0175323486328125,0.004604339599609375,-0.028167724609375,-0.0374755859375,-0.00606536865234375,0.01282501220703125,0.00824737548828125,0.035491943359375,-0.032958984375,-0.02423095703125,-0.04290771484375,-0.03047180175781