cmn2wabqx00bmjc3olqvtvbr6	tbo-bo-assessments	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{BusinessOwner}	How do I track vendor assessments as a Business Owner?	How do I track vendor assessments as a Business Owner?\nBO Assessments page\nHow to see ongoing assessments for my vendors\nBusiness Owner assessment tabs\nHow to view completed assessments as BO\nHow to manage offboard assessments\nBO assessment status tracking\nWhere do I see assessments awaiting response?\nHow to review offboarding vendor assessments\nThe BO Assessments page lets you monitor all vendor assessments for your business unit through a tabbed interface with Ongoing, Completed, and Offboard assessment views, each with sub-tab navigation for detailed status filtering.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → BO → Assessments**\nSelect the **Ongoing Assessments** tab to see active assessments for your business unit vendors\nUse sub-tabs within Ongoing: **Awaiting Response** (waiting for vendor input) and **Pending with Assessor** (being evaluated)\nSelect the **Completed Assessments** tab to review finished vendor evaluations and results\nSelect the **Offboard Assessments** tab to manage vendor offboarding workflows\nUse Offboard sub-tabs: **Offboard Approval** (pending your review) and **Terminated Vendors** (completed offboarding)\nView table columns: Assessment ID, Vendor, Type, Status, Initiated, Due Date, and Action\nClick an offboard assessment to route to the **Offboard Review** page for approval\nStatus is color-coded: Initiated (outline), In-Progress (secondary), Completed (default) for quick visual scanning\nAs the Business Owner, you monitor assessment progress but do not conduct the technical assessment itself\nOffboard assessments require your review and approval before a vendor relationship can be terminated\nUse the Ongoing tab regularly to ensure assessments are progressing on schedule\nbo\nassessment\nongoing\ncompleted\noffboard\nbusiness owner\nawaiting response\npending\ntabs\nstatus\noffboarding	{-