cmn2wabrd00bnjc3od0i2d0mf	tbo-bo-contracts	tprm	Contract Management	tprm	{BusinessOwner}	How do I manage vendor contracts as a Business Owner?	How do I manage vendor contracts as a Business Owner?\nBO Contracts page\nHow to renew a vendor contract\nHow to start vendor offboarding from contracts\nWhere do I see expiring contracts?\nHow to upload a contract document\nBusiness Owner contract renewal process\nHow to download a vendor contract\nWhat do the red and amber date highlights mean?\nThe BO Contracts page is your central hub for vendor contract lifecycle management. It has tabs for expiring contracts and all vendor contracts, with capabilities to renew, offboard, and upload/download contract documents.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → BO → Contracts**\nView the **Expiring Contracts** tab to see contracts nearing expiration — these require your attention for renewal or offboarding decisions\nView the **All Vendor Contracts** tab for a complete listing of all vendor contracts in your business unit\nTo **renew a contract**: click the **Renew** button, enter new start and end dates in the dialog, and confirm\nTo **initiate offboarding**: click **Start Offboarding** on the vendor's contract (this is conditional on assessment status)\nTo **upload a contract**: use the upload action and select a file (PDF, Word, or Excel formats supported)\nTo **download a contract**: click the download button on any vendor's contract record\nWatch for **date highlighting**: **red** indicates expired contracts, **amber** indicates contracts expiring soon\nContract renewal and offboarding are key Business Owner responsibilities — these decisions impact the vendor relationship\nOffboarding can only be initiated when the vendor's assessment status permits it\nVendors with active offboarding show an 'Offboard Request Submitted' status badge\nRed and amber date highlighting helps you prioritize which contracts need immediate attention\nAlways ensure contract documents are uploaded for compliance and audit trail purposes\nbo\ncontract\nexpiring\nrenew\noffboarding\nupload\ndownload\nbusiness owner\nexpired\namber\nred\npdf\ndocument	{-0.038055419921875,0.040252685546875,0.06396484375,0.021697998046875,-0.033966064453125,-0.0005021095275878906,-0.054168701171875,-0.0298919677734375,0.039337158203125,0.025970458984375,0.044036865234375,-0.0290679931640625,0.0029754638671875,-0.0310211181640625,0.03204345703125,-0.0056304931640625,0.001652717590332031,0.039703369140625,-0.03338623046875,0.0287628173828125,0.0478515625,0.041534423828125,-0.00843048095703125,0.021759033203125,-0.0243377685546875,0.0174407958984375,-0.01422119140625,-0.00830078125,-0.003801345825195312,-0.0606689453125,0.0648193359375,-0.019561767578125,-0.0311737060546875,0.01486968994140625,-0.016448974609375,-0.01702880859375,0.0003199577331542969,-0.0287017822265625,0.054901123046875,-0.00702667236328125,0.001708030700683594,-0.020294189453125,0.0307769775390625,0.0146484375,0.007049560546875,0.0191497802734375,-0.024993896484375,0.01194000244140625,-0.0082244873046875,0.044464111328125,-0.0117340087890625,-0.0079345703125,0.022613525390625,-0.01328277587890625,-0.0523681640625,-0.01114654541015625,-0.0064544677734375,0.0090484619140625,0.0006895065307617188,0.0267181396484375,0.010162353515625,-0.01038360595703125,-0.034912109375,0.0071563720703125,-0.033447265625,0.01226806640625,-0.102783203125,0.045135498046875,0.0224151611328125,-0.0096435546875,0.0229949951171875,0.0232696533203125,0.0195159912109375,0.0087738037109375,0.017791748046875,0.01432037353515625,0.062286376953125,0.036529541015625,-0.029144287109375,0.018585205078125,0.005985260009765625,-0.01085662841796875,-0.018310546875,0.0283050537109375,-0.0284271240234375,0.022216796875,-0.044403076171875,-0.018798828125,0.002025604248046875,-0.018585205078125,-0.01293182373046875,0.0105438232421875,-0.0162353515625,-0.0177459716796875,0.045745849609375,-0.0194244384765625,-0.0743408203125,-0.031585693359375,-0.023040771484375,0.01