cmn2wac0g00bojc3ok7tafcfp	tbo-bo-issues	tprm	Issue Management	tprm	{BusinessOwner}	How do I manage vendor issues as a Business Owner?	How do I manage vendor issues as a Business Owner?\nBO Issues page\nBusiness Owner issue management\nHow to track vendor issues for my business unit\nWhere do I see issue severity and status?\nHow to monitor remediation progress as BO\nBusiness unit vendor issues\nBO issue tracking view\nThe BO Issues page lets you view and track all issues related to vendors in your business unit. Monitor issue severity, status, and remediation progress to ensure vendor risks are being addressed.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → BO → Issue Management**\nView the list of issues related to your business unit vendors\nCheck **issue severity** levels (High, Medium, Low) to prioritize attention\nMonitor **issue status** (Open, Overdue, Closed) to track resolution progress\nTrack **remediation progress** for each issue to ensure timely resolution\nUse this view to identify patterns — repeated issues with a vendor may indicate deeper relationship concerns\nAs the Business Owner, you oversee issues from a business impact perspective rather than technical detail\nOverdue issues should be escalated — they represent unresolved risks to your business unit\nIssue severity and status help you prioritize which vendor relationships need intervention\nRemediation is typically handled by the Assessor or IT team, but you should monitor progress\nbo\nissues\nbusiness owner\nseverity\nstatus\nremediation\nbusiness unit\nvendor\ntracking	{-0.04792691022157669,0.0389568880200386,0.080422542989254,0.03152525797486305,-0.0168750062584877,-0.02377411536872387,0.008041070774197578,-0.03159626200795174,0.01694600842893124,0.03209327906370163,0.05675493180751801,-0.01294618286192417,-0.07251755893230438,-0.03164359554648399,0.05495619028806686,0.01908792741596699,-0.0214901901781559,0.01488692685961723,-0.00618316326290369,0.05159538984298706,0.06948810815811157,0.031241245567798