cmn2wac0v00bpjc3otmek4xg2	tbo-bo-user-management	tprm	User Management	tprm	{BusinessOwner}	How do I manage my team users as a Business Owner?	How do I manage my team users as a Business Owner?\nBO User Management page\nBusiness Owner team management\nHow to add users to my business unit team\nHow to assign roles to team members as BO\nBO team user administration\nBusiness unit user management\nThe BO User Management page lets you manage team users within your business unit, including adding members and assigning appropriate roles for TPRM activities.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → BO → User Management**\nView the list of current team members in your business unit\nAdd new team members as needed for your business unit's TPRM activities\nAssign appropriate **roles** to team members based on their responsibilities\nManage user access to ensure your team has the right permissions for their tasks\nThis is scoped to your business unit — you can only manage users within your own team\nRole assignment determines which TPRM pages and actions each team member can access\nFor organization-wide user management, contact the TPRM Administrator or Customer Administrator\nbo\nuser management\nteam\nbusiness owner\nrole assignment\nbusiness unit\nusers	{-0.002439036034047604,0.05320741981267929,0.0247547198086977,0.03711032867431641,-0.02234015613794327,-0.03510906547307968,-0.02329728007316589,0.02912703901529312,-0.01373691204935312,-0.008461850695312023,0.01952316425740719,-0.001370428246445954,-0.01939264684915543,-0.02141566015779972,0.03530484065413475,0.01362814754247665,-0.008189939893782139,-0.01840289309620857,-0.03088901750743389,0.07204537093639374,0.04898736998438835,0.02801764383912086,-0.02821341902017593,0.0198277048766613,-0.03782816976308823,0.05290288105607033,-0.02001260221004486,0.03804569691419601,-0.04481082782149315,-0.05847160518169403,0.01822887174785137,-0.01904460228979588,-0.01175740454345942,0.04054727405309677,0.02890951000154018,-0.04624651372432709,