cmn2wac1a00bqjc3os3mci8un	tbo-bo-monitoring	tprm	Monitoring	tprm	{BusinessOwner}	How do I view vendor monitoring as a Business Owner?	How do I view vendor monitoring as a Business Owner?\nBO Monitoring page\nBusiness Owner vendor security scorecard\nHow to see vendor security scores as BO\nBO monitoring KPI view\nWhere do I see vendor security posture as Business Owner?\nBusiness unit vendor monitoring dashboard\nHow to check vendor security ratings\nThe BO Monitoring page displays the vendor security monitoring scorecard for your business unit vendors, showing security scores and KPI ratings from automated scanning.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → BO → Monitoring** (or **Sidebar → TPRM → Monitoring** depending on configuration)\nView the **Vendor Scorecard** table showing security scores for each vendor in your business unit\nCheck the **Security Score** badge per vendor — color-coded for quick risk identification\nReview individual **KPI columns** including: Network Security, DNS Health, Patching Cadence, Endpoint Security, IP Reputation, Application Security, Email Security, SSL/TLS Config, Privacy, and more\nKPI cell colors indicate score ranges: **Green** (≥80 — good), **Emerald** (≥65 — fair), **Yellow** (≥50 — caution), **Red** (<50 — concern)\nUse this scorecard to understand the security posture of your vendor relationships\nMonitoring data is generated from automated security scans — you view the results but do not trigger scans\nOnly vendors with completed monitoring scans appear in the scorecard\nLow security scores may indicate a need to discuss risk mitigation with the vendor or escalate to the RM\nUse monitoring data alongside assessment results for a complete view of vendor risk\nbo\nmonitoring\nscorecard\nsecurity\nkpi\nbusiness owner\nsecurity score\nvendor\nscan	{-0.02407554350793362,0.02828606590628624,0.05868338793516159,0.01766979321837425,-0.0005011989851482213,-0.01637424901127815,-0.03927420452237129,-0.01834155805408955,0.0217603575438261,0