cmn2wac2300bsjc3o0o6tmpdl	tbo-bo-notifications	tprm	Notifications	tprm	{BusinessOwner}	How do I manage notifications as a Business Owner?	How do I manage notifications as a Business Owner?\nBO notification center\nBusiness Owner alerts and notifications\nHow to see unread notifications as BO\nWhat notifications does a Business Owner receive?\nWhere do I find vendor status change alerts?\nBO due date reminders\nBusiness Owners receive role-specific notifications about vendor status changes, assessment updates, due date reminders, and other TPRM activities related to their business unit.\nClick the **notification bell** icon in the header to see a quick dropdown of recent notifications\nAlternatively, navigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → BO → Notifications** for the full notification center\nView **unread notifications** indicated by a badge count on the bell icon\nReview notifications for: assessment assignments, vendor status changes, due date reminders, and remediation updates\nClick a notification to navigate to the relevant page or record\nMark notifications as **read** to clear the unread badge count\nNotifications are scoped to your business unit — you only receive alerts for your vendors\nDue date reminders help you stay on top of contract renewals and assessment timelines\nCheck notifications regularly to stay informed about vendor relationship changes\nbo\nnotifications\nalerts\nbusiness owner\nunread\nstatus change\ndue date\nreminder\nbadge	{-0.01876348257064819,0.02987532876431942,0.0306587740778923,0.04645822569727898,-0.02513549290597439,-0.02334662899374962,-0.003799703205004334,-0.00431220605969429,0.03282630071043968,0.03959003463387489,0.0126199759542942,0.007749566342681646,-0.03802314773201942,-0.00497160479426384,0.04230597242712975,0.04037347808480263,0.01390613056719303,0.02089183963835239,-0.03726581856608391,0.08544761687517166,0.06105639785528183,0.03833652287721634,-0.009740820154547691,0.01320755947381258,-0.03992952778935432,0.02540969848632812