cmn2wac3900bujc3ogi7p4k2s	tbo-renew-contract	tprm	Contract Management	tprm	{BusinessOwner}	How do I renew a vendor contract as a Business Owner?	How do I renew a vendor contract as a Business Owner?\nBO contract renewal process\nHow to extend a vendor contract\nSteps to renew an expiring contract\nBusiness Owner contract renewal dialog\nHow to set new contract dates\nRenew vendor agreement as BO\nBusiness Owners renew vendor contracts from the BO Contracts page by clicking Renew on an expiring contract and entering new start and end dates.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → BO → Contracts**\nGo to the **Expiring Contracts** tab to find contracts that need renewal\nIdentify the vendor contract to renew — watch for **amber** (expiring soon) or **red** (expired) date highlighting\nClick the **Renew** button on the contract row\nIn the renewal dialog, enter the **new contract start date**\nEnter the **new contract end date**\nOptionally upload an updated contract document (PDF, Word, or Excel)\nClick **Confirm** to complete the renewal\nContract renewal is a key Business Owner responsibility — expiring contracts represent a business risk\nRed-highlighted dates indicate already expired contracts that need urgent attention\nAmber-highlighted dates indicate contracts expiring soon that should be renewed proactively\nThe renewed contract dates will be reflected in the BO Vendor Inventory and BO Dashboard\nbo\nrenew\ncontract\nexpiring\nextend\ndates\nbusiness owner\nrenewal	{-0.03501627594232559,0.04643311351537704,0.05986878275871277,0.002600405132398009,-0.04316121339797974,0.003205184359103441,-0.05996160209178925,-0.01630148105323315,0.02404033206403255,0.03777766600251198,0.03580524399876595,-0.02180105447769165,0.008464006707072258,-0.03559640049934387,0.01367931999266148,0.006172517780214548,-0.01916729286313057,0.04378774762153625,-0.03940201178193092,0.01751974038779736,0.03496986627578735,0.04743092507123947,-0.01536167971789837,0.01829710602760315,-0.023437002673745