cmn2wac4300bwjc3o1qxh6yvk	tbo-no-access	tprm	Permissions	tprm	{BusinessOwner}	What TPRM pages can I NOT access as a Business Owner?	What TPRM pages can I NOT access as a Business Owner?\nBusiness Owner restricted pages\nWhy can't I see the RM Dashboard?\nWhy don't I have access to the Assessor pages?\nBO role limitations in TPRM\nWhat is not available to a Business Owner?\nWhich TPRM modules are restricted for BO?\nWhy can't I access Configuration or Settings?\nBusiness Owner permission restrictions\nAs a Business Owner, your access is scoped to business-side vendor management. Several TPRM pages are restricted because they belong to other roles (Relationship Manager, Assessor, Administrator) or require higher-level permissions.\n**RM Dashboard** — Available to Relationship Managers only; use the BO Dashboard instead\n**Assessor Dashboard** — Available to Assessors only; shows technical assessment analytics\n**Admin Vendor Management** — Full admin vendor CRUD; use BO Vendor Inventory instead\n**RM Vendor Inventory** — RM-scoped vendor view; your equivalent is BO Vendor Inventory\n**RM Assessments** — RM assessment management; use BO Assessments for your view\n**RM Contracts** — RM contract tracking; use BO Contracts for your view\n**RM Issue Register** — RM-scoped issues; use BO Issues for your view\n**Assessor Assessments, Assessor Inventory, Assessor Issue Register** — Technical assessment pages for Assessors only\n**AM Assessments, AM Follow-ups, AM SME Management** — Account Manager pages\n**Approver Assessments** — Assessment approval workflow for Approvers\n**CAIQ Questions** — Assessor questionnaire library\n**Program Monitor** — Executive program overview for Administrators\n**Control Center** — Risk parameter configuration for Administrators\n**Assessment Factory, Assessment Templates** — Batch assessment tools for Assessors/Admins\n**TPRM User Management** — Organization-wide user admin; use BO User Management for your team\n**Factory User Management** — Factory team admin\n**Configurations / Settings** — System configuration for Administrators\n**TPRM Reports** — Administrative reporting\nIf you need access to a restricted page, contact your TPRM Administrator or Customer Administrator\nYour BO-prefixed pages provide equivalent business-side views for vendor inventory, assessments, contracts, and issues\nThe Business Owner role is intentionally scoped to business relationship management — technical assessment and system configuration are handled by other roles\nMenu items for restricted pages are automatically hidden from your sidebar navigation\nbo\nno access\nrestricted\npermissions\nbusiness owner\ncannot access\nnot available\nlimitations\nrm\nassessor\nadmin	{0.006969727110117674,0.06293253600597382,0.06723736971616745,0.03623232990503311,-0.005006288178265095,-0.007956250570714474,-0.03682168200612068,-0.01806491799652576,0.007719228975474834,0.01596374996006489,0.01702714525163174,-0.02276692166924477,-0.0033919767010957,0.02106292545795441,0.01125534065067768,0.005432287231087685,0.006854419130831957,0.01216499228030443,-0.01284402888268232,0.09352758526802063,0.0700560063123703,-0.00089523836504668,-0.05447661876678467,-0.01548970583826303,-0.02831451594829559,0.03005694784224033,-0.001637533539906144,0.01518221851438284,-0.007245185319334269,-0.04186961054801941,0.04666129872202873,-0.04207460209727287,-0.01864145696163177,0.0003763524582609534,0.01624561473727226,-0.04404764994978905,0.009679464623332024,0.001249970635399222,0.03510487452149391,0.01319635845720768,-0.02253630571067333,-0.009301510639488697,-0.01532314997166395,0.02379188127815723,-0.02867325209081173,0.03177375718951225,-0.006578961387276649,0.008968398906290531,-0.000820768647827208,-0.02238256111741066,0.006021639332175255,0.02450935356318951,-0.02531650848686695,-0.004740439355373383,-0.03702667728066444,-0.0003265057748649269,-0.02500902116298676,-0.0148491058498621,-0.03843599557876587,0.006873636972159147,-0.005054333247244358,-0.0