cmn2wacba00byjc3o09992kqm	trm-rm-dashboard	tprm	Dashboard	tprm	{RelationshipManager}	How do I use the Relationship Manager Dashboard?	How do I use the Relationship Manager Dashboard?\nWhat does the RM Dashboard show?\nRelationship Manager home page\nHow to see vendor criticality as RM\nRM Dashboard charts overview\nWhere do I see assessment status as a Relationship Manager?\nRM vendor risk overview\nRelationship Manager analytics dashboard\nThe RM Dashboard displays vendor criticality distribution and assessment status across all your managed vendors through two interactive bar charts, giving you an at-a-glance view of your vendor portfolio.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → RM → Dashboard**\nView the **Vendor Criticality** bar chart showing vendor distribution across Nominal, Low, Moderate, High, and Critical levels with color coding\nView the **Assessment Status** bar chart showing counts of Initiated, In Progress, and Completed assessments\nHover over chart bars to see **interactive tooltips** with exact vendor and assessment counts\nThe dashboard **auto-refreshes** data on page load so you always see the latest status\nUse the criticality chart to identify high-risk vendors requiring immediate attention or assessment initiation\nThe dashboard shows data for all vendors you manage, not limited to a single business unit\nUse vendor criticality to prioritize which vendors need assessments first\nIf no vendors exist yet, a 'No Data to Display' message appears in the chart area\nBoth charts are interactive — hover for details on each bar segment\nrm\ndashboard\nrelationship manager\ncriticality\nassessment status\nchart\nbar chart\nanalytics\nvendor risk	{-0.0269483458250761,0.03596388176083565,0.06431245803833008,0.02822575159370899,-0.002329115755856037,0.008413681760430336,-0.01256524957716465,-0.009242766536772251,0.004655160941183567,0.02648160234093666,0.001274334965273738,-0.03311428427696228,-0.02542528510093689,-0.002023582579568028,0.03751150891184807,-0.0045