cmn2wacbp00bzjc3obro1hdre	trm-rm-inventory	tprm	Vendor Management	tprm	{RelationshipManager}	How do I manage vendors in the RM Vendor Inventory?	How do I manage vendors in the RM Vendor Inventory?\nHow to create a vendor as Relationship Manager\nRM Vendor Inventory page\nHow to edit vendor details in RM inventory\nHow to add a new vendor\nHow to delete a vendor from RM inventory\nHow to view vendor risk ratings as RM\nRM vendor list and search\nHow to initiate an assessment from vendor inventory\nThe RM Vendor Inventory is your primary page for creating and managing vendor records. You can create new vendors, edit details, view risk ratings (VRR), initiate assessments, and track assessment history for each vendor.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → RM → Vendor Inventory**\nView the vendor list showing risk rating (VRR), status, and assessment information for each vendor\nClick **Create** to add a new vendor — enter vendor name, domain, vendor code, and description\nUse **Search** and **Filter** to find specific vendors in the inventory\nClick a vendor to view full details including risk rating: Nominal, Low, Moderate, High, or Critical\nClick **Edit** on a vendor to update its details\nClick **Delete** to remove a vendor (if permitted)\nClick **Initiate Assessment** on a vendor to start a new assessment — select type and assign an assessor\nView **Assessment History** for each vendor to see past and ongoing assessments\nCreating a vendor is the first step in the vendor lifecycle — you must create the vendor record before initiating an assessment\nThe Vendor Risk Rating (VRR) reflects the overall risk classification: Nominal, Low, Moderate, High, or Critical\nYou can initiate assessments directly from the vendor inventory page rather than navigating to the Assessments page\nAll vendor data supports dynamic translation — records entered in any language are translated when created or edited\nrm\nvendor\ninventory\ncreate\nedit\ndelete\nrisk rating\nvrr\nvendor code\ndomain\nassessment\nrelationship manager	{-0.05991670489311218,0.05643204972147942,0.0420820489525795,-0.001207680907100439,-0.02387230657041073,-0.01997626759111881,0.001994904363527894,0.005426623858511448,-0.006805966608226299,0.03881518170237541,0.02085953205823898,-0.02690927870571613,-0.01094399392604828,0.005574842914938927,0.04939014464616776,-0.006684971507638693,0.0009301487589254975,0.05154385417699814,-0.05193103849887848,0.05977151170372963,0.04167066514492035,0.05130186304450035,-0.00424994807690382,-0.01565674878656864,-0.02146450616419315,0.03061172552406788,0.0006809747428633273,0.03680666536092758,0.00940735824406147,-0.04970473051071167,0.00902017392218113,-0.03971054777503014,0.01295856013894081,0.01997626759111881,-0.008288154378533363,0.008021965622901917,0.008681388571858406,-0.003605649806559086,0.017338577657938,0.006521628238260746,-0.02078693360090256,0.01654001139104366,0.02773204445838928,0.04447774589061737,0.01935919374227524,0.01977057568728924,-0.01079275086522102,0.003173092845827341,-0.01316425204277039,-0.05488331243395805,-0.02014566026628017,-0.01512437034398317,0.0006942086038179696,-0.01261977478861809,-0.0396137498319149,-0.01144007313996553,0.02712707035243511,0.02442888170480728,-0.01989157125353813,0.02579612471163273,0.04409056529402733,-0.0343867689371109,-0.01654001139104366,-0.0281918253749609,-0.009371059946715832,0.01633431948721409,-0.05217302590608597,0.02840961702167988,0.002953789429739118,-0.03404798358678818,0.01585033908486366,-0.02108942158520222,0.04041231796145439,0.005112037062644958,0.01110733766108751,-0.01378132589161396,0.05222142487764359,0.006963260006159544,-0.05236661806702614,0.04259022697806358,0.02700607478618622,-4.90124111820478e-05,-0.02523954957723618,0.004797450266778469,0.003747818991541862,-0.01185750588774681,-0.03124089911580086,-0.02450148016214371,0.02257766015827656,-0.02346092276275158,-0.04440515115857124,0.01823394000530243,0.007271796930581331,0.0470428392291069,0.02424738928675652,-0