cmn2wacc400c0jc3opcjm8mlt	trm-rm-assessments	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{RelationshipManager}	How do I manage assessments as a Relationship Manager?	How do I manage assessments as a Relationship Manager?\nHow to create a vendor assessment\nHow to initiate an assessment in TPRM\nRM Assessments page overview\nHow to assign an assessor to an assessment\nHow to track assessment status as RM\nAssessment lifecycle in TPRM\nHow to filter assessments by status or vendor\nHow to view assessment results as RM\nThe RM Assessments page lets you create vendor assessments, assign assessors, and track the full assessment lifecycle from Draft through to Completed. This is where you initiate and oversee all vendor evaluations.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → RM → Assessments**\nView the assessment list showing status, vendor, assignee, and dates for each assessment\nClick **Create Assessment** to initiate a new assessment — select the vendor, assessment type, and assign an assessor\nTrack assessment status through the lifecycle: **Draft → In Progress → Submitted → Under Review → Approved/Completed**\nUse **Filter** options to narrow assessments by status, vendor, or assigned assessor\nClick an assessment to view its details, results, and current progress\nMonitor overdue or stalled assessments and follow up with assigned assessors as needed\nYou initiate assessments and assign assessors, but the Assessor role conducts the actual CAIQ questionnaire\nEach assessment goes through a defined lifecycle — Draft, In Progress, Submitted, Under Review, and Approved/Completed\nYou can create assessments from this page or directly from the RM Vendor Inventory\nAssessment results feed into the Vendor Risk Rating (VRR) displayed in the vendor inventory\nFilter by status to quickly see which assessments need attention or are overdue\nrm\nassessment\ncreate\ninitiate\nassign\nassessor\nstatus\nlifecycle\ndraft\nin progress\nsubmitted\nreview\ncompleted\nvendor\nrelationship manager	{-0.0421702