cmn2waccj00c1jc3oais73pdi	trm-rm-issues	tprm	Issue & Remediation	tprm	{RelationshipManager}	How do I manage the Issue Register as a Relationship Manager?	How do I manage the Issue Register as a Relationship Manager?\nRM Issue Register page\nHow to track vendor issues in TPRM\nHow to assign remediation owners for issues\nHow to set due dates for issue remediation\nHow to add comments to vendor issues\nHow to export the issue register\nIssue severity and status tracking as RM\nHow to manage remediation as a Relationship Manager\nThe RM Issue Register provides full remediation tracking for issues identified during vendor assessments. You can view issues by severity, assign remediation owners, set due dates, add comments, and export the register.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → RM → Issue Management**\nView the issue list showing severity (High/Medium/Low), status, and due dates for each issue\nClick an issue to view full details including domain, description, risk, and recommendation\n**Assign a remediation owner** to each issue — this person is responsible for resolving the issue\n**Set due dates** for remediation to ensure timely resolution\n**Track remediation status** — issues move through Open, Overdue, and Closed states\n**Add comments** to issues for communication and progress updates with remediation owners\nClick **Export** to download the issue register for reporting or stakeholder distribution\nMonitor overdue issues and escalate as needed to ensure vendor compliance\nIssues are generated from assessment findings — they are linked to specific assessment codes and question numbers\nAssigning remediation owners and setting due dates is a key RM responsibility for ensuring timely resolution\nIssues that pass their due date automatically move to 'Overdue' status for visibility\nUse comments to communicate with remediation owners and document progress\nExport the issue register regularly for management reporting and audit trails\nrm\nissue\nregister\nremediation\nseverity\nstatus\ndue date\nowner\ncomment\nexport\ntracking\nrelationship manager\nopen\noverdue\nclosed	{-0.03191883489489555,0.07735969126224518,0.08416969329118729,0.004712498746812344,-0.02643163688480854,0.002221519127488136,0.0200258232653141,-0.01169703993946314,0.01233394723385572,0.05550888553261757,0.03845937922596931,-0.003870434127748013,-0.02679908275604248,-0.006173097528517246,0.04259927198290825,-0.02218150720000267,0.008690104819834232,0.01264015212655067,0.00810831505805254,0.0885300561785698,0.0573706142604351,0.06501349806785583,-0.01377923600375652,-0.02574573643505573,-0.02226724475622177,0.06129004061222076,-0.005478011909872293,0.030179588124156,0.01998907886445522,-0.01156231015920639,0.03059602715075016,-0.03721006214618683,-5.27247138961684e-05,0.004571644123643637,0.03965970128774643,0.02445967495441437,0.003689773147925735,0.008102190680801868,-0.01799261942505836,0.01780889742076397,-0.002267449861392379,0.007361174095422029,-0.007018223870545626,0.04357913136482239,-0.00506463460624218,0.00410621240735054,-0.02340632863342762,0.02709303982555866,0.02912624180316925,-0.01006802823394537,-0.007159078493714333,-0.01963387988507748,-0.006614033132791519,0.05070758610963821,0.01155006140470505,-0.01139695942401886,0.01259115990251303,0.04774352163076401,-0.008892199955880642,0.003499925835058093,0.03561779484152794,-0.008671732619404793,-0.04544085636734962,-0.03314365446567535,0.0133872926235199,0.005692355334758759,-0.06212291866540909,0.0148325813934207,0.01840905845165253,-0.01196037698537111,0.01576344482600689,-0.01320356968790293,0.03142890706658363,0.001313620479777455,0.04394657537341118,0.006252711173146963,0.0827489048242569,0.003983729984611273,-0.00123783468734473,0.00611798046156764,0.03194333240389824,-0.006344572640955448,-0.05908536165952682,-0.0346379354596138,0.001464426517486572,-0.04348114505410194,-0.06129004061222076,-0.03409901633858681,-0.01763742230832577,-0.006914114113897085,-0.0195113979279995,0.03245775401592