cmn2wacdr00c4jc3odxxocqz7	trm-rm-reports	tprm	Reports	tprm	{RelationshipManager}	How do I generate TPRM reports as a Relationship Manager?	How do I generate TPRM reports as a Relationship Manager?\nRM Reports page overview\nWhat reports are available in TPRM?\nHow to create vendor risk reports\nHow to export TPRM reports\nAssessment completion reports for RM\nIssue resolution reports in TPRM\nHow to generate management reports as RM\nThe Reports page lets you generate comprehensive TPRM reports including vendor risk summaries, assessment completion reports, issue resolution tracking, and historical trend analysis for management review and regulatory compliance.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Reports**\nSelect the report type you need: vendor risk assessment, assessment completion, or issue resolution\nConfigure report parameters such as date range, vendor scope, or status filters\nClick **Generate** to produce the report\nReview the report data including charts, summaries, and detailed breakdowns\nClick **Export** to download the report for stakeholder distribution or audit purposes\nUse **historical trend analysis** to track how vendor risk posture has changed over time\nReports pull data from assessments, issues, and monitoring — ensure your data is up to date for accurate reporting\nExport reports regularly for management review meetings and regulatory submissions\nHistorical trend reports help demonstrate improvement in vendor risk posture over time\nReports can be filtered by vendor, status, or date range for targeted analysis\nrm\nreports\ngenerate\nvendor risk\nassessment completion\nissue resolution\nexport\nmanagement\ntrend\nrelationship manager	{-0.04302176460623741,0.06772071868181229,0.09769093990325928,-0.01717187464237213,-0.02481405064463615,-0.02382425032556057,-0.0167805589735508,0.01407587341964245,0.00292623951099813,0.02550460770726204,-0.03397545218467712,-0.006922843866050243,-0.01622811332345009,-0.02242011576890945,0.01864506676793098,-0.01