cmn2wacek00c6jc3oopltbic9	trm-vendor-lifecycle	tprm	Vendor Management	tprm	{RelationshipManager}	What is the vendor lifecycle and how does the RM manage it?	What is the vendor lifecycle and how does the RM manage it?\nEnd-to-end vendor management process\nVendor onboarding to offboarding lifecycle\nHow to manage a vendor from creation to completion\nVendor lifecycle stages in TPRM\nWhat are the steps in vendor management?\nFull vendor lifecycle as Relationship Manager\nHow does vendor onboarding work?\nThe Relationship Manager oversees the complete vendor lifecycle end-to-end: creating vendor records, initiating risk assessments, assigning assessors, tracking issue remediation, managing contracts, monitoring security posture, and ensuring ongoing compliance.\n**Step 1 — Create Vendor:** Navigate to RM Vendor Inventory and create a new vendor record with name, domain, vendor code, and description\n**Step 2 — Initiate Assessment:** Create an assessment for the vendor, select the assessment type, and assign an assessor to conduct the evaluation\n**Step 3 — Track Assessment:** Monitor assessment progress through the lifecycle (Draft → In Progress → Submitted → Under Review → Completed) from RM Assessments\n**Step 4 — Manage Issues:** Review issues identified during the assessment in the RM Issue Register — assign remediation owners and set due dates\n**Step 5 — Track Remediation:** Follow up on open and overdue issues, add comments, and ensure remediation actions are completed on time\n**Step 6 — Manage Contracts:** Track vendor contracts, monitor expiration dates, and coordinate renewals in RM Contracts\n**Step 7 — Monitor Security:** Review vendor security posture in the Monitoring scorecard, trigger new scans when needed, and identify vendors with degraded scores\n**Step 8 — Report:** Generate TPRM reports for management review and regulatory compliance using the Reports page\nThe RM is the primary lifecycle owner — you coordinate with Assessors (who conduct questionnaires) and Business Owners (who own business relationships)\nVendor risk ratings (VRR) are updated based on assessment results and monitoring data\nIssues that are not remediated on time escalate to 'Overdue' status for visibility\nContinuous monitoring through security scans helps identify emerging risks between formal assessments\nvendor\nlifecycle\nonboarding\noffboarding\nend-to-end\ncreate\nassess\nmonitor\ncontract\ncompliance\nrelationship manager	{-0.03419326990842819,0.0539482943713665,0.08580022305250168,0.008017858490347862,-0.01892580278217793,-0.00136349315289408,-0.003201046027243137,0.003801623126491904,-0.0001735805271891877,0.05355807393789291,0.01677957735955715,-0.03611999377608299,-0.01263346150517464,-0.01680396683514118,0.01603571698069572,-0.0107799032703042,0.005502750631421804,0.03294943273067474,-0.03036420792341232,0.06492330878973007,0.08141022175550461,0.0363638810813427,0.01207251660525799,0.008584900759160519,-0.04248550161719322,0.02212075144052505,-0.002623333362862468,0.04360739141702652,-0.01027993019670248,-0.04199772328138351,0.05185084789991379,-0.03831499442458153,0.005880778655409813,0.01807219162583351,0.01991355419158936,0.02587664686143398,-0.01307246182113886,-0.01162132155150175,0.01073722261935472,0.02604736760258675,-0.005804563406854868,0.02209636382758617,-0.01319440640509129,0.06058208271861076,0.02002330496907234,0.03431521356105804,-0.01116402912884951,0.03124220855534077,0.006072841584682465,-0.008475149981677532,-0.01743807829916477,-0.003774185664951801,0.01808438636362553,0.02575470134615898,-0.03558343648910522,-0.01468213088810444,0.03268115594983101,0.01308465655893087,-0.02638881281018257,0.01931602694094181,0.03994905203580856,-0.03241287544369698,-0.01626741141080856,-0.03204704448580742,-0.01598693802952766,0.01048723608255386,-0.06560619920492172,0.02636442519724369,-0.003152268240228295,-0.0368516594171524,0.01931602694094181,-0.009115359745919704,0.008725136518478394,-0.006347216665744781,0.043680559