cmn2wacez00c7jc3oi3yzgpu6	trm-no-access	tprm	Permissions	tprm	{RelationshipManager}	What pages are restricted for the Relationship Manager role?	What pages are restricted for the Relationship Manager role?\nWhat pages can't I access as RM?\nWhy can't I see the BO Dashboard?\nWhy can't I access the Assessor Dashboard?\nRM restricted pages in TPRM\nWhat is not available to the Relationship Manager?\nWhy is the Assessment Factory missing from my sidebar?\nWhy can't I see Configuration or Settings?\nThe Relationship Manager role is focused on end-to-end vendor lifecycle management. Several pages are restricted because they belong to other roles (Business Owner, Assessor, Administrator) with different responsibilities.\nThe following pages are **not accessible** to the Relationship Manager role:\n**BO Dashboard** — Business Owner analytics scoped to a business unit\n**BO Vendor Inventory, BO Assessments, BO Contracts, BO Issues** — Business Owner pages scoped to business unit vendors\n**BO User Management** — Business unit team management\n**Assessor Dashboard** — Assessor-specific analytics with 6 charts\n**Assessor Assessments, Assessor Vendor Inventory, Assessor Issue Register** — Assessor workqueue and tools\n**Assessment Factory, Assessment Templates** — Batch assessment creation tools for Assessors/Admins\n**Assessor Follow-ups** — Assessor follow-up tracking\n**CAIQ Questions** — Assessor questionnaire library\n**Program Monitor** — Executive program overview for Administrators\n**Control Center** — Risk parameter configuration for Administrators\n**Configuration / Settings** — System configuration for Administrators\n**TPRM User Management, Factory User Management** — Organization-wide and factory user admin\n**SME Management** — Subject Matter Expert management\n**AM Assessments, AM Follow-ups, AM SME Management** — Account Manager pages\n**Approver Assessments** — Assessment approval workflow for Approvers\nIf you need access to a restricted page, contact your 