cmn2wacjm00c8jc3owbfqe26g	tas-role-overview	tprm	Role Overview	tprm	{TPRMAssessor}	What is the TPRM Assessor role?	What is the TPRM Assessor role?\nWhat can I do as an Assessor?\nAssessor role overview\nWhat pages can an Assessor access in TPRM?\nWhat is the Assessor responsible for?\nAssessor capabilities in TPRM\nWhat does the TPRM Assessor do?\nAssessor role summary\nThe TPRM Assessor is the hands-on assessment conductor. You answer CAIQ questionnaire questions, gather evidence, provide risk ratings, use AI-assisted responses, manage issues, and track follow-ups — all supported by the most comprehensive dashboard with 6 analytical charts.\n**Assessor Dashboard** — View 6 analytical charts covering issues, assessments, risk, results, top vendors, and domain distribution\n**Assessor Assessments** — Open assigned assessments, answer CAIQ questions with compliance ratings, attach evidence, and submit for review\n**Assessor Inventory** — View vendors assigned for assessment with risk ratings and completion status\n**CAIQ Questions** — Browse the full CAIQ questionnaire library organized by domain (accessed within assessments)\n**Issue Register** — View issues grouped by vendor with High/Medium/Low severity breakdowns, add remediation comments\n**Assessment Factory** — Batch-create assessments for multiple vendors at scale\n**Assessment Templates** — Manage templates that define assessment structure and questions\n**Follow-ups** — Track follow-up actions arising from assessments and reviews\n**Monitoring** — View vendor security monitoring scorecard with 14 KPI columns\n**Reports** — Generate TPRM reports for vendor risk, assessment completion, and issue resolution\n**Support** — Submit support requests and access help resources\nThis is the technical assessment execution role — you conduct the actual vendor evaluations using CAIQ questionnaires\nAI-assisted answering (Enable AI button) can help you complete questionnaire responses faster and more consistently\nYou can save draft progress at any time and return to complete assessments later\nEvidence attachment is supported per individual question for thorough documentation\nYour dashboard is the most comprehensive in the TPRM module with 6 distinct charts\nassessor\nrole\noverview\nresponsibilities\ncapabilities\naccess\ncaiq\nquestionnaire\nassessment\nevidence\nai	{0.00949859619140625,0.0277862548828125,0.06146240234375,0.034423828125,-0.006008148193359375,-0.01258087158203125,-0.01763916015625,0.0003366470336914062,0.031005859375,0.044647216796875,0.036529541015625,-0.0131378173828125,0.0199127197265625,-0.0177764892578125,0.0176544189453125,-0.0238494873046875,0.001367568969726562,-0.0055694580078125,-0.00811004638671875,0.06488037109375,0.0219573974609375,-0.0188446044921875,-0.018768310546875,-0.0214691162109375,-0.0144805908203125,-0.0287017822265625,-0.050537109375,0.035858154296875,-0.031890869140625,-0.0287933349609375,0.031463623046875,-0.04132080078125,-0.03631591796875,0.016448974609375,0.0369873046875,-0.00580596923828125,-0.0003721714019775391,0.0199432373046875,0.0009737014770507812,0.0004048347473144531,0.002378463745117188,0.03582763671875,-0.035919189453125,0.0201568603515625,-0.034393310546875,-0.005413055419921875,0.0384521484375,0.01739501953125,0.006771087646484375,0.010711669921875,-0.006458282470703125,0.05877685546875,0.029022216796875,0.01678466796875,-0.01287841796875,0.0086212158203125,0.0154876708984375,0.0261993408203125,-0.050933837890625,-0.0201568603515625,0.0097198486328125,-0.0318603515625,-0.0272064208984375,0.0048980712890625,-9.828805923461914e-05,-0.005832672119140625,-0.026275634765625,0.0304718017578125,0.0044403076171875,-0.0203704833984375,0.020904541015625,0.005954742431640625,0.0232391357421875,-0.0103607177734375,-0.000980377197265625,-0.03265380859375,0.041473388671875,0.0343017578125,-0.04302978515625,-0.0162200927734375,0.001168251037597656,0.00930023193359375,-0.020721435546875,-0.0222625732421875,0.021270751953125,-0.0142745971