cmn2wackf00cajc3or8l8mqpu	tas-assessor-inventory	tprm	Vendor Management	tprm	{TPRMAssessor}	How do I use the Assessor Vendor Inventory?	How do I use the Assessor Vendor Inventory?\nHow to view vendors assigned to me?\nAssessor vendor list\nWhere do I see my assigned vendors?\nAssessor Inventory page overview\nHow to check vendor risk ratings as Assessor?\nView vendor assessment status\nThe Assessor Vendor Inventory is a read-only view of vendors assigned to you for assessment. It shows each vendor's current risk rating and assessment completion status, helping you manage your assessment workload.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Inventory**\nBrowse the list of **vendors assigned** to you for assessment\nView each vendor's **current risk rating** (Nominal, Low, Moderate, High, Critical)\nCheck the **assessment completion status** for each vendor to see what needs attention\nClick on a vendor to **access the assessment form** for that vendor\nUse the list to **prioritize your assessment workload** based on risk level and due dates\nThis is a read-only view — vendor creation and editing is handled by Relationship Managers and Business Owners\nVendors appear here only if they have been assigned to you as the assessor\nRisk ratings are updated as you complete assessments and provide compliance ratings\nUse this page to track which vendors still need assessment completion\nassessor\ninventory\nvendor\nassigned\nrisk rating\nassessment status\nvendor list\nworkload	{-0.038787841796875,0.00997161865234375,0.046112060546875,0.005702972412109375,-0.0228729248046875,-0.0294647216796875,-0.037353515625,-0.046539306640625,0.036865234375,0.005924224853515625,0.0282745361328125,-0.01557159423828125,0.0193939208984375,-0.0341796875,0.041351318359375,-0.0118560791015625,0.001820564270019531,-0.0005178451538085938,-0.055023193359375,0.06646728515625,0.00989532470703125,0.038299560546875,-0.0032958984375,-0.0254669189453125,-0.0228729248046875,-0.0166778564453125,-0.06347656