cmn2wacku00cbjc3orqcjkcmb	tas-assessor-assessments	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{TPRMAssessor}	How do I conduct vendor assessments as an Assessor?	How do I conduct vendor assessments as an Assessor?\nHow to answer CAIQ questions?\nHow do I complete a vendor assessment?\nAssessment questionnaire workflow\nHow to use AI-assisted answering?\nAssessor assessment workqueue\nHow to submit an assessment for review?\nHow to save draft progress on an assessment?\nHow to attach evidence to assessment questions?\nThe Assessor Assessments page is your primary workqueue. Open assigned assessments to answer CAIQ questionnaire questions organized by domain, attach evidence, use AI-assisted responses, save draft progress, and submit completed assessments for review.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessments**\nView your list of **assigned assessments** with status indicators\nClick an assessment to **open the CAIQ questionnaire**\nQuestions are organized **by domain** (e.g., Data Security, Access Control, Business Continuity)\nFor each question, select a **compliance rating** from the available options\nClick **Enable AI** to activate AI-assisted question answering — the AI will suggest responses based on the question context\nAdd **evidence** to individual questions by uploading supporting documents or files\nAdd **notes** to questions to provide additional context or explanation for your ratings\nClick **Save Draft** at any time to preserve your progress and return later\nOnce all questions are answered, click **Submit** to send the assessment for review\nView **vendor details** within the assessment context for reference while answering\nAI-assisted answering (Enable AI) helps you complete responses faster — review AI suggestions before accepting them\nYou can save draft progress at any point and resume later without losing work\nEvidence can be attached per individual question for thorough documentation\nThe assessment lifecycle follows: Draft → In Progress → Submitted → Under Review → Approved/Completed\nOnce submitted, the assessment moves to the Approver for review — you cannot edit submitted assessments unless they are returned\nCompliance ratings should reflect the vendor's actual security posture based on evidence gathered\nassessor\nassessment\ncaiq\nquestionnaire\nai\nevidence\ncompliance\nrating\nsubmit\ndraft\nworkqueue\nenable ai\ndomain	{0.00699615478515625,0.0126953125,0.0823974609375,0.0293426513671875,-0.001860618591308594,-0.02777099609375,-0.042083740234375,-0.0179595947265625,0.0154266357421875,0.058837890625,0.05255126953125,-0.0281524658203125,0.0192413330078125,-0.02227783203125,0.035858154296875,0.0084381103515625,-0.00473785400390625,-0.00281524658203125,-0.0185394287109375,0.0267486572265625,0.00835418701171875,0.002880096435546875,-0.006221771240234375,-0.005481719970703125,-0.0479736328125,-0.041015625,-0.060272216796875,0.01399993896484375,-0.0235748291015625,-0.0307769775390625,0.024261474609375,-0.031494140625,-0.035858154296875,0.036468505859375,-0.016357421875,0.02197265625,-0.019927978515625,0.01537322998046875,0.00926971435546875,0.002716064453125,0.0064239501953125,0.004291534423828125,-0.021728515625,-0.002063751220703125,-0.0206756591796875,0.01395416259765625,0.0157012939453125,0.0071258544921875,-0.0091552734375,0.0064239501953125,-0.01430511474609375,0.055816650390625,0.037841796875,-0.0124359130859375,-0.01763916015625,-0.013031005859375,0.01116943359375,0.01116180419921875,-0.054595947265625,0.01432037353515625,0.0141143798828125,-0.034912109375,-0.01488494873046875,0.026397705078125,0.00775146484375,-0.0208740234375,-0.00344085693359375,0.032196044921875,0.0277557373046875,-0.04150390625,0.023529052734375,0.017120361328125,0.0687255859375,0.01556396484375,0.00550079345703125,-0.0229644775390625,0.038787841796875,0.03582763671875,-0.0278778076171875,0.007183074951171875,-0.028106689453125,-0.007572174072265625,-0.0227203369140625,-0.035736083984375,0.037628173828125,0.00472640991210