cmn2wacl900ccjc3om42jgnea	tas-caiq-questions	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{TPRMAssessor}	How do I browse CAIQ questions?	How do I browse CAIQ questions?\nWhat is the CAIQ questionnaire library?\nHow to search CAIQ questions?\nHow to filter questions by domain?\nCAIQ question reference list\nWhere can I see all assessment questions?\nHow are CAIQ questions organized?\nThe CAIQ (Consensus Assessments Initiative Questionnaire) Questions page is a reference library of all assessment questions organized by domain. Search by keyword or filter by domain to find specific questions.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → CAIQ Questions**\nBrowse the full list of **CAIQ questions** organized by domain\nView each question's **ID, question text, and domain** assignment\nUse the **search bar** to find questions by keyword\nUse the **domain filter** to narrow the list to a specific security domain\nReference this library when preparing for assessments or understanding the scope of a domain\nCAIQ stands for Consensus Assessments Initiative Questionnaire — a standardized questionnaire for assessing cloud service provider security\nQuestions are organized by domains such as Data Security, Access Control, Business Continuity, and more\nThis page is a read-only reference — actual question answering happens in the Assessor Assessments page\nUnderstanding the CAIQ structure helps you prepare better for vendor assessments\ncaiq\nquestions\nquestionnaire\ndomain\nlibrary\nsearch\nfilter\nconsensus\ncloud\nsecurity	{0.01241302490234375,-0.00722503662109375,0.0555419921875,0.03125,0.026336669921875,-0.0245513916015625,-0.037200927734375,-0.015167236328125,-0.00882720947265625,0.056427001953125,0.051544189453125,-0.038482666015625,0.0142364501953125,0.005977630615234375,0.032623291015625,0.0184478759765625,0.0169525146484375,-0.00234222412109375,-0.02801513671875,0.0584716796875,0.03125,0.00433349609375,-0.047882080078125,0.0150146484375,-0.064697265625,-0.0223846435546875,-0.03585815