cmn2wacm200cejc3ocg5wsboh	tas-assessment-factory	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{TPRMAssessor}	How do I use the Assessment Factory?	How do I use the Assessment Factory?\nHow to batch-create assessments?\nCreate multiple assessments at once\nAssessment Factory for bulk generation\nHow to schedule batch assessments?\nMulti-vendor assessment creation\nHow to use template-based batch assessments?\nThe Assessment Factory lets you batch-create and schedule assessments for multiple vendors simultaneously. Use templates to generate assessments at scale, saving time compared to creating individual assessments one by one.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessment Factory**\nSelect the **assessment template** to use for the batch\nChoose **multiple vendors** to include in the batch assessment generation\nConfigure **scheduling options** if you want assessments created on a future date\nReview the batch configuration and click **Generate** to create all assessments\nMonitor the **batch creation status** to confirm all assessments were created successfully\nNavigate to **Assessor Assessments** to see the newly created assessments in your workqueue\nThe Assessment Factory is ideal for periodic assessment cycles where many vendors need to be assessed simultaneously\nTemplate-based creation ensures consistency across all generated assessments\nGenerated assessments appear in your Assessor Assessments workqueue ready for completion\nUse Assessment History (Factory Reports) to review past batch creation results\nassessment factory\nbatch\nbulk\ncreate\nschedule\nmulti-vendor\ntemplate\ngenerate\nscale	{-0.032196044921875,0.001488685607910156,0.10723876953125,-0.017242431640625,-0.021453857421875,-0.018524169921875,-0.0137176513671875,-0.0299835205078125,0.01126861572265625,0.0217742919921875,0.020477294921875,-0.045074462890625,0.023681640625,-0.0443115234375,0.0254364013671875,0.006504058837890625,-0.034912109375,0.03131103515625,-0.032989501953125,0.003740310668945312,