cmn2wacmh00cfjc3ox3n7pa1u	tas-assessment-templates	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{TPRMAssessor}	How do I manage Assessment Templates?	How do I manage Assessment Templates?\nHow to create assessment templates?\nWhat are assessment templates for?\nTemplate management in TPRM\nHow to define assessment structure?\nAssessment template configuration\nHow to assign templates to assessment types?\nAssessment Templates define the structure and questions used in vendor assessments. Create and manage templates to standardize the assessment process and assign them to specific assessment types for consistent evaluation.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Template**\nView the list of **existing assessment templates**\nClick **Create** to define a new template with a name and description\nDefine the **assessment structure** by selecting domains and questions to include\n**Assign the template** to specific assessment types so it is used when those types of assessments are created\nEdit existing templates to update questions or structure as assessment requirements evolve\nTemplates ensure consistency across assessments — all assessors use the same questions and structure\nTemplates are used by the Assessment Factory for batch assessment generation\nChanges to a template affect only future assessments — existing assessments retain their original template structure\nWell-defined templates improve assessment quality and reduce the time needed to set up new assessments\ntemplate\nassessment\nstructure\nquestions\ncreate\nmanage\ndefine\nassign\ntype	{-0.00598907470703125,0.0335693359375,0.10711669921875,-0.015960693359375,-0.007625579833984375,-0.0269622802734375,-0.001627922058105469,-0.031097412109375,0.0129241943359375,0.0430908203125,-0.003522872924804688,-0.03326416015625,0.061309814453125,-0.033233642578125,0.0142822265625,-0.0178070068359375,-0.0008234977722167969,0.003778457641601562,0.0188446044921875,0.066650390625,0.055999755859375,0.00745391845703125,-0.03092956542