cmn2wacu100cijc3ow8enb13m	tas-reports	tprm	Reports	tprm	{TPRMAssessor}	How do I generate TPRM reports as an Assessor?	How do I generate TPRM reports as an Assessor?\nTPRM reports overview\nHow to export assessment reports?\nVendor risk assessment reports\nAssessment completion summary reports\nIssue resolution tracking reports\nWhere do I generate TPRM reports?\nThe Reports page lets you generate comprehensive TPRM reports including vendor risk assessment summaries, assessment completion reports, issue resolution tracking, and historical trend analysis for stakeholder distribution.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Reports**\nSelect the **report type** you want to generate (vendor risk, assessment completion, issue status, etc.)\nConfigure any **filters or date ranges** for the report\nClick **Generate** to create the report\nReview the report content on screen\nClick **Export** to download the report for stakeholder distribution or audit purposes\nReports provide management-level visibility into assessment progress and vendor risk posture\nUse assessment completion reports to track your team's progress against assessment schedules\nIssue resolution reports help demonstrate remediation progress to stakeholders\nHistorical trend analysis shows how vendor risk posture has changed over time\nreports\ntprm\nexport\nvendor risk\nassessment completion\nissue resolution\nsummary\ntrends\nanalytics	{-0.039093017578125,0.05291748046875,0.1102294921875,-0.01800537109375,-0.03448486328125,-0.031524658203125,-0.0261383056640625,0.0105133056640625,0.028533935546875,0.019012451171875,-0.0211029052734375,0.001306533813476562,0.00481414794921875,-0.051300048828125,0.0229034423828125,-0.009185791015625,0.003561019897460938,-0.0001313686370849609,-0.0296478271484375,0.08758544921875,0.056121826171875,0.0189208984375,-0.036865234375,-0.0265045166015625,-0.0165252685546875,0.029541015625,-0.0450439453125,0.021697998046875,-0.031158447265625,-0.00536346435546875,-0.00678253173828125,-0.03