cmn2wacva00cljc3om91xo1xz	tas-ai-assisted-answering	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{TPRMAssessor}	How does AI-assisted question answering work?	How does AI-assisted question answering work?\nHow to use the Enable AI button?\nAI-assisted assessment responses\nHow does AI help with CAIQ questions?\nAutomated assessment answering\nAI suggestions for assessment questionnaires\nHow to activate AI in assessments?\nWhat does Enable AI do in assessments?\nAI-assisted question answering accelerates the assessment process. Click the Enable AI button within an assessment to activate AI suggestions that propose compliance ratings and response text based on the question context, vendor profile, and available evidence.\nOpen an assessment from **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessments**\nLocate the **Enable AI** button within the assessment questionnaire interface\nClick **Enable AI** to activate AI-assisted answering for the current assessment\nThe AI will analyze each question's context, the vendor profile, and any uploaded evidence\nReview the **AI-suggested compliance rating** and response text for each question\n**Accept, modify, or reject** the AI suggestion — you have full control over the final answer\nContinue through the assessment, using AI suggestions as a starting point for your expert evaluation\nYou can disable AI assistance at any time to answer questions manually\nAI suggestions are recommendations, not final answers — always review and apply your professional judgment\nThe AI considers the question text, vendor context, and available evidence to generate suggestions\nAI-assisted answering significantly reduces the time needed to complete assessments, especially for large questionnaires\nEvidence attached to questions improves the quality and relevance of AI suggestions\nYou can toggle AI assistance on and off during an assessment as needed\nai\nassisted\nenable ai\nautomated\nquestion answering\nsuggestion\ncaiq\nresponse\nartificial intelligence	{0.00950622558