cmn2wacvp00cmjc3oaccj07j5	tas-no-access	tprm	Access & Permissions	tprm	{TPRMAssessor}	What pages are restricted for the TPRM Assessor role?	What pages are restricted for the TPRM Assessor role?\nWhat can't I access as an Assessor?\nWhy can't I see RM Dashboard?\nAssessor restricted pages in TPRM\nPages not available to Assessor\nWhy is Vendor Management hidden from my menu?\nWhat modules are Assessors not allowed to use?\nAssessor permission limitations\nAs a TPRM Assessor, your role is focused on conducting assessments. Several pages are restricted because they serve different functions managed by other roles (RM, BO, Admin). Restricted pages are automatically hidden from your sidebar navigation.\n**RM Dashboard** — Relationship Manager analytics (use Assessor Dashboard instead)\n**BO Dashboard** — Business Owner analytics (use Assessor Dashboard instead)\n**RM/BO Vendor Management & Inventory** — Vendor creation/editing is handled by RMs and BOs (use Assessor Inventory for your read-only view)\n**RM/BO Assessments** — Assessment creation and lifecycle management (use Assessor Assessments for your workqueue)\n**RM/BO/IT Issue Management** — Full issue management with remediation assignment (use Assessor Issue Register for your view)\n**Program Monitor** — Executive program overview restricted to Administrators\n**Control Center** — Risk parameter configuration restricted to Administrators\n**Configuration / Settings** — System configuration restricted to Administrators\n**TPRM User Management / Factory User Management** — User administration restricted to Administrators\n**Contracts** — Contract management handled by Relationship Managers\n**Vendor Offboarding** — Offboarding process managed by RMs and BOs\n**SME Management** — Subject Matter Expert management handled by Account Managers\n**AM Assessments / AM Follow-ups** — Account Manager-specific pages\n**Approver Assessments** — Assessment approval restricted to Approvers\nIf you need access to a restricted page, contact your TPRM Administrator or Customer Administrator\nYour Assessor-prefixed pages provide equivalent read-only views where applicable (Dashboard, Inventory, Issue Register)\nThe Assessor role is intentionally scoped to assessment execution — vendor lifecycle management, configuration, and approvals are handled by other specialized roles\nMenu items for restricted pages are automatically hidden from your sidebar navigation\nrestricted\nno access\npermission\nhidden\nrm dashboard\nbo dashboard\nvendor management\nconfiguration\nsettings\ncontracts\noffboarding\nsme\nprogram monitor\ncontrol center	{0.002231597900390625,0.058807373046875,0.066162109375,0.0233306884765625,-0.003774642944335938,0.007587432861328125,-0.03802490234375,-0.0185699462890625,0.0211639404296875,0.01322174072265625,0.020050048828125,-0.037841796875,0.01444244384765625,0.04266357421875,0.007053375244140625,-0.0143890380859375,0.002981185913085938,0.004894256591796875,-0.0183868408203125,0.09588623046875,0.05316162109375,0.01806640625,-0.04327392578125,-0.003286361694335938,-0.01195526123046875,0.0009603500366210938,-0.0063018798828125,0.0171051025390625,0.001691818237304688,-0.01898193359375,0.040802001953125,-0.045745849609375,-0.01212310791015625,0.005245208740234375,0.0239715576171875,-0.029510498046875,0.0191497802734375,0.01483917236328125,0.0175323486328125,0.003122329711914062,-0.031341552734375,0.01412200927734375,-0.025115966796875,0.034088134765625,-0.02392578125,0.041259765625,0.0088653564453125,0.021331787109375,-0.0051116943359375,-0.012237548828125,-0.0108184814453125,0.0238037109375,-0.0108184814453125,0.005550384521484375,-0.0242462158203125,-0.001641273498535156,-0.0173797607421875,0.0003149509429931641,-0.049072265625,0.00826263427734375,0.0005216598510742188,0.00782012939453125,-0.042236328125,0.001818656921386719,0.01215362548828125,-0.0034027099609375,-0.041595458984375,0.00908660888671875,-0.0052490234375,-0.0173492431640625,-0.01181793212890625,-0.0161590576171875,