cmn2wacwi00cojc3ozzue31c9	tap-dashboard	tprm	Dashboard	tprm	{TPRMApprover}	How do I use the Approver Dashboard?	How do I use the Approver Dashboard?\nWhat charts are on the Approver Dashboard?\nApprover Dashboard overview\nHow to read the dashboard analytics?\nWhat metrics does the Approver Dashboard show?\nWhere is the Approver Dashboard?\nDashboard charts for Approver role\nHow to monitor assessment status from the dashboard?\nThe Approver Dashboard provides 6 analytical charts giving you an at-a-glance view of vendor risk posture, assessment progress, and issue status. It shares the same layout as the Assessor Dashboard.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Approver → Dashboard**\n**Issue Status** bar chart — View Open, Overdue, and Closed issues mapped from database statuses\n**Assessment Progress** bar chart — Track assessments by Initiated, In Progress, and Completed status\n**Inherent Risk** pie chart — See the distribution of High, Medium, and Low risk vendors (mapped from VRR levels)\n**Assessment Result** pie chart — Review Satisfactory, Unsatisfactory, and Deficient assessment outcomes\n**Top 5 Vendors** stacked bar chart — Identify the top vendors by severity (High, Medium, Low)\n**Domain Distribution** horizontal bar chart — View top 10 domains by issue count\nEach chart shows an empty state message when no data is available\nThe dashboard auto-refreshes on page load to show the latest data\nUse the Assessment Progress chart to quickly identify how many assessments are awaiting your review\nThe Assessment Result chart helps you track quality trends — a high Unsatisfactory or Deficient rate may indicate assessment quality issues\nInteractive tooltips on each chart provide exact counts when you hover over data points\nThis is the same dashboard layout used by the Assessor role\ndashboard\napprover\ncharts\nanalytics\nissues\nassessments\nrisk\nresults\nvendors\ndomain\nbar chart\npie chart	{-0.0024261474609375,0.025238037109375,0.04229736328125,0.0299377441406