cmn2wacww00cpjc3ofveiq8wr	tap-assessments	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{TPRMApprover}	How do I review and approve vendor assessments as an Approver?	How do I review and approve vendor assessments as an Approver?\nHow to approve or reject an assessment?\nApprover assessment review workflow\nHow to add review comments when approving?\nWhere do I see assessments awaiting my approval?\nHow to reject an assessment with comments?\nAssessment approval process step by step\nHow to review assessment responses and evidence?\nHow to check assessment scores before approving?\nThe Approver Assessments page lists all submitted assessments awaiting your review. You can examine every response and piece of evidence, view the overall assessment score, and then approve or reject with detailed review comments.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Approver → Assessments**\nView the list of assessments that have been **submitted for approval** (status: Submitted / Under Review)\nClick on an assessment to open the **full review view**\nReview each **question response** — examine the compliance rating, response text, and any attached evidence\nCheck the **assessment result summary** and overall score to evaluate the vendor's risk posture\nTo **approve**: click the **Approve** button and optionally add review comments affirming the assessment quality\nTo **reject**: click the **Reject** button and provide **detailed review comments** explaining the rejection reason and what needs improvement\nThe assessment status updates automatically — approved moves to **Completed**, rejected returns to the **assessor for revision**\nAlways review all responses and evidence thoroughly before approving — you are the final quality gate\nRejected assessments are returned to the assessor with your comments so they know exactly what to fix\nApproved assessments move to Completed status and finalize the vendor risk evaluation\nYou receive notifications when new assessments are submitted for your review\nAssessment scores are calculated from individual question compliance ratings across all domains\nYou can filter and search the assessment list by vendor name, assessment ID, or status\napprove\nreject\nreview\nassessment\ncomments\nscore\nsummary\nevidence\nresponses\nquality\nworkflow\nsubmitted\napproval	{-0.0211334228515625,0.0300140380859375,0.05859375,0.01427459716796875,-0.03411865234375,-0.01081085205078125,-0.0305023193359375,-0.007320404052734375,0.032318115234375,0.06353759765625,0.05242919921875,-0.035888671875,-7.975101470947266e-05,0.0002114772796630859,0.01812744140625,-0.031402587890625,0.035980224609375,-0.0119171142578125,0.01042938232421875,0.05816650390625,0.04718017578125,-0.01036834716796875,-0.001713752746582031,-0.003940582275390625,-0.03350830078125,-0.025909423828125,-0.032958984375,-0.01727294921875,-0.025421142578125,-0.037078857421875,0.0294647216796875,-0.01427459716796875,-0.028228759765625,0.05621337890625,-0.0205230712890625,-0.007556915283203125,-0.005580902099609375,0.006710052490234375,0.010284423828125,-0.0104827880859375,0.002626419067382812,0.0428466796875,-0.023162841796875,0.057861328125,-0.00528717041015625,0.033599853515625,-0.00722503662109375,-0.0228424072265625,-0.01403045654296875,-0.037261962890625,-0.0099945068359375,0.057403564453125,0.0174560546875,0.0019683837890625,-0.004337310791015625,-0.01067352294921875,-0.01151275634765625,-0.0118408203125,-0.04681396484375,0.0222625732421875,0.01068115234375,-0.01413726806640625,-0.00725555419921875,0.006458282470703125,-0.006343841552734375,-0.040252685546875,-0.03363037109375,0.0070648193359375,0.02130126953125,-0.015869140625,0.02532958984375,0.009124755859375,0.08612060546875,0.02508544921875,0.0256805419921875,-0.031982421875,0.0908203125,0.035980224609375,-0.02911376953125,0.01517486572265625,0.0008807182312011719,0.01175689697265625,-0.0245513916015625,-0.014617919921875,0.00730133056640625,0.003757476806640625,-0.05078125,-0.01131439208984375,-0.00811767578125,-0.038940429687