cmn2wacxq00crjc3o1u0pgpa0	tap-review-comments	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{TPRMApprover}	How should I write effective review comments when approving or rejecting?	How should I write effective review comments when approving or rejecting?\nWhat to write in review comments?\nBest practices for rejection comments\nHow to provide feedback on assessments?\nWhat should I include in approval comments?\nHow to explain why I'm rejecting an assessment?\nWriting good review feedback for assessors\nReview comments are your primary communication channel with assessors. When approving, affirm what was done well. When rejecting, provide specific, actionable feedback referencing domains, questions, or evidence gaps so the assessor knows exactly what to fix.\nOpen the assessment and complete your full review of all responses and evidence\n**For approvals**: Add comments acknowledging thoroughness, noting any minor observations for future assessments\n**For rejections**: Clearly state which domains or questions have issues\nReference **specific question IDs or domain names** so the assessor can locate the problem areas quickly\nDescribe **what is missing or incorrect** — e.g., 'Domain X: evidence does not support the Satisfactory rating' or 'Question Y: response lacks detail on compensating controls'\nSuggest **what the assessor should do** to resolve the issue — e.g., 'Please attach the SOC 2 report as evidence for Domain Z'\nEnter your comments in the review comments field before clicking Approve or Reject\nSpecific, actionable comments reduce the number of revision cycles needed\nEven when approving, brief positive comments help assessors understand what good looks like\nRejected assessments with vague comments often come back with the same issues — be precise\nYour review comments are stored as part of the assessment audit trail\nConsider the assessment's overall quality, not just individual question responses\ncomments\nreview\nfeedback\nrejection\napproval\nbest practices\nquality\nrevision\nimprovement	{0.03729248046875,0.04986572265625,0.04913330078125,0.0125274658203125,-0.0168304443359375,0.006103515625,-0.02630615234375,-0.0107421875,0.03607177734375,0.0736083984375,0.0679931640625,-0.031890869140625,-0.008026123046875,0.00113677978515625,0.023681640625,0.0007033348083496094,0.0322265625,0.0150146484375,0.0278472900390625,0.039520263671875,0.019134521484375,-0.01666259765625,0.03094482421875,0.043212890625,-0.0023040771484375,-0.0295257568359375,-0.01629638671875,-0.00848388671875,-0.0230712890625,-0.0279083251953125,0.01580810546875,-0.018768310546875,-0.0218353271484375,0.004840850830078125,-0.025726318359375,0.037139892578125,-0.01001739501953125,-0.0182952880859375,0.0301666259765625,-0.006587982177734375,0.0322265625,0.0712890625,0.0003733634948730469,0.0147247314453125,-0.04779052734375,0.0225067138671875,-0.003896713256835938,-0.03546142578125,-0.022552490234375,-0.04119873046875,-0.032745361328125,0.05975341796875,0.02020263671875,-0.001020431518554688,0.00513458251953125,-1.192092895507812e-05,-0.03033447265625,0.002481460571289062,-0.036102294921875,0.0305023193359375,-0.0094146728515625,-0.0169677734375,-0.0072174072265625,-0.003335952758789062,-0.011444091796875,-0.047149658203125,-0.025848388671875,-0.0121307373046875,0.02947998046875,0.00927734375,0.0653076171875,0.01335906982421875,0.06341552734375,0.003711700439453125,-0.0287322998046875,-0.06304931640625,0.060150146484375,0.01181793212890625,-0.0102996826171875,-0.0283203125,-0.03558349609375,0.05169677734375,-0.011749267578125,-0.032196044921875,0.0130462646484375,0.006229400634765625,-0.07550048828125,-0.0269775390625,-0.024139404296875,-0.036041259765625,-0.00806427001953125,0.038726806640625,-0.038055419921875,-0.0263824462890625,0.001633644104003906,0.0289154052734375,-0.035888671875,0.03790283203125,-0.0300445556640625,0.00730133056640625,0.0258331298828125,-0.033782958984375,-0.042449951171875,0.01305389404296875,0.058990478515625,-0.0093841552734375,0.0227