cmn2wad4l00ctjc3o2jdfe0at	tap-reports	tprm	Reports	tprm	{TPRMApprover}	How do I generate and use TPRM reports as an Approver?	How do I generate and use TPRM reports as an Approver?\nHow to access TPRM reports?\nWhat reports can an Approver generate?\nVendor risk summary reports\nAssessment completion reports\nHow to export TPRM reports?\nWhere are TPRM reports located?\nHow to view assessment reports?\nThe TPRM Reports page lets you generate comprehensive reports including vendor risk summaries, assessment completion status, issue resolution tracking, and historical trends. Reports can be exported for stakeholder distribution and audit purposes.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Reports**\nSelect the type of report you want to generate (vendor risk, assessment completion, issue resolution, etc.)\nConfigure any filters such as date range, vendor, or assessment type\nClick **Generate** to create the report\nReview the report data including charts, tables, and summary statistics\nUse the **Export** option to download the report for stakeholder distribution or audit records\nLeverage historical trend analysis to monitor improvements or regressions over time\nReports reflect the latest data including your recent approval and rejection decisions\nAssessment completion reports show how many assessments have been approved vs. rejected vs. pending\nUse vendor risk summary reports to identify high-risk vendors requiring attention\nExported reports are suitable for management review, regulatory submissions, and audit documentation\nHistorical trend reports help you track whether vendor risk posture is improving over time\nreports\ngenerate\nexport\nvendor risk\nassessment completion\nissue resolution\nsummary\ntrends\nstakeholder	{-0.032440185546875,0.054656982421875,0.10284423828125,-0.01404571533203125,-0.028045654296875,-0.0303497314453125,-0.03814697265625,0.02203369140625,0.03253173828125,0.03594970703125,-0.002376556396484375,-0.002904891967773438,-0.020843505859375,-0.025