cmn2wad5000cujc3oxrwj9491	tap-notifications	tprm	Notifications	tprm	{TPRMApprover}	How do notifications work for the Approver role?	How do notifications work for the Approver role?\nWhat notifications does the Approver receive?\nHow to check for assessments awaiting approval?\nWhere is the notification bell?\nHow to manage TPRM notifications?\nHow do I know when an assessment needs my review?\nNotification alerts for Approver\nHow to mark notifications as read?\nApprovers receive notifications when assessments are submitted for review. Check the notification bell icon in the header for a badge count of unread items, or use the notification dropdown for quick access to pending items.\nLook for the **notification bell icon** in the header bar — a badge count shows unread notifications\nClick the bell to open the **notification dropdown** for a quick preview of recent alerts\nYou will receive notifications when an **assessment is submitted** for your approval\n**Status change alerts** notify you when assessment statuses change (e.g., resubmitted after rejection)\n**Due date reminders** alert you when assessments are approaching their review deadline\nClick a notification to navigate directly to the relevant assessment\n**Mark notifications as read** to clear the badge count after reviewing them\nUnread notification count is visible at all times in the header badge\nNotifications are role-specific — you only see alerts relevant to your Approver responsibilities\nPromptly reviewing notifications ensures assessments do not sit in the queue waiting for approval\nDue date reminders help you prioritize which assessments to review first\nThe notification system covers: assessment submissions, status changes, and due date reminders\nnotifications\nalerts\nbell\nbadge\nunread\nawaiting approval\nsubmitted\nreminder\nstatus change	{-0.0111236572265625,0.049102783203125,0.04022216796875,0.0081634521484375,-0.031341552734375,-0.01513671875,0.0242919921875,-0.0001620054244995117,0.