cmn2wad5t00cwjc3ogsx7axff	tap-no-access	tprm	Access & Permissions	tprm	{TPRMApprover}	What pages are restricted for the TPRM Approver role?	What pages are restricted for the TPRM Approver role?\nWhat can't I access as an Approver?\nWhy can't I see Vendor Management?\nApprover restricted pages in TPRM\nPages not available to Approver\nWhy is RM Dashboard hidden from my menu?\nWhat modules are Approvers not allowed to use?\nApprover permission limitations\nAs a TPRM Approver, your role is focused exclusively on reviewing and approving assessments. You have access to only 4 areas: Dashboard, Assessments, Reports, and Notifications. All other pages are managed by other specialized roles and are hidden from your sidebar.\n**RM Dashboard / BO Dashboard** — Role-specific dashboards for Relationship Managers and Business Owners\n**Vendor Management / Vendor Inventory** — Vendor creation, editing, and lifecycle management (handled by RMs and BOs)\n**RM/BO/AM Assessments** — Assessment creation, assignment, and Account Manager workflows (handled by RMs, BOs, and AMs)\n**Contracts** — Contract management (handled by Relationship Managers)\n**Issue Management / Issue Register** — Issue tracking and remediation assignment (handled by RMs, BOs, IT teams, and Assessors)\n**Monitoring** — Vendor security monitoring and scorecards (handled by RMs, BOs, and Assessors)\n**Follow-ups** — Follow-up action tracking (handled by Assessors and Account Managers)\n**Assessment Factory** — Batch assessment creation (handled by Assessors)\n**Assessment Templates** — Template management (handled by Assessors and Admins)\n**CAIQ Questions** — Question library browsing (accessible to Assessors within their workflow)\n**Vendor Offboarding** — Offboarding process (managed by RMs and BOs)\n**SME Management** — Subject Matter Expert management (handled by Account Managers)\n**Program Monitor** — Executive program overview (restricted to Administrators)\n**Control Center** — Risk parameter configuration (restricted to Administrators)\n**Configuration / Settings** — System configuration (restricted to Administrators)\n**User Management / Factory User Management** — User administration (restricted to Administrators)\nIf you need access to a restricted page, contact your TPRM Administrator or Customer Administrator\nThe Approver role is intentionally scoped to assessment review and approval — this focused scope ensures clear separation of duties\nYou cannot conduct assessments (answer questions, attach evidence) — that is the Assessor's responsibility\nYou cannot create or assign assessments — that is the Relationship Manager's responsibility\nMenu items for restricted pages are automatically hidden from your sidebar navigation\nYour 4 accessible areas (Dashboard, Assessments, Reports, Notifications) provide everything needed for the approval workflow\nrestricted\nno access\npermission\nhidden\nvendor management\ncontracts\nissues\nmonitoring\nfollow-ups\nconfiguration\nsettings\noffboarding\nsme\nprogram monitor\ncontrol center\nassessment factory\ntemplates	{2.652406692504883e-05,0.06353759765625,0.0595703125,0.0286712646484375,-0.0137786865234375,-0.002038955688476562,-0.02734375,0.0044708251953125,0.025634765625,0.0338134765625,0.037689208984375,-0.03778076171875,-0.0201873779296875,0.05413818359375,0.000598907470703125,-0.0206298828125,0.016265869140625,0.003805160522460938,0.003780364990234375,0.08038330078125,0.0635986328125,0.0183563232421875,-0.03472900390625,-0.001573562622070312,-0.022491455078125,0.0123291015625,-0.0057373046875,0.022430419921875,0.002292633056640625,-0.0252685546875,0.045745849609375,-0.042510986328125,-0.0213165283203125,0.01812744140625,0.00618743896484375,-0.030487060546875,0.01678466796875,0.006252288818359375,0.0145721435546875,0.00235748291015625,-0.022979736328125,0.01079559326171875,-0.01873779296875,0.046051025390625,-0.0228424072265625,0.0450439453125,-0.005035400390625,0.00835418701171875,-0.00846099853515625,-0.0147781372070