cmn2wadtx00dkjc3on2u7l1pk	tsme-follow-up-status	tprm	Follow-Ups	tprm	{TPRMSME}	What do follow-up statuses mean for an SME?	What do follow-up statuses mean for an SME?\nFollow-up status meanings\nHow to understand follow-up progress\nWhat are the follow-up completion states?\nHow to tell if a follow-up is overdue\nSME follow-up status tracking\nFollow-up items have status indicators showing their progress. As an SME, tracking these statuses helps you prioritize domain-specific remediation actions and ensure timely completion.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → AM → Follow-Ups**\nReview the status column for each follow-up item\nCheck **due dates** to identify items that need urgent attention\nFilter or sort by status to focus on open or pending items in your domain\nTrack completion of follow-ups linked to your expert assessment areas\nOverdue follow-ups should be prioritized — they indicate remediation actions past their due date\nCompleted follow-ups remain visible for audit trail and reference purposes\nIf you need to escalate a follow-up issue, contact the Account Manager or use the Support page\nfollow-up\nstatus\nopen\nclosed\noverdue\npending\ncompletion	{0.019683837890625,0.0496826171875,0.0648193359375,0.0001224279403686523,-0.03302001953125,0.0228118896484375,0.0285186767578125,0.013702392578125,0.06585693359375,0.0443115234375,0.054046630859375,-0.00817108154296875,-0.061676025390625,-0.060455322265625,-0.01204681396484375,0.022064208984375,-0.034149169921875,-0.00676727294921875,0.005523681640625,0.07049560546875,0.077880859375,0.0205841064453125,-0.046875,0.065185546875,-0.028411865234375,-0.01263427734375,-0.044830322265625,0.0238494873046875,-0.019866943359375,-0.0156402587890625,0.0167388916015625,-0.020904541015625,-0.0362548828125,0.0225982666015625,0.037872314453125,0.052154541015625,-0.00559234619140625,0.005279541015625,0.0259857177734375,0.00904083251953125,-0.011260986328125,0.036163330078125,-0.00710296630859375,0.003360748291015625,-0.0251159667