cmn2wad6m00cyjc3o7e5t7dpf	tam-assessments	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{AccountManager}	How do I manage assessments as an Account Manager?	How do I manage assessments as an Account Manager?\nHow do I view my assessments as AM?\nAccount Manager assessment tabs\nHow to start or resume an assessment?\nWhere do I see active assessments?\nHow to handle offboard assessments as AM?\nAM assessment page overview\nHow do I search for assessments?\nThe AM Assessments page provides a tabbed view of all your assessments organized by lifecycle stage — Active, Submitted, Past, and Offboard. You can start Draft assessments, resume In Progress ones, and route offboard assessments to the dedicated offboard questionnaire page.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → AM → Assessments**\nUse the **Active** tab to view assessments currently in progress or awaiting your action (Draft, In Progress, Returned statuses)\nUse the **Submitted** tab to view assessments you have submitted for review\nUse the **Past** tab to view completed or closed assessments for historical reference\nUse the **Offboard** tab to view and manage offboarding assessments — click to route to the offboard questionnaire page\nClick **Start** on a Draft assessment to begin the assessment process\nClick **Resume** on an In Progress assessment to continue where you left off\nUse the **search bar** to filter assessments by assessment code or vendor name\nReview the **status badge** color to quickly identify each assessment's current state\nStatus color coding: Gray (Draft), Blue (In Progress), Orange (Returned), Purple (Submitted), Indigo (Under Review), Green (Completed)\nStarting an assessment changes its status from Draft to In Progress\nOffboard assessments have a dedicated questionnaire page separate from regular assessments\nYou manage assessments from a commercial perspective — technical CAIQ responses are handled by the assigned Assessor\nIf an assessment is Returned (orange), it requires your attention before it can proceed\nam\naccount manager\nassessments\nactive\nsubmitted\npast\noffboard\nstart\nresume\ndraft\nsearch\nvendor\ncommercial	{0.002698898315429688,0.06610107421875,0.07763671875,0.0245361328125,-0.01107025146484375,0.00882720947265625,0.01183319091796875,-0.034698486328125,0.051361083984375,0.047760009765625,0.040435791015625,-0.06134033203125,0.0198516845703125,0.002193450927734375,0.02459716796875,0.01538848876953125,-0.0285491943359375,0.004978179931640625,-0.0221405029296875,0.046630859375,0.039886474609375,0.04522705078125,-0.0088348388671875,0.006107330322265625,-0.04443359375,-0.0153045654296875,-0.054351806640625,-0.003042221069335938,-0.045501708984375,-0.0263519287109375,0.054840087890625,-0.039337158203125,-0.0491943359375,0.03680419921875,0.04339599609375,0.041900634765625,-0.001645088195800781,0.03564453125,-0.00844573974609375,0.0199432373046875,-0.002569198608398438,0.04620361328125,0.020050048828125,0.002519607543945312,-0.0187225341796875,0.02532958984375,0.0085601806640625,0.026947021484375,0.009246826171875,0.0286865234375,-0.004314422607421875,0.061553955078125,0.0275421142578125,-0.0200653076171875,-0.00408935546875,-0.006076812744140625,0.002197265625,-0.0133514404296875,-0.002489089965820312,0.0204620361328125,-0.0085296630859375,0.00731658935546875,-0.0236663818359375,0.0159759521484375,-0.021728515625,0.003278732299804688,-0.041900634765625,0.035003662109375,-0.0155029296875,-0.037506103515625,0.0198974609375,0.021575927734375,0.056365966796875,-0.00921630859375,-0.01371002197265625,-0.020721435546875,0.06170654296875,0.02728271484375,-0.06134033203125,0.0159149169921875,-0.027496337890625,0.006786346435546875,-0.05859375,-0.0244903564453125,0.03436279296875,0.0233612060546875,-0.048095703125,-0.040924072265625,0.002056121826171875,-0.0484619140625,-0.00771331787109375,0.053009033203125,-0.04095458984375,0.034027099609375,0.0261993408203125,-0.01548004150390625,-0.03155517578125,0.02337646484375,-0.032806396484375,0.023895263671875,0.026840