cmn2wad7100czjc3ok4747npr	tam-start-resume	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{AccountManager}	How do I start or resume an assessment as Account Manager?	How do I start or resume an assessment as Account Manager?\nHow to begin a draft assessment?\nHow to continue an in-progress assessment?\nWhat does Start do on a draft assessment?\nCan I resume an assessment I paused?\nHow to pick up where I left off on an assessment?\nStarting assessment as AM\nResume assessment workflow\nAs an Account Manager, you can start assessments that are in Draft status and resume assessments that are In Progress. Starting moves the assessment from Draft to In Progress, while resuming lets you continue where you left off.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → AM → Assessments**\nOpen the **Active** tab to see assessments awaiting your action\nLocate a **Draft** assessment (gray badge) and click the **Start** button to begin the assessment process\nThe assessment status changes from Draft to **In Progress** (blue badge)\nTo resume an In Progress assessment, locate it in the Active tab and click **Resume**\nYou will be taken to the assessment detail page where you can continue managing it\nSave your progress at any time — you can always come back and resume later\nOnly Draft assessments show the Start action — once started, they become In Progress\nYou can only start or resume assessments assigned to you as Account Manager\nThe actual CAIQ questionnaire completion is handled by the assigned Assessor — your role is managing the assessment from a commercial standpoint\nIf an assessment shows Returned status (orange), review the return comments before resuming\nstart\nresume\ndraft\nin progress\nbegin\ncontinue\nassessment\naccount manager\nam\nworkflow	{0.0147705078125,0.08392333984375,0.06976318359375,0.018524169921875,-0.012939453125,0.00386810302734375,0.0186309814453125,0.003692626953125,0.01666259765625,0.04119873046875,0.0477294921875,-0.0309295654296875,0.013885498046875,-0.002773284912109375,0.