cmn2wad7f00d0jc3o0lu1rjpz	tam-offboard	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{AccountManager}	How do I handle offboard assessments as Account Manager?	How do I handle offboard assessments as Account Manager?\nWhat is the offboard questionnaire?\nHow to manage vendor offboarding assessments?\nWhere do I find offboard assessments?\nHow to complete an offboard assessment?\nOffboarding assessment workflow for AM\nHow to terminate a vendor assessment?\nOffboard assessments are handled through the Offboard tab on the AM Assessments page. When a vendor relationship is being terminated, you complete the dedicated offboard questionnaire to document the closure process from a commercial perspective.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → AM → Assessments**\nClick the **Offboard** tab to view all offboarding assessments\nLocate the assessment for the vendor being offboarded\nClick the assessment to route to the **dedicated offboard questionnaire page**\nComplete the offboard questionnaire covering commercial closure items\nSubmit the completed offboard questionnaire for review\nOffboard assessments use a separate, dedicated questionnaire page — different from regular assessment workflows\nThe offboard process documents the commercial closure of the vendor relationship\nEnsure all follow-up actions related to the vendor are resolved before completing offboarding\nThe overall offboarding process is managed by Relationship Managers and Business Owners — you handle the questionnaire portion as Account Manager\noffboard\noffboarding\nterminate\nvendor\nquestionnaire\naccount manager\nam\nclosure\nend\nrelationship	{-0.0243682861328125,0.0606689453125,0.07415771484375,0.0289459228515625,-0.033660888671875,0.01189422607421875,-0.01163482666015625,-0.046600341796875,0.07025146484375,0.0291900634765625,0.054962158203125,-0.074462890625,-0.02252197265625,-4.488229751586914e-05,0.01093292236328125,-0.0170440673828125,0.002859115600585938,0.0211029052734375,-0.01263427734375,0.047393798828125,0.036651