cmn2wad7u00d1jc3onkgn381q	tam-follow-ups	tprm	Follow-Ups	tprm	{AccountManager}	How do I track follow-ups as an Account Manager?	How do I track follow-ups as an Account Manager?\nWhere do I see my follow-up actions?\nHow to manage follow-ups in TPRM?\nAccount Manager follow-up tracking\nHow to track assessment follow-up completion?\nWhere are my pending follow-up items?\nAM follow-up page overview\nHow to link follow-ups to assessments?\nThe AM Follow-Ups page lists all follow-up actions arising from your assessments and reviews. Track completion status, monitor due dates, and ensure all assessment-related actions are addressed from the commercial side of the vendor relationship.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → AM → Follow-Ups**\nView the list of all follow-up items with their current **status** and **due dates**\nCheck the **status** column to identify which follow-ups are pending, in progress, or completed\nMonitor **due dates** to prioritize follow-ups requiring immediate attention\nClick a follow-up item to view its details and the linked assessment context\nUpdate follow-up progress as actions are completed\nFollow-ups are linked to specific assessments — you can trace each follow-up back to its originating assessment\nOverdue follow-ups may trigger notifications to ensure timely completion\nAs Account Manager, your follow-ups focus on commercial and vendor-relationship actions rather than technical remediation\nCoordinate with the Assessor if follow-ups require technical input or evidence gathering\nfollow-up\nfollow-ups\ntracking\nactions\ndue date\ncompletion\nstatus\nassessment\naccount manager\nam\npending	{-0.01320648193359375,0.0655517578125,0.08367919921875,-0.0006566047668457031,-0.0298004150390625,0.003351211547851562,0.040740966796875,0.0072021484375,0.050628662109375,0.04888916015625,0.037353515625,-0.024658203125,-0.024871826171875,-0.042236328125,-0.0139617919921875,-0.019378662109375,-0.0219573974609375,-0.0086822509765625,-0.0208740234375,0.05096