cmn2wadfb00d2jc3o7ltnmzbk	tam-sme-management	tprm	SME Management	tprm	{AccountManager}	How do I manage SMEs as an Account Manager?	How do I manage SMEs as an Account Manager?\nWhat is SME Management in TPRM?\nHow to assign SMEs to assessment domains?\nHow to add a Subject Matter Expert?\nWhere do I manage domain expertise assignments?\nHow to track SME availability?\nAccount Manager SME assignment\nHow do I assign experts to domains?\nThe AM SME Management page lets you list, assign, and manage Subject Matter Experts for assessment domains. You can assign SMEs to specific domains based on their expertise, track their availability, and ensure the right specialists are involved in vendor assessments.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → AM → SME Management**\nView the list of all available **Subject Matter Experts** with their expertise areas\nCheck SME **availability** status to see who is available for assignment\n**Assign an SME** to a specific assessment domain (e.g., Data Security, Access Control, Business Continuity)\nTrack which SMEs are currently assigned to active assessments\nUpdate SME assignments as assessment needs change or new domains require expertise\nSMEs provide specialized domain knowledge during the vendor assessment process — they do not conduct the full assessment themselves\nMatching SMEs to the right domains ensures assessment quality and accurate risk evaluation\nAn SME can be assigned to multiple domains if they have the required expertise\nCoordinate with the Assessor team to ensure SME assignments align with upcoming assessment schedules\nIf no SME is available for a required domain, contact your TPRM Administrator for assistance\nsme\nsubject matter expert\ndomain\nassign\nexpertise\navailability\nmanagement\naccount manager\nam\nspecialist	{0.00928497314453125,0.052520751953125,0.080810546875,-0.0282440185546875,-0.0002639293670654297,0.0060272216796875,0.0178375244140625,0.018768310546875,0.0207672119140625,0.0367431640625,0.04925537109375,-