cmn2wadg500d4jc3ou2ml3qqp	tam-no-access	tprm	Access & Permissions	tprm	{AccountManager}	What pages are restricted for the TPRM Account Manager role?	What pages are restricted for the TPRM Account Manager role?\nWhat can't I access as an Account Manager?\nWhy can't I see the Dashboard?\nAccount Manager restricted pages in TPRM\nPages not available to Account Manager\nWhy is Vendor Management hidden from my menu?\nWhat modules are Account Managers not allowed to use?\nAM permission limitations\nAs a TPRM Account Manager, your role is focused on the commercial side of vendor assessment management. You have access to only 4 areas: Assessments, Follow-Ups, SME Management, and Support. All other pages — including dashboards, vendor management, contracts, issues, monitoring, reports, and configuration — are managed by other specialized roles and are hidden from your sidebar.\n**All Dashboards (RM, BO, Assessor, Approver)** — Role-specific dashboards are restricted to their respective roles\n**Vendor Management / Vendor Inventory** — Vendor creation, editing, and lifecycle management (handled by RMs and BOs)\n**Contracts** — Contract management (handled by Relationship Managers)\n**Issue Management / Issue Register** — Issue tracking and remediation (handled by RMs, BOs, IT teams, and Assessors)\n**Monitoring** — Vendor security monitoring and scorecards (handled by RMs, BOs, and Assessors)\n**Reports** — TPRM reporting and analytics (handled by RMs, BOs, Assessors, and Approvers)\n**RM/BO/Assessor/Approver Assessments** — Other role-specific assessment pages\n**CAIQ Questions** — Question library browsing (accessible to Assessors within their workflow)\n**Assessment Factory** — Batch assessment creation (handled by Assessors and Factory Admins)\n**Assessment Templates** — Template management (handled by Assessors and Admins)\n**Vendor Offboarding** — Offboarding process management (managed by RMs and BOs — though you handle the offboard questionnaire from your Assessments tab)\n**Program Monitor** — Executive program overview (restricted to Administrators)\n**Control Center** — Risk parameter configuration (restricted to Administrators)\n**Configuration / Settings** — System configuration (restricted to Administrators)\n**User Management / Factory User Management** — User administration (restricted to Administrators)\nIf you need access to a restricted page, contact your TPRM Administrator or Customer Administrator\nThe Account Manager role is intentionally scoped to commercial vendor management — this focused scope ensures clear separation between commercial and technical assessment duties\nYou cannot conduct assessments (answer CAIQ questions, attach evidence) — that is the Assessor's responsibility\nYou cannot create or assign assessments — that is the Relationship Manager's responsibility\nYou cannot approve or reject assessments — that is the Approver's responsibility\nMenu items for restricted pages are automatically hidden from your sidebar navigation\nYour 4 accessible areas (Assessments, Follow-Ups, SME Management, Support) provide everything needed for commercial vendor account management\nrestricted\nno access\npermission\nhidden\ndashboard\nvendor management\ncontracts\nissues\nmonitoring\nreports\nconfiguration\nsettings\noffboarding\nprogram monitor\ncontrol center\nassessment factory\ntemplates\nuser management	{-0.003116607666015625,0.060455322265625,0.0814208984375,0.0223846435546875,-0.002279281616210938,0.006633758544921875,-0.0305938720703125,-0.0076446533203125,0.03228759765625,0.0256805419921875,0.0362548828125,-0.045166015625,-0.0079193115234375,0.03564453125,0.002557754516601562,-0.002252578735351562,-0.0063018798828125,0.007663726806640625,-0.035858154296875,0.0772705078125,0.0732421875,0.0296630859375,-0.038726806640625,0.0001131296157836914,-0.044647216796875,0.0133514404296875,-0.0167388916015625,0.01306915283203125,-0.005741119384765625,-0.0189971923828125,0.06427001953125,-0.0484619140625,-0.024154663085