cmn2wadgj00d5jc3o10hwpix5	taud-role-overview	tprm	Role Overview	tprm	{TPRMAuditor}	What is the TPRM Auditor role?	What is the TPRM Auditor role?\nWhat can I do as a TPRM Auditor?\nTPRM Auditor role overview\nWhat pages can an Auditor access in TPRM?\nWhat is the TPRM Auditor responsible for?\nAuditor capabilities in TPRM\nWhat does the TPRM Auditor do?\nTPRM audit oversight role\nThe TPRM Auditor provides independent audit oversight of the entire TPRM process and vendor assessment quality. This is an entirely read-only role — you can view all vendor records, assessments, issues, monitoring data, and reports but cannot create, edit, or delete any records.\n**Assessor Dashboard** (view-only) — Review 6 analytical charts covering issues, assessments, risks, results, top vendors, and domain distribution\n**Vendor Inventory** (view-only) — View all vendors assigned for assessment, their details, and current risk ratings\n**Assessments** (view-only) — Review assessment questionnaires, CAIQ responses, compliance ratings, and evidence attached to assessments\n**Issue Register** (view-only) — Audit issue records grouped by vendor with severity breakdowns (High/Medium/Low), review remediation status\n**Monitoring** (view-only) — Review vendor security scorecards with 14 KPIs, scan results, and security posture data\n**Follow-ups** (view-only) — Review follow-up items, their completion status, and linkage to assessments\n**Factory Reports** (view-only) — Review assessment factory batch history and completion analytics\n**Reports** (view-only) — Access TPRM reports including vendor risk summaries, assessment completion, and issue tracking\nThis is an entirely READ-ONLY role — you cannot create, edit, delete, approve, or reject any records\nYour role provides independent audit oversight separate from operational TPRM activities\nAll 8 accessible pages are view-only to maintain audit independence and objectivity\nYou see the Assessor-perspective views (Dashboard, Inventory, Assessments) rather than RM or BO views\nIf you need write access for specific audit activities, contact your TPRM Administrator or Customer Administrator\nMenu items for restricted pages (RM/BO dashboards, contracts, configuration, etc.) are automatically hidden from your sidebar\nauditor\ntprm auditor\naudit\nrole\noverview\nread-only\nindependent\noversight\nreview\nquality	{-0.00833892822265625,0.0648193359375,0.04144287109375,0.0126495361328125,-0.0175933837890625,0.001685142517089844,-0.016815185546875,-0.00402069091796875,0.0229339599609375,0.012847900390625,0.0280303955078125,-0.0110321044921875,0.005596160888671875,0.005374908447265625,0.01392364501953125,-0.0125732421875,-0.014678955078125,-0.01311492919921875,-0.00823974609375,0.10491943359375,0.047210693359375,-0.006473541259765625,-0.017059326171875,-0.0156402587890625,-0.0193634033203125,-0.024322509765625,-0.0239715576171875,0.024566650390625,-0.02783203125,-0.0204620361328125,0.0184173583984375,-0.0438232421875,0.0068511962890625,0.012969970703125,0.038116455078125,-0.0247650146484375,0.002183914184570312,-0.001066207885742188,0.01473236083984375,0.01013946533203125,-0.0106658935546875,0.0258636474609375,-0.0269317626953125,0.056732177734375,0.00360870361328125,0.0264892578125,0.017852783203125,0.0294189453125,0.005462646484375,-0.0197906494140625,-0.01142120361328125,0.03887939453125,0.002664566040039062,0.036285400390625,-0.0369873046875,0.004917144775390625,0.0004816055297851562,0.00714111328125,-0.0253143310546875,-0.001455307006835938,0.004169464111328125,-0.011993408203125,-0.0185394287109375,-0.0301361083984375,-0.003419876098632812,0.003713607788085938,-0.081298828125,0.0224761962890625,0.001833915710449219,-0.003332138061523438,-0.00901031494140625,0.0006971359252929688,-0.006221771240234375,-0.01438140869140625,0.01204681396484375,0.010101318359375,0.066650390625,0.017425537109375,-0.03515625,-0.044677734375,0.0235595703125,0.042236328125,-0.028076171875,0.016754150390625,0.01348114013671875,-0.