cmn2waec000dyjc3oz1fw9u8y	tfad-role-overview	tprm	Role Overview	tprm	{FactoryAdmin}	What is the TPRM Factory Administrator role?	What is the TPRM Factory Administrator role?\nWhat can a Factory Administrator do in TPRM?\nFactory Administrator role permissions\nWhat pages can the Factory Administrator access?\nWhat is the scope of the Factory Administrator role?\nTPRM Factory Administrator responsibilities\nHow does the Factory Administrator role differ from the TPRM Administrator?\nWhat does a Factory Admin manage in vendor risk management?\nThe TPRM Factory Administrator administers TPRM for a specific factory or facility. You manage factory team users (assigning FactoryAdmin and FactoryAssessor roles), operate the assessment factory for batch assessment creation, and view factory assessment reports and history. Your scope is limited to your factory — you do not have organization-wide TPRM access.\nLog in with your Factory Administrator credentials to access the TPRM module\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Factory → User Management** to manage your factory team\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessment Factory** to batch-create assessments for your factory\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessment History** to view factory assessment reports\nYour access is scoped to your specific factory/facility — not the entire organization\nThe Factory Administrator has access to **3 pages**: Factory User Management, Assessment Factory, and Factory Reports\nYou do NOT have access to: All Dashboards, Vendor Management, Contracts, RM/BO/AM/Assessor/Approver Assessments, Issues, Monitoring, Follow-ups, TPRM User Management, BO User Management, SME, Offboarding, Control Center, Program Monitor, Configuration, Settings, CAIQ Questions, Templates, or TPRM Reports\nYour role is scoped to a specific factory/facility — broader organization-wide TPRM access is managed by TPRM Administrators and Relationship Managers\nYou can assign only FactoryAdmin and FactoryAssessor roles to users within your factory team\nfactory administrator\nfactory admin\nrole\npermissions\nfactory\nfacility\nuser management\nassessment factory\nreports\nbatch\nteam	{-0.0137482788413763,0.06429276615381241,0.05190813541412354,-0.002962027676403522,-0.002832089550793171,-0.01788393966853619,0.006192314438521862,-0.006963559426367283,0.02198606915771961,0.01964997872710228,0.004946027416735888,0.0110712768509984,-0.01700092107057571,-0.007991885766386986,-0.01959409192204475,-0.004775571171194315,-0.03067095763981342,0.006304088979959488,-0.008997857570648193,0.08257909119129181,0.03791395202279091,0.001668236334808171,-0.03268289938569069,-0.02780952677130699,-0.02959792129695415,-0.007198285777121782,0.002155853202566504,0.04748186096549034,-0.03974705934524536,-0.03089450672268867,0.03304057940840721,-0.03782453387975693,-0.04137896746397018,0.02149426005780697,0.06228082254528999,-0.02385270595550537,0.01463129837065935,0.005245024338364601,0.006449395790696144,0.03393477573990822,-0.0321463830769062,0.005823458079248667,-0.04323442652821541,0.02986618131399155,-0.01083096116781235,-0.001957453088834882,0.01425126474350691,0.04191548377275467,0.008757541887462139,-0.02537284046411514,0.02734007313847542,-0.0007782308384776115,0.01030003186315298,0.01364768203347921,-0.04815251007676125,0.001263751881197095,-0.0139047633856535,-0.007187108509242535,-0.01674383878707886,0.01119422912597656,-0.01410595793277025,-0.03503016754984856,-0.001406264491379261,-0.04260848835110664,0.001935098203830421,-0.01284290477633476,-0.05736273899674416,0.00658911420032382,0.009875288233160973,-0.0116133838891983,-0.008740776218473911,-0.02405389957129955,-0.01690032333135605,-0.03069331310689449,0.01570433564484119,-0.006723243743181229,0.06402450799942017,0.05087981000542641,-0.05128219723701477,-0.004462602082639933,0.02780952677130699,0.02237728051841259,-0.02149426005780697,0.02727300859987736,-0.017682746052742,-0.01646440289914608,-0.01009324844926596,-0.03127454