cmn2wadgy00d6jc3oer5rc7h3	taud-dashboard	tprm	Dashboard	tprm	{TPRMAuditor}	How do I use the Assessor Dashboard as an Auditor?	How do I use the Assessor Dashboard as an Auditor?\nWhat charts are on the Auditor dashboard?\nHow do I review TPRM analytics as an Auditor?\nAuditor dashboard overview\nWhere can I see assessment progress charts?\nHow do I view issue and risk analytics?\nTPRM Auditor dashboard charts\nHow to review vendor risk posture as Auditor?\nThe Assessor Dashboard provides 6 analytical charts for independent audit review of the TPRM program's health — covering issue status, assessment progress, inherent risk, assessment results, top vendors by severity, and domain distribution. All data is read-only.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Dashboard**\nReview the **Issue Status** bar chart — shows Open, Overdue, and Closed issue counts (DB statuses mapped to 3 buckets)\nReview the **Assessment Progress** bar chart — shows counts of Initiated, In Progress, and Completed assessments\nReview the **Inherent Risk** pie chart — shows High, Medium, and Low risk distribution (mapped from VRR levels)\nReview the **Assessment Result** pie chart — shows Satisfactory, Unsatisfactory, and Deficient assessment outcomes\nReview the **Top 5 Vendors** stacked bar chart — shows vendors with the most issues, broken down by severity (High, Medium, Low)\nReview the **Domain Distribution** horizontal bar chart — shows top 10 domains by issue count (CUST. prefix stripped)\nUse these charts to identify audit focus areas — e.g., vendors with high issue counts or domains with recurring problems\nAll dashboard data is VIEW-ONLY — you cannot modify any records from this page\nCharts auto-refresh on page load with the latest data\nEach chart shows an empty state message when no data exists for that metric\nHover over chart elements for interactive tooltips with exact counts\nUse the dashboard to prioritize which vendor assessments or issue areas require deeper audit review\ndashboard\ncharts\nanalytics\nissues\nassessments\nrisk\npie chart\nbar chart\ntop vendors\ndomain\nauditor	{-0.01068878173828125,0.030029296875,0.079833984375,0.0243072509765625,0.003467559814453125,0.0281982421875,-0.038970947265625,-0.017120361328125,0.0295562744140625,0.01134490966796875,0.02239990234375,-0.03375244140625,0.0181427001953125,-0.0175323486328125,0.0322265625,-0.0215301513671875,-0.000324249267578125,-0.021636962890625,-0.0220489501953125,0.06329345703125,0.046844482421875,0.001802444458007812,-0.007419586181640625,-0.00637054443359375,-0.0144805908203125,0.003862380981445312,-0.01690673828125,0.01009368896484375,0.001563072204589844,0.00530242919921875,-0.005634307861328125,-0.042938232421875,0.0224151611328125,0.021209716796875,0.027923583984375,-0.01336669921875,-0.018096923828125,0.01055145263671875,0.041900634765625,0.003248214721679688,-0.01311492919921875,0.06854248046875,-0.001128196716308594,0.0655517578125,-0.017669677734375,0.007427215576171875,0.01506805419921875,0.013214111328125,-0.00638580322265625,0.0077667236328125,-0.032989501953125,0.057220458984375,-0.01206207275390625,-0.01056671142578125,-0.018585205078125,-0.005092620849609375,-0.0187835693359375,0.0330810546875,-0.028076171875,-0.017730712890625,0.038238525390625,-0.002712249755859375,-0.005748748779296875,-0.020263671875,0.00191497802734375,-0.01373291015625,-0.043121337890625,0.031707763671875,0.038116455078125,-0.0273590087890625,0.001566886901855469,0.004638671875,0.056671142578125,0.00728607177734375,0.021728515625,-0.00928497314453125,0.042938232421875,-0.01352691650390625,-0.0355224609375,0.002826690673828125,0.01497650146484375,0.0204010009765625,-0.04888916015625,0.002687454223632812,0.025177001953125,-0.04058837890625,-0.0328369140625,-0.005496978759765625,0.03826904296875,-0.03662109375,-0.0006098747253417969,0.0039520263671875,-0.040374755859375,0.0080718994140625,0.03338623046875,-0.001408576965332031,-0.0328369140625,0.01100921630859375,-0.03375244140625,0.0264739