cmn2wadhd00d7jc3o9ko3e23l	taud-inventory	tprm	Vendor Management	tprm	{TPRMAuditor}	How do I review vendor inventory as an Auditor?	How do I review vendor inventory as an Auditor?\nHow do I view vendor records as a TPRM Auditor?\nAuditor vendor inventory access\nWhere can I see vendor details for audit?\nHow to review vendor risk ratings as Auditor?\nCan I view all vendors as an Auditor?\nTPRM Auditor vendor list\nHow to audit vendor records?\nThe Vendor Inventory page (Assessor view) lets you view all vendors assigned for assessment, their details, and current risk ratings. As an Auditor, you have read-only access — you cannot create, edit, or delete vendor records.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Inventory**\nReview the vendor list showing all vendors assigned for assessment\nView each vendor's details including name, domain, vendor code, and description\nCheck the **current risk rating** for each vendor (Nominal, Low, Moderate, High, Critical)\nReview the **assessment completion status** for each vendor\nUse search and filter controls to locate specific vendors for audit review\nThis is a READ-ONLY view — you cannot create, edit, or delete vendors\nYou see the Assessor perspective of vendor inventory, focused on assessment workload and status\nVendor Risk Ratings (VRR) are calculated from assessment results — Nominal, Low, Moderate, High, Critical\nUse this page to verify vendor data completeness and accuracy as part of your audit review\nYou do not have access to the RM or BO vendor inventory views, which include additional management capabilities\nvendor\ninventory\nvendor list\nrisk rating\nvendor details\naudit\nreview\nread-only\nassessment status	{-0.05328369140625,0.051025390625,0.055511474609375,0.003419876098632812,-0.0279998779296875,-0.006229400634765625,-0.0254669189453125,-0.00926971435546875,0.01042938232421875,0.01139068603515625,0.0220794677734375,-0.02276611328125,0.013946533203125,-0.00968170166015625,0.033782958984375,-0.0082855224609