cmn2wadhr00d8jc3o9km9qbh2	taud-assessments	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{TPRMAuditor}	How do I review assessments as an Auditor?	How do I review assessments as an Auditor?\nHow do I audit vendor assessments?\nAuditor assessment review access\nCan I view CAIQ responses as an Auditor?\nHow to review assessment quality as Auditor?\nWhere do I see assessment details for audit?\nTPRM Auditor assessment page\nHow to audit assessment completeness?\nCan I see assessment evidence as Auditor?\nThe Assessments page (Assessor view) provides read-only access to all assigned assessments. You can review CAIQ questionnaire responses, compliance ratings, attached evidence, and vendor details — enabling independent audit of assessment quality and completeness.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessments**\nReview the list of assessments with status and assignee information\nClick on an assessment to open the assessment questionnaire detail\nReview **CAIQ questions by domain** — verify that responses are complete and appropriate\nCheck **compliance ratings** assigned to each question\nReview **evidence and notes** attached to individual questions for adequacy\nVerify the **vendor details** within the assessment context\nCheck the assessment **status** (Draft, In Progress, Submitted, Under Review, Completed) to track lifecycle progress\nYou have VIEW-ONLY access — you cannot answer questions, add evidence, submit, approve, or reject assessments\nAssessment statuses: Draft → In Progress → Submitted → Under Review → Approved/Completed\nUse this page to audit the quality of assessor responses, evidence sufficiency, and overall assessment completeness\nThe CAIQ (Consensus Assessments Initiative Questionnaire) is organized by security domains\nYou can view AI-assisted answers if the assessor used the Enable AI feature, which helps verify consistency\nThis is the Assessor-perspective view — you do not have access to RM, BO, AM, or Approver assessment views\nassessment\ncaiq\nqu