cmn2wadiz00dbjc3o5l1e0dv3	taud-follow-ups	tprm	Follow-ups	tprm	{TPRMAuditor}	How do I review follow-ups as an Auditor?	How do I review follow-ups as an Auditor?\nHow do I audit follow-up actions?\nAuditor follow-up tracking access\nWhere can I see follow-up status for audit?\nHow to review follow-up completion as Auditor?\nCan I view assessment follow-ups as Auditor?\nTPRM Auditor follow-up page\nHow to audit remediation follow-ups?\nThe Follow-ups page (Assessor view) provides read-only access to follow-up actions arising from assessments and reviews. You can review follow-up items, their completion status, due dates, and linkage to assessments for audit purposes.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Follow-ups**\nReview the list of follow-up items with their current status and due dates\nCheck the **completion status** of each follow-up item\nVerify the **linkage to assessments** — each follow-up should trace back to a specific assessment\nReview **due dates** to identify overdue or at-risk follow-up items\nAssess the overall follow-up completion rate as a measure of TPRM process effectiveness\nYou have READ-ONLY access — you cannot create, edit, complete, or delete follow-up items\nFollow-ups are linked to specific assessments for traceability\nReview follow-up completion rates as an audit metric for the TPRM program's remediation effectiveness\nOverdue follow-ups may indicate process weaknesses or insufficient resources for remediation\nCompare follow-up trends over time to assess whether the TPRM process is improving\nfollow-up\nfollow up\naction\ntracking\ncompletion\ndue date\nstatus\nassessment\nremediation\naudit\nreview	{-0.027099609375,0.0703125,0.0626220703125,0.00727081298828125,-0.039886474609375,0.0226593017578125,0.0211639404296875,0.00943756103515625,0.039337158203125,0.0239105224609375,0.021575927734375,-0.0248565673828125,0.0001360177993774414,-0.0506591796875,-0.01023101806640625,-0.036285400390625,0.00556182861328125,-0.0290985107421875,0.