cmn2wadqn00dcjc3o96c6vt7r	taud-factory-reports	tprm	Reports	tprm	{TPRMAuditor}	How do I review factory reports as an Auditor?	How do I review factory reports as an Auditor?\nHow do I audit assessment factory history?\nAuditor factory reports access\nWhere can I see batch assessment results?\nHow to review assessment factory analytics?\nCan I view factory batch history as Auditor?\nTPRM Auditor assessment factory reports\nHow to audit batch assessment creation?\nThe Factory Reports page provides read-only access to assessment factory batch history and results. You can review how assessments were batch-created, their completion status, and factory analytics for audit oversight of the assessment generation process.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessment History**\nReview the **assessment factory batch history** — each batch record shows when and how assessments were generated\nCheck **batch assessment completion status** to verify all generated assessments were properly executed\nReview **factory assessment analytics** for patterns in batch creation frequency and volume\nVerify that batch-created assessments follow the same quality standards as individually created ones\nYou have VIEW-ONLY access — you cannot create batches or modify factory reports\nThe Assessment Factory is the batch mechanism for creating multiple vendor assessments simultaneously\nAs an Auditor, verify that batch-created assessments maintain the same rigor as manually created ones\nReview factory history to ensure assessment scheduling is consistent and covers all required vendors\nYou do not have access to the Assessment Factory creation page — only the reports/history view\nfactory\nreports\nbatch\nassessment\nhistory\nanalytics\ncompletion\nfactory reports\naudit\nreview	{-0.0109405517578125,0.0264129638671875,0.0726318359375,-0.00079345703125,-0.01468658447265625,-0.0060577392578125,-0.01268768310546875,-0.031494140625,0.002695083618164062,0.002979278564453125,0.0217132568359375,