cmn2wadr300ddjc3ooqsqsyrv	taud-reports	tprm	Reports	tprm	{TPRMAuditor}	How do I generate and review TPRM reports as an Auditor?	How do I generate and review TPRM reports as an Auditor?\nHow do I access TPRM reports for audit?\nAuditor reporting access\nWhere can I find vendor risk reports?\nHow to generate audit-focused TPRM reports?\nCan I export reports as an Auditor?\nTPRM Auditor reports page\nHow to review assessment completion reports?\nThe Reports page provides access to comprehensive TPRM reports including vendor risk summaries, assessment completion reports, issue resolution tracking, and historical trends. These reports support independent audit review and can be exported for stakeholder distribution.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Reports**\nReview **vendor risk assessment reports** — summaries of vendor risk ratings and risk posture across the portfolio\nReview **assessment completion summary reports** — track how many assessments are completed vs. outstanding\nReview **issue and remediation status reports** — monitor resolution progress and overdue items\nUse **historical trend analysis** to identify improving or degrading trends in vendor risk and assessment quality\n**Export reports** for inclusion in audit work papers or distribution to management and stakeholders\nReports are READ-ONLY and generated from current system data\nExported reports can be used as audit evidence or included in audit work papers\nUse trend reports to assess whether the TPRM program is maturing and risk levels are being managed effectively\nCross-reference report data with dashboard charts and issue register for a complete audit picture\nReports cover the entire TPRM program, not just individual vendors — useful for program-level audit conclusions\nreports\nreporting\nvendor risk\nassessment completion\nissue resolution\nexport\ntrends\naudit\nmanagement\nreview	{-0.033843994140625,0.05267333984375,0.099365234375,-0.00254058837890625,-0.0220489501953125,-0.00337982177734375,