cmn2wadrh00dejc3ombwvlph8	taud-no-access	tprm	Access & Permissions	tprm	{TPRMAuditor}	Which TPRM pages are restricted for the Auditor role?	Which TPRM pages are restricted for the Auditor role?\nWhat pages can I not access as an Auditor?\nWhy can't I see certain TPRM menu items?\nAuditor restricted pages in TPRM\nWhat is hidden from the TPRM Auditor?\nWhich TPRM features are unavailable to Auditors?\nWhy is my TPRM sidebar limited as an Auditor?\nWhat can't a TPRM Auditor do?\nAs a TPRM Auditor, your access is intentionally limited to read-only views that support independent audit oversight. Many TPRM pages are restricted because they involve operational activities (creating, editing, approving) that would compromise audit independence.\n**RM Dashboard** — Relationship Manager dashboard (restricted to RM role)\n**BO Dashboard** — Business Owner dashboard (restricted to BO role)\n**RM/BO/Admin Vendor Management** — Vendor creation, editing, and deletion (restricted to operational roles)\n**RM/BO/AM/Approver Assessments** — Assessment creation, execution, approval, and management (restricted to operational roles)\n**Contracts** — Contract management and document handling (restricted to RMs and BOs)\n**Assessment Factory (creation)** — Batch assessment creation (restricted to Assessors with write access)\n**Assessment Templates** — Template creation and management (restricted to Assessors with write access)\n**SME Management** — Subject Matter Expert assignments (restricted to Account Managers)\n**Vendor Offboarding** — Offboarding process management (restricted to RMs and BOs)\n**RM/BO/IT Issue Management** — Issue creation and remediation management (restricted to operational roles)\n**AM/IT Follow-ups** — Follow-up creation and management (restricted to operational roles)\n**Program Monitor** — Executive program overview (restricted to Administrators)\n**Control Center** — Risk parameter configuration (restricted to Administrators)\n**Configuration / Settings** — Sy