cmn2wadsa00dgjc3o7pp65q8i	tsme-assessments	tprm	Assessments	tprm	{TPRMSME}	How do I review assessments as an SME?	How do I review assessments as an SME?\nHow to view my assigned assessments as SME\nSME assessment review process\nHow do I provide expert input on assessments?\nWhere do I see assessments assigned to my domain?\nHow to open an assessment as a Subject Matter Expert\nSME assessment questionnaire\nHow to answer assessment questions in my specialty area\nAs an SME, you can view assessments on the AM Assessments page. Your access is limited to reviewing specific assessment areas related to your domain of expertise, providing specialist input on questions within your area of specialization.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → AM → Assessments**\nView the list of assessments with tabs for **Active**, **Submitted**, **Past**, and **Offboard** assessments\nUse the **search bar** to filter assessments by assessment code or vendor name\nOpen an assessment to review the questions assigned to your domain of expertise\nReview the CAIQ questionnaire questions relevant to your specialization area\nProvide your expert input, compliance ratings, and notes on questions within your domain\nAdd any supporting evidence or documentation to substantiate your expert review\nSave your progress — you can return to continue reviewing at any time\nYou will only see assessments that have been assigned to you by the Account Manager\nYour view is limited to your area of domain expertise — you may not see all questions in an assessment\nStatus color coding helps track progress: Gray (Draft), Blue (In Progress), Orange (Returned), Purple (Submitted), Indigo (Under Review), Green (Completed)\nAs an SME, you provide specialist advisory input — the Account Manager manages the overall assessment lifecycle\nYou cannot create new assessments or assign assessors — this is managed by the Account Manager\nsme\nassessment\nreview\ndomain\nexpert\nquestionnaire\nspecialist\nassigned\nCAIQ	{0.024917602