cmn2wadsp00dhjc3ogg97ld12	tsme-assessment-status	tprm	Assessments	tprm	{TPRMSME}	What do the assessment status colors mean for an SME?	What do the assessment status colors mean for an SME?\nAssessment status meanings\nWhat does each assessment status indicate?\nHow to understand assessment progress as SME\nAssessment status color codes\nWhat is the assessment lifecycle for an SME?\nSME assessment status tracking\nAssessments progress through several statuses, each indicated by a color-coded badge. As an SME, you primarily work with assessments in Active status where your domain expertise is needed.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → AM → Assessments**\nReview the status badges on each assessment in the list view\n**Gray (Draft)** — Assessment has been created but not yet started\n**Blue (In Progress)** — Assessment is actively being worked on; your expert input may be needed\n**Orange (Returned)** — Assessment has been returned for revisions; check if your domain area needs updates\n**Purple (Submitted)** — Assessment has been submitted for review\n**Indigo (Under Review)** — Assessment is being reviewed by the approver\n**Green (Completed)** — Assessment has been approved and finalized\nAs an SME, your primary focus is on Active (In Progress) assessments where your domain expertise is required\nReturned assessments may need your attention if the reviewer requested changes in your specialty area\nYou can view past and completed assessments for reference, but cannot modify them\nstatus\ncolor\ndraft\nin progress\nsubmitted\ncompleted\nreturned\nassessment\nlifecycle	{0.0345458984375,0.0330810546875,0.0684814453125,0.0204620361328125,-0.003879547119140625,0.02294921875,0.046783447265625,-0.01209259033203125,0.05279541015625,0.03717041015625,0.04827880859375,-0.0362548828125,-0.02239990234375,-0.034332275390625,0.029693603515625,0.046295166015625,-0.041229248046875,0.00601959228515625,-0.018707275390625,0.0626220703125,0.077392578125,0.0163116455078125,-0.035186767578125,