cmn2wadt400dijc3oitpiu55l	tsme-assessment-tabs	tprm	Assessments	tprm	{TPRMSME}	How do I use the assessment tabs as an SME?	How do I use the assessment tabs as an SME?\nWhat are the assessment tab categories?\nHow to filter assessments by Active, Submitted, Past\nWhere do I find completed assessments as SME?\nHow to navigate assessment tabs\nSME assessment tab navigation\nHow to switch between assessment views\nThe AM Assessments page organizes assessments into four tabs — Active, Submitted, Past, and Offboard — allowing you to quickly find assessments relevant to your current domain review work.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → AM → Assessments**\nClick the **Active** tab to see assessments currently in progress that may need your expert input\nClick the **Submitted** tab to see assessments that have been submitted for review\nClick the **Past** tab to view completed or closed assessments for reference\nClick the **Offboard** tab to see assessments related to vendor offboarding\nUse the **search bar** within any tab to filter by assessment code or vendor name\nThe Active tab is your primary working area — this is where assessments needing your domain expertise will appear\nPast assessments are read-only and useful for referencing previous expert reviews\nThe number of visible assessments depends on what the Account Manager has assigned to you\ntabs\nactive\nsubmitted\npast\noffboard\nfilter\nassessment\nnavigate	{-0.003290176391601562,0.0496826171875,0.044952392578125,0.00908660888671875,-0.00298309326171875,0.01438140869140625,-0.002172470092773438,-0.0183563232421875,0.03155517578125,0.0301361083984375,0.041351318359375,-0.069580078125,0.0369873046875,0.018951416015625,0.0178985595703125,0.024658203125,-0.026458740234375,0.001141548156738281,-0.0180511474609375,0.0604248046875,0.058807373046875,0.016876220703125,-0.026824951171875,0.0190887451171875,-0.043304443359375,-0.0161285400390625,-0.05853271484375,0.0062408447265625,-0.040985107421875,-0.00994110107421875,0