cmn2wadti00djjc3ontckb96t	tsme-follow-ups	tprm	Follow-Ups	tprm	{TPRMSME}	How do I track follow-up items as an SME?	How do I track follow-up items as an SME?\nSME follow-up management\nHow to view my assigned follow-ups\nWhere do I see follow-up actions from assessments?\nHow to track remediation items as SME\nFollow-up tracking for Subject Matter Expert\nHow to manage my follow-up tasks\nSME assessment follow-up actions\nThe AM Follow-Ups page lets you view and track follow-up actions arising from vendor assessments. As an SME, you can monitor follow-up items related to your domain of expertise and track their completion status.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → AM → Follow-Ups**\nView the list of follow-up items with their status and due dates\nReview follow-up details including the linked assessment and required actions\nTrack the completion status of follow-up items in your domain area\nUse filters or search to find specific follow-up items\nMonitor due dates to ensure timely completion of domain-specific remediation actions\nFollow-ups are linked to specific assessments — they arise from findings or gaps identified during the assessment process\nAs an SME, your follow-ups are typically related to your area of domain expertise\nDue dates are set during the assessment process — monitor them to avoid overdue items\nThe Account Manager oversees the overall follow-up lifecycle; your role is to track and address items in your specialist area\nfollow-up\nfollow-ups\nremediation\naction\ntracking\ndue date\nstatus\nassigned	{0.00687408447265625,0.06689453125,0.078857421875,-0.0083465576171875,-0.051025390625,0.005115509033203125,0.0347900390625,0.0148773193359375,0.05633544921875,0.054473876953125,0.046142578125,-0.0418701171875,-0.038360595703125,-0.047027587890625,-0.00844573974609375,0.00278472900390625,-0.036590576171875,-0.0120697021484375,-0.01143646240234375,0.06512451171875,0.08074951171875,0.042877197265625,-0.041717529296875,0.02606201171875,-0.04351806640625,-0