cmn2waduc00dljc3ol90tv5yg	tsme-support	tprm	Support	tprm	{TPRMSME}	How do I access support as an SME?	How do I access support as an SME?\nSME support page\nHow to submit a support request as Subject Matter Expert\nWhere do I get help as an SME?\nHow to contact the support team\nSME help resources\nHow to report an issue as SME\nWhere to find FAQ and help as Subject Matter Expert\nThe AM Support page provides help resources and a contact form for submitting support requests. As an SME, use this page to get assistance with assessment reviews, technical issues, or questions about your domain expertise areas.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → AM → Support**\nReview the **FAQ and help resources** section for common questions\nView the **support team contact details** for direct communication\nTo submit a support request, fill in the **support/contact form** with your issue details\nDescribe the issue clearly, including any assessment references or domain-specific context\nSubmit the form to create a support ticket\nInclude the assessment ID or vendor name when reporting assessment-related issues for faster resolution\nThe support page is role-specific — you will see resources relevant to the SME role\nFor urgent issues related to assessment deadlines, mention the due date in your support request\nsupport\nhelp\ncontact\nfaq\nrequest\nissue\nassistance	{0.006374359130859375,0.0167999267578125,0.08636474609375,-0.00402069091796875,-0.039764404296875,0.0177001953125,-0.006900787353515625,0.056732177734375,0.01849365234375,0.030029296875,0.03082275390625,-0.054229736328125,-0.002859115600585938,-0.0111846923828125,-0.01141357421875,0.050079345703125,-0.006622314453125,0.049591064453125,0.001896858215332031,0.04791259765625,0.0745849609375,0.040985107421875,-0.051727294921875,0.03277587890625,-0.021942138671875,-0.00469207763671875,-0.026092529296875,-0.0184326171875,-0.01163482666015625,-0.0113983154296875,0.036102294921875,-0.037628173828125,-0.04046630859375,0.00991821289062