cmn2wae1300dmjc3o5046hcqq	tsme-no-access	tprm	Access & Permissions	tprm	{TPRMSME}	Why can't I access certain TPRM pages as an SME?	Why can't I access certain TPRM pages as an SME?\nSME restricted pages\nWhy can't I see the dashboard as SME?\nWhy don't I have access to vendor management?\nSME missing menu items\nWhy can't I access monitoring or reports?\nWhy is the assessment factory not visible to me?\nWhat pages are restricted for the Subject Matter Expert role?\nWhy can't I see contracts or issues as SME?\nThe SME role is a specialist advisory role with intentionally limited access. You can only access AM Assessments, AM Follow-Ups, and AM Support. All other TPRM pages — including dashboards, vendor management, contracts, issues, monitoring, reports, configuration, settings, assessment factory, templates, control center, program monitor, offboarding, SME management, and CAIQ questions — are restricted to other roles.\nYour accessible pages are: **AM Assessments**, **AM Follow-Ups**, and **AM Support**\nIf a sidebar menu item is not visible, your SME role does not have the required permission\nContact your **Account Manager** if you believe you need access to additional pages\nContact your **TPRM Administrator** to request a role change if your responsibilities have expanded\nThe following pages are NOT accessible to the SME role: All Dashboards (RM, BO, Assessor, Auditor, Admin), Vendor Management/Inventory, Contracts, Issue Register, Monitoring, Reports, User Management, Configuration/Settings, Assessment Factory, Templates, Control Center, Program Monitor, Offboarding, SME Management, and CAIQ Questions\nPermissions are enforced at both the UI level (hidden menu items) and the API level (blocked requests) for security\nThe SME role is designed for domain specialists who provide expert input on specific assessment areas — broader access is managed by the Account Manager, Assessor, or Administrator roles\nIf you see a 'Permission Denied' error, it means you attempted to access a restricted resource\naccess\nrestricted\npermission\ndenied\nmissing\nhidden\ndashboard\nvendor\nmonitoring\nreports\ncontracts\nissues\nfactory\ntemplates\nconfiguration\nsettings\noffboarding\nCAIQ	{0.014068603515625,0.05706787109375,0.07501220703125,0.024444580078125,-0.005336761474609375,0.026214599609375,-0.0325927734375,0.032501220703125,0.045654296875,0.0287933349609375,0.03436279296875,-0.04864501953125,-0.00650787353515625,0.017333984375,-0.002656936645507812,0.0171356201171875,-0.004756927490234375,0.006320953369140625,-0.01415252685546875,0.0843505859375,0.0919189453125,0.035491943359375,-0.0789794921875,0.01428985595703125,-0.030548095703125,0.01806640625,-0.002588272094726562,0.01538848876953125,-0.00917816162109375,-0.006801605224609375,0.07769775390625,-0.03619384765625,-0.04327392578125,-0.0168304443359375,0.0304107666015625,-0.01078033447265625,0.01190185546875,0.0058135986328125,0.0296783447265625,0.0004527568817138672,-0.0239105224609375,0.0207977294921875,-0.0206756591796875,0.0286865234375,-0.0248870849609375,-0.005428314208984375,-0.00839996337890625,-0.001061439514160156,0.0181884765625,-0.004215240478515625,-0.001515388488769531,0.0218658447265625,-0.005859375,0.034332275390625,-0.01169586181640625,-0.0206298828125,-0.012786865234375,0.0184173583984375,-0.03680419921875,0.009307861328125,-0.0083465576171875,-0.0135345458984375,-0.0457763671875,0.0189056396484375,-0.00727081298828125,-0.023895263671875,-0.0252685546875,0.001324653625488281,-0.003335952758789062,-0.016937255859375,-0.01456451416015625,-0.01861572265625,0.0251312255859375,-0.01294708251953125,-0.002836227416992188,-0.0199127197265625,0.051025390625,0.0460205078125,-0.01812744140625,-0.0186309814453125,0.017059326171875,0.002286911010742188,-0.0638427734375,-0.001843452453613281,-0.01397705078125,0.01244354248046875,-0.078369140625,-0.029296875,0.013031005859375,-0.0277252197265625,-0.0443115234375,0.011749267578125,-0.004180908203125,0.00959014892578125,0.0042648