cmn2wae1i00dnjc3oplnwf8gn	tit-it-issues-overview	tprm	Issue & Remediation	tprm	{InternalITTeam}	How do I use the IT Issues page as an Internal IT Team member?	How do I use the IT Issues page as an Internal IT Team member?\nWhat is the IT Issue Management page?\nHow do I view IT-related vendor issues?\nInternal IT Team issue tracking\nWhere do I manage IT vendor issues?\nHow to access IT issues in TPRM?\nWhat can I do on the IT Issues page?\nIT team issue register overview\nThe IT Issues page is the sole page accessible to the Internal IT Team role. It allows you to view and manage IT-related vendor issues, track technical remediation workflows, and provide IT security input from a technology risk perspective.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Internal IT → Issue Management**\nView the list of IT-related vendor issues assigned to your team\nReview issue details including **domain**, **severity** (High/Medium/Low), **issue description**, **risk**, and **recommendation**\nTrack issue **status** (Open, Overdue, Closed) and **due dates**\nView **assessment code linkage** and **question number references** for each issue\nAdd **remediation comments** to provide technical input on how issues should be resolved\nThis is the ONLY page accessible to the Internal IT Team role — all other TPRM pages are restricted\nIssues shown here are specifically IT-related: IT security, infrastructure, and technology risks\nYour role focuses on providing technical input — broader issue management is handled by Assessors and Relationship Managers\nIssue codes and assessment linkage help trace issues back to the original assessment context\nit issues\nissue management\ninternal it\nvendor issues\nIT team\nissue register\ntechnical issues\nIT security	{-0.04522705078125,0.04888916015625,0.06719970703125,0.017486572265625,-0.010589599609375,-0.0288238525390625,0.0005698204040527344,0.00934600830078125,0.01491546630859375,0.05096435546875,0.052093505859375,0.02374267578125,-0.037109375,-0.01939392