cmn2wae1x00dojc3o6l6oc86l	tit-track-it-issues	tprm	Issue & Remediation	tprm	{InternalITTeam}	How do I track and remediate IT vendor issues?	How do I track and remediate IT vendor issues?\nHow to track IT issue remediation progress?\nHow do I update remediation status for IT issues?\nIT issue remediation workflow\nHow to add comments to IT vendor issues?\nHow do I monitor overdue IT issues?\nTracking IT security remediation actions\nTrack IT vendor issues by monitoring their status (Open, Overdue, Closed), reviewing severity levels, checking due dates, and adding remediation comments with your technical input on resolution approaches.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Internal IT → Issue Management**\nReview the issue list — check the **Status** column for Open, Overdue, or Closed issues\nPrioritize **Overdue** and **High severity** issues that need immediate IT attention\nClick on an issue to view its full details: domain, severity, description, risk, and recommendation\nAdd **remediation comments** to document your IT team's technical assessment and recommended fix\nTrack **due dates** to ensure IT-related issues are resolved within the required timeframe\nMonitor the progression from **Open → Closed** as remediation is completed\nOverdue issues should be escalated or addressed immediately — they have passed their remediation deadline\nSeverity levels (High/Medium/Low) help prioritize which IT issues need urgent technical attention\nRemediation comments are visible to Assessors and Relationship Managers who manage the broader issue lifecycle\nFocus your comments on IT-specific remediation: infrastructure changes, security patches, configuration fixes, etc.\ntrack\nremediate\nremediation\nstatus\noverdue\ncomments\nIT security\nresolution\nprogress	{-0.043304443359375,0.05615234375,0.07574462890625,0.004108428955078125,-0.017852783203125,-0.00667572021484375,-0.00492095947265625,-0.002857208251953125,0.03173828125,0.038970947265625,0.046966552734375,0.0054244995117187