cmn2waebl00dxjc3ounrwm7xc	tfa-no-access	tprm	Access & Permissions	tprm	{FactoryAssessor}	Why can't I access other TPRM pages as a Factory Assessor?	Why can't I access other TPRM pages as a Factory Assessor?\nFactory Assessor restricted pages\nWhy can't I see the dashboard as Factory Assessor?\nWhy don't I have access to vendor management as Factory Assessor?\nFactory Assessor missing menu items\nWhy can't I access assessments or monitoring?\nWhy is the assessment factory creation not visible to me?\nWhat pages are restricted for the Factory Assessor role?\nWhy can I only see factory reports?\nThe Factory Assessor is the most limited factory role in TPRM — you can only access the **Factory Reports** page (read-only). All other TPRM pages are restricted because your role is focused exclusively on reviewing factory/facility-specific assessment reports. This includes all dashboards, vendor management, contracts, assessments pages, issues, monitoring, follow-ups, user management, configuration, settings, assessment factory (creation), templates, SME management, offboarding, control center, program monitor, CAIQ questions, and TPRM reports.\nYour only accessible page is: **Factory Reports** (Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessment History)\nIf a sidebar menu item is not visible, your Factory Assessor role does not have the required permission\nContact your **TPRM Administrator** if you believe you need access to additional pages\nContact your **TPRM Administrator** to request a role change if your responsibilities have expanded beyond reviewing factory reports\nThe following pages are NOT accessible to the Factory Assessor role: All Dashboards (RM, BO, Assessor, Auditor, Admin), Vendor Management/Inventory, Contracts, All Assessment pages, Issues, Monitoring, Follow-ups, User Management, Configuration/Settings, Assessment Factory (creation), Templates, SME Management, Offboarding, Control Center, Program Monitor, CAIQ Questions, and TPRM Reports\nPermissions are enforced at both the UI level (hidden menu items) and the API level (blocked requests) for security\nThe Factory Assessor role is designed for personnel who review factory/facility assessment results only — broader TPRM access is managed by Assessors, Relationship Managers, or Administrators\nIf you see a 'Permission Denied' error, it means you attempted to access a restricted resource\nThis is intentionally the most limited factory role — with read-only access to only 1 page compared to other roles that have 3-15+ pages\naccess\nrestricted\npermission\ndenied\nmissing\nhidden\ndashboard\nvendor\nmonitoring\nreports\ncontracts\nfactory\ntemplates\nconfiguration\nsettings\noffboarding\nassessments\ncontrol center\nissues\nfollow-ups	{-0.003644953714683652,0.05371234938502312,0.06837069243192673,0.01359822880476713,0.007211380638182163,0.002607745118439198,-0.0498383603990078,-0.01785176619887352,0.03295509144663811,0.01399086322635412,0.02290365844964981,-0.02185663394629955,0.008219141513109207,0.01250539720058441,0.001440476509742439,-0.0003124713257420808,0.007617102470248938,0.001990982331335545,-0.005614668130874634,0.07653748244047165,0.04536233097314835,0.01392542384564877,-0.05653931573033333,-0.02949991263449192,-0.02719645760953426,-0.01430497039109468,0.005542685277760029,0.02656824328005314,-0.03722171857953072,-0.0238459799438715,0.04991688579320908,-0.04091247916221619,-0.03295509144663811,0.007132853381335735,0.05101626366376877,-0.0141479168087244,0.03575588390231133,0.001743949949741364,0.02391141839325428,0.0216995794326067,-0.00880154874175787,0.03122750297188759,-0.02714410796761513,0.008559424430131912,-0.01891187764704227,0.006573350168764591,0.02612325921654701,0.03604381531476974,-0.0002991790242958814,-0.01671312749385834,-0.009665343910455704,0.02642427757382393,-0.0216995794326067,0.001438022591173649,-0.03381888568401337,-0.01179865561425686,-0.03345242887735367,-0.0168309174478054,-0.03264098614454269,0.01505097560584545,0.00301673891954124,-0.0005