cmn2wae3j00dsjc3o0b6oigu6	tit-no-access	tprm	Access & Permissions	tprm	{InternalITTeam}	Why can't I access other TPRM pages as an Internal IT Team member?	Why can't I access other TPRM pages as an Internal IT Team member?\nInternal IT Team restricted pages\nWhy can't I see the dashboard as Internal IT?\nWhy don't I have access to vendor management?\nInternal IT missing menu items\nWhy can't I access monitoring or reports?\nWhy is the assessment factory not visible to me?\nWhat pages are restricted for the Internal IT Team role?\nWhy can I only see IT Issues?\nThe Internal IT Team is the most limited TPRM role — you can only access the **IT Issue Management** page. All other TPRM pages are restricted because your role is focused exclusively on providing technical IT input for vendor issues. This includes dashboards, vendor management, contracts, assessments, monitoring, reports, user management, configuration, settings, assessment factory, templates, follow-ups, SME management, offboarding, control center, and program monitor.\nYour only accessible page is: **IT Issue Management** (Sidebar → TPRM → Internal IT → Issue Management)\nIf a sidebar menu item is not visible, your Internal IT Team role does not have the required permission\nContact your **TPRM Administrator** if you believe you need access to additional pages\nContact your **TPRM Administrator** to request a role change if your responsibilities have expanded beyond IT issue management\nThe following pages are NOT accessible to the Internal IT Team role: All Dashboards (RM, BO, Assessor, Auditor, Admin), Vendor Management/Inventory, Contracts, All Assessment pages, Monitoring, Reports, User Management, Configuration/Settings, Assessment Factory, Templates, Follow-ups, SME Management, Offboarding, Control Center, and Program Monitor\nPermissions are enforced at both the UI level (hidden menu items) and the API level (blocked requests) for security\nThe Internal IT Team role is designed for IT specialists who provide technical input on IT-related vendor issues only — broader TPRM access is managed by Assessors, Relationship Managers, or Administrators\nIf you see a 'Permission Denied' error, it means you attempted to access a restricted resource\nThis is intentionally the most limited TPRM role — with access to only 1 page compared to other roles that have 4-15+ pages\naccess\nrestricted\npermission\ndenied\nmissing\nhidden\ndashboard\nvendor\nmonitoring\nreports\ncontracts\nfactory\ntemplates\nconfiguration\nsettings\noffboarding\nassessments\ncontrol center	{-0.036651611328125,0.061798095703125,0.05926513671875,0.0257415771484375,-0.00559234619140625,-0.003170013427734375,-0.047454833984375,0.016845703125,0.0207672119140625,0.023193359375,0.032440185546875,0.002353668212890625,-0.0107574462890625,0.0113525390625,0.0248260498046875,-0.01271820068359375,-0.00811004638671875,-0.001185417175292969,-0.0447998046875,0.07855224609375,0.0638427734375,0.00804901123046875,-0.05035400390625,-0.00751495361328125,-0.025177001953125,0.0170135498046875,-0.005710601806640625,0.033966064453125,-0.003168106079101562,-0.005466461181640625,0.07269287109375,-0.04058837890625,-0.0053558349609375,-0.02880859375,0.074462890625,-0.01611328125,0.0246124267578125,0.0204315185546875,0.01416778564453125,0.00931549072265625,-0.004047393798828125,0.031524658203125,-0.0101318359375,0.03485107421875,-0.03277587890625,-0.01309967041015625,0.01073455810546875,0.027587890625,-9.804964065551758e-05,-0.031097412109375,0.004116058349609375,0.01230621337890625,-0.0289154052734375,0.024993896484375,-0.03277587890625,-0.01354217529296875,-0.043243408203125,0.0164947509765625,-0.032196044921875,0.00897216796875,-0.00881195068359375,-0.01059722900390625,-0.028045654296875,0.0132904052734375,0.003522872924804688,-0.0164337158203125,-0.0304412841796875,-0.0106048583984375,0.02197265625,-0.023956298828125,-0.0268402099609375,0.007709503173828125,-0.0113067626953125,-0.00577545166015625,0.0223388671875,-0.0083312988