cmn2wae4c00dujc3ost3jojz2	tfa-factory-reports	tprm	Reports	tprm	{FactoryAssessor}	How do I view factory assessment reports as a Factory Assessor?	How do I view factory assessment reports as a Factory Assessor?\nWhere are the factory reports?\nHow to access factory assessment history\nView assessment factory batch results\nFactory Assessor reports page\nHow to see completed factory assessments\nWhere do I find batch assessment reports?\nHow to review factory assessment analytics\nAssessment factory history for Factory Assessor\nAs a Factory Assessor, you can view factory assessment reports on the Assessment History page. This page provides read-only access to assessment factory batch history, batch assessment completion status, and factory assessment analytics.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessment History**\nView the list of assessment factory batch history entries\nReview **batch assessment completion status** for each factory assessment run\nExamine **factory assessment analytics** to understand trends and results\nUse sorting and filtering options to locate specific factory assessment batches\nAll data on this page is **read-only** — you cannot modify or delete any reports\nThis is your only accessible page as a Factory Assessor — all other TPRM pages are restricted\nAccess is strictly **read-only** — you cannot create, edit, or delete factory reports\nFactory reports cover assessment factory batch history, batch completion status, and factory assessment analytics\nIf you need to create or run factory assessments, contact your TPRM Administrator — the Assessment Factory (creation) page is not accessible to the Factory Assessor role\nFor detailed vendor assessment data beyond factory reports, you would need an elevated role such as Assessor or Account Manager\nfactory reports\nassessment history\nbatch\nfactory assessment\nanalytics\nreports\nview\nread-only\ncompleted	{-0.001094818115234375,0.0250396728515625,0.06854248046875,-0.013397216796875,0.