cmn2wae4r00dvjc3o3r2z4mjh	tfa-report-data	tprm	Reports	tprm	{FactoryAssessor}	What information is included in factory assessment reports?	What information is included in factory assessment reports?\nWhat data is shown in factory reports?\nWhat can I see in assessment factory history?\nFactory report columns and fields\nWhat details are in batch assessment results?\nHow to read factory assessment analytics\nWhat metrics are available in factory reports?\nFactory assessment reports include assessment factory batch history, batch assessment completion status, and factory assessment analytics. These reports provide a read-only summary of factory/facility-specific vendor assessment results.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessment History**\nReview **Assessment Factory Batch History** — shows past factory assessment batches with dates and parameters\nCheck **Batch Assessment Completion Status** — indicates whether each batch assessment has been fully completed\nExamine **Factory Assessment Analytics** — provides trend data and summary statistics for factory assessments\nUse the data table controls to sort, filter, and search across report entries\nExport report data if export functionality is available for your role\nAll report data is read-only — you cannot modify the underlying assessment results\nFactory reports reflect assessments that have been run through the Assessment Factory by users with creation permissions (Assessors, Account Managers, or Administrators)\nIf report data appears incomplete or outdated, contact the Assessor or Account Manager responsible for running factory assessments\nAnalytics data helps identify trends across multiple factory assessment batches over time\nfactory reports\ndata\ncolumns\nfields\nbatch\nanalytics\nmetrics\nhistory\ncompletion\nstatus	{0.001334190368652344,0.03582763671875,0.0650634765625,-0.0116729736328125,0.01024627685546875,-0.0124359130859375,-0.020355224609375,-0.057342529296875,0.02093505859375,0.0164489746