cmn2waeb500dwjc3oifxqd5yu	tfa-navigation	tprm	Navigation	tprm	{FactoryAssessor}	How do I navigate the TPRM module as a Factory Assessor?	How do I navigate the TPRM module as a Factory Assessor?\nWhere is the Factory Assessor menu?\nFactory Assessor sidebar navigation\nHow to find factory reports in the sidebar\nTPRM navigation for Factory Assessor\nWhat menu items can I see as Factory Assessor?\nHow to get to the Assessment History page\nAs a Factory Assessor, your sidebar navigation is extremely limited. You will see only one menu item under the TPRM section: **Assessor → Assessment History**. This leads to the Factory Reports page, which is your sole accessible area in the application.\nAfter logging in, look at the **left sidebar** for the TPRM navigation menu\nLocate **TPRM → Assessor → Assessment History** — this is your only visible menu item\nClick on **Assessment History** to open the Factory Reports page\nUse the **breadcrumb trail** at the top of the page to confirm your current location\nUse the **header bar** to access your user profile, notifications, and language switcher\nOnly one sidebar menu item is visible to the Factory Assessor role — if you see additional items, your role may have been updated\nIf the Assessment History menu item is not visible, contact your TPRM Administrator to verify your role assignment\nThe language selector in the header allows switching between English, Arabic (RTL), and Latvian\nUse **Ctrl+K** (or **Cmd+K** on Mac) to open Global Search if available for your role\nnavigation\nsidebar\nmenu\nfactory assessor\nassessment history\npath\nlocation	{-0.03133365511894226,0.05367916822433472,0.08264095336198807,-0.003732574637979269,-0.01594146527349949,0.002768222242593765,-0.02438032999634743,-0.008563700132071972,0.0105735482648015,0.01976142451167107,-0.001846001599915326,-0.02368125133216381,0.03260697424411774,-0.03305638208985329,-0.005711213685572147,0.01726471818983555,0.01112282276153564,0.01051737181842327,-0.02494208