cmn2waecf00dzjc3otu55z3qk	tfad-factory-user-management	tprm	User Management	tprm	{FactoryAdmin}	How do I manage factory team users as a Factory Administrator?	How do I manage factory team users as a Factory Administrator?\nHow to add users to my factory team\nFactory user management page\nHow to assign FactoryAdmin or FactoryAssessor roles\nManage factory team members\nHow to create a new factory user\nHow to remove a user from my factory team\nFactory team role assignments\nHow do I edit factory user permissions?\nFactory User Management allows you to manage the users within your specific factory/facility team. You can add new team members, assign them the FactoryAdmin or FactoryAssessor role, edit existing user details, and remove users from the factory team. This is scoped to your factory only — you cannot manage users outside your facility.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Factory → User Management**\nView the list of all users currently assigned to your factory team\nClick **Add User** to add a new team member to your factory\nSelect the user and assign them a role: **FactoryAdmin** or **FactoryAssessor**\nTo edit an existing user, click the **Edit** action on the user row\nUpdate the user's role or other details as needed and save\nTo remove a user from the factory team, use the **Delete** action on the user row\nYou can only assign two roles: **FactoryAdmin** (manages the factory) and **FactoryAssessor** (reviews factory reports)\nUser management is scoped to your specific factory/facility — you cannot manage users in other factories or at the organization level\nOrganization-wide TPRM user management is handled by the TPRM Administrator role — contact them if you need users added to the broader TPRM team\nChanges to user roles take effect immediately upon saving\nRemoving a user from the factory team does not delete their account — it only removes their factory role assignment\nfactory\nuser\nmanagement\nteam\nfactory admin\nfactory assessor\nrole\nassign\nadd\nremove\nedit\nfacility	{-0.01173618901520967,0.05632413923740387,0.01595930382609367,-0.012418108060956,-0.02365183085203171,-0.02457302063703537,-0.006280835252255201,0.008655589073896408,0.01977565884590149,0.01817254908382893,0.02121127769351006,-0.007644673809409142,-0.005646769888699055,0.003445486770942807,0.02251529879868031,-0.01130550354719162,-0.01938086375594139,-0.02258707955479622,-0.03026764467358589,0.08044254779815674,0.03404811024665833,0.03876172751188278,-0.02832955680787563,0.01365034841001034,-0.0240346621721983,0.003950944636017084,0.02488407120108604,0.03505304083228111,-0.07206809520721436,-0.02825777605175972,-0.002940029138699174,-0.03313888236880302,-0.03270819783210754,0.03538801893591881,0.04515023157000542,-0.02215639315545559,0.03792428225278854,0.02646325156092644,0.00913412868976593,0.05096448957920074,-0.0351487509906292,-0.0198474396020174,-0.01201134920120239,0.01258559711277485,-0.02596078626811504,0.01046805828809738,0.00337370578199625,0.04416922479867935,-0.005739487241953611,-0.03043513372540474,0.05163444578647614,-0.02275456860661507,0.01839985698461533,0.000994465546682477,-0.04242255538702011,0.006197090726345778,-0.01143112033605576,-0.003397632855921984,-0.03261248767375946,0.02355612255632877,0.0015522635076195,-0.03909670189023018,0.02490799874067307,-0.01251381635665894,0.01058769319206476,-0.0112217590212822,-0.03883350640535355,0.02155821956694126,0.01053385809063911,-0.0242619700729847,-0.01493044290691614,-0.04474347457289696,-0.00966052245348692,-0.01254970673471689,0.004097497090697289,-0.0168446023017168,0.05694624036550522,0.01847163774073124,-0.05603701248764992,-0.01778971776366234,0.02813814207911491,0.01210705749690533,-0.03596226871013641,0.04385817423462868,-0.01307610049843788,-0.01116194110363722,-0.05364431440830231,-0.02816206961870193,5.953708387096412e-05,-0.0527350902557373,-0.02341256104409695,0.028066361322999,-0.03196645900607109,0.0521608404815197,0.0194526445120573,-0.02145054750144482,-0