cmn2waedn00e2jc3olchpp5ir	tfad-assessment-scheduling	tprm	Assessment Management	tprm	{FactoryAdmin}	Can I schedule assessments in advance using the Assessment Factory?	Can I schedule assessments in advance using the Assessment Factory?\nHow to schedule future assessments for my factory\nScheduled assessment creation in the factory\nCan I set up recurring assessments?\nHow to plan assessment batches in advance\nAssessment factory scheduling options\nHow do I automate assessment creation for vendors?\nThe Assessment Factory supports scheduled assessment creation, allowing you to plan and queue batch assessments in advance for your factory/facility. This helps ensure timely vendor assessments without manual intervention on the due date.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessment Factory**\nSelect the vendors to include in the scheduled batch\nChoose the assessment template\nSet the **scheduled date** for when the assessments should be created\nConfigure assessment parameters (assessors, due dates relative to creation)\nConfirm and save the scheduled batch\nThe system will automatically generate the assessments on the scheduled date\nMonitor scheduled and completed batches from the Factory Reports page\nScheduling assessments in advance helps maintain a consistent assessment cadence for your factory vendors\nScheduled batches appear in the Factory Reports page with their planned execution date\nEnsure assigned assessors are available and have the correct roles before the scheduled date\nContact your TPRM Administrator if you need to modify organization-level scheduling policies\nschedule\nassessment\nfactory\nadvance\nrecurring\nplan\nbatch\nautomate\nfuture\ndate	{-0.02929713018238544,0.003929877653717995,0.09010714292526245,-0.02225597202777863,-0.005859426222741604,-0.005133152473717928,-0.003785238601267338,-0.02781996503472328,0.0276230089366436,0.01611342094838619,0.0300357136875391,-0.02409011870622635,0.035451989620924,-0.03779083490371704,0.004662306