cmn2waee200e3jc3o2ta5s75f	tfad-factory-reports	tprm	Reports	tprm	{FactoryAdmin}	How do I view factory assessment reports as a Factory Administrator?	How do I view factory assessment reports as a Factory Administrator?\nWhere are the factory reports?\nFactory assessment history and reports\nHow to review batch assessment results for my factory\nFactory assessment analytics\nHow do I track assessment completion for my factory?\nWhere can I see the history of factory assessments?\nAssessment factory batch history\nHow to view completed factory assessment data?\nThe Factory Reports page provides comprehensive reporting on your factory's assessment activity, including batch assessment history, completion status, and factory-level assessment analytics. Use it to track assessment progress and review completed assessment results for your facility.\nNavigate to **Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessment History**\nView the list of all assessment batches created for your factory\nReview **batch assessment completion status** — see how many assessments in each batch are complete vs. pending\nClick on a specific batch to view detailed assessment results\nUse filters to narrow results by date range, status, or vendor\nReview factory assessment analytics for trends and patterns\nExport report data if needed for stakeholder distribution or audit purposes\nFactory Reports shows only assessments related to your specific factory/facility — not organization-wide data\nBatch history includes all assessments created through the Assessment Factory page\nUse these reports to identify overdue assessments and follow up with assigned assessors\nThe Factory Administrator has full view access to all factory reports — the Factory Assessor also has read-only access to this same page\nFor organization-wide TPRM reports, contact your TPRM Administrator — the TPRM Reports page is not accessible to factory roles\nfactory\nreports\nassessment\nhistory\nbatch\nanalytics\ncompletion\nresults\nstatus\ntra