cmn2waeeh00e4jc3obkrx5084	tfad-no-access	tprm	Access & Permissions	tprm	{FactoryAdmin}	Why can't I access certain TPRM pages as a Factory Administrator?	Why can't I access certain TPRM pages as a Factory Administrator?\nFactory Administrator restricted pages\nWhy is the dashboard not visible to me as Factory Admin?\nWhy can't I manage vendors as a Factory Administrator?\nWhy don't I see monitoring or issues pages?\nWhat pages are hidden from Factory Administrators?\nFactory Admin missing menu items\nWhy can't I access TPRM configuration or settings?\nWhy is the TPRM Reports page not available to Factory Admin?\nThe Factory Administrator role is scoped to factory/facility-level TPRM administration only. You have access to **3 pages**: Factory User Management, Assessment Factory, and Factory Reports. All other TPRM pages are restricted because they serve organization-wide functions outside the factory scope — including dashboards, vendor management, contracts, role-specific assessments, issues, monitoring, follow-ups, TPRM user management, BO user management, SME, offboarding, control center, program monitor, configuration, settings, CAIQ questions, templates, and TPRM reports.\nYour accessible pages are: **Factory User Management** (Sidebar → TPRM → Factory → User Management), **Assessment Factory** (Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessment Factory), and **Factory Reports** (Sidebar → TPRM → Assessor → Assessment History)\nIf a sidebar menu item is not visible, your Factory Administrator role does not have the required permission\nContact your **TPRM Administrator** if you believe you need access to additional pages\nContact your **TPRM Administrator** to request a role change if your responsibilities have expanded beyond factory-level administration\nThe following pages are NOT accessible to the Factory Administrator role: All Dashboards (RM, BO, Assessor, Auditor, Admin), Vendor Management/Inventory, Contracts, RM Assessments, BO Assessments, AM Assessments, Assessor Assessments, Approver Assessments, Issues, Monitoring, Follow-ups, TPRM User Management, BO User Management, SME Management, Offboarding, Control Center, Program Monitor, Configuration, Settings, CAIQ Questions, Templates, and TPRM Reports\nPermissions are enforced at both the UI level (hidden menu items) and the API level (blocked requests) for security\nThe Factory Administrator role is designed for personnel who administer a specific factory/facility — broader TPRM access is managed by TPRM Administrators, Relationship Managers, or other organization-level roles\nIf you see a 'Permission Denied' error, it means you attempted to access a restricted resource\nThe Factory Administrator has access to 3 pages — more than the Factory Assessor (1 page) but far fewer than organization-wide roles like TPRM Administrator (15+ pages)\naccess\nrestricted\npermission\ndenied\nmissing\nhidden\ndashboard\nvendor\nmonitoring\nreports\ncontracts\ntemplates\nconfiguration\nsettings\noffboarding\nassessments\ncontrol center\nissues\nfollow-ups\nfactory admin	{-0.002491466701030731,0.05542820692062378,0.07127973437309265,0.01024613622575998,0.02077906019985676,-0.001464897650294006,-0.03952453657984734,-0.01095658726990223,0.0272448156028986,0.01892797648906708,0.01313356496393681,-0.00677861412987113,-0.005266461987048388,0.01473045069724321,0.004539716057479382,0.001270175445824862,-0.0002763996308203787,0.005768340080976486,-0.01423509046435356,0.09218915551900864,0.06413611769676208,0.01896708458662033,-0.05876537039875984,-0.00975729338824749,-0.03292842209339142,0.0122145414352417,0.02205656841397285,0.03243306279182434,-0.03141627088189125,-0.01685528457164764,0.04406099393963814,-0.04320063069462776,-0.03874238952994347,0.002670708810910583,0.0493013821542263,-0.02231728471815586,0.03798631206154823,-0.003027563681825995,0.02685374207794666,0.02459854818880558,-0.01287936698645353,0.02077906019985676,-0.02000994794070721,0.01044819131493568,-0.009503095410764217,0.001566739