cmn2ug6x501i3zkpvmt7ejdh4	AUDIT_CREATED	Audit Creation	Sent when a new audit is created and assigned	Internal Audit Notification – Upcoming Audit: {auditName}	<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">\n  <h2 style="color: #1e40af; margin-bottom: 20px;">Internal Audit Notification</h2>\n  <p style="margin: 10px 0; line-height: 1.6;">Dear {recipientName},</p>\n      <p style="margin: 10px 0; line-height: 1.6;">This is to inform you that the Internal Audit team will be conducting an audit for <strong>{departmentName}</strong> as part of the audit plan.</p>\n      <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 15px 0;">\n        <tr><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background: #f5f5f5; font-weight: bold; width: 35%;">Audit Period</td><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{startDate} – {endDate}</td></tr>\n        <tr><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background: #f5f5f5; font-weight: bold; width: 35%;">Scope</td><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{description}</td></tr>\n        <tr><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background: #f5f5f5; font-weight: bold; width: 35%;">Auditee Assigned</td><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{auditeeName}</td></tr>\n      </table>\n      <p style="margin: 10px 0; line-height: 1.6;">We request your cooperation in providing the necessary information and support during this engagement. A detailed schedule and document request list will follow shortly.</p>\n  <p><a href="{entityLink}" style="background-color: #1e40af; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block; margin-top: 15px;">View Audit Details</a></p>\n  <div style="margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #eee;">\n    <p style="margin: 0;">Best regards,</p>\n    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;"><strong>GRC Platform Team</strong></p>\n  </div>\n</div>	Dear {r