cmn5pj4n701eh3u7uwcsmn08a	cmn31d1b500esjc3oubbjw7fb	cmn5phzbw01cf3u7uddd50kcy	NIST SP 800-30 Rev. 1 — Guide for Conducting Risk Assessments	Framework/Guideline	Optional	Provides detailed methodology for threat/vulnerability-based risk assessments. Useful for consistent risk analysis across engineering, cloud, and corporate IT environments.	\N	f	2026-03-25 07:13:37.603	2026-03-25 07:13:37.603
cmn5pj4n701ei3u7uf8iyawsp	cmn31d1b500esjc3oubbjw7fb	cmn5phzbw01cf3u7uddd50kcy	COBIT 2019 — Governance and Management Objectives	Framework/Guideline	Optional	Strengthens IT governance, controls oversight, and auditability for a private limited company with complex IT operations. Useful for aligning security, risk, and compliance with business objectives.	\N	f	2026-03-25 07:13:37.603	2026-03-25 07:13:37.603
